nātyantamāsaktiḥ nāpyatyantamanāsaktirbhavati | sa ca 
bhaktisādhanopāstāvadhikārī | etādṛśādhikāraprāptiśca 
bhaktibhūmikā'rurukṣutvaṃ ca nālpapuṇyena kintu 
anekakoṭijanmasādhitasukṛtalabhyam | tatrāpi sundarībhaktistato'pi dūratarā | 
taduktaṃ brahmāṇḍapurāṇe 

yasyānyadevatānāmakīrtanaṃ janmakoṭiṣu |
tasyaiva bhavati śraddhā śrīdevīnāmakīrtane |
carame janmani yathā śrīvidyopāsako bhavet || iti ||

sthalāntare'pi(-)

yasya no paścimaṃ janma yadi vā śaṃkaraḥ svayam |
