taduttaraṃ caturvāraṃ tarpayitvetyantatarpaṇam eko gaṇaḥ sūcitaḥ | asmin sūtre 
punarityanena trayodaśamithunatarpaṇam anyo gaṇaḥ sūcitaḥ | 
gaṇatrayasūcanaphalaṃ ca(-)ekaikagaṇasya ekaikāpūrvajanakatvāt tanmadhye 
ekasya vismaraṇe punaḥ tadgaṇamārabhyaiva anuṣṭhanaṃ na sakalādimārabhya |

yathā mantraikadeśe varṇalope tanmantrasyādimārabhyāvartanaṃ tadvat | 
śrīśrīpatītyekaṃ girijāgirijāpatītyekaṃ mithunam evaṃ rītyā ekaṃ 
strīlliṅgāntam ekaṃ pulliṅgāntaṃ mithunaṃ jñeyam | madadravottaraṃ na 
vidyante vighnāḥ yasyeti vyutpattyā avighna iti pulliṅgaḥ | śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | evaṃ 
trayodaśamithuneṣu ekaikāṃ devatāṃ dvitīyāntamuccārya tarpayāmī iti yojayet 
| itthaṃ coktarītyā ekadevatāyāścaturvāraṃ tarpaṇaṃ tato mūlena caturvāraṃ 
kāryaṃ pūrvavat | evamuktaprakāreṇa krameṇa niruktasaṃkhyākāni tarpaṇāni 
bhavanti | taditthaṃ mūlatarpaṇāni 228 varṇatarpaṇāni 112 mithunatarpaṇāni 104 
āhatya pūrvoktasaṃkhyākāni 444 catuścatvāriṃśaduttaracatuśśatatarpaṇāni 
bhavantītyarthaḥ || 3 ||

yāgagṛhapraveśādi vighneśvaradhyānāntam 

evaṃ tarpaṇakramamuktvā pūjāvidhiṃ vaktumupakramate(-)

athayāgavidhiḥ(-)gṛhamāgatya sthaṇḍilamupalipya dvāradeśa 
ubhayapārśvayorbhadrakālyai bhairavāya(-)dvārordhve lambodarāya namaḥ iti 
antaḥpraviśya āsanamantreṇa āsane sthitvā prāṇānāyamya ṣaḍaṅgāni 
vinyasya mūlena vyāpakaṃ kṛtvā svātmani devaṃ 
siddhalakṣmīsamāśliṣṭapārśvam ardhenduśekharamāraktavarṇaṃ 
mātuluṅgagadāpuṇḍrekṣukārmukaśūlasudarśanaśaṅkhapāśotpaladhānya(-)
mañjarīnijadantāñcalaratnakalaśapariṣkṛtapāṇyekādaśakaṃ 
prabhinnakaṭamānandapūrṇamaśeṣavighnadhvaṃsanighnaṃ vighneśvaraṃ 
dhyātvā || 4 ||

atha(-)adhikārāntaravākyamidam | etena tarpaṇaprakaraṇaṃ samāptam | tathā ca 
prakaraṇena tarpaṇopāsanayoḥ aṅgāṅgībhāvaḥ sūcitaḥ | tena 
dīkṣā'ṅgakrame tarpaṇasya nātideśaḥ | ucyate iti śeṣaḥ | gṛhamāgatyetyanena 
tarpaṇaṃ nadyādau gṛhādbahiḥ kāryamiti sūcitam | sthaṇḍilaṃ yāgadeśam 
upalipya gomayeneti śeṣaḥ || 

