natvañjanādivat kāṇḍānusamayena tadvat atra bādhakābhāvāt sarveṣāṃ 
tulyapradhānasannikarṣasambhavācca | ādimaṃ spaṣṭaṃ upādimaṃ dvitīyaṃ 
madhyamaṃ tṛtīyaṃ ca dattvā | ayaṃ pratipattisaṃskāraḥ madhyamāniti 
dvitīyāśruteḥ | dānena dravyaṃ saṃskuryāt iti tadarthaḥ | tathā ca 
āvaraṇapūjottaraṃ dravyadoṣe etasya nivṛttireva | anugrahaṃ kārayitvā 
tayoranugraho yathā bhavet tathā tatsaṃtoṣaṃ svayaṃ saṃpādayet iti bhāvaḥ | 
namaḥ ityārabhya japet ityantaḥ spaṣṭārthaḥ || 

yacca nibandhe japānantaraṃ baṭukasuvāsinīpūjanakathanaṃ 
tatsūtraviruddhamityanena spaṣṭīkṛtam || 9 ||

gaṇapatyudvāsanam 

yadyagnikāryasaṃpattiḥ baleḥ pūrvaṃ vidhivat saṃskṛte'gnau svāhā'ntaiḥ 
śrīśrīpatyādivighnakartṛparyantaiḥ mantrairhutvā punarāgatya devaṃ trivāraṃ 
saṃtarpya yogyaissaha mapañcakamurarīkṛtya mahāgaṇapatimātmanyudvāsya 
siddhasaṅkalpaḥ sukhī viharet iti śivam || 10 ||

iti duṣṭakṣatriyakulāntaka(-)reṇukāgarbhasambhūta(-)mahādevapradhānaśiṣya(-)
paraśurāma(-)śrībhārgavamahopādhyāya(-)śrīmatkulācāryaviracitakalpasūtre 
gaṇapatiprakaraṇaṃ dvitīyakhaṇḍātmakaṃ samāptam |

yadītyanena homasya kṛtākṛtatvaṃ sūcitam | baleḥ pūrvam(-)ityanena kramaśeṣaḥ 
(")deśaḥ sū(-)ba 2(.") sūcitaḥ | vidhivat iti(-)agre (")agratana 9-
khaṇḍapratipāditahomavidhyuktarītyetyarthaḥ |(") vakṣyamāṇavidhinetyarthaḥ | 
śrīśrīpatibhyāṃ svāheti mantrasvarūpam ||

yacca nibandhe śriyai svāhā śrīpataye svāhā iti mantravibhāgaṃ lilekha taṃ 
pratyayaṃ praśnaḥ(-)mithunamekā devatā uta devatādvayam (?) ādye 
mantradvayavibhāgo'nucitaḥ | dvitīye āvaraṇapūjāyāṃ 
śrīśrīpatiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti nibandhe samaṣṭimantralekho'nucitaḥ | 
tasmāt sandarbhaviruddhamupekṣyam | na ca tava mate caturāvṛttitarpaṇe'pi 
samaṣṭimantrāpattiḥ iti vācyam tatra mithuneṣvekaikāṃ devatāṃ caturvāramiti 
vartate na mithunāni tarpayitveti | pūjāprakaraṇe kevalamithunāni pūjayedityeva | 
tena mithunasya devatātvaṃ spaṣṭam | evaṃ homasthale'pi 

<p. 84> 

śrīśrīpatyādītyanena mithunasyaikadevatātvaṃ spaṣṭam | anyathā 
yādivighnakartṛparyantairityeva vadet śrīpatigrahaṇaṃ vyartham | na ca 
vighnakartṛparyantairityatra ekadevatāgrahaṇaṃ pratyekasya devatātve kimiti 
jñāpakaṃ na bhavet iti vācyam | yadīdaṃ mantrasvarūpajñāpakaṃ bhavet 
atrāpi vighnakartrantairityanenaiva śrīśrīpatyādīnāṃ lābhe śrīśrīpatyādīti 
vyarthaṃ sat mantrasvarūpajñāpakaṃ sat sārthakam | vighnakartṛparyantairiti 
agrimamithunanivartakaṃ sat sārthakamiti sarvaṃ samañjasam | tasmāt 
caturāvṛttitarpaṇe pūrvoktayuktyā 
catuścatvāriṃśadadhikacatuśśatatarpaṇasaṅkhyāparipūrtaye ca pratyekaṃ 
devatātvam (")devatātve'pi pūjāyāṃ(-)ba 2 |(") | pūjāyāṃ home coktajñāpakena 
vyāsajyavṛttyeva devatātvam | ato mantrasvarūpamasmaduktameva | 
vighnakartṛparyantairityanena agnimamithunaparisaṃkhyā ||

hutvā ityatra dravyākāṅkṣāyām anādiṣṭa ājyaṃ bhavati iti paribhāṣayā 
ājyameva | kāmanāviśeṣe tu dravyaviśeṣo modakā'diḥ | punarāgatya ityanena 
pūjāpradeśādanyo homapradeśaḥ(-)iti sūcitam | śeṣaṃ pūrvavat | yogyaiḥ 
saṃpradāyābhijñaiḥ saha | etadviśeṣaṇasvarasārthaṃ vitatya 
spaṣṭīkariṣyāmaḥ upariṣṭāt śrīkrame (")3 khaṇḍa 30 sūtrabhāṣyānte(-)saṃprati 
idānīṃtanā ajitendriyā ityādinā |(") | mapañcakamurarīkṛtya svīkṛtya śrīkrame 
vakṣyamāṇena vidhinā | atra sahaśabdaśca na yogyābhāve'pyavaśyaṃ 
saṃpādanīyamiti tadabhāve aṅgalopajanitaṃ prāyaścittaṃ vā prāpayati kiṃ tu 
vidyamāne sāhityaṃ avidyamāne kevalaṃ svayameva saha śākhayā prastaraṃ 
praharati itivat | atra gaṇapatyupāsanāmaryādā'nukteḥ śyāmā'divat | 
japasaṅkhyāścānukteḥ tantrāntaraṃ śaraṇīkāryam | tatra tantrāntaravacanaṃ 
tantrasāre(-)

dhyāyenmantraṃ japenmantraṃ caturlakṣaṃ samāhitaḥ |
catussahasrasaṃyuktaṃ catvāriṃśatsahasrakam |
daśāṃśaṃ juhuyāt dravyairaṣṭabhirmodakādibhiḥ || iti ||

udvāsanamudrayā udvāsya | siddhasaṅkalpaḥ siddhakāryaḥ | sukhī (")idametat 
khaṇḍīyāntimasūtrasthapadaṃ jñeyam |(") viharet iti pratipāditakarmaṇaḥ na 
kevalaṃ pratyūhanāśaḥ kintvidamapi phalamiti darśitam | etena 
śrīvidyopāstyanaupayikānaṅgasvatantragaṇanāyakopāstyā yadyadapekṣitaṃ tat 
sidhyatīti kṛtasaṅkalpeti padena sūcitam 
(")etacchrīgaṇeśapūjāpaddhatyanuṣṭhānaviśeṣajñānāya(-)śrīprapañcasāra 
gaṇeśapurāṇa śāradātilaka mantramahodadhyāditāntrikagranthā dṛṣṭavyāḥ |(") 
| śivam iti pūrvavat prakaraṇasamāptidyotakam ||

[iti śrīrāmeśvaranirmitāyāṃ saubhāgyodayanāmnyāṃ 
paraśurāmasūtravṛttau gaṇanāyakapaddhatirnāma dvitīyakhaṇḍaḥ samāptaḥ] ||

sūtrasya punarāvṛttau śodhyaṃ sūcayitavyakam |
pariśiṣṭasthalaṃ caiva pūrṇamādyāprasādataḥ || [iti dvitīyaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] śrīḥ | 




<p. 85>

[tṛtīyaḥ khaṇḍaḥ (-) śrīkramaḥ ]

lalitā'dhikāraḥ 

nityaughatrayamilitāmaṣṭāvaraṇāṅgaṣaṭkasaṃvītām |
cintayatāṃ tatkṛpayā vāco niryāntyayatnato vadanāt ||

evaṃ pūrvakhaṇḍena śrīlalitopāstyaṅgabhūtaṃ gaṇapatyupāsanamuktvā 
śrīparadevatāyāḥ śrīlalitāyāḥ kramaṃ vaktumupakramate(-)

evaṃ gaṇapatimiṣṭvā vidhūtasamastavighnavyatikaraḥ śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ 
śrīlalitāyāḥ kramamārabheta || 1 || 

evamiti vighnavyatikaraḥ(-)ityantena granthena pūrvaṃ kaṃcitkālaṃ 
gaṇapatyārādhanaṃ kṛtvā paścāt śrīlalitopāstyārabhya iti sūcitam | evaṃ 
pūrvoktaprakāreṇa iṣṭvā upāsya vidhūtā nirastāḥ samastāḥ saṃpūrṇāḥ 
vighnānāṃ vyatikarāḥ saṅghātāḥ yena ||

gaṇanāyakopāsteḥ pradhānakarmatvam 

idam adhikāriviśeṣaṇam | ayam utpattividhiḥ | pūrvaviśeṣaṇasvārasyāt 
adhikāravidhirapi | yadvā(-)nādhikāriviśeṣaṇamidam tathā sati 
gaṇapaterupāsanāyāḥ agnimopāsanāṅgatvāpatteḥ | na ceṣṭāpattiḥ | 
tārtīyaśrutiliṅgādīni aṅgatvasādhakāni ṣaṭ pramāṇāni | tanmadhye 
tṛtīyavākyapramāṇasiddham aṅgatvam tadbādhakaliṅgaśrutyorabhāvena 
pramāṇasiddhāṅgatvāpahnavasya kartumaśakyatvāt | kiṃ tu 
gaṇapatyupāstyuttaravṛttitvarūpakramaviśiṣṭalalitopāstiranena vidhīyate | yadvā(-)
pūrvopāstirūpaguṇaviśiṣṭakramaviśeṣaviśiṣṭo vā ayamārambhaḥ | 
tatkālalalitopāstiḥ anena vidhīyate | vidhūtasamastavighnavyatikara iti 
pūrvoktaphalasyānuvādakam | evaṃ cārambho nāma saṅkalpaviśeṣaḥ 
darśapūrṇamāsāvārapsye itivat | lalitākramamārabheta ityanena yāvajjīvaṃ 
vartiṣye iti saṅkalpaḥ siddhaḥ | tadaṅgaṃ gaṇapatyārādhanam | 
etadguṇakasaṅkalpaśca śrīlalitopāstau prayājādivadārādupakārakaḥ 
pradhānakarma yaistu dravyaṃ na cikīrṣyate iti jaiminisūtroktalakṣaṇasattvāt | na 
ca adhikāriviśeṣaṇatve saṃpratyuktaviśiṣṭavidhirūpatve vā anuṣṭhāne ko 
viśeṣa iti vācyam | yadyadhikāriviśeṣaṇaṃ tarhi pramādādinā 
gaṇapatyupāstimakṛtvā lalitopāstyārambhe anadhikāriṇā andhādinā 
anuṣṭhitadarśapūrṇamāsavat tāvatparyantakṛtasya karmaṇo'phalatvena yadā 
sāvadhānatā tadā lalitopāstiṃ tyaktvā gaṇapatyupāstiṃ saṃpādya 
saṃpannādhikāraḥ tataḥ śrīvidyopāstiṃ kuryāt | viśiṣṭavidhipakṣe 
gaṇapatyupāsterārambhāṅgatvena ārambhasya ca lalitopāstyaṅgatvena 

<p. 86> 

vismṛtyārambhe jāte sati aṅgalopajanitadoṣaparihārāya kiṃcidvihitaṃ 
prāyaścittam nāṅgānusāreṇa pradhānāvṛttiḥ | na ca 
atyantamaṅgalopādvaraṃ tasyānuṣṭhānaṃ pradhānasyāṅgānanurodhitvānmā 
bhavatvāvṛttiḥ aṅgaṃ tu kevalamanuṣṭhīyatām iti vācyam | 
pradhānapūrvāṅgānāṃ yāvatāṃ pradhānena apūrve jananīye sahakāritvaṃ 
kāmye pradhānenāpūrve jananīye sahakāriṇo'bhāvāt anantaraṃ pradhānasya 
naṣṭatvena kevalāṅgānuṣṭhāne tadapi vyartham | nitye tu yāvajjīvaṃ kartavyam 
ityaṅgaloparahitaṃ ca kartavyam ityukte aśakyānuṣṭhānarūpatvena śāstrasya 
aprāmāṇyāpattibhiyā sakalāṅgam ityasya 
yāvacchakyayāvajjñātasakalāṅgamiti vākyasaṅkoco yuktaḥ | tathā ca 
yathāśakti yāvajjñātairevāṅgaiḥ sahitapradhānena apūrvotpattiḥkalpyata iti 
kḷptaṃ ṣaṣṭhe | tathā ca lalitopāsternityatvena ajñātayatkiṃcidaṅgalope'pi 
pradhānenetarāṅgasahitena apūrvajananāt punaraṅgānuṣṭhānasya vyarthatvāt 
na gaṇapatyupāstirūpasyāṅgasyājñātasya punaranuṣṭhānam | yadi 
vighnanirāsārthaṃ kiṃcidanuṣṭheyaṃ tarhi vināyakastavapāṭhādikaṃ 
tanmantrajapa eva vā kāryaḥ | evaṃprakārānuṣṭhānabhedo'sti iti tadvicāraḥ 
kṛtaḥ | ito'dhikaṃ sudhiyo vicārayantu ||

śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ śakticakrāṇi śrīcakrāvayavanavacakrāṇāṃ madhye 
trikoṇādīni pañcacakrāṇi | taduktaṃ brahmāṇḍapurāṇe(-)

caturbhiḥ śivacakraiśca śakticakraiśca pañcabhiḥ |
navacakraiśca saṃsiddhaṃ śrīcakraṃ śivayorvapuḥ ||
trikoṇamaṣṭakoṇaṃ ca daśakoṇadvayaṃ yathā |
caturdaśāraṃ caitāni śakticakrāṇi pañca ca || iti ||

teṣām ekā mukhyā nāyikā yā tasyāḥ | yadvā(-)śaktayaḥ sadhavāḥ striyaḥ 
tāsāṃ cakraṃ samūhaḥ teṣāṃ madhye ekā advitīyā ceyaṃ nāyikā (")nāthā 
śreṣṭhā | na ca(-)ba |(") jaganniyantrī | na ca na nirdhāraṇe iti ṣaṣṭhīsamāsaniṣedhāt 
kathamayamarthaḥ iti vācyam ṣaṣṭhīsamāsaniṣedhe'pi puruṣottamaḥ(-)itivat 
saptamīsamāse bādhakābhāvāt | yadvā(-)tattadvastuniṣṭhatattatkāryanirvāhikāḥ 
śaktayaḥ tāsāṃ samūhasyaikā advitīyā nāyikā prerikā taduktaṃ 
śrīdevībhāgavate(-)

śivādyavaniparyante śaktayaḥ kāryasādhakāḥ |
mayaiva preritā viddhi tāḥ sarvā munisattama || iti ||

yadvā(-)śaktayaḥ śyāmāvārtālīprabhṛtayaḥ tā eva cakraṃ parivāraḥ cakraṃ 
sevyaṃ nṛpaḥ sevyaḥ ityabhiyuktaprayogāt | tāsāmekanāyikā advitīyaniyantrī 
ityarthaḥ | etena śrīvidyāyāḥ prādhānyaṃ sūcitam | śakticakraikanāyiketi 
lalitāyā guṇaḥ | tathā ca viśiṣṭasya devatātvaṃ utpattivākye 

<p. 87>

śrūyamāṇaguṇaviśiṣṭasya devatātvāt yadagnaye pavamānāya(-)agnaye 
pāvakāya ityādivat utpattivākye śrutadevatāyāḥ sarvatroccāraṇamiti niyamāt | 
itthaṃ ca yatra devatānāmakīrtanamāvaśyakaṃ tatra guṇaviśiṣṭasyaiva 
kīrtanam yathā sandhyājapādau sandhyāpūjā'dau śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ 
śrīlalitāyāḥ prītaye amukakarma kariṣya iti | evaṃ nivedane | anyathā 
pavamāneṣṭau agnaye juṣṭaṃ nirvapāmi ityeva syāt | tasmāt 
guṇaviśiṣṭadevatāyojanaṃ mantreṣvatra kāryam | kramaṃ pūjām upāsanāṃ 
vā ārabhet ||

lalitānāmanirvacanam 

lalitānāmanirvacanaṃ padmapurāṇe(-)

lokānatītya lalate lalitā tena cocyate | iti ||

atra cakāradyotyaṃ niruktyantaraṃ darśayāmāsurasmatparameṣṭhiguravaḥ 
sahasranāmabhāṣye(-)lalitaṃ śṛṅgārabhāvajanyaḥ kriyāviśeṣaḥ tadvatī lalitā | 
tena śṛṅgārarasapradhāneyaṃ mūrtiriti dhvanitam || 1 || 

brāhmamuhūrtakartavyadhyānādi 

tato (")itaḥ paraṃ lalitopāsakena anudinaṃ kartavyāḥ kriyā āha iti ba kośe(.") 
gurudhyānādīnupadiśati sūtradvayena(-)

brāhme muhūrte brāhmaṇo muktasvāpaḥ pāpavilāpāya paramaśivarūpaṃ 
gurumabhimṛśya || 2 ||

brāhmaḥ muhūrtaḥ(-)divasaṃ ṣaṣṭighaṭikā'tmakaṃ triṃśatā vibhajya 
aṣṭāviṃśo muhūrtaḥ sa brāhmaḥ | taduktaṃ devībhāgavate(-)

aṣṭāviṃśatitamo yaśca muhūrto brahmanāmakaḥ |
tasminnutthāya matimāṃścintayedātmano hitam (")itonyadapi purāṇaprasiddhaṃ 
brāhmamuhūrttalakṣaṇaṃ tatra svāpaniṣedhopi viṣṇupurāṇe 
ratnāvalyādigranthādau ca(-)yathā(-)
rātreḥ paścimayāmasya muhūrto yastṛtīyakaḥ | sa brāhma iti vijñeyo vihitaḥ sa 
prabodhane ||
pañca pañca uṣaḥkālāḥ sapta pañcāruṇodayaḥ | aṣṭa pañca 
bhavetprātastataḥ sūryodayaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
tatra phalaṃ dhanvantariḥ(-)dharmārthakāmaprītyarthe satāṃ grahaṇamuttamam | 
prāpnuyātsvargavāsaṃ ca nityamevaṃ samācaret ||
ratnāvalyāṃ ca | brāhme muhūrte yā nidrā sā puṇyakṣayakāriṇī | tāṃ karoti 
dvijo mohātpādakṛcchreṇa śudhyatīti ||(") || iti ||

tasmin brāhmaṇaḥ muktasvāpaḥ nidrāṃ tyaktvā | tasmin samaye nidrātyāgasya 
sāmānyataḥ smṛtiprāptatve'pi kratvarthatvena aprāptamanena vidhīyate | 
darśapūrṇamāsaprakaraṇe nānṛtaṃ vadet itivat kratvarthatvam | 
tasminnidrā'bhāve prāśastyaṃ ca tripurārahasye(-)

dvimuhūrtāvaśeṣe tu sūryasyodayanaṃ prati |
uṣaḥkālaḥ samākhyātaḥ sādhakānāṃ śubhāvahaḥ ||

<p. 88>

tatkāle yo yamarthaṃ vai cintayenniścalāntaraḥ |
tadasya jāyate rāma kālavelāsvabhāvataḥ ||
yastu kalpadrumaprakhye kāle'sminnāvabudhyate |
buddhvā vā svaṃ hitaṃ niava cintayatyatimūḍhadhīḥ ||
sarvaiḥ svārthaiḥ paribhraṣṭaḥ paṅke gauriva sīdati || iti ||

īdṛśe kāla utthāya sarvapāpakṣayāya(-)tādarthye caturthī | śiva (")atra pūrvatane 7 
patre 1 sūtrabhāṣye vṛttikṛdudāhṛte śrutipathagalitānāmityādiśloke śrīsūtopi 
śrīśivaṃ bhagavantaṃ gurugururityāha(-)tathaivātra sthalepi bhagavān 
śrījāmadagnyo rāmopyenaṃ parameṣthinaṃ śrīśivaparamaśivaṃ 
gurumityācacaṣṭa idamevātiśāyi namasyatvaṃ madādevatvaṃ ceśasya 
guruguroriti(-)pa(.)(-)ka(.)(-)sū(.)(-)dvitīyāvṛttiddipariśiṣṭakāraḥ (") eva guruḥ na tato'nyaḥ 
iti abhimṛśya manasi dhyātvā || 2 ||

mūlādividhibilaparyantaṃ taḍitkoṭikaḍārāṃ taruṇadivākarapiñjarāṃ 
jvalantīṃ mūlasaṃvidaṃ dhvātvā tadraśminihatakaśmalajālaḥ kādiṃ hādiṃ 
vā mūlavidyāṃ manasā daśavāramāvartya || 3 ||

mūlam ādhāracakraṃ tadādi tadārabhya vidhibilaparyantam etasya 
jvalantīmityanenānvayaḥ | taṭitkoṭayo vidyutkoṭayaḥ tadvat kaḍārāṃ kapiśāṃ 
taruṇadivākaraḥ nabhomadhyavartī sūryaḥ tadvat piñjarām ata eva jvalantīṃ 
mūlasaṃvidaṃ nirviṣayacittaṃ dhyātvā tadraśmibhiḥ cidrūpajvālāraśmibhiḥ 
nihatāni parihṛtāni kaśmalānāṃ jālāni samūhāḥ yena īdṛśaḥ san kādiṃ 
kāmopāsitāṃ hādiṃ lopāmudropāsitāṃ vā vidyāṃ pañcadaśīṃ manasā 
kramaviśiṣṭān varṇān dhyātvā ||

atra nibandhe svagurupādukoccāraḥ pañcamudrābhiḥ namanam anye ca 
svakapolakalpitāḥ ślokāśca likhitāḥ | te sūtrānabhimatā anādaraṇīyāḥ | 
evaṃ dantadhāvane mantrāḥ viṃśatigaṇḍūṣaniyamaḥ sarve'pi 
niṣpramāṇāstyājyāḥ || 3 ||

snānasandhyākarma 

tataḥ snānasandhye vadati(-)

snānakarmaṇi prāpte mūlena (")mūlena mūrdhani datvā(-)ba(.") datvā triḥ 
salilāñjalīn tristadabhimantritāḥ pītvā'pastrissantarpya triḥ prokṣyātmānaṃ 
paridhāya vāsasī (")mūlena ityadhikaḥ(-)ba2(.") hrāṃ (")gṛhamāgatya dīrghatrayānvito 
haṃsa ityuktvā ityadhikaḥ ta kośe(.") hrīṃ hrūṃ saḥ ityuktvā 
mārtāṇḍabhairavāya prakāśaśaktisahitāya svāheti trissavitre dattārghyaḥ || 4 ||

<p. 89>

snānakarmaṇi prāpte snānāvasare | etena vaidikasnānottaratvam asya sūcitam | 
ayamevārthaḥ spaṣṭamuktaḥ tripurā'rṇave(-)

traivarṇikairvaidikā'nte tāntrikaṃ kriyate'khilam || iti ||

atra pratyañjali mantrāvṛttiḥ | añjalīn iti bahuvacanena dravyabhede siddhe 
kriyāyā āvṛttirapi dravyabhede mantrāvṛtterekādaśe vyavasthāpitatvāt | dattvā 
ityasya kutretyākāṅkṣāyāṃ snānarūpatayā yogyatvāt svaśirasīti 
pūraṇīyam | mūlena iti mūlamuccārayanniti tadarthaḥ | triḥ tadabhimantritāḥ 
mūlābhimantritāḥ | trirityasya abhimantritā ityanenānvayaḥ sannihitatvāt na 
pītvetyanena viprakṛṣṭatvāt | tena mūlatrivārābhimantritānām apāṃ sakṛdeva 
prāśanam | triḥ santarpya mūlamuccārya śakticakraikanāyikāṃ śrīlalitāṃ 
tarpayāmīti mantrasya sakṛtpāṭhaḥ kriyā'bhyāsarūpatvāt | caturāvṛttitarpaṇe 
tu mantrāvṛttireva na kriyā'vṛttiḥ iti pūrvameva vyavasthāpitam | na hi 
dravyabhedaprāpakaṃ śāstramasti tasmāt sakṛdeva mantraḥ | 
prokṣaṇe'pyevameva | ātmānam iti śarīravācakaṃ mukhyārthasya 
prokṣaṇajanitasaṃskārāsambhavāt | tarpaṇaprokṣaṇayoḥ mantrānukteḥ 
mūleneti yojayet | taduktaṃ tripurā'rṇave(-)

mantrānuktau mūlamantraṃ yojayet parameśvari || iti ||

na mūlena dattvā ityasmādanuṣaṅga tathā sati tadabhimantritāḥ 
ityatrāpyanuṣaṅge tatpadavaiyyarthyāt | ato'dhyāhāra eva | vastraparidhānaṃ 
(")mūlena mūlamuccārayan iti tadarthaḥ ityadhikaḥ(-)ba 2(.") smṛtiprāptamanūdyate | 
tatphalaṃ snānakarmaparisamāptijñānaṃ jñeyam | ityuktvā 
(")vaidikasandhyottaraṃ tāntrikasadhyāṃ kariṣye iti saṅkalpya(-)ityadhikaḥ(-)ba(.) kośe(.") 
ityetāvadapahāya svāhā'nto'rghyadānamantraḥ | yadyapi mantraliṅgenaiva 
devatālābhe savitra iti vyartham | tathā'pi dattārghya ityatra dānapadārthaḥ 
svasvatvadhvaṃsapūrvakadevatoddeśyakadravyatyāgaḥ | sa ca amukadevatāyā 
idaṃ na mameti rūpaḥ | tatra mantraliṅgena mārtaṇḍabhairavāyedaṃ na mameti 
siddhaḥ | aindryā gārhapatyamupatiṣṭhate itivat taṃ bādhituṃ caturthyantaṃ 
savitre iti | atrāpi sakṛddattadravyasya punardānāsambhavāt aparārghye 
dravyāntaratvaṃ siddham | tathā ca dravyapṛthaktvāt mantrāvṛttiḥ yathā 
nānābījeṣvavahananamantraḥ || 5 ||

tataḥ śrīcakrabhāvanaṃ savitṛmaṇḍale devyai arghyadānaṃ ca vidhīyate(-)

tanmaṇḍalamadhye navayonicakramanucintya (")iyaṃ śrītripurāgāyatrī spaṣṭā 
yathā(-)aiṃ tripurasundari vidmahe klīṃ pīṭhakāmini dhīmahi | tannaḥ klinnā 
pracodayāt |(") vācamuccārya tripurasundari vidmahe kāmamuccārya pīṭhakāmini 
dhīmahi(-)śaktimuccārya tannaḥ klinnā pracodayāditi(-)trirmaheśyai dattārghyaḥ 
śatamaṣṭottaramāmṛśya manuṃ maunamālambya || 5 ||

<p. 90>

tasya savitṛmaṇḍalasya dṛśyamānavartulākārasya madhye navayonayaḥ catasraḥ 
parāṅmukhāḥ pañca svābhimukhā yonayo yasmin tat navayonicakraṃ 
śrīcakramityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ kāmikāgame(-)navayoniḥ śrīcakramiti | 
sundarīhṛdaye'pi(-)navayoniḥ śrīcakraṃ viśvasyotpattikāraṇaṃ proktam iti | 
śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | vācaṃ prathamakūṭaṃ 
śrīmadvāgbhavakūṭaikasvarūpamukhapaṅkajā iti pramāṇāt | 
prathamakūṭānantaraṃ vidmahe ityantaṃ paṭhet | tataḥ kāmaṃ madhyakūṭaṃ 
taduktaṃ cidgaganacandrikāyām(-)

śaktivāgbhavayormadhye kāmarājastu viśrutaḥ |
raktaśuklaprabhāmiśraḥ(......................) iti ||

taduccārya pīṭhakāmini dhīmahi iti paṭhet | śaktiṃ śaktikūṭaṃ tṛtīyam 
uccārya paṭhitvā śaktikūṭaikatā'pannakaṭyadhobhāgadhāriṇī iti 
sahasranāmapāṭhāt | tataḥ pracodayādityantaṃ paṭhet | idaṃ 
tripurāgāyatrītyapyucyate | śeṣaṃ pūrvavat | āmṛśya japitvā | śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam 
|| 

atra nibandhakāroktaṃ(-)snāne jale hastamātramaṇḍalakaraṇamārabhya vam iti 
bījena saptavāramabhimantraṇāntaṃ sandhyāyāṃ trirātmānaṃ 
prokṣyetyantaṃ(-)tantrāntarastham etattantrānusāriṇā na spraṣṭavyam | yadi 
spṛśyate tantrāntaraṃ tarhi sandhyātrayaṃ pārāyaṇakramaśca kena hetunā 
tyaktaḥ | tanmūlaṃ prāmāṇikaśced vadatu || 5 || 

yāgamandirapraveśādi 

tato yāgamandirapraveśādin vadati(-)

yāgamandiraṃ gatvā kḷptākalpassaṅkalpākalpo vā pīṭhamanunā āsane 
samupaviṣṭaḥ || 6 ||

yāgamandiraṃ pūjāsthānaṃ gatvā | etena sandhyā bahirjale nadyādāviti 
siddham | kḷptāḥ dhṛtāḥ ākalpāḥ bhūṣaṇāni yenedṛśaḥ | idaṃ 
bhūṣaṇadhāraṇaṃ pūjākarturaṅgam | ato loke pūjākarturdhāryāṇi yāni 
bhūṣaṇāni tānyavaśyaṃ dhāryāṇi | idaṃ ca śrīmatāṃ sambhavati | evaṃ sati 
daridrasya aṅgabhūtabhūṣaṇāsamarthasya andhādivadanadhikāraḥ prasaktaḥ | 
ata āha(-)saṅkalpākalpo veti | saṅkalpena mānasakriyayā kalpita ākalpo yenedṛśo 
vā | manasā nirmitabhūṣaṇadhāraṇakarteti yāvat | tathā ca 
daridrasyāpyastyadhikāra iti bhāvaḥ | bhūṣaṇāni padmarāgapracurāṇi 
bhūṣaṇaviśeṣaniyamasya tantrāntarasthasyāpi grahaṇamabhimatam ||

<p. 91>

yattu nibandhe dvārapūjāyāṃ tāmbūlabhakṣaṇamuktaṃ tat 
sūtrakārānabhimatam | yadvā(-)yāgamandire kriyāvidhānāt arthasiddhe gamane 
punaryāgamandiraṃ gatveti vyarthaṃ sat 
gaṇapatikramasthāntaḥpraviśyetyarthakaśabdakathanāt tadantadharmātideśaṃ 
jñāpayati | ata eva vārāhīkrame nāyaṃ śabdaḥ | tena śrīkrame śyāmākrame 
dvārapūjā'stu | tathā'pi śrīkrame tāmbūlabhakṣaṇaṃ nirmūlameva ||

pīṭhamanuneti pūrvaṃ vyākhyātam | samupaviṣṭa ityatra samityupasargeṇa ā 
samāpti ekāsanena stheyam iti jñāpayati | ata eva yenāsanena 
samāptiparyantamavasthāne svasya śramo na syāt tena padmādyanyatamenāsanena 
stheyamityarthaḥ ||

nibandhe bālātṛtīyabījena dvādaśavāramabhimantraṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa 
prokṣaṇam uktam | tat sūtrānabhimataṃ jñeyam || 6 ||

etatsaparyopayoginīṃ tritārīmāha(-)

tritārīmuccārya raktadvādaśaśaktiyuktāya dīpanāthāya nama iti bhūmau 
muñcet puṣpāñjalim || 7 ||

tritārīṃ vakṣyamāṇāmuktvā (")atraiva adhastane(-)sūtre bhāṣye ca(-)ityarthaḥ |(") 
nama ityantamuccaret | ayaṃ dīpanāthārhaṇamanuḥ | anena bhūmau 
puṣpāñjaliṃ dadyāt | puṣpāṇāmañjaligṛhītānāṃ pracayaḥ puṣpāñjaliḥ | 
taduktam agastyasaṃhitāyāṃ somavāravidhiprakaraṇe(-)

saṃśliṣṭahastadvayamadhyavartī prasūnapuñjaḥ kusumāñjaliḥ syāt || iti || 7 ||

sarvamantreṣu tritārīsaṃyogavidhiḥ 

sarvamantropayuktāṃ kāṃcit paribhāṣāmāha(-)

sarveṣāṃ mantrāṇāmādau tritārīsaṃyogaḥ | tritārī vāṅmāyākamalāḥ || 8 
||

atra sarvaśabdasya prakaraṇena saṅkocaṃ kṛtvā 
śrīvidyopāstyaṅgabhūtānāmetaduttarapaṭhitānām ityarthaḥ | 
tenaitatpūrvamantreṣu tritārīyogo nāstīti siddham | ata eva setubandhe(-)
yāgamandirapraveśottaraṃ kalpasūtre tritārīyogapāṭhāt tataḥ prāk mantreṣu na 
tadyoga iti mantavyam iti sthitam | ādāvityanena antavyāvṛttiḥ | yoga iti vaktavye 
samityupargeṇa tritāryuccāraḥ spaṣṭamabhūt | tato 
yatkiṃcidaṅgamantrapāṭhasamaye madhye yadi karaṇāpāṭavādidoṣeṇa eko 
varṇo luptaḥ tadā punarmantraḥ paṭhanīyaḥ tatrāpi punaḥ tritārīyogaḥ sūcitaḥ | 
yadvā(-)tritārīpāṭhānantaraṃ kenacit pratibandhena mantrapāṭhe yadi 
kṣaṇavilambaḥ tādṛśasthale punastritāryuccāro'vilambenoccāraṇarūpo 

<p. 92>

jñāpyate | yadyapyanenaiva dīpanāthārhaṇamantre tritārīyogaprāptau tatra 
tritārīmuccāryeti vyartham | tathā'pi tatra tritārīmuktveti tanmantraghaṭakatvaṃ 
tritāryā jñāpayati | eyaṃ paribhāṣā ca tritārīyogena mantrāṇāṃ 
saṃskāraṃ vadati iti na vaiyyarthyam ||

yattu nibandhe dīpanāthārhaṇottaraṃ gaṇapatinamanaṃ gurunamanam 
aṅguṣṭhādikaniṣṭhāntavyāpakamiti prāṇapratiṣṭhā ca tatsarvaṃ 
tantrāntarastham anyaprakaraṇasthaṃ śrīvidyāprayoge na spraṣṭavyam ||

atra tritārī ketyākāṅkṣāyāmāha(-)tritārīti | vāk sabinduḥ dvādaśasvaraḥ | 
māyā turīyoṣmasahitadvitīyāntasthottarasabindusturyasvaraḥ | kamalā 
prathamoṣmasahitadvitīyāntasthopari sabindusturyasvaraḥ | ete tritārīpadavācyā 
bhavantīti śeṣaḥ (")aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ(-)iti(-)saṃbhūya(-)tritārīmantraḥ |(") | 
vāgādīnāmuktārthatve pramāṇamagre vakṣyāmaḥ || 8 ||

śrīcakrasvarūpaṃ tatsādhanadravyaṃ ca 

itaḥ paraṃ śrīcakrasvarūpaṃ tatsādhanadravyaṃ cāha(-)

purataḥ pañcaśakticatuḥśrīkaṇṭhamelanarūpaṃ bhūsadanatrayavalitrayabhūpa(-)
patradikpatrabhuvanāradruhiṇāravidhikoṇadikkoṇatrikoṇabinducakramayaṃ 
mahācakrarājaṃ sindūrakuṅkumalikhitaṃ (")militaṃ(-)a |(") 
cāmīkarakaladhautapañcaloharatnasphaṭikādyutkīrṇaṃ vā niveśya || 9 ||

purata ityasya niveśyetyanena sākamanvayaḥ | pañcaśaktayaḥ śakticakrāṇi 
catuḥśrīkaṇṭhāḥ catvāri śivacakrāṇi eṣāṃ melanarūpam abhinnasvarūpam | 
etena viśeṣaṇena etādṛśasvarūpajñānaṃ pūjā'dāvāvaśyakamiti sūcitam | 
etanmelanaprakāraḥ pūjākāle īdṛśajñānasyāvaśyakatā coktā 
brahmāṇḍapurāṇe(-)

trikoṇe baindavaṃ śliṣṭamaṣṭāre'ṣṭadalāmbujam |
daśārayoḥ ṣoḍaśāraṃ bhūgṛhaṃ bhuvanāsrake ||

śaivānāmapi śāktānāṃ cakrāṇāṃ ca parasparam |
avinābhāvasambandhaṃ yo jānāti sa cakravit ||

evaṃ vibhāgamajñātvā śrīcakraṃ yo'rcayet sakṛt |
na tatphalamavāpnoti lalitā'mbā na tuṣyati || iti ||

<p. 93>

ayamevārthastantreṣu bahu pratipāditaḥ | granthavistarabhayānneha 
tatratyavacanāni likhitāni | bhūsadanatrayaṃ paritaḥ caturasrarekhātrayam | 
caturasrabhūsadanaśaktigrāhakaṃ pramāṇaṃ tu(-)

tadbāhye vṛttamālikhya tadbāhye caturasrakam |

iti tantrāntaravacanam | asmatparameṣṭhigurubhirapi setubandhe likhitaṃ bhūgṛhaṃ 
nāma caturasram iti ||

śrīcakre dvārarahitacaturasratrayalekhanasamarthanam 

nanu tantrāntaravacane caturasrakamityekavacanena ekameva caturasramiti pratīyate 
iha caturasratrayamityuktam dvayorvirodhe kathametaditi cet(-)na 
tattattantrānusāripuruṣabhedena vyavasthitavikalpasambhavāt | evaṃ 
sūtrānuyāyināṃ śrīcakre bhūpuraṃ dvārarahitam anuktatvāt ||

nanu tripurā'rṇave vṛttaṃ tato bhūpurāṇāṃ tritayaṃ dvāraśobhitam 
ityuktatvāt evaṃ nityātantre evaṃ tribhūsadanakaṃ caturdvāravibhūṣitam iti 
vāmakeśavaratantre pariveṣaṃ bhūpuraṃ ca caturdvāropaśobhitam iti 
evamāditantrānusāreṇa atrāpi dvāratātparyaṃ kalpyatām(-)iti cet(-)na vṛttatrayaṃ 
ca dharaṇīsadanatrayaṃ ca śrīcakrametaduditaṃ paradevatāyāḥ iti yāmalavacane 
evamanyeṣvapi tantreṣu dvārarahitabhūpuraśravaṇena vikalpasya durnivāratvāt | 
na caivaṃ dvārarahitabhūpurasya kenāpi 
nibandhakāreṇālikhitatvādidamaśraddheyam iti vācyam saundaryalaharyāṃ 
trayaścatvāriṃśat iti śloke dvārānukteḥ 
bhagavatpādānāmasmaduktapakṣasyaivābhimatatvāt | evaṃ 
prapañcasāraṅgrahe śrīvidyāraṇyasvāmibhirapi dvārarahitamapi śrīcakre 
caturasramupalabhyate kvaciditi granthena asmadanumatameva likhitam | 
evamaticirantanaśiṅgabhūpālapaddhatāvapi tathā'sti | idamanveṣituṃ pravṛttau 
anyānyapi nibandhāntaravākyāni miliṣyanti | etāvadalamiti na viśeṣayatnaḥ 
kṛtaḥ ||

itthaṃ cāhaṃ sūtrānuyāyīti viśeṣābhimānavatā nityotsavanibandhakāreṇa 
śrīcakralekhanaprakārakathanāvasare caturdvāraṃ bhūpuraṃ samudbhāvayet iti 
yato likhitam ata eva tena sūtraṃ na pariśodhitam | gatānugatikalokānusāreṇa 
likhitamiti sphuṭam ||

kiṃ ca nibandhakāraḥ śrībhāskararāyāṇāṃ śiṣya iti svanibandha eva lilekha | 
śrībhāskararāyoktasetubandhe pratidiśaṃ rekhātrayayuktaṃ 
dvārasāmānyābhāvavat iti tṛtīyaḥ pakṣaḥ | kalpasūtramasmin pakṣe 
anukūlamiti likhitam ||

kiṃ ca sarveṣāṃ mantrāṇām ādau tritārīsaṃyoga iti kalpasūtrasya 
yāgamandirapraveśottarameva pāṭhāt tataḥ prāktanamantreṣu na tadyoga iti 
setubandhe sthite ayaṃ muṣaḥkārī raśmimālāmantreṣu 

<p. 94>

sandhyāvandane ca tritārīṃ yojayāmāsa | tathā dvāracatuṣṭayaṃ ca 
yojayāmāsa | evaṃ sati gurumatamapi yaḥ ajānan svecchayā likhati sa kīdṛśa 
upāsakaḥ kīdṛśo vā guruśiṣyabhāvaḥ taṃ na vidmaḥ ||

yadi ca setubandhe prathamaṃ dvārasāmānyābhāvaṃ vilikhya agre tattvaṃ 
vicārya agre tatraiva dvārasāmānyābhāvapakṣastu 
dvārapratiṣedhaparyudāsānyataramantareṇa yāmalakalpasūtrādau 
dvārānuktimātreṇa kalpyamānaḥ sāhasamātram iti likhitatvāt kathaṃ 
gurumatānabhijñatetyucyate(-)tadā āstāṃ dvāraviṣaye gurumatābhijñatā | 
raśmimālāmantreṣu sandhyāmantreṣu ca tritārīyojane gurumatānabhijñatā 
vajralepāyitā | etenāyaṃ nibandhaḥ sarvatantrasvatantraśrībhāskararāyaiḥ 
pariśodhita ityaitihyamapi nirmūlamiti sphuṭaṃ yuktamutpaśyāmaḥ || 

valitrayaṃ vṛttatrayam (")etadviṣaye(-)ddi(.) pa(.)(-)śi(.)-11-vi(.)(-)dṛśyaḥ |(") | atra bahavaḥ(-)
ṣoḍaśadalasya aṣṭadalasya dve karṇikāvṛtte tayorbahiḥ ekaṃ vṛttaṃ evaṃ ca 
vṛttatrayaṃ na padmadvayasya bahirvṛttatrayam | yattu balitrayam iti kalpasūtram 
vṛttatrayaṃ ca dharaṇīsadanatrayaṃ ca iti yāmalavacanaṃ jyeṣṭārūpaṃ 
catuṣkoṇaṃ vāmārūpaṃ bhramitrayam itti yoginītantravacanam sarvam 
uktavṛttatrayaparamevetyāhuḥ ||

śrīcakre pañcavṛttalekhanasamarthanam 

atra asmatparameṣthiguravaḥ setubandhe vakṣyamāṇaprakārāntareṇa 
śrīcakralekhanāvasare(-)

bahiḥ padmadvayaṃ kuryādaṣṭaṣoḍaśakacchadam |
guṇavṛttaṃ tataḥ kuryāccaturasraṃ ca tadbahiḥ ||

iti vāmakeśvaratantravacane tataḥ padasvārasyena padmadvayādbahireva trīṇi 
vṛttāni tadanusāreṇa pariśeṣaṃ bhūpūraṃ ceti | atraikavacanamavivakṣitam | 
evaṃ ca pañca vṛttāni | ata eva jñānārṇave (")jñānārṇave-10 paṭale-72-73-
ślokāvimau staḥ |(")(-)

etadbāhye maheśāni vṛttaṃ pūrṇendusaṃnibham |
tadyutaṃ kuru mīnākṣi vasupatraṃ manoharam |
tathā ṣoḍaśapatraṃ tu vilikhet suravandite |
tadbāhye devadeveśi trivṛttaṃ mātṛkā'nvitam |

ityatra tadbāhya iti padena karṇikāvṛttādatiriktaṃ vṛttatrayaṃ suspaṣṭamuktam ||

tadvyākhyātāro'nye āgraheṇa tadbāhye iti ślokārdhaṃ svapustapakori 
likhitatvāt akṣaralekhanaprakārasya kasmiṃścittantre alekhanāt 
akasmānmātṛkā'nvitatvokterasaṅgatatvāt bahuṣu 

<p. 95>

pustakeṣu anupalabdheśca prakṣiptamiti paramatamanūdya tadupari yadi prakṣiptaṃ 
tarhi tṛtīyavṛttavidhāyakavacanābhāvāt vṛttadvayāpatteriti dūṣitatvāt 
saṃhitāyāṃ tantrāntare ca bahirvṛttatrayaṃ suspaṣṭamastīti likhitatvāt 
pañcavṛttānīti (setubandhe) vyavasthāpayāmāsuḥ |

atra maheśvarānandanāthāḥ(-)tadbāhye vṛttamālikhya tadbāhye caturasrakam iti 
paramānandatantre vṛttamityekavacanāt vṛttaṃ tato bhūpurāṇām iti vṛttaṃ 
tribhūsadanakam iti pariveṣaṃ bhūpuraṃ ca iti suvṛttaṃ parameśāni iti 
tripurārṇava(-)nityātantra(-)vāmakeśvaratantra(-)dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāsu 
ekavacanabalāt karṇikāvṛttadvayenaiva saha trivṛttamiti vyavasthāpya tataḥ 
setubandhamatamanūdya taddūṣaṇe setubandha eva 
vāmakeśvaratantrajñānārṇavavacanayoḥ bahuṣu pustakeṣvanupalambhāditi 
śrībhāskararāyalekhaṃ hetutvenopanyasya setubandhaṃ dūṣayāmāsuḥ ||

ayaṃ prakāro'siddhaḥ | setubandhe taiḥ siddhāntāvasare bahuṣu 
pustakeṣvanupalambhāditi noktaḥ | kiṃ tu vādimatānuvādavelāyām upanyastaḥ | 
sa ca vādino lekhaḥ | tena hetunā śrībhāskararāyamataṃ kathaṃ nirastam | 
rāyaiśca pratyuta matpustakamadhyalekhāt pramāṇameveti pratibandyuttaraṃ 
vṛttadvayāpattiśceti dūṣaṇadvayaṃ dattam | kiṃ ca vāmakeśvaratantravacane na 
ko'pi vivādaṃ lilekha | evaṃ sati tatrāpi nirmūla īdṛśo doṣāropaḥ kevalaṃ 
svapāṇḍityaprakaṭanārtha eva | ato vāmakeśvaratantravacanasya 
vṛttatrayaprāpakasya jñānārṇavasya ca gatimakalpayitvā na 
vṛttapañcakanivṛttirbhaviṣyati ||

yadi ca niruktaikavacanabalādeva yāmalakavacanena aṣṭadalaṣoḍaśadaleti 
pṛthaguktvā taduttaraṃ śrūyamāṇavṛttatrayetipade trayamityasya 
samudāyānuvādakatvarūpavaiyyarthyamaṅgīkṛtya evaṃ vāmārūpaṃ 
bhramitrayamityatra aṣṭadalaṣoḍaśadalāvayavasya bhramereva 
vāmārūpatvakalpanāyāsaḥ kriyate | tarhi tadbāhye 
caturasrakamityatrāpyekavacanaṃ tulyam | tadupodbalakāni vacanāni(-)
vāmakeśvaratantre pariveṣaṃ bhūpuraṃ ca iti tatraiva ṣaṣṭhapaṭale 
vāmārūpaṃ catuṣkoṇam iti pūrvatantre ca guṇavṛttaṃ tataḥ kuryāccaturasraṃ 
ca tadbahiḥ iti dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām(-)suvṛttaṃ parameśāni tato 
bhubimbamālikhet ityādivacanāni | evaṃ vacaneṣu satsu ekavacane nirbharavataḥ 
atra paramānandatantraṭippaṇyām caturasraṃ caturasratrayam (")taccaturasratrayaṃ 
tribhiraṅgulaiḥ ityadhikaḥ(-)ba 2(.") iti maheśvarānandanāthalekhaḥ 
sandarbhaviruddha eva ||

yadi ca bhūpurāṇāṃ tritayaṃ dvāraśobhitam ityāditantravacanairekavacanaṃ 
tatratyamavivakṣitamityucyate tarhi vṛttamityatraikavacanena ko'parādho'nuṣṭhitaḥ 
| evaṃ bahuṣvekavacanaṃ loke vede ca prayujyamānaṃ bahūpalabhyate | loke gṛhe 
dhānyamasti saṃpanno vrīhi iti 

<p. 96>

hetustadudbhave iti īdṛśasthale jātyekavacanamiti vadanti śiṣṭāḥ | brāhmaṇo 
mama daivatam iti purāṇaprayogaḥ | śrutau bahupatnīkadarśapūrṇamāse patnīṃ 
saṃnahya gṛhaṃ saṃmārṣṭi ityevamādīni bahūni santi | tadvadupapateḥ 
naikavacanasya sarvathā gatyabhāvaḥ ||

na ca(-)uktasthaleṣu bādhakavaśādekavacanasya lakṣaṇāṃ bahutve kalpayitvā 
ekavacanaṃ nirvāhyam | prakṛte'pi tadvatpakṣāśrayaṇe 
vāmakeśvaratantrasthasya guṇavṛttaṃ tataḥ ityatra tata ityasyaiva lakṣaṇāyāṃ 
tātparyagrāhakatā vācyā | sā ca na sambhavati | 
tataḥpadaghaṭitavāmakeśvaratantrasya tadbāhye vṛttam iti 
paramānandatantrasyaikavacanaghaṭitasya tulyabalatvena ekavacanānusāreṇa tata 
ityasyaiva lakṣaṇāpakṣaṃ avivakṣāpakṣaṃ vā'śrityaikavacanavivakṣaiva kimiti 
na kriyate | dvayormadhye anyatarasya anyathānayane kārye tata iti 
padasvārasyenaikavacanamavivakṣitaṃ na viparītamityatra niyāmakābhāvāt(-)iti 
vācyam | pratyayārthaprātipadikārthayormadhye ekānusāreṇa 
aparasyānyathānayane prāpte prātipadikasya prabalatvena tadanusāreṇa 
vacanapratyayārthasyaivānyathā nayanam | taduktaṃ śrīvidyāraṇyasvāmibhiḥ(-)

triranūktir(-)ṛco dharmaḥ sthānadharmo'tha nāgrimaḥ |
strīliṅgatvānna tatprātipadikaprabalatvataḥ ||

iti prātipadikaprābalyasādhakayuktayo'pi bahvyaḥ santi | 
granthavistarabhayādabhiyuktoktikḷptaiva likhitā | tasmāt prātipadikībhūta tata 
ityanusāreṇa ekavacanameva anyathā neyam | tathā ca sudhiyā āgrahaṃ parityajya 
kevalatattvabubhutsunā vicāryamāṇe sarvatantreṣvapi vacanamātrasyāvivakṣāṃ 
kṛtvā śrīyantre pañcavṛttānyabhimatānīti sidhyediti | prakṛtamanusarāmaḥ ||

bhūpapatramiti(-)bhūpā iti ṣoḍaśasaṅkhyāyāḥ saṅketaḥ | ṣoḍaśa patrāṇi 
yasmiṃstat | dikpatraṃ(-)digityaṣṭasaṅkhyāyāḥ saṃjñā tāvanti patrāṇi 
yasmiṃstat | bhuvanāraṃ(-)bhuvanamiti caturdaśasaṅkhyāyāḥ saṃjñā 
tāvadaraṃ tāvatkoṇam | druhiṇāraṃ druhiṇa iti daśasaṅkhyāyāḥ saṃjñā 
śrībhāgavatādau sṛṣṭinimittānāṃ daśaprajāpatīnāṃ kardamādīnāṃ 
prasiddhatvāt | tāvadaraṃ daśakoṇamityarthaḥ | etena vidhikoṇamiti ca 
vyākhyātaprāyam | dikpadaṃ ca vyākhyātam | trikoṇabindu spaṣṭau | 
mayamityanena samaṣṭyekarūpatvaṃ jñāpitam | mahācakrarājaṃ(-)cakrarājamiti 
śrīcakrasya nāma tatra mahattvaṃ pūjyatvaṃ maha pūjāyāṃ ityanuśāsanāt | 
tathā ca brahmaviṣṇurudrādisakalapūjyamityarthaḥ | sindūraṃ prasiddhaṃ 
kuṅkumaṃ kāśmīram etadanyatareṇa | yadvā(-)dvandvasamāsena sāhityapratīteḥ 
sindūrasahitakuṅkumena likhitam ||

<p. 97>

navyāstu(-)yadā bhūmau prastāro likhyate tadā kuṅkumarajobhiḥ pūraṇaṃ 
meruprastāraścet sindūrarajobhiriti vyavasthāmāhuḥ | tatra mūlaṃ cintyam ||

lekhanaprakārasya asmatparameṣṭigurukṛtasetubandhe savistaramuktatvānnātra 
likhyate | etāvatparyantaṃ pūjāsamaye nityayantranirmāṇaprakāraḥ uktaḥ | 

idānīṃ siddhayantre'pi pūjāprakāraṃ yantranirmāṇadravyaniyamaṃ cāha(-)
cāmīkaretyādinā | cāmīkaraṃ suvarṇaṃ kaladhautaṃ raupyam | yadyapi 
kaladhautapadaṃ suvarṇavācakamapi bhavati | kaladhautaṃ raupyahemnoḥ iti 
kośāt tathā'pi suvarṇasya pūrvamuktatvādraupyameva | pañcalohaṃ 
tallakṣaṇamuktaṃ tantrasāre bṛhatpāñcarātre ca(-)

raupyaṃ nṛpaguṇaṃ proktaṃ diksaṅkhyo hemabhāgakaḥ | 
tāmraṃ dvādaśabhāgaḥ syāllohabhāgasya pañcakam |
ārakūṭasya ṣaḍbhāgāḥ pañcalohaṃ prakīrtitam || iti ||

ārakūṭaṃ pittalaṃ śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | ratnāni marakatādīni teṣu utkīrṇaṃ 
pūrvoktaśāstreṇa nirmitam | ādipadāt tāmradṛṣadādikaṃ 
paramānandatantroktaṃ grāhyam | idamapi pūrvoktacakrarāje viśeṣaṇam | 
īdṛśaṃ cakrarājaṃ purato niveśya ||

atra pūjanaṃ mukhyam | etasyālābhe tantrāntaroktapratinidhisvīkāro'pi kāryaḥ | 
taduktaṃ paramānandatantre(-)

ādarśe caikaguṇitaṃ pustake dviguṇaṃ phalam |
pratimāyāṃ caturdhāṃ syāt śāligrāmeṣu ṣoḍaśa ||

śivanābhe śataguṇaṃ pūjanāt puruṣārthakam |
sahasradhā nārmade tu phalaṃ devi pracikṣate ||

kuṇḍalyāṃ lakṣaguṇitaṃ devatādarśanaṃ bhavet |
cakrarāje tu yā pūjā sā'nantaphaladāyinī || iti ||

imāni tu paṭhitakrame uttarottarābhāve pūrvaṃ pūrvaṃ grāhyam | 
etādṛśārthatātparyagrāhakameva phalatāratamyaśravaṇam | kuṇḍalī 
śeṣakuṇḍalī | pustakaṃ kulaśāstrapustakam | pratimā dhyānaślokasthākārā | 
śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam ||

yantrapratiṣṭhā sūtre anuktatvāt na kartavyā sūtrānuyāyibhiḥ | evaṃ 
prāṇapratiṣṭhā'pi na kāryā sūtrānuyāyibhiḥ anuktatvāt 
anākāṅakṣitatvācca | vastuvastu(-)yantrapratiṣṭhāyāḥ 

<p. 98>

pūjāprayogabahirbhūtatvāt adhikābhyudayecchāyāṃ 
tantrāntaroktamanuṣṭheyaṃ (")etadyantrapratiṣṭhākaraṇākaraṇaviṣaye(-)ddi(0) 
pariśiṣṭa 11-vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") yathā sahasranāmapāṭhādi | tatkaraṇe abhyudayaḥ 
akaraṇe'pi na hāniḥ sūtrānuyāyinām | yathā vā yajñopavītasaṃskāraḥ 
baudhāyanasūtre paṭhitaḥ | anyasūtrāpaṭhitatvāt bahvalpaṃ vā iti sūtrāt 
ananuṣṭhāne na hāniriti draviḍāndhradeśīyāḥ yajñopavītasya na saṃskāraṃ 
kurvanti | mahārāṣṭradeśīyaistu karaṇe abhyudayaṃ matvā saṃskāraḥ kriyate | 
tadvat cakrarāje saṃskāre abhyudayaḥ akaraṇe sūtrānuyāyināṃ na hāniḥ || 9 ||

