svarānte vyañjanasyādṛṣṭatvādādāveva yojyam | itthaṃ(-)haiṃ hklīṃ hsauḥ(-)
śrīcakrāsanāya namaḥ(-)ityeko mantraḥ | śivabhṛguyuk(-)śivo hakāraḥ bhṛguḥ 
sakāraḥ sakārādhikāre jagadbījaṃ śaktināmā so'haṃ vegavatī bhṛguḥ iti 
nandanakośāt | etadubhayayuktā bālā hsaiṃ hsklī hssauḥ(-)sarvamantrāsanāya 
namaḥ(-)iti dvitīyo mantraḥ | bhuvanā bhuvaneśvarī tasya mantro māyābījarūpa 
evoddhṛtaḥ devībhāgavate(-)śivamāyā'gnibindumān iti vacanāt | śivo hakāraḥ | 
māyā īkāraḥ | agniḥ rephaḥ | binduḥ prasiddhaḥ | eṣāṃ yoge hrīmiti bhavati 
bhuvaneśī ca lajjā ca hṛlekhā kuladevatā iti kośāt | prakṛte'pi sa eva madano 
vyākhyātaḥ | tathā ca(-)hrīṃ klīṃ bleṃ sādhyasiddhāsanāya namaḥ(-)iti tṛtīyo 
mantraḥ | evaṃ tribhirmantraiḥ krameṇa cakramantradevatā'sanāni cakre 
kalpayitvā | ayaṃ caturāsananyāsa iti kathyate || 18 ||

