pāśādhikaraṇanyāyena ṣaṇmantreṣu ekatvānvayāsambhavāt ||

vastutastu(-)aṅgamantravṛttisaṅkhyāyāḥ ṣaṭpadenaiva 
bodhitatvādvacanārtho'vivakṣita eva | tathā ca autsargikamekavacanameva yuktam | 
na ca viśeṣaṇavācakaṣaṭpadasamānavacanakatvahāniriti vācyam ṣaṭpadena 
sākaṃ samāsāṅgīkāreṇa anupapattyabhāvāt | anenāpi jalasaṃskāra eva ||

yadvā(-)ṣaḍaṅgamantraiḥ ṣaḍaṅgadevatāḥ tasminneva śaṅkhodake 
kūṭatrayadvirāvṛttyā krameṇa hṛdayāya namaḥ hṛdayaśaktiśrīpādukāṃ 
