svasūtre niṣedhābhāve sati tantrāntare vidyamānatvena vā uta tantrāntare 
dvipātraniṣedhaśravaṇādvāḥ | nādyaḥ vrīhibhiryajeta ityatra na godhūmairiti 
niṣedhābhāvāt godhūmayogenāpyapūrvaṃ syāt | na dvitīyaḥ tathā sati 
paraśurāmasūtroktasaṅgītamātṛkāvārāhyādyupāsteḥ śrīvidyā'ṅgatvena 
saubhāgyānandasandohe pareṣāmapi īdṛśāṅgatyāgasya niryuktikatvāpattiḥ | 
etena tṛtīyapakṣo'pi nirastaḥ | nāpi caturthaḥ | tathā hi yo'yaṃ tasmāt 
pātradvayaṃ devi naiva kuryāt kadācana iti niṣedhaḥ yā ca nindā(-)

ālasyenānyathā vā'pi kṛtvā pātradvayaṃ śive |
pūjāphalena hīnastu vikriyāṃ labhate naraḥ ||

iti tripātrakamiti vidhiśeṣārthavādaḥ | anyathā tripātravidhinaiva 
dvipātravyāvṛttau niṣedhasya nivṛttirūpaphalābhāvena vaiyyarthyāpatteḥ | yadi 
ca vidhinā pravṛttimātraṃ niṣedhena ca taditaranivṛttirityucyate tarhi ekādaśa 
prayājān yajati ityatra na dvādaśa na daśa iti vākyābhāvāt 
daśabhirdvādaśabhiśca prayājairapūrvaṃ syāt | tasmādvidhinaiva 
dvipātranivṛttau niṣedho vyarthaḥ san taccheṣo'rthavāda eva | arthavādasya 
stutimātre tātparyam | na tasminniṣedharūpatvamasti | kathaṃ niṣedhena hetunā 
tantrāntare tripātratvasādhanam ||

<p. 114>

	kiṃ ca(-)etattantre kati pātrāṇi (?) ityākāṅkṣāyāṃ svasūtre 
viśeṣāśravaṇāt tantrāntarasthaṃ pūrvavattu tripātrakam iti vacanameva 
ākāṅkṣāpūrakaṃ sat tripātraṃ sādhayatīti paramatam | tathā sati 
dvipātraprāpterevābhāvena niṣedhasya dūranirastatvāt ||

	na ca arthavāda iti vadatastava mate dvipātraprāptyabhāvena na dvipātraṃ 
kuryāditi vākyasya prāmāṇyaṃ kathaṃ cintyate iti vācyam | 
arthavādaghaṭakaniṣedhasya prāptipūrvakatvamiti na niyamaḥ tasya svārthe 
tātparyābhāvāt | ato'prāptārthaniṣedho'pi nirvahati yathā(-)nāntarikṣe na 
divyagniścetavyaḥ iti yadantarikṣe cinvīta antarikṣaṁ śucā'rpayet iti | 
tādṛśārthasya na svārthe tātparyam kiṃ tu prāśastyamātre | taccābādhitam ||

	na vā tantrayoḥ parasparaṃ prakṛtivikṛtibhāvaḥ sapramāṇaḥ yato vā 
prāptaṃ niṣidhyeta | na hyaprāptaniṣedhaḥ svapne'pi śrutaḥ ||

	kiṃ ca(-)paraprītaye arthavāde'pi āropitaniṣedhatvamastu | tathā'pi na 
teṣāṃ samīhitasiddhiḥ | tathā hi kalpasūtreṇa pātradvayaprāptiḥ 
paramānandatantreṇa tanniṣedhaḥ tathā sati tantrayoḥ samabalatvena 
grahaṇāgrahaṇavadvikalpa eva syāt | niṣedhaśāstrasyaiva svarucyā 
prābalyāṅgīkāre grahaṇapakṣastvatyantaṃ bādhyeta | vikalpa eva na syāt | 
dvipātraprayogo'śāstrīyaḥ iti vadatāṃ maheśvarānandanāthādīnāṃ vikalpo 
na hīṣṭaḥ | sa ca duṣparihāraḥ ||

	na ca(-)paraśurāmasūtre na kaṇṭharaveṇa dvipātraṃ kartavyamityuktam kiṃ 
tu pātradvayaprayogasthapāṭhānusāreṇa kalpyo vidhiḥ | tasmāt pātradvayaṃ 
devi naiva kuryāt iti pratyakṣo niṣedhaḥ | tathā ca pratyakṣeṇānumānikaṃ 
bādhyate | grahaṇāgrahaṇasthale ubhayaṃ pratyakṣamiti vikalpo yuktaḥ | prakṛte na 
tathā vaiṣamyāt (-) iti vācyam | agnīṣomīyapaśau adhrigupraiṣe ṣaḍviṁśatirasya 
vaḍkrayaḥ iti mantro'sti | tatra vaḍkrayaḥ prārśvasthīni asya paśoḥ 
ṣaḍviṃśatiriti tadarthaḥ | ayaṃ mantraḥ aśvamedhe agnīṣomīyavikṛtitvāt 
atideśena prāptaḥ | tathā sati aśvamedhe catustriṁśadvājino devabandhoḥ iti 
mantrāntaramasti | tena mantraliṅgena aśvasya pārśvāsthīni catustriṃśat iti 
siddham | tatsiddhau ṣaḍviṁśatirasya vaṅkrayaḥ iti mantre ṣaḍviṃśaliṅgavirodhe 
tatsthāne catustriṁśadasya vaṅkrayaḥ ityūhaḥ prāptaḥ | evaṃ sati 
aśvamedhaprakaraṇe punarevaṃ śrūyate(-)na catustriṁśaditi brūyāt 
ṣaḍviṁśatirityeva brūyāt iti | atra catustriṃśadityūhaśāstrasyānumānikatvāt 
taṃ bādhitvā na catustriṃśat iti niṣedhaḥ(-)nityaṃ pravartate iti 
pūrvapakṣamuktvā taduttaraṃ yatrānumāniko vidhiḥ niṣedhaśca pratyakṣaḥ 
tatra dvayorapi samabalatvamaṅgīkāryam | tathā hi prabaladurbalabhāvo hi na 
vastuni svābhāvikaḥ kutracidasti 

<p. 115>

kiṃ tvākāṅkṣāyāṃ śīghropasthitivilambopasthitiprayuktaḥ | yathā vikṛtau 
karmaviśeṣe prakṛtito vedyāstaraṇaṃ prāptam | tatra kena vedyāstaraṇaṃ 
kāryam ityākāṅkṣāyāṃ sādhanabodhakaṃ padaṃ yadi na syāt tadā 
prākṛtavedyāstaraṇasādhanaṃ smṛtvā kuśān buddhau āropya praścāt 
prakṛtivat kuśairāstaraṇaṃ kartavyamiti ānumānikaśabdakalpanayā ākāṅkṣā 
pūraṇīyā | tato'pi jhaṭiti śaramayaṃ barhirbhavati iti 
pratyakṣavākyenopasthitaśaraiḥ ākāṅkṣāśāntau bodhakaśāstrasya tadaṃśe 
ākāṅkṣāvirahāt durbalatvam | prakṛte na catustriṁśaditi brūyāt iti niṣedhasya 
prāptisāpekṣatvāt catustriṁśadvājinaḥ iti liṅgena pūrvaṃ vidhikalpanānantaraṃ 
vidhimanusṛtya pravṛttaṃ puruṣaṃ nivartayituṃ niṣedhaḥ paścāt pravṛttaḥ | na 
(")ataḥ yamupajīvya pravṛttaḥ tamatyantaṃ bādhitumasamarthassan pakṣe bādhate | 
ata īdṛśasthale (-)a(.) śrī ba2. (") kuśaśāstrāt pūrvaṃ śaraśāstramiva niṣedhaḥ 
vidhikalpanāt pūrvaṃ pravṛttikṣamaḥ | ata īdṛśasthale 
ānumānikavidhipratyakṣaniṣedhayoḥ tulyabalatvādvikalpa eveti navame 
turīyapāde siddhāntitaṃ jaiminitantre | prakṛte'pi tathā tulyabalatvādvikalpo 
duṣparihāraḥ ||

yadi ca sūtre pātradvayetikartavyatāsahitasthāpanakathanena prayogavidhau 
dvipātravidhirna kalpyate tantrāntarānusāreṇa pātradvayakathanaṃ 
tṛtīyasyāpyupalakṣakamiti kalpyate tadā sarveṣvapi tantreṣu tripātraprayogasyaiva 
tantrābhimatatvena dvipātrapravartakābhāvena dvipātravidheḥ 
śaśaśṛṅgasamatvena tanniṣedhasyāpi tādṛśatvena tena hetunā kathaṃ 
tvatsamīhitasiddhiḥ | seyaṃ ubhayataḥ pāśā rajjuḥ | tasmāt 
kalpasūtrayoginītantrānusāribhiḥ dvipātraprayogo niśśaṅkamanuṣṭheyaḥ ||

yattu paramānandatantraṭippaṇyāṃ saubhāgyānandasandohasaṃjñikāyāṃ 
ekonaviṃśollāse pañcadaśaślokavyākhyānāvasare (-) nanu 
paraśurāmasūtravāmakeśvarāditantreṣu proktapātradvayaṃ virudhyeta(-)iti 
cecchṛṇu | agrimollāse anukalpapūjāyāṃ pātradvayasya suspaṣṭaṃ 
vakṣyamāṇatvāt anukalpapūjāparaṃ paraśurāmasūtrāditantram | ata eva tatra 
śāpamocanamantrāṇāmabhāva iti suvacam | atha vā (-) ātmayogābhyāsiparam | 
ata eva tripurārṇave ātmayogaparāṇāṃ tu nāṅgalopena (")nāṅgalopo na 
bādhitaḥ(-)śrī(.") hīyate iti | ata eva śrībhāskararāyaiḥ 
ekapātrādisaṃkṣepapūjanaṃ abhyāsaśīlānāmiti setubandhe nirūpitam | atha 
vā 

paramāpatpakṣo vā | taduktaṃ tantre (-)

pratyakṣayugmapātraṃ vai kṛtvā śāpamavāpnuyāt |
kvacinmayaivopadiṣṭaḥ paramāpattikālikaḥ ||

(-)iti maheśvarānandanāthāḥ pakṣatrayamūcuḥ taccintyam ||

<p. 116>

paraśurāmasūtroktasaraṇirmukhyā na milati | tathā pratinidhisvīkārapakṣa iti 
prathamapakṣe tasyābhivyañjakāḥ pañcamakārāḥ tairarcanaṃ guptyā iti 
tadvadādimaṃ saṃśodhya iti ādimabinduṃ datvā iti pūrayitvā ādimam iti 
mapañcakena santarpya iti prabhṛtīnāṃ śatāvadhivākyānāṃ sūtrasthānāṃ 
kuṇḍalaprakṣepa eva syāt | kiṃ ca(-)mapañcakālābhe'pi 
nityakramapratyavamṛṣṭiḥ iti sūtreṇa nityapūjāyāṃ mapañcakasya 
mukhyatvaṃ susphuṭam | evaṃ sati sūtramanukalpaparamiti lekhaḥ 
pūrvottarasūtrāpariśodhanamūlaḥ prāmādika iti heya eva ||

kiṃ ca(-)etatpakṣasya sādhakatayā śāpamocanābhāvo hetutvenopanyastaḥ | sa tu 
atyantanirmūlako'saṅgataśca | tathā hi(-)śāpavimocanaṃ nāma kiṃ pūrvaṃ 
kṛṣṇaṃ sthitaṃ yat tasyānantarakriyayā śuklatvasaṃpādanarūpaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ 
phalaṃ kiṃ vā saṃmārgādinā srukṣvivādṛṣṭaṃ yāgasādhanaśarīraṃ 
utpadyata iti | nādyaḥ śāpamocakamantrasahasrāvṛttyā'pi 
pūrvarūpaparāvṛttyadarśanāt | na dvitīyaḥ 

kvacittantreṣu vistāraḥ kvacittantreṣu saṃgrahaḥ |
ekaṃ tantraṃ samāśritya samyakkarma kṛtaṃ tathā ||
sarvaṃ tena kṛtaṃ rāma (")rāma(-)śrī ba2(.") etacca śrīgurumārgataḥ ||

iti tripurārahasyavacanena |

bahvalpaṃ vā svagṛhyoktaṃ yasya yāvat prakīrtitam |
tasya tāvati śāstrārthe kṛte sarvaḥ (")sarvaṃ kṛtaṃ bhavedityapi(-)pāṭhāntaram |(") 
kṛto bhavet ||

iti bodhāyanasmṛtipramāṇena ca ādimadravye yāvaduktasaṃskāraireva 
yāgajanakasvarūpalābhe śāpavimocanamantrāṇāṃ tatrāprayojakatvāt 
kathamanena hetunā sūtraṃ pratinidhiparaṃ sidhyet | kiṃ ca mukhyābhāve 
pratinidhisvīkāre mukhyadharmā yāvantaḥ pratinidhau pravartante yathā 
vrīhyabhāve nīvāre yāvad vrīhidharmāḥ yathā vā somābhāve pūtikeṣu 
yāvatsomadharmāḥ tatra ūho'pi nāstīti sādhitaṃ jaiminitantre | anutiṣṭhanti ca 
tathaiva śiṣṭāḥ | evaṃ sati pratinidhau śāpavimocanamantrābhāvaḥ kena 
vāryate | itthaṃ ca vahnāvanuṣṇatvavadatyantāsiddhahetuṃ prayuñjānāste 
svāvidvattāṃ susphuṭaṃ prakaṭayāmāsuḥ ||

	nāpi dvitīyaḥ pakṣaḥ sādhuḥ | tathā hi(-)dīkṣā'dyārabhya 
nikhilaparaśurāmasūtrapratipāditaṃ karma yogābhyāsiparaṃ uta pūjāmātram(-) 
nādyaḥ dīkṣātaḥ prāk yogābhyāsitvaṃ na saṃbhavati | adīkṣitānāṃ purato 
noccarecchivapaddhatim iti niṣedhena tāntrikasiddhāntaśravaṇābhāvena  
śravaṇamṛte yogāsaṃbhavena yogābhyāsināmiyaṃ dīkṣeti vaktumaśakyatvāt | 
dvitīye(-)īdṛśābhyāsī etattantravihitapūjākartā kimetattantroktadīkṣāvān uta 
tantrāntareṇa  dīkṣitasya kālena 

<p. 117>

svatantrānuṣṭhānena paripakvacittasyaiva etatsūtroktapūjāyāmadhikāro vā(-)
nādyaḥ dīkṣā'vyavahitottarakṣaṇe na bhavadabhimatadhyānasiddhiḥ | 
ayamanubhūyate sarvaiḥ | itthaṃ ca sūtrānusāreṇa dīkṣāṃ saṃpādya 
ayogitvenaitattantroktapūjānadhikārāt tantrāntarāśrayaṇaṃ pūjā'rthaṃ 
kartavyam | tarhi(-)

svaśāstre vartamāno yaḥ paraśāstraṃ niṣevate |
bhrūṇahatyāmavāpnoti svaśāstramavamanyate ||

iti niṣedhollaṅghanam | kiṃ ca(-)dīkṣottaraṃ 
mahāvidyā'rādhanapratyūhāpohāya gāṇanāyakīṃ paddhatimāmṛśet iti 
sūtreṇa lalitopāstivighnanāśasādhanatvaṃ gaṇapatyupāsteruktam | 
lalitopāstyanannaraṃ hi tatsādhyaścittaparipākaḥ tato niruktayogaḥ | tadanantaraṃ 
dvipātraprayoge adhikāro vācyaḥ | sa na saṃbhavati gaṇapatyupāsteḥ 
vighnasamānakālikatvena tadānīṃ niruktayogābhāvādapi gaṇapatyupāstau 
dvipātrakathanāt tatrāvaśyaṃ dvipātraprayogo'ṅgīkāryaḥ | itthaṃ ca tatra 
vyabhicaritādhikārasya anyatrāpi kalpanaṃ kena pratibaddham 
sakṛdvyabhicaritāyāḥ striyaḥ kimaparatra vastrāvaguṇṭhaneneti nyāyāt |

na ca(-)yaścāyogī tena gaṇapatyupāstiṃ tyaktvā kevalalalitopāstireva 
tantrāntaramanusṛtya yogasiddhiparyantaṃ anuṣṭheyā na gaṇapatyupāstiḥ atha vā 
gaṇapatyupāstāvapi tantrāntaramāśrīyatām(-)iti vācyam | tathā sati evaṃ 
gaṇapatimiṣṭvā vidhūtasamastavighnavyatikaraḥ śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ 
śrīlalitāyāḥ kramamārabheta iti sūtre'pi aprāmāṇyaṃ vaktavyaṃ syāt | 
sūtre gaṇapatyupāstipāṭhavaiyyarthyam(-)na lalitopāsteḥ pūrvamanuṣṭhānaṃ 
ayogitvena tasya tadā'nadhikārāt | lalitopāstyā phalasiddhyanantaramapi 
aprayojakatvāt ananuṣṭheyam | evaṃ ca vaiyyarthyaṃ durnivāram ||

na ca(-)dvipātraniṣedhasya lalitāprakaraṇasthatvāt tatraivāyogināmanadhikāraḥ | 
anyatrāstyeva dvipātraprayoge'dhikāraḥ niṣedhābhāvāt iti vācyam 
śrīlalitāyā mahāyāgānuṣṭhānāvasare nirvighnatāsiddhaye 
paraśurāmasūtrānusāreṇa nikhilagaṇapatyupāstiṃ vidhāya pātrāsādanakāle 
dvipātraprayogaṃ parityajya tripātraprayogamanusaratāṃ 
maheśvarānandanāthānāṃ etatpakṣasyānanumatatvāt | nāpi tantrāntareṇa 
dīkṣitasya svatantrānuṣṭhānena paripakvacittasya sūtroktapūjāyāmadhikāra iti 
dvitīyaḥ pakṣaḥ | tathā sati sūtre dīkṣāpāṭhavaiyyarthyāt | 
evametatpakṣasādhakatvena tripurārṇavavacanam ātmayogaparāṇāṃ tu 
nāṅgalopena hīyate ityalikhat | tadatīva mandam | yogābhyāsināmaṅgalopo na 
doṣāyeti tadarthaḥ | yogirūpādhikāriviśeṣam(-)uddiśya sūtroktadvipātravidhiriti 
siddhāntastadīyaḥ | evaṃ ca yogiprayoge tṛtīyapātrasya 
vaiśyakartṛkadarśapūrṇamāsasambandhisāmidhenyāṃ 
pāñcadaśyasyevānaṅgatvādaṅgalopa eva nāsti | evaṃ satyaṅgalope doṣo 
nāstīti svamatasādhakatvena 

<p. 118>

hetukathanaṃ vandhyāputrasya svakāryasādhakatvena grahaṇavadeva bhavati | yā 
caitadviṣaye ekapātrādisaṅkṣepapūjanamabhyāsaśīlānāmiti 
setubandhalekhasammatirdarśitā sā'pyasiddhā | setubandhe īdṛśī paṅktiḥ na 
kutrāpyasti | pratyuta dvipātraprayoga eva vyavasthāpitaḥ | tathā hi(-)
pūrvacatuśśatīsambandhinaḥ 

hemādipātre sādhāre sthāpayedarghyamañjasā (")mambunā(-)ba(.") |
rocanācandrakāśmīralaghukastūrikāyutam ||
bhāvayedvahnisūryendubhūtāni parameśvari |
japecca daśavāraṃ tattarpayettena yoginīḥ ||

iti ślokadvayasya vyākhyānāvasare idaṃ pūrvatantrasthavacanaṃ 
sāmānyārghyaparaṃ uttaratantrasthaṃ śrīcakrasyātmanaścaiva madhye 
tvarghyaṃ pratiṣṭhayet iti viśeṣārghyaparaṃ tadante tathaivārghyaṃ viśeṣeṇa 
sādhayet sādhakottamaḥ iti gurupātrātmapātrānyataraparamiti 
prācīnavyākhyāṃ nirasya pūrvatantrasthavacanameva viśeṣārghyaparamityapi 
matāntaraṃ nirasya pūrvatantre sāmānyārghyavidhiḥ uttaratantrasthena 
śrīcakrasyātmanaśceti vacanena tasyaiva deśakālavidhiḥ tathaivārghyaṃ 
viśeṣeṇa iti pūrvadharmātideśasahitaviśeṣārghyavidhiriti 
vyavasthāpyopasaṃhārasamaye tasmādetattantrānusāreṇa dvayoreva 
sthāpanamiṣṭam(-)iti dvipātravyavasthāmātraṃ śrībhāskararāyāścakruḥ | (sā 
ca asmākamanu guṇā pareṣāmananuguṇā ca) yogināmevāyaṃ prayogaḥ iti 
nocuḥ ||

yattu(-)setubandhe sthalāntare tantrāntareṣu 
yoginītantrasyottaracatuśśatīvadantaryāgaprapañcasyābhāvāt 
tantrarājasyāpyetatsāpekṣatvādatyuttamam(-)etattantraṃ etatsāpekṣatvaṃ ca 
tantrarāje(-)nityāhṛdayasaṃproktasphuṭopāyena bhāvayet iti kathanāt | 
nityāhṛdayametaduttaratantranāma | atra bahiryāgāṅgānāmalpānāṃ 
kathane'pi antaraṅgopāstidārḍhyaśīlānāṃ tāvataiva paripūrtisaṃbhavāt iti 
kalpyata iti likhitatvāt | maradvayakhaṇḍanapūrvakapūrvalikhitaitattantrānusāreṇa 
dvayoreva sthāpanamiṣṭam iti vākye etatpadaṃ uttaracatuśśatīparam | 
uttaracatuśśatyāṃ tu śuddhāntaḥkaraṇasyaivādhikārāt teṣāṃ prayoga eva 
pātradvayamiti siddhāntaḥ samīhitaḥ | etadabhiprāyeṇaivāsmākaṃ 
setubandhasaṃmatilekho'pīti(-)tadapi na | tathā sati uttaratantre 
sāmānyārghyodakotpattividhyabhāvena 
kevalamuttaracatuśśatītantreṇaivānutiṣṭhatāṃ viśeṣārghyapātrasyaivā 
sādhanaṃ prasaktaṃ na pātradvayasya | tathā copasaṃhāravākye 
etattantrānusāreṇa dvayoḥ sthāpanamiṣṭamiti vākyaṃ virudhyata eva | 
tasmādetattantrapadena pūrvottaracatuśśatīmekīkṛtya 
samagratantrānuyāyināmityevābhiprāyaḥ | 

<p. 119>
 
ata eva sāmānyārghyasya pūrvacatuśśatyāmutpannasya viniyogo'ṣṭamapaṭale 
vakṣyatīti setubandhalekhaśca saṅgacchate | etena pūrvottaratantroktamekameveti 
spaṣṭam | īdṛśī pūjā aparipakvacittasyāpi prāptā tadanusāreṇa pātradvayaṃ 
durnivāram ||

yaśca bahiryāgāṅgānāmalpānāṃ kathane'pyantaraṅgopāstiśīlānāṃ 
tāvataiva paripūrtiriti setubandhalekhaḥ sa naitattantrānusāriparaḥ | kiṃ tu 
tantrarājānusāreṇa pūrvamupāstiṃ kurvataḥ kālena 
cittaśuddhipūrvakabhāvanāyāṃ saṃpannāyām itthaṃ kurvan hi satataṃ 
mucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ iti vacane sāṅgabahiryāgasya satatamityanena 
taduttaramapi yāvajjīvaṃ sāṅgopāstiprāptau tadbādhakamidaṃ 
nityāhṛdayasaṃproktasphuṭopāyena bhāvayet iti | nityāhṛdayamutaracatuśśatī 
tatra proktaḥ yaḥ sphuṭaḥ upāyaḥ bahiryāgānuṣṭhānapūrvikā bhāvanā tāṃ 
kuryāditi tadarthaḥ(-)tantrarāje bahiryāgāṅgānāṃ bahutvāt yogābhyāsaṃ 
cikīrṣatāṃ tadanuṣṭhānapūrvakayogābhyāse kālābhāvena kāni heyāni kāni 
saṃgrāhyāṇi iti vicikitsāyāṃ yogamabhyasiṣoḥ 
yāvajjīvaprāptatantrarājoktayāvadaṅgakalāpānuṣṭhānaṃ na kartavyam kiṃ tu 
uttaracatuśśatyuktālpāṅgakalāpenaiva bahiryāgaṃ saṃpādya bhāvanāṃ 
kuryāt tāvataiva tasya paripūrtiriti kalpyata iti tantrarājānuyāyinaḥ 
uttaracatuśśatīdharmaprāptyabhiprāyakaḥ | naitāvatā nikhilaṃ tantraṃ 
yogābhyāsiparamiti brahmāpi sādhayituṃ śaknoti | tathā sati tantrarājavacane 
nityāhṛdayetyanena uttaracatuśśatyā eva yogābhyāsiparatvakathanāt 
pūrvacatuśśatīpāṭhavaiyyarthyāt | atastantrarājavacanena paripakvacittānāṃ 
yogābhyāsadakṣāṇām uttaracatuśśatyuktamekaṃ pātraṃ 
viśeṣārghyarūpaṃ samaṣṭimantreṇa pūjanam | aparipakvacittānāṃ 
yoginītantrānusāriṇāṃ pūrvottaracatuśśatīmekīkṛtya dvipātraprayoga iti 
setubandhābhiprāyatattvam | evameva sūtrānuyāyināmityalaṃ pallavitena ||

nāpi paramāpatpakṣo veti(-)tṛtīyaḥ pakṣaḥ | tathā hi tṛtīyapakṣasādhakaṃ 
yadvacanaṃ(-)

pratyakṣe yugmapātraṃ vai kṛtvā śāpamavāpnuyāt |
kvacinmayaivopadiṣṭaḥ paramāpattikālikaḥ ||

iti likhitaṃ tat kiṃ yopagurettaṃ śatena yātayāt 
itivacchāparūpāniṣṭasādhanatvaṃ dvipātre jñāpayati 
uttarārdhastaccheṣo'rthavādaḥ uta pūrvārdhenāniṣṭasādhanatvaṃ 
uttarārdhena āpattau abhyanujñā ceti dvyamucyate atha vā 
kevalamabhyanujñāpara eva vā sarvo'pi ślokaḥ | nādyaḥ uttarārdhasya 
arthavādarūpasya kevalastutau tātparyeṇāpattikāle 
abhyanujñāpakatvāsaṃbhavāt svoktapakṣāsiddheḥ | kiṃ ca(-)dvipātre 
aniṣṭasādhanatvaṃ pratipādayan dvipātre pravṛttaṃ puruṣaṃ nivartayati iti 
vācyam | tatra dvipātraprayoge pravṛttisādhanaṃ rāgo vā tantrāntaraṃ vā  
nādyaḥ tripātraṃ kartavyamiti |

<p. 120>

vidhisattve aṅgalopādbhītasya śraddhāvataḥ dvipātre rāgo na kadā'pi 
saṃbhavati | na dvitīyaḥ vikalpo duṣparihāraḥ iti prāgeva dattottaratvāt | etena 
dvitīyapakṣaḥ pratyuktaḥ | tasmāt agatyā yasmiṃstantre idaṃ vacanaṃ paṭhitaṃ 
tatra tripātravidhiḥ syādeva | taccheṣaḥ pūrvārdho'rthavādaḥ | uttarārdhena 
tripātravidhitantrānuyāyināṃ paramāpattau 
svānyatantroktadvipātraprayogagrahaṇamabhyanujñātam |

anṛtaṃ na vadedvidvānanṛtaṃ dharmanāśanam |
prāṇasaṃśaya āpanne tvanṛtaṃ naiva duṣyati ||

itivat tṛtīyapakṣa eva sādhuḥ | ayamevārthaḥ spaṣṭīkṛto bodhāyanācāryaiḥ(-)

svaśāstre vidyamāne yaḥ paraśāstreṇa vartate |
bhrūṇahatyāsamaṃ tasya svaśāstramavamanyataḥ ||
ārṣeyasya svaśāstrasya pradeśāstadgu(paraśāstragu)ṇaissaha |
karmaṇāṃ pravicārā(")ryā(")rthamāpatsu ca samāpnuyāt || iti ||

asyodāharaṇaṃ bhavasvāminā darśitam | yathā tṛtīyasavane saumyaṃ tantraṃ 
tūṣṇīm iti śālikiśākhāyām darśapūrṇamāsavat sarvam iti śākhā'ntare | 
svasvaśākhibhiḥ yathoktamanuṣṭheyam | āpattau tu sarvairapi tūṣṇīmiti | itthaṃ 
ca tryā(dvyā)dipātrāṇāmāpatkāle abhyanujñāpakaṃ śāstraṃ katham 
ā(anā)pannaparamiti vyavasthāpayet | tasmānna kiṃcidetat | 
paraśurāmasūtrayoginītantrānusāribhiḥ niḥśaṅkaṃ dvipātrāsādanameva 
kartavyam ||

nanu tantrāntarasthadvipātradūṣakavacanānāṃ vidhiśeṣārthaparatvaṃ 
vyavasthāpya sūtrānusāribhiḥ dvipātraprayoga eva kāryaḥ tantrāntrarasparśo na 
kāryaḥ iti pratijñāyāṃ tantrānuktaṃ sūcitaṃ ca tathā'nyeṣvapi dūṣitam 
anyatantrāt grāhyam iti vidhyudāharaṇaṃ kimiti cet(-)śṛṇu | asyaiva 
vacanasyāvyavahitapūrvam 

kvacittantreṣu vistāraḥ kvacittantreṣu saṃgrahaḥ |
ekaṃ tantraṃ samāśritya samyakkarmakṛte tathā |
sarvaṃ tena kṛtaṃ rāma tacca śrīgurumārgataḥ ||

ityanena pūjā'ṅgānāṃ pūjā'naṅgabhūtānāṃ yāvatkarmaṇāṃ 
svatantrānuktānāṃ nivṛttau kathitāyāṃ tantrānuktaṃ sūcitaṃ ca ityanena 
keṣāṃcitpūjā'ṅgānāṃ grahaṇam tathā'nyeṣvapi dūṣitam ityanena 
pūjā'naṅgabhūtānāṃ keṣāṃcidakaraṇe atinindā śrūyate | yathā 
sahasranāmapāṭhaḥ | tasyānanuṣṭhāne(-)

<p. 121>

akīrtayannidaṃ stotraṃ kathaṃ bhakto bhaviṣyati |
apaṭhannāmasāhasraṃ prīṇayedyo maheśvarīm ||
sacakṣuṣā vinā rūpaṃ paśyedeva vimūḍhadhīḥ |
rahasyanāmasāhasraṃ muktvā yaḥ siddhikāmukaḥ ||
sabhojanaṃ vinā nūnaṃ kṣunnivṛttimabhipsati |

ityādivacanaiḥ apāṭhe'pi nindā śrūyate | tattantrāntarasthamavaśyaṃ grāhyam 
| atraiva tripurārahasyavacanābhiprāyaḥ | śvatantreṇāviruddhaṃ tu yāvadanyat 
samācaret iti pūrvalikhitatantrāntaravacanasyāpyatraiva tātparyam na tu 
ekaprayogāṅgeṣu tantrāntarāśrayaṇam | prayogāṅgeṣu sūcitaṃ 
ākāṅkṣitaṃ ca muktvā tantrāntarasthasya īṣadapi praveśo nāstīti 
paramasiddhāntaḥ | ata eva śrībhāgavate'pi 

yastvicchayā kṛtaḥ puṃbhirābhāso hyāśramāt pṛthak |
svabhāvavihito dharmaḥ kasya neṣṭaḥ praśāntaye ||

iti imamevārthamāha | asya ślokasya svadharmānuṣṭhānānantaraṃ 
dharmabhūyastvārthamapi paradharmo nānuṣṭheyaḥ anupayogādityāha(-)
svabhāveti iti śrīdharasvābhyavataraṇam | etena śloko vyākhyātaḥ || 30 ||

tatpātrasthabindubhiḥ karaṇīyakṛtyamāha(-)

tadbindubhistriśaḥ śirasi gurupādukāmiṣṭvā 
(")atroktaśrīgurupādukātantramantrajñānāyāgratanadvi pariśiṣṭasthāḥ 6-10/1 
6/11 6/14 6-16/1 6-16/5 6/18taḥ 6/20 ete viṣayā dṛśyāḥ |(") ārdraṃ jvalati 
jyotirahamasmi jyotirjvalati brahmāhamasmi yo'hamasmi brahmāhamasmi ahamasmi 
brahmāhamasmi ahamevāhaṃ māṃ juhomi svāheti 
tadbindumātmanakuṇḍalinyāṃ juhuyāt || 31 ||

tadbindubhiḥ viśeṣārghyabindubhiḥ triśaḥ trivāraṃ śirasi dvādaśāntasthāne 
(")dvādaśasthāne nāma brahmarandhre(-)ityarthaḥ(-)pāścātya-2 khaṇḍe(-)
śrīgaṇapatikrame-2 sūtrabhāṣye-69-patre(-)sphuṭīkṛtosyārthaḥ |(") 
gurupādukāmiṣṭvā gurupādukoddeśena dravyadānaṃ kṛtvā ārdraṃ jvalati iti 
svāhā'ntena mantreṇa tadbinduṃ gurupādukāyāgaśeṣabindumityarthaḥ 
sarvanāmnāṃ sannihitaparatvena pādukādattaśeṣasyaiva sannihitatvāt tadīyaṃ 
śeṣamādāya japan yogaṃ samācaret iti yoginītantravacanācca | ātmanaḥ svasya 
kuṇḍalinyāṃ cidvahnau | kuṇḍalinīsvarūpamuktaṃ tantrāntare(-)

<p. 122>

viśade karṇikāyāṃ ca dhyātvā'dhāre'tha lohite |
karṇikākulakuṇḍāntassārdhatrivalayākṛtim ||
prasuptasarpasadṛśīṃ bisatantutanīyasīm |
dhyātvā kuṇḍalinīśaktim(...................) || iti ||

juhuyāt ityanena asmin karmaṇi homabuddhiḥ dṛḍhā kāryā na tu pānabuddhiriti 
sūcitā | bindumityanena homadravyasyātyalpatvaṃ sūcitam | bindumiti dvitīyayā 
pratipattisaṃskāro'pi sūcitaḥ | gurupādukāyai dattaśeṣaṃ homena 
saṃskuryādityarthaḥ | tena śeṣābhāve na homaḥ ||

kuladravyasvīkāravidhisamarthanam 

nanu (")ita ārabhyaitat-31-sūtrabhāṣyāntaṃ yāvat(-)surāgrahaṇakhaṇḍanaṃ | 
kvācitkaṃ tanmaṇḍanamapyabhyadhāyītyavagantavyam |(") 
sakalaśrutismṛtipurāṇeṣu surāpānasya pañcamahāpātakeṣu (")yathāha 
śrīyājñavalkyaḥ(-)brahmahā madyapaḥ steyī tathaiva gurutalpagaḥ | 
mahāpāpāni catvāri tatsaṃsargī ca pañcamaḥ | prā(.) a(.) 3 ślokaḥ 21
manurapi(-)brahmahatyā surāpānaṃ steyaṃ gurvaṅganāgamaḥ |
mahānti pātakānyāhuḥ saṃsargaścāpi taiḥ saha(-)a 11 ślokaḥ 54 |(") 
pañcamahāpātakeṣu gaṇitatvāt kathaṃ tantroktaḥ dravyasevanaṃ sukhāya 
bhavitumarhati | evaṃ yeṣu tantreṣu dravyasevanaṃ vrihitaṃ teṣveva tantreṣu 
niṣedho bahulamupalabhyate | yathā kulārṇave(-)

surādarśanamātreṇa kuryāt sūryāvalokanam |
tatsamāghrāṇamātreṇa prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ caret ||
ājānubhyāṃ bhavet snānamānābhyupavasecchive |
ūrdhvaṃ nābhestrirātraṃ syānmadyasya sparśane vidhiḥ ||
surāpāne kāmakṛte jvalantīṃ tāṃ vinikṣipet | 
mukhe tayā vinirdagdhaḥ tataḥ śuddhimavāpnuyāt ||
madyapānajadoṣasya prāyaścittamitīritam || iti ||

tripurārṇave'pi(-)

kāmānmohādyadi surāṃ pibet sakṛdapi dvijaḥ |
vidvānapi ca saṃtyājyaḥ tantrajñairavicāritam || iti ||

devīyāmale'pi(-)

āghrāṇaṃ darśanaṃ caiva surāyāssaṃtyajedbudhaḥ || iti ||

<p. 123>

darśanameva tyajet kimu pānatyāge iti tadarthaḥ | evaṃ anyatantravacanānyapi 
bahūni santi | granthavistarabhayānneha likhyante | tasmāt 
kuladravyasvīkāraśāstramaśraddheyamiti cet(-)na 
rāgaprāptasurāpānanivartakānyeva amūni vacanāni | kratvarthapravṛttiriṣṭaiva 
anyathā na brāhmaṇaṃ hanyāt iti niṣedhena brahmaṇe brāhmaṇamālabhate iti 
śruteraprāmāṇyāpatteḥ | ayamevārthaḥ spaṣṭamuktaḥ śrībhāgavate(-)

yadghrāṇabhakṣo vihitaḥ surāyāḥ tathā paśorālabhanaṃ na hiṃsā | 
evaṃ vyavāyaḥ prajayā na ratyai imaṃ viśuddhaṃ nu viduḥ svadharmam ||
ye tvanevaṃvidaḥ puṃsaḥ stabdhāssadabhimāninaḥ |
paśūn druhyanti visrabdhāḥ pretya khādanti te ca tān ||

iti granthen | tasmāt niravakāśaviśeṣadravyasvīkāravidheḥ kratvarthatvakalpanāt 
niṣedhasya ca kevalapuruṣārthatvena ekārthatvābhāvāt | ata 
evaitadabhiprāyasūcakameva kāmāditi tripurārṇave kulārṇave ca kāmakṛte iti 
padaṃ paṭhitam | evaṃ tantrāntare(-)

doṣo'nyatra varārohe yajñe doṣo na vidyate |
aśvamedhādiyajñeṣu vājihatyā yathā bhavet ||

iti sadṛṣṭāntamuktārthameva draḍhayati ||

atra tārābhaktisudhārṇave evaṃ ca vīrasyāpi brāhmaṇasya kṣīrameva anyasya 
tadapi na iti bhāvaśodhanaprakaraṇe uktvā evametadagre sthalāntare uktāyā eva 
pratijñāyā dṛḍhīkaraṇārthaṃ bahuvicāraḥ kṛto nṛsiṃhācāryaiḥ | tathā hi(-)

vīkṣaṇaprokṣaṇadhyānamantramudrāvibhūṣitam |
dravyaṃ tarpaṇayogyaṃ syāddevatāprītikārakam ||

tarpaṇamatra pānameva | idaṃ tu brāhmaṇetaraviṣayam brāhmaṇasya 
tadupādānaniṣedhāt || 

nanu(-)

brāhmaṇaistu sadā peyaṃ kṣatriyaistu raṇāgame |
vaiśyairdhanaprayoge ca śūdraistu na kadācana ||

iti kulārṇave 

sautrāmaṇyāṃ kulācāre brāhmaṇaḥ prapibet surām |

<p. 124>

iti samayācāratantre 

satye kramāccatuvarṇaiḥ kṣīrājyamadhupiṣṭajaiḥ |
tretāyāṃ pūjitā devī ghṛtena sarvajātibhiḥ ||
madhubhiḥ sarvavarṇaistu pūjitā dvāpare yuge |
pūjanīyā kalau devī devalairāsavaiḥ śubhaiḥ ||

iti yāmale coktatvāt kathaṃ brāhmaṇasyānadhikāra iti cet(-)ucyate |

viprāḥ kṣoṇibhujā viśastaditare kṣīrājyamadhvāsavaiḥ iti laghustave 

varṇānukramabhedena dravyabhedā bhavanti vai iti jñānārṇave dravyeṇa 
sāttvikenaiva brāhmaṇaḥ pūjayecchivām iti tatraivoktam | tathā 
āsavabhedamuktvā 

evaṃ dadyāt kṣatriyo'pi paiṣṭīṃ tu na kadācana |
nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsye tāmre gavyaṃ tathā madhu ||
rājanyavaiśyayordānaṃ (")(-)rdeyaṃ brāhmaṇasya(-)śrī(.") na dvijasya kadācana |
evaṃ pradānamātreṇa hīnāyurbrāhmaṇo (")hīno bhavati brāhmaṇaḥ(-)śrī(.)(-)evaṃ 
pāṭhāntare(-)vrā(-)ityasyagurutvācchandobhaṅgabhayamatra ca(-)
hīnāyūrityādipāṭhaḥ susādhuḥ (punarāvṛttikṛt-)(") bhavet ||

iti mahākālasaṃhitāyām 

kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyā ghṛtena nṛpavaṃśajaiḥ |
mākṣikairvaiśyavarṇaistu āsavaiḥ śūdrajātibhiḥ ||

iti bhairavītantre 

yatrāvaśyaṃ vinirdiṣṭaṃ madirādānapūjanam |
brāhmaṇastāmrapātre tu madhu madyaṃ prakalpayet ||

iti kulacūḍāmaṇau

brāhmaṇo madirāṃ dattvā (")pītvā(-)śrī(.") brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate |
svagātrarudhiraṃ dattvā svātmahatyāmavāpnuyāt ||

iti haṃsamāheśvaratantre kalidharmaprakaraṇe gṛhyapariśiṣṭe 
harināthopādhyāyaiḥ sautramiṣyāṃ surāgrahaṇaniṣedhasyoktatvāt 
brāhmaṇaistu sadā'peyā ityakārapraśleṣāt brāhmaṇasya sadā niṣedhaḥ | 
kṣatriyasya saṅgrāmakāle vikalasya saṅgrāmāsaṃbhavāt | vaiśyasya 
dhanaprayogakāle anyathā

<p. 125>

vikaladhiyā viṃśatidāne kartavye śatādidānāpatteḥ | śūdrairnaiva kadācana 
apeyā tena sarvadaiva peyetyarthaḥ | evaṃ ca pūjanīyā kalau devi kevalairāsavaiḥ 
ityatra anuṣajyamānasarvavarṇaśabdaśca brāhmaṇetaraviṣaya ityavadhātavyam ||

atha(-)

kṣīraṃ vṛkṣasamudbhūtamājyaṃ valkalasaṃbhavam |
madhu puṣparasodbhūtam āsavaṃ taṇḍulodbhavam ||

iti bhairavītantre kṣīrādipadānāṃ āsavaviśeṣaparibhāṣaṇāt brāhmaṇasyāpi 
tatrādhikāraḥ pratīyate iti cet(-)atra pratibhāti | kṣīrādīnāṃ kathaṃ 
bhairavakalpamityatredaṃ vacanam | tena kṣīraṃ vṛkṣasamudbhūtaṃ 
vārkṣamaireyamityarthaḥ | evamagre'pi | anyathā kṣīravṛkṣapadādervaiparītyena 
prayogāpatteḥ anuvādamanuktvā tu na vidheyamudīrayet iti nyāyāt | 
taṇḍulodbhavastvodanaḥ | tena śūdrasyāpyodanasthāne āsavameva tena | 
pṛthagodanaṃ brāhmaṇādibhiḥ āsavaṃ ca na deyamityarthaḥ | likhitavacanāt 
āmaṃ śūdrahastena pakvānnaṃ pakvamucchiṣṭamucyate ityādismṛteśca ||

na ca(-)śukraśāpasya brāhmaṇaviṣayatvena surāyāṃ 
taduddhāravidhānānupapattiḥ iti vācyam śūdramātrasya sadā'dhikāre 
śāstrasiddhe śukraśāpavimocanasyādṛṣṭārthatvāt ||

kiṃ ca(-) aindryā gārhapatyamupatiṣṭhate ityādau liṅgāpekṣayā śruteriva 
śāpavimocanakalpyamaireyadānavidhānāpekṣayā brāhmaṇo madirāṃ dattvā 
ityādiniṣedhavidheḥ śrautasya balavattvaṃ yuktisāmyāt ityantena lekhena 
brāhmaṇetaraparamiti pratijñāṃ dṛḍhīcakruḥ nṛsiṃhapaṇḍitāḥ |

tadatīva mandam | tathā hi(-)dravyeṇa sāttvikeneti jñānārṇavavacanaṃ 
svasādhakatvena likhitam | tadatyantamapariśodhanamūlam | sāttvikadravyaṃ 
nāma vrīhyādivat (na) lokaprasiddhaṃ kiṃcidasti | ataḥ kiṃ tat sāttvikadravyam 
ityākāṅkṣāyāṃ prakṛtipratyayayoḥ vyākaraṇasmṛtivat śāstraikagamyā 
sāttvikapadaśaktiḥ | tacchāstraṃ tripurārṇave(-)

gauḍī mādhvī ca paiṣṭī ca trividhaṃ dravyamīritam |
aikṣavakṣaudrajātā'dyā gauḍī syāt sāttvikī smṛtā ||
madhūkakusumadrākṣātālavṛkṣādisaṃbhavā |
mādhvīti kīrtitā tajjñaiḥ rājasī sā bhavecchive ||
piṣṭataṇḍulajātā yā tāmasī pauṣṭikī smṛtā |
sāttvikī brāhmaṇe khyātā rājasī nṛpavaiśyayoḥ || iti ||

<p. 126>

evaṃ sati śāstre brāhmaṇetaraparamiti pratijñā ajñānamūleti dhruvaṃ 
pratīmaḥ | tathā mahākālasaṃhitāsthaṃ jānīyāt nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsye iti | 
rājanyavaiśyakartṛkaprayoge mukhyadravyapratinidhiniyamaṃ vidhāya 
brāhmaṇakartṛke prayoge uktadravyaparisaṅkhyāṃ kṛtvā 
parisaṅkhyāśeṣatvena evaṃ pradānamātreṇa hīnāyurbrāhmaṇo bhavet iti 
nindayā arthavādarūpayā stauti | idaṃ vacanaṃ bhavatsādhakaṃ kathaṃ bhavet ||

na ca(-)kṣatriyādikartṛkatvenaiva brāhmaṇādikartukatvanivṛttiḥ yathā 
godhūmanivṛttirvrīhiniyamena tathā ca kathaṃ brāhmaṇakartṛkaprayoge tasya 
prāptiḥ tannivṛttyarthā parisaṅkhyā vā katham(-)iti vācyam dṛṣṭāntavaiṣamyāt | 
darśapūrṇamāsayāgaḥ dravyamantarā anupapannaḥ ityākṣepeṇa 
itaradravyādivat pakṣe vrīhiprāptau brīhaya eveti niyamyate | tāvatā 
darśapūrṇamāse dravyāntarākāṅkṣā virahādārthikī itaranivṛttiḥ | prakṛtau 
rājanyavaiśyakartṛke prayoge pratinidhiniyamena dravyākāṅkṣāyāḥ virahe'pi 
brāhmaṇakartṛke dravyākāṅkṣāsattvāt pakṣe asyāpi prāptau parisaṅkhyāyā 
yuktatvāt tasmāt anena pratijñāsiddhiḥ ṣaṇḍeneva putrotpattiḥ ||

yacca kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyā iti bhairavītantravacanaṃ sādhakatvena likhitaṃ 
tadapi bālapratāraṇāmātraṃ bhairavītantra eva etadvacanasamīpe kṣīraṃ 
vṛkṣasamudbhūtam ityanena kṣīrādipadārthanirṇayāt | yattu kṣīraṃ 
vṛkṣasamudbhūtam ityasya kṣīraṃ vṛkṣasamudbhūtakāryakārītyarthaṃ kṛtvā 
vṛkṣasamudbhūtakāryaṃ tarpaṇaṃ kṣīre prasiddhe vidhīyata iti(-)tadaśuddham | 
vṛkṣasamudbhavādipadatrayasya kiṃ dravyasāmānyamarthaḥ kiṃ dravyaviśeṣaḥ 
| ādye vṛkṣasamudbhūtatvarūpaśakyārthapravṛttinimittarūpasya 
dravyatvāvacchinne bādhādviśeṣārthe śaktasya sāmānye lakṣaṇā | tathā sati 
śrūyamāṇaśakyārthatyāgaḥ vṛkṣasamudbhūtapadenaiva ājyādiṣu 
vidhānasambhave ekārthānāṃ tat phalasambhavādipadānāṃ vaiyyarthyaṃ ca | 
vṛkṣasamudbhavādipadaṃ dravyaviśeṣaparamiti dvitīyapakṣe dravyaviśeṣasya 
kāryaṃ kṣīre vidhīyate | tat kiṃ dṛṣṭaṃ vā kiṃ vā'dṛṣṭasādhanaṃ 
śāstrīyaṃ kāryaṃ vidhīyate | ādye vidhānavaiyyarthyaṃ lokata eva jñātuṃ 
śakyatvāt | dvitīye yathā khalevālī yūpo bhavati ityatra yūpe paśuṃ niyuñjīta 
ityanena śāstreṇa kṛtaṃ yatkāryaṃ tat khalevālyāṃ vidhīyate | tathā 
śāstrāntaraprāptaṃ vidhīyate uta śāstrāntareṇa aprāptaṃ vidhīyate | ādye 
kṣīraṃ vṛkṣasamudbhūtamityanenaiva vṛkṣasamudbhūtakāryasya 
kṣīratarpaṇāderlābhe kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyeti śāstraṃ vyartham | na hi 
khalevālī yūpo bhavati iti procya khalevālyāṃ paśuṃ niyuñjīta iti pṛthaguktam 
aprāptakāryasya vidhānaṃ tadvat vandhyāputrāderapi dampatikāryatvena 
vidhānāpatteḥ | manmate tu kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyeti 
tarpaṇasādhanadravyavidhiḥ kṣīrapadasya prasiddhārthaṃ bādhitvā 
arthaviśeṣatātparyagrāhakaṃ kṣīraṃ vṛkṣasamudbhūtam iti vacanamiti na 
kasyā'pi vaiyyarthyam | anyo'pi nānupapattigandhaḥ | yadyapi 
vidhāyakatvābhāvena 

<p. 127>

vaiyyarthyaṃ kalpyam | tathā'pi yadāgneyamaṣṭākapālaṃ nirvapati saumyaṃ 
carum ityaṣṭau havīṃṣi cāturmāsye vidhāya punaḥ vaiśvadevena yajet iti 
samudāyasya vaiśvadeva iti saṅketaḥ kṛtaḥ | tena vasante vaiśvadevena yajeta 
ityatra yāgena viśvedevayāgasyaiva vasante prāptau ta bādhitvā navīnasaṅketena 
aṣṭānāṃ yāgānāṃ saṃpattiṃ kurvan sārthakaṃ tadvākyam ityuktaṃ 
jaiminitantre | tathā sārthakaṃ bhavitumarhati | 

na ca (-) svenaiva kṣīrapadamatyantarūḍhaṃ prayujya rūḍhiśaktiṃ parityaktuṃ 
vyākhyā'ntaraṃ kṛtam evaṃ na kutrāpi dṛṣṭam iti vācyam | kāśīkhaṇḍe(-)

arundhatīṃ dhruvaṃ caiva tathā saptarṣimaṇḍalam |
āsannamṛtyurno paśyet(.....................................) ||

iti prathamamuktvā arundhatī nāsikāgraṃ ityādinā svenaiva vyākhyātam | evaṃ 
śataśaḥ santi paraṃ tu prayojanābhāvāt adhikaṃ na likhitam ||

asmin vacane caturthacaraṇe āsavaṃ taṇḍulodbhavam ityatra taṇḍulodbhavamiti 
piṣṭodbhavasyāpi upalakṣakaṃ bṛhadvāmakeśvaratantre(-)

kṣīramājyaṃ madhu tathā hyāsavaṃ ca maheśvari |
vṛkṣatvakpuṣpapiṣṭotthaṃ kramāt jñeyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ ||

ityatra paiṣṭe'pi āsavasaṅketasya kṛtatvāt | etena paramate daṇḍaprakṣepātmako 
hetuḥ kṣīravṛkṣapadādeḥ vaiparītyena prayogāpatteḥ iti tatsādhakatayā 
anuvādyamanuktveti lekhaḥ saḥ sarvo'pi parāhataḥ 
arthaviśeṣatātparyagrāhakatvena varṇanena atra 
uddeśyavidheyabhāvagandhasyāpyabhāvāt | ata eva nāmadheyapāde udbhidā 
yajeta ityatra nāmadheyasyāvidheyatayā na svataḥ dharme prāmāṇyam kiṃ tu 
ṛtvijāṃ prayogavidhismārakatayā tadvāreti sthitamākare ||

astu vā paraprītaye aśāstrīyaḥ vṛkṣasamudbhūtamuddiśya kṣīrasaṃjñā 
vidhīyate ityaṅgīkāraḥ | tathā'pi paraprakṣiptadaṇḍaḥ asmin mate asahyaḥ | 

yadyat prathamanirdiṣṭam iti vyāptisiddhamūlo hi daṇḍaprakṣepaḥ sa tu asiddhaḥ 
dadhnā juhoti ye yajamānāsta ṛtvijaḥ vāyavyaṃ svetamālabheta bhūtikāmaḥ 
ityādau śataśo vyabhicārāt | tarhyanuvādyamanuktveti prāmāṇikokteḥ kā 
gatiriti cet asati bādhake prathamanirdiṣṭamuddeśyaṃ prāyeṇa bhavatīti 
tasyābhiprāyaḥ | prakṛte kṣīramuddiśya vṛkṣasamudbhūtatvavidhāne 
vaiyyarthyameva bādhakam | idaṃ kathaṃ na jñātaṃ pareṇa | evam āsavaṃ 
taṇḍulodbhavam ityatra taṇḍulodbhavaśabdasya odanamarthaṃ bruvan 
tatsādhakatayā āmaṃ śūdrasya pakvānnam iti ca likhan bālānāmapyupahāsyo 
babhūva | etena laghustavaratnasya 

<p. 128>

sādhakatvalekho dūrīkṛtaḥ kṣīrādīnāṃ sāṅketikaśadbānāṃ tatra 
gṛhītatvāt | yattu śukraśāpavimocanaliṅgāpekṣayā brāhmaṇo madirāṃ 
dattvā iti pratyakṣaśruteḥ prābalyamiti kathanaṃ tadapi tuccham | na hi brāhmaṇo 
madirāṃ dattvā brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate ityatra niṣedhārthe nañśrutiḥ 
vidhipratyayarūpā'sti | kiṃ tu madirādānanindayā kalpyo vidhiḥ | itthaṃ ca tasya 
pratyakṣaśrutitvaṃ bruvan vidvatsamāje kimuttaraṃ vadediti na vidmaḥ | itthaṃ ca 
śukraśāpavimocanasahitasya sautrāmaṇyāṃ kulācāre brāhmaṇaḥ prapibet 
surām iti kulācārasthapratyakṣasvalikhitavacanasya gatim akalpayitvā mukhena 
brāhmaṇetaraparamiti pratijñāmātreṇa pareṣāṃ (")sarveṣāṃ(-)śrī(0)(") 
mohamutpādayan tāntrikabahiṣkṛto mantavyaḥ ||

itthaṃ ca vacanānāmiyaṃ vyavasthā dravyeṇa sāttvikena ityatra kṣīreṇa 
brāhmaṇaistarpyā ityasya laghustavasthamahākālasaṃhitāvacanasya vyavasthā 
darśitā | tathā ca yacca bhairavītantravacanaṃ kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyā iti 
yacca bṛhadvāmakeśvaratantre 

krameṇa brāhmaṇādyaistu kṣīrājyamākṣikāsavaiḥ (")madhupiṣṭajaiḥ(-)śrī(0)(") iti 

yacca laghustavavacanaṃ teṣāṃ sāmānyarūpatvāt yāmalavacane śatye 
kramāccaturvarṇaiḥ kṣīrājyamadhupiṣṭajaiḥ ityatropasaṃhāraḥ | itthaṃ ca 
kṣīrādīnāṃ bhairavyāditantraiḥ aviśeṣeṇa sadā prāptau kālaviśeṣe 
kartṛviśeṣe kṣīrādidravyaviśeṣa iti saṅkocasampādakaṃ yāmalavacanam | yattu 
jñānārṇavasthaṃ dravyeṇa sāttvikenaiva brāhmaṇaḥ pūjayecchivām iti 
aikṣavakṣaudrajātāyāḥ sāttvika dravyasya kṣīrapadavācyatayā yāmalavacanena 
saṅkocāsambhavāt yugacatuṣṭaye prāpnuvadbrāhmaṇakartṛkaprayoge vikalpaḥ 
prāpnoti | evaṃ rājasī nṛpavaiśyayoḥ ityanena kṣatriyavaiśyakartṛkaprayoge 

madhūkakusumadrākṣātālavṛkṣādisambhavā |
mādhvīti kīrtitā tajjñaiḥ rājasī (")rājasī sā bhavecchive iti caturthaḥ 
pādotrāvadheyaḥ |(") ||

iti vivaraṇena uktadravyaprakṛtikadravyasya sadā prāptau uktānāmamīṣāṃ 
saṅghāte kṣīrādisaṃjñāyā apravṛtteḥ sambhavatkṣatriyasya 
valkalaprakṛtikadravyasya kṛtayuge prāptau etad (")(?)(")drākṣādiprakṛtikasyāpi 
prāptau vikalpaḥ | śūdrasya vacanadvaye ekarūpatvāt kṛte na vikalpaḥ | evaṃ 
tretā'diṣu yathāyathaṃ svayamūhyam | kaliyuge brāhmaṇasya 
jñānārṇavatripurārṇavavacanābhyāṃ aikṣavamadhuprakṛtikaṃ prāptaṃ 
pūjanīyā kalau sarvavarṇaiḥ kevalamāsavaiḥ iti | evaṃ sati(-)

kṛte tu śūdraiḥ saṃpūjyā pratyakṣairāsavaiḥ priye |
tretāyāṃ vaiśyaśūdrābhyāṃ nṛpādyaiḥ dvāpare yuge |
kalau yuge mahādevi brāhmaṇādyaiḥ prapūjitā ||

<p. 129>

iti rahasyārṇavavacanaṃ yadyupatiṣṭhate tadā kṛtetaravacanaiḥ dravyetaraviśeṣaḥ 
sarvavarṇeṣu prāptaḥ rahasyārṇavavacanena śūdrātirikte parisaṅkhyā'pi 
prāptā tathā sati kṛte traivarṇike vikalpaḥ pratyakṣasya dravyasya | yadvā(-)
rahasyārṇave'pi kṛtayugasambandhiśūdrakartṛkaprayoge pratyakṣāsavaṃ 
taṇḍulaprakṛtikaṃ vidhīyate | tena tantrāntareṇa śūdrasya āsavaprāptau 
vaiyyarthyabhiyā parisaṅkhyātvakalpanam aśraddheyam | tathā sati 
brāhmaṇādikartṛkaprayoge dravyasya ākāṅkṣitatvāt anyasmāt tantrāt 
kṣīrādikaṃ grāhyam | na vikalpaḥ | evameva tretāyāṃ rahasyārṇavavacanaṃ 
śūdravaiśyayorāsavaṃ vidadhāti | tathā sati vaiśyasya anena āsavaṃ prāptam | 
yāmalavacanena dhṛtaṃ prāptam | atra vikalpaḥ | evaṃ dvāpare 
vaiśyakṣatriyayoḥ āsavamadhuvikalpaḥ uktavacanadvayena | kaliyuge tu ubhayoḥ 
ekarūpatayā virodhābhāvāt avicāra eva | yuktaścāyameva pakṣaḥ na 
parisaṅkhyāpakṣaḥ | itthaṃ ca yatrāvaśyaṃ vinirdiṣṭam iti 
kulacūḍāmaṇivacanaṃ tasmin mukhyālābhe iti pūraṇīyam | mukhyālābhe 
brāhmaṇena tatsthāne tāmrapātre madhu yojayet iti tadarthaḥ | evaṃ sati tāmre 
gavyaṃ tathā madhu | rājanyavaiśyayorevaṃ na dvijasya kadācana iti 
mahākālasaṃhitāvacanena virudhyate | tathā tulyabalatvādvikalpo na parihāryaḥ 
paramate'pi ||

yadapi haṃsamāheśvaratantravacanaṃ (")haṃsapārameśvara(-)ba 1(.") brāhmaṇo 
madirāṃ dattvā brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate iti tat yadi tattantre kṣatriyādīnāṃ 
kuladravyavidhisamīpe syāt tarhi taccheṣo'rthavādaḥ apaśavo vā anye go 
aśvebhyaḥ itivat | yadi tatsamīpe na syāt tarhi ajitendriyabrāhmaṇaparam tasya 
dravyadānaniṣedhasyāgre vakṣyamāṇatvāt | yacca kulārṇavavacanam 
brāhmaṇaistu sadā'peyam iti tatra akārapraśleṣaṃ kṛtvā yo'yaṃ 
brāhmaṇānāṃ niṣedhaḥ kṛtaḥ sapumarthapara iti parābhiprāyaḥ | kṣatriyasya 
saṅgrāmakāle vikalasya saṅgrāmāsambhavāt ityādiniṣedhahetulekhāt | sa 
cāsmākamiṣṭa eva | 

kratvarthātiriktadravyasvīkāro brāhmaṇasya nāstīti vayamapi brūmaḥ | yaśca 
harināthoktaḥ sautrāmaṇyāṃ kalau surāgrahaniṣedhaḥ so'pyasmākamanumataḥ 
| na tāvatā kulācāre'pi niṣedhaḥ sambhavati | 
kaliyugasambandhisautrāmaṇigrahatvaṃ surāniṣedhoddeśyatā'vacchedakaṃ 
tadanākrāntatvāt kulācārasya kaimutikanyāyapraveśe atiprasaṅgāt | tasmāt 
paroktānāṃ brāhmaṇaviṣaye bādhakānāṃ gandhasyāpyabhāvena 
sādhakasahasrasya darśitatvena tantraprāmāṇyamaṅgīkurvataḥ 
brāhmaṇādikartṛkapūjāyāṃ prathamādaraḥ śāstraprāptaḥ | sa tu 
brāhmaṇā'pi tyaktumaśakyaḥ | itthaṃ ca(-)

vinā dravyādhivāsena na smarenna japet priye |
ye smaranti mahādevi teṣāṃ duḥkhaṃ pade pade ||
nāsavena vinā mantraṃ na mantreṇa vinā'savam ||

<p. 130>

iti kulārṇave 

vinā'lipiśitābhyāṃ ca pūjanaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet |

iti samayācāre 

vinā hetukamāsvādya kṣobhayukto maheśvari |
na pūjāṃ na japaṃ kuryānna dhyānaṃ na ca cintanam ||

iti bhāvacūḍāmaṇau 

vinā'lipiśitābhyāṃ ca yaḥ kuryāt pūjanaṃ mama |
duḥkhaṃ sandhākaro bhūtvā yoginīnāṃ paśurbhavet ||

iti kālikāpurāṇe

yaḥ kuryādādimadravyavihīnaṃ tava pūjanam |
tava krodhena dagdhaḥ san bhasmībhavati nānyathā ||

iti samayāṅkamātṛkāyāṃ sthitam(-)īdṛśāni vacanānyanugṛhītāni bhavanti | 
evaṃ ca brāhmaṇetaraparamityantamaśuddhamiti akṛtrimayā svamatyā 
vicāryamāṇe pratibhāti | ito'dhikaṃ nirmatsarāḥ paṇḍitāḥ vicārayantu | 
imāṃ vijñāya sudhiyā madanti iti 
tripuropaniṣatsaptamamantrabhāṣye'pyevameva sthitam ||

yattu saubhāgyānandasandohe asmadvyavasthāpitārthameva pratijñāya 
vaidikamantrairabhimantraṇasya vihitatvāt śūdrapūjāparatve tatra 
tasyānavakāśādvidheranavakāśāpattihetunā brāhmaṇādhikāraḥ sādhitaḥ sa 
tu atiśithilaḥ | varṣāsu rathakāra ādadhīta ityatra rūḍhiśaktyā yogaṃ bādhitvā 
saṅkarajāterādhānādhikārasiddhau tadanantaraṃ tadupayuktavedādhyayanamapi 
kalpyata iti ṣāṣṭhanyāyena śūdrasya yuktyā adhikārasiddhau vedamantrapāṭhe 
yāvadupayukte adhikārasyānivāryatvena anena hetunā svepsitāsiddheḥ ||

etāvatparyantaṃ brāhmaṇe adhikāravyavasthā kṛtā | 
vyavasthito'pyayamadhikāro na sarvasya kiṃ jitendriyasya kāmādirahitasyaiva | ata 
eva paramānandatantre(-)

ayaṃ tu paramaḥ kaulamārgaḥ samyaṅmaheśvari |
asidhārāvratasamo manonigrahahetukaḥ ||
sthiracittasya sulabhaḥ saphalastūrṇasiddhidaḥ |
anyasya viphalo duḥkhahetuḥ syāt parameśvari || iti ||

<p. 131>

tripurārṇave'pi(-) 

ayaṃ sarvottamo dharmaḥ śivoktaḥ sukhasiddhidaḥ |
jitendriyasya sulabho nānyasyānantajanmabhiḥ ||
yadūrdhvaretasāṃ sarvatyāgināmaniketinām |
kṣaṇena smṛtamātreṇa mohamutpādayatyalam ||
tadevātra hi saṃsiddhau kāraṇaṃ sarvamīritam |
ito madyamito māṃsaṃ bhakṣyamuccāvacaṃ tathā ||
taruṇyaścāruveṣāḍhyā madaghurṇitalocanāḥ |
tatra saṃyatacittatvaṃ sarvathā hyatiduṣkaram ||
bhaktiśraddhāvihīnasya kathaṃ syādetadīśvari || iti ||

bhāvacūḍāmaṇau(-)

tantrāṇāmatigūḍhatvāttadbhāvo'pyatigopitaḥ |
brāhmaṇo vedaśāstrārthatattvajño buddhimān vaśī ||
gūḍhatantrārthabhāvasya nirmanthyoddharaṇakṣamaḥ |
kaulamārge'dhikārī syāditaro duḥkhabhāk bhavet || iti ||

kulārṇave(-)

ahobhuktaṃ tu yanmadyaṃ mohayet tridaśānapi |
tanmaireyaṃ śivaṃ pītvā yo na vikriyate naraḥ ||
japan śivaparo bhūtvā sa muktaḥ sa ca kaulikaḥ || iti ||

bhagavatā paraśurāmeṇāpi kaulācāre mukhyadharmatvena 
kāmakrodhalobhamohamadamātsaryāvihitahiṃsāsteyalokaviruddhalokavidviṣṭa(-)
varjanam" (")idaṃ śrībhagavaduktaṃ sūtraṃ pāścātyaikakhaṇḍe 33 patre-19-
saṃkhyākam |(") iti pratipāditam | tena yathā ājyāvekṣaṇādyaṅgānusāreṇa 
cakṣuṣmata eva darśapūrṇamāsayoradhikāraḥ nāndhānāṃ tathā 
kāmakrodhādivarjanādyaṅgānusāreṇa jitendriyasyaiva adhikāro nānyasyeti 
sūtrakṛdabhiprāyaḥ | evamanyeṣvapi tantreṣu bahūni vacanānyupalabhyante | tāni 
anatiprayojanatvāt granthavistarabhayācca na likhitāni ||

samprati idānīṃtanā ajitendriyāḥ capalajihvāḥ śiśnodaraparāyaṇāḥ 
rāmāndhatayā āropitakaulikatākāḥ kevaladravyamātralolupāḥ 
likhitavacanānyanādṛtya svādhikāramavicāryaiva svābhiprāyasādhanāni 
pītvā pītvā punaḥ pītvā iti āgalāntaṃ pibet dravyam 
ityādikulārṇavavacanānyeva puraskṛtya tadabhiprāyamajānanto jānanto vā 
dhūrtāḥ santaḥ yathecchā'cāraṃ 

<p. 132>

kurvanti | ihāmutra na kutrāpi śarma labhante | pratyuta 
mahāpātakajanitayātanāṃ śrīdharmarājaśāsanāt labhanta eva | nātra 
sandehaḥ | tādṛśāḥ patitāḥ tantragoṣṭhīṣu na smartavyāḥ | ata 
evaitādṛśakaulikānāmupahāso'pi vistareṇa kṛtaḥ prabodhacandrodaye | tasmāt 
jitendriyāṇāṃ bhaktiśraddhāvatāṃ viduṣām ārambhe 
pratipāditabhaktibhūmikāmārūḍhānāmeva atrādhikāraḥ anyeṣāṃ 
patanāyaiva ityalaṃ vistareṇa | uktādhikāribhinnānāṃ viṣṇvādyupāsanaṃ 
kevalavaidikamārgeṇeti tattvam ||

dakṣiṇavāmācāravivekaḥ 

ajitendriyaiḥ kulamārgaṃ praviśya kevalodakādinā pūjā kāryā | ayaṃ dakṣiṇo 
mārgaḥ | jitendriyaiḥ proktadravyeṇa saparyā'nuṣṭheyā | ayaṃ vāmācāra iti 
kaścit | tattuccham vāmācārapadārthasyaiva tenājñātatvāt | tathā ca 
trikūṭārahasye(-)

vāmācāraṃ pravakṣyāmi śrīvidyāsādhanaṃ priye |
yaṃ vidhāya kalau śīghraṃ māntrikaḥ siddhibhāk bhavet ||
mālā nṛdantasaṃbhūtā pātraṃ mānuṣamuṇḍakam |
āsanaṃ siṃhacarmādi kaṅkaṇaṃ strīkacodbhavam ||

ityādyupakramya vistareṇa varṇitam | tanmadhye mukhyadravyanāmāpi nāsti | 
tadvistarastu savyāpasavyamārgasthā iti lalitānāmavyākhyānāvasare 
asmatparameṣṭhigurubhiḥ vistareṇa prapañcitaḥ | viśeṣajijñāsubhiḥ 
tato'vagantavyam | tathā kālikāpurāṇādapi | granthavistarabhayāneha tanomi ||

ajitendriyasya kaulamārge anadhikāraḥ

yadapi paramānandatantraṭippaṇyāṃ ajitendriyāṇāṃ gandhodakena 
pūjanamuktam tadasat mukhyālābhe cānukalpo nānyathā tu kadācana iti 
paramānandatantre viṃśollāsavacanavirodhāt mukhye'nadhikṛtasya 
pratinidhāvadhikārasya śaśaviṣāṇatulyatvāt | tasmādajitendriyāṇām 
āpātataḥ upāsanecchāyām anyamārgeṇa anyadevatopāsanaṃ kṛtvā tena 
paripakvāntaḥ karaṇaṃ dṛḍhaṃ viditvā paścāt kaulamāśrayet | taduktaṃ 
kulasāre(-)

anyāsāṃ devatānāṃ tu bhūyo bhūyo niṣevaṇāt |
paripakvamanāḥ kaule labdhaprāmāṇyako naraḥ | 
bāhyendriyāṇi saṃyamya praviśedatra netaraḥ || iti ||

brahmāṇḍapurāṇe'pi(-)

yasyānyadevatānāmakīrtanaṃ janmakoṭīṣu |
tasyaiva bhavati śraddhā śrīdevīnāmakīrtane |

<p. 133>

carame janmani yathā śrīvidyopāsako bhavet |
nāmasāhasrapāṭhaśca tathā caramajanmani || iti ||

yāmale'pi(-)

śrutismṛtiproktakarmānuṣṭhānādbahujanmasu |
śodhitaṃ ca mano jñātvā śrīvidyopāsako bhavet || iti ||

pheṭkārītantre'pi(-)

sarvathā gopanīyeyaṃ vidyā syādajitendriye |
tena vīryavatī vidyā na vidyā syāt prakāśataḥ ||
kulapuṣpaṃ kuladravyaṃ kulapūjāṃ kulaṃ japam |
nedṛśānāṃ pravaktavyaṃ yadīcchet priyamātmanaḥ (")siddhi(-)śrī(0)(") || iti ||

ajitendriye pravacanamapi niṣidhyate | kimu vaktavyaṃ svīkāre | 
tasmādajitendriyasya kaulamārge nāstyadhikāra ityalamativistareṇa || 31 ||

etadarghyaśodhanamiti śivam || 31 ||

|| [iti(...) kalpasūtre śrīkramo nāma tṛtīyaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||

etat sāmānyārghyaśodhanottaraṃ tajjalena iti maṇḍalādikaraṇamuktam 
tadārabhya kuṇḍalinyāṃ juhuyāt ityantaṃ karma arghyaśodhanam 
arghyasaṃskāraḥ | yadyapi pūrvoktasūtre karmakalāpavidhānādeva 
arghyasaṃskāra iti jñātuṃ śakyate tathā'pi 
śāpavimocanādikatipayasaṃskāraḥ (")saṃskārān iti pāṭha ucitaḥ pratibhāti | 
|| sūtrasya punarāvṛttau śodhyaṃ sūcayitavyakam ||
|| pariśiṣṭa sthalaṃ caiva pūrṇamādyā prāsādataḥ || [iti tṛtīyaḥ khaṇḍaḥ](-) 
śrīḥ(-) ||(") pātrāntarāṇi ca bhrāntyā kecana svīkuryuḥ tanmābhūta ityetadarthaṃ 
paraśurāmaḥ paramakāruṇikaḥ bhrāntinirāsāya idaṃ sūtraṃ praṇināya | etat 
uktaṃ yat tāvadeva śodhanaṃ nānyadityarthaḥ | śiva mityanena 
arghyaprakaraṇasamāptiḥ sūcitā ||

viśeṣārghyaśodhane nibandhe maṇḍalapūjāyāṃ vidyayā madhyapūjanaṃ 
sūtre uktaṃ tattyaktam | anuktaṃ turīyasvaralekhanaṃ hrīṃ mahālakṣmīśvarīti 
mantraṃ sudhādevīpūjanādi gālinyā puṣpaṃ dattvetyantam anuktaṃ 
saṃgṛhītam | atra pramāṇābhāvāt kevalatadbuddhyā racitamasaṅgrāhyam || 31 ||

[iti ... kalpasūtravṛttau śrīkramo nāma tṛtīyaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||





[caturthaḥ khaṇḍaḥ(-)lalitākramaḥ]

śrīcakre paracityāvāhanam

hṛdi sthitāyā devatāyāḥ śrīcakre āvāhanaprakāraṃ darśayitumupakramate(-)

atha hṛccakrasthitāmantassuṣumṇāpadmāṭavīnirbhedanakuśalāṃ nirasta 
mohatimirāṃ śivadīpadīptimādyāṃ saṃvidaṃ vahannāsāpuṭena nirgamayya 
līlā'kalitavapuṣaṃ tāṃ trikhaṇḍamudrāśikhaṇḍe (")etad 
trikhaṇḍāmudroddhāraḥ dvi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15/8-11 viṣaye dṛśyaḥ |(") kusumāñjalau 
haste samānīya || 1 ||

atheti kramaviśeṣadyotakam atha jihvāyā atha vakṣasaḥ itivat | yadvā(-)
pūrvaprakaraṇavicchedadyotakam | hṛccakram anāhataṃ tadeva dahramityapi 
vyavahriyate | tatra sthitāṃ | śāstre devatānivāsasthānaṃ tadeva prasiddham | 
tathā ca śrutiḥ(-) tatrāpi dahraṃ gaganaṃ viśokastasmin yadantastadupāsitavyam iti 
| skāndapurāṇe'pi hṛtpuṇḍarīkāntarasanniviṣṭam iti | ato devatāyā 
nivāsasthānaṃ hṛccakram | tatra sthitāyā bāhyopacārapūjanaṃ na sambhavati | 
ataḥ tatra sthānādbahirānayanārthaṃ sārvakālikaṃ sthānaṃ jñāpayitumidaṃ 
viśeṣaṇaṃ jñeyam | suṣumṇā'pi 
mūlādhārādibrahmarandhrasthasaroruhāntānāṃ kamalānāṃ 
gumphanādhārabhūtadaṇḍākṛtireko nāḍīviśeṣaḥ | taduktaṃ viṣṇupurāṇe(-)

mūlādidehacakrāṇāmādhārā'sau prakīrtitā |
yā suṣumṇeti sarvatra gīyate paramarṣibhiḥ ||

iti | tasyāṃ yāni padmāni viśuddhyādīni teṣāṃ aṭavī durgamaṃ vartma tasya 
nirbhedanaṃ gamanāgamanānukūlavartmasaṃpādanaṃ tadviṣaye kuśalām | 
anena viśeṣaṇena hṛdayāt śrīcakrādau āgamane pūjā'nantaraṃ punargamane 
prayāsābhāvaḥ sūcitaḥ | nirasteti nirastaḥ dūrīkutaḥ moho'jñānaṃ tadeva 
timiraṃ yayā tām | etadviśeṣaṇārthaṃ dṛḍhīkartuṃ viśeṣaṇāntaramāha(-)
śiveti | śivātmako yo dīpaḥ tasya dīptiṃ prakāśarūpām | etena 
prakāśarūpatvakathanena pūrvaviśeṣaṇena pratipāditaṃ 
ajñānatimiranāśanaṃ sūpapādamiti dhvanitam | kiṃ ca yathā 
dīpaprabhayoravinābhāvasambandhaḥ evaṃ śivaśaktyorapyavinābhāvaḥ 
sūcitaḥ | ayamevārthaḥ spaṣṭamukto brahmāṇḍapurāṇe(-)

trikoṇarūpiṇī śaktiḥ bindurūpaḥ paraḥ śivaḥ |
avinābhāvasambandhaḥ tasmādbindutrikoṇayoḥ || iti ||

<p. 135>

śrīdevībhāgavate'pi(-)

yasmin dharmiṇi yo dharmo'vinābhūtaśca tiṣṭhati |
sa dharmī śivarūpaḥ syāddharmaśśaktisvarūpadhṛk || iti ||

anayorvastunoraupādhiko bhedo na vāstava iti tattvanirūpaṇe prapañcitaṃ 
prāgeva (")prāgeva nāma(-)anugate 3 khaṇḍe-92 patre(-)śrīkrame-9 sūtrabhāṣye(-)
ityarthaḥ |(") | ādyāṃ saṃvidaṃ aparicchinnasaṃvidaṃ vahan nāsāpuṭena yena 
nāsāpuṭena aprayatnena śvāso nirgacchati tena mārgeṇa nirgamayya yathā 
nirgamanaṃ bhavet tadanukūlavyāpāraṃ kuryāt | atra tādṛśo vyāpāraḥ 
hṛdayasthānāt uktamārgeṇa nirgamanabhāvanameva | tadanantaravyāpāraṃ 
vidhatte līleti | līlayā svecchāmātreṇa ākalitaṃ svīkṛtaṃ vapuḥ 
dhyānaślokoktaṃ yayā | etena itaraśarīravat garbhavāsena vinā 
bhaktānugrahāya svīkṛtamanoharavapuṣṭvaṃ sūcitam | uktaṃ ca gītāyām(-)

yadā yadā hi dharmasya glānirbhavati bhārata |
abhyutthānamadharmasya tadā'tmānaṃ sṛjāmyaham || iti (")śrī bha gī(.) a(.) 4 
ślokaḥ-7 |(") ||

mārkaṇḍeyapurāṇe'pi(-)

evaṃ yadā yadā bādhā dānavotthā bhaviṣyati | 
tadā tadā'vatīryāhaṃ kariṣyāmyarisaṃkṣayam || iti (")śrī saptaśatī(-)a(.) 12 
antimaḥ ślokaḥ |(") ||

tām aṅgīkṛtavapuṣaṃ trikhaṇḍamudrā (")iyaṃ trikhaṇḍā mudrā ddi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 
15/8-11 viṣaye dṛśyā |(") trikhaṇḍā trīn janmamṛtyujarāḥ yadvā 
sattvarajastamoguṇān khaṇḍayatīti trikhaṇḍā kevalamokṣapradetyarthaḥ | yadvā 
trīṇi khaṇḍāni kalāḥ icchājñānakriyā'tmikāḥ tatsvarūpā trikhaṇḍā | 
taduktaṃ yoginītantre(-)

mudrā'khyā sā yadā saṃvidambikā trikalāmayī | 
trikhaṇḍā rūpamāpannā sadā sannidhikāriṇī |
sarvasya cakrarājasya vyāpikā parikīrtitā || iti ||

mudrāśadbārthaśca viśvasya modanāt drāvaṇācca mudrā | taduktaṃ 
yoginītantre(-)

cidātmabhittau viśvasya prakāśāmarśane yadā |
karoti svecchayā pūrṇavicikīrṣāsamanvitā ||
kriyāśaktistu viśvasya modanād drāvaṇāttathā ||
mudreti kathitā devī(.....................) || iti ||

<p. 136>

asyārthaḥ yadā cicchaktiḥ svātmābhinnāyāṃ bhittau svecchayā 
īkṣaṇānantaraṃ vikārān pūrṇānicchantī prakāśāmarśane karoti | ayaṃ 
bhāvaḥ jagataḥ ṣaḍbhāvavikārāḥ asti jāyate vardhate vipariṇamate apakṣīyate 
naśyati iti | teṣu dvitīyo vikāraḥ prakāśaḥ sphuṭībhāva iti tallakṣaṇāt | tṛtīyo 
vikāraḥ āmarśanam idaṃ tayā hṛdayaṅgamībhāva iti tallakṣaṇāt | itthaṃ ca 
tripurasundaryāḥ svāntassthitasṛṣṭisattāparyālocanottaraṃ viśvasya 
dvitīyādivikāraviṣayiṇī icchotpadyate | seyaṃ vicikīrṣā | tato viśvasya 
utpattyabhivṛddhikrameṇa karoti | te evaite pūrvoktaprakāśavimarśane 
īdṛśecchākṛtiviśiṣṭacit kriyāśaktirityucyate | iyaṃ kriyāśaktiḥ 
tripurasundaryā kriyamāṇotpattyabhivṛddhī anumodate drāvayati ceti mudrā sā | 
anumodanaṃ nāma svabhinnakartṛkakriyānukūlyam | drāvaṇaṃ nāma ghanasya 
saṅkucitasya praśithilāvayavatā'pādanātmakaḥ prasaraḥ | īdṛśakriyāśaktireva 
svavṛttimudrātvasāmānādhikaraṇyena īkṣaṇādermelanena trikalāmayī 
trikhaṇḍā bhavati iti paramarahasyārthaḥ | ataḥ sarvaśreṣṭheyaṃ vyāpikā 
mudreti tasyā āvāhane viniyogaḥ kṛtaḥ | etādṛśī yā mudrā tasyā 
adṛṣṭasvarūpaṃ pratipāditam | dṛṣṭasvarūpaṃ tu aṅgulīpragrathanarūpaṃ 
nānāvidhaṃ tantrabhedena dṛśyate | asmin na dṛśyate | ato 
gurusampradāyāvagataṃ tantrārthaṃ caikīkṛtyāgre spaṣṭīkrīyate | īdṛśaṃ yat 
trikhaṇḍātmakaṃ bāhyarūpaṃ tena śikhaṇḍitaḥ grathitaḥ kusumayuktaḥ 
añjaliḥ yasmin tasmin haste samānīya gṛhītvā || 1 ||

māyālakṣmī parā uccārya devīnāma cāmṛtacaitanyamūrtiṃ kalpayāmi 
namaḥ iti kalpayitvā || 2 || 

māyā hrīṃ śrīṃ iti lakṣmīśabdārthaḥ parā sauḥ | etadviṣaye pramāṇāni 
pūrvameva darśitāni | evaṃ bījatrayamuccārya devīnāma 
śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ lalitāyāḥ iti ṣaṣṭhyantaṃ yogyatvāt | tato 
namo'ntamavikṛtaṃ paṭhet | evaṃ ca ādau sādhāraṇaparibhāṣāprāptā tritārī 
aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ sauḥ śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ 
amṛtacaitanyamūrtiṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ iti trayastriṃśadvarṇo mantaḥ | anena 
paradevatāyā mūrtiṃ kalpayitvā bhāvayitvā ||

atra pūrvasūtre līlā'kalitavapuṣaḥ haste āgatāyāḥ punarmūrtikalpane 
vaiyyarthyādataḥ prabalenārthakrameṇa pāṭhakramabādhaḥ | tathā cāyaṃ 
kramaḥ prathamaṃ kevalacitomūrtikalpanamanena mantreṇa tato mūrteḥ 
kalpitāyāḥ nāsāpuṭamārgeṇa nirgamanaṃ tato haste kusumagarbhe'ñjalau 
samānayanamitivivekaḥ || 2 ||

hasarayujaṃ vācaṃ hasayuktāṃ kalarīṃ hasaracaturdaśaṣoḍaśānapyuccārya

mahāpadmavanāntaḥsthe kāraṇānandavigrahe |
sarvabhūtahite mātarehyehi parameśvari ||

iti baindavacakre paracitimāvāhya || 3 ||

<p. 137>

pūrvaṃ nyāsaprakaraṇe uktena samudāyagrahaṇa iti nyāyena hasetyādiṣu 
kevalavyañjanamātragrahaṇaṃ sampradāyāt | haśca saśca raśca tairyutaṃ 
vācaṃ hsraiṃ iti | haśca saśca ābhyāṃ yukto'yaṃ 
kakāralakārarephekārabindusamudāyaḥ hsklrīṃ iti | tathā haśca saśca raśca 
caturdaśa aukāraḥ saḥ ca ṣoḍaśo visargaḥ saḥ ca hasaracaturdaśaṣoḍaśāḥ 
hsrauḥ iti etānuccārya parameśvarītyantaṃ yathāśrutaṃ paṭhitvā binducakre 
paracitimāvāhayet | mantrasvarūpaṃ tu prathamaṃ tritārī hasraiṃ hsklrīṃ 
hsrauḥ(-)

mahāpadmavanāntaḥsthe kāraṇānandavigrahe |
sarvabhūtahite mātarehyehi parameśvari ||

ityaṣṭatriṃśadvarṇo mantraḥ | mahāpadmavanasya yo'ntaḥ pradeśaḥ tatrasthe | 
mahāpadmasvarūpamuktaṃ brahmāṇḍapurāṇe(-)

padmāṭavīsthalaṃ vakṣye sāvadhāno mune śṛṇu | 
same suratnakhacite tatra ṣaḍyojanāntare |
paritaḥ sthalapadmāni mahākāṇḍāni santi vai ||

setubandhe tu mahāpadmavanaṃ sahasradalakamalasamudāyaḥ ityuktam | 
kāraṇānandaḥ aparicchinnānandaḥ sa eva vigraho yasyāḥ | yadvā kāraṇaṃ 
prathamaṃ tasmin jātaḥ kāraṇaḥ tatra jātaḥ ityaṇ | sa cāsāvānandaśceti | 
śeṣaṃ pūrvavat | śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | 

yadvā caitanyamahaso bahirnissāraṇaṃ kṛtvā mantreṇa paricchinnāṃ mūrtiṃ 
kalpayitvā haste samānīya mantreṇa pīṭhaniveśanāntam āvāhanapadārthaḥ 
avadānādipradānāntasyeva bahvīnāṃ kriyāṇām ekapadārthatve 
bādhakābhāvāt | tena yatra dīkṣā'dau nānādevatānāṃ tantreṇa pūjanaṃ 
tatra samudāyasyaikapadārthatvāt kāṇḍānusamayaḥ tāvatāṃ siddhaḥ | 
etādṛśāvāhanaikadeśapīṭhanivaśane sādhanībhūto'yaṃ mantraḥ ||

nibandhakārastu jñānārṇavoktaṃ antaryāgakramaṃ āvāhanādimudrāśca 
darśayāmāsa | tadanādaraṇīyaṃ pramāṇābhāvāt || 3 ||

catuṣaṣṭhayupacāravidhiḥ

catuṣṣaṣṭhyupacārān kuryāt | sarve upacāramantrāḥ 
tritārīpūrvāḥ kalpayāmi namaḥ ityantāḥ kartavyāḥ || 4 ||

catuṣṣaṣṭītyanena etattantrānuyāyināṃ 
tantrāntaroktaṣoḍaśādyanyatamapūjāvyāvṛttiḥ || nanu kimayaṃ 
parisaṅkhyāvidhiḥ uta niyamavidhiḥ uta apūrvavidhiḥ nādyaḥ kenāpi 
pramāṇena nityamaprāpteḥ | pakṣe'pi prāptyabhāvena na dvitīyaḥ | tarhi tṛtīyaḥ 
syāditi cediṣṭāpattiḥ | tathā'pi sarvāṃśe nāpūrvavidhiḥ upacārāṃśe 
apūrvaḥ catuṣṣaṣṭyaṃśe niyamaḥ | upacāravidhau upacārāṇāmanantatvena 
tatra nānāsaṅkhyāprāptau catuṣṣaṣṭhisaṅkhyāyā api pakṣe prāptatvāt | na ca(-)

<p. 138>

evamekasminniyamāpūrvasvīkāre vidhisāṅkaryam iti vācyam iṣṭāpatteḥ 
yadāgneyo'ṣṭākapāla iti vākye agnipuroḍāśayoḥ pakṣe prāptau tadaṃśe 
niyamaḥ yāgāṃśe apūrva iti dṛṣṭatvāt | na ca catuṣṣaṣṭhyupacārān vidhāya 
ityagrimasūtreṇa (")purastādevāgāmi-5-sūtroktavākyena |(") parisaṅkhyāvidhiḥ 
anenopacāravidhiḥ iti vācyam tathā sati asmin sūtre catuṣṣaṣṭhipadavaiyyarthyāt 
| na ca evaṃ sati catuṣṣaṣṭhītyagrimavākyaṃ vyartham iti śaṅkanīyam 
catuṣṣaṣṭhyupacārānanūdya kramaviśeṣavidhānāt | sarvathā nopacārasya 
saṅkhyāyā vidhāyakaṃ tat | kuryāditi spaṣṭavidhyantam idameva 
saṅkhyāviśiṣṭopacāravidhāyakam ||

yadvā pāṭhenaiva kramasiddhau agrimeṇa catuṣṣaṣṭhyupacārān vidhāya ityanena 
kramavidhānāsambhavāt vihitānāmeva iti catuṣṣaṭhyupacāran vidhāya 
ityanuvādakam upasaṃhārarūpam | asya phalaṃ tu tantrāntare 
catuṣṣaṣṭhyupacārānantarbhūtāḥ uktādanye kecana santi tairarcanaṃ mābhūt 
kiṃ tu pratinidhiṃ kalpayitvā mantre śrutadravyanāmnaivārpaṇametadartham | 
itthaṃ coktopacārādadhikaiḥ sambhave sati pūjanaṃ kartavyam | ata eva 
tripurārṇave(-)

uktopacārādadhikaiḥ sambhave sati pūjayet ||

iti vacanaṃ uktanyāyagarbhameva | niyamavidherayogavyavacchede tātparyam 
natvanyayogavyavacchede | tena catuṣṣaṣṭhyupacāramadhye ekasyāpyayogo mā 
bhavatvityatraiva tātparyam na tvadhikavyavacchede | tasmāt ito'dhikānāṃ 
śibikāgajāśvanṛtyādīnāṃ yāvatāṃ sambhavaḥ tāvatkalpanaṃ 
sūtrāviruddhaṃ mantavyam ||

atra upacārapadārthaśca kalpyamānadravyajanitaḥ sukhaviśeṣaḥ taṃ kuryāt 
utpādayet ityarthaḥ ||

na ca nityatṛptāyāṃ devatāyāṃ kalpyamānadravyeṇa kīdṛśī sukhotpattiḥ iti 
vācyam | nityatṛpte sukhotpattiḥ na bhavatīti satyaṃ tathā'pi 
paricchinnaśarīrakalpanavattaccharīre sukhakalpanena svātmanyadṛṣṭotpattireva na 
tu kalpitena paradevatāyāḥ sukhotpattiḥ | ata evoktaṃ śivamahimne (")atra mahimani(-)
iti(-)pāṭhaḥ(-)sambhāvyatām |(") na hi svātmārāmaṃ viṣayamṛgatṛṣṇā bhramayati 
iti | ata evopacāramantre kalyayāmītyeva kriyāpadaṃ yojitam | śeṣaṃ suspaṣṭam 
|| 4 ||

tritārīmuccārya pādyaṃ kalpayāmi namaḥ iti krameṇa ābharaṇāvaropaṇaṃ 
