krameṇetyanena pādyamiti prātipadikasthāne 
ābharaṇāvaropaṇādipadoccāraṇaṃ jñāpayati | snānīyodvartanaṃ 
śarīralagnasnehaviyogasādhanaṃ sugandhicūrṇaviśeṣaḥ | atra dvitīyāntāni 
sarvāṇi tattadvastujanyasukhaviśeṣaparāṇi | kucottarīyaṃ kañcukam | ālepaḥ 
sugandhidravyaśarīrasaṃyogaḥ tajjanako maṇḍapaḥ sthānaviśeṣaḥ | kaṅkumaṃ 
kāśmīram | saṅkuḥ vṛkṣaviśeṣaḥ | taduktaṃ viśvakośe śaṅkuḥ kīle gare 
śastre saṅkhyāpādapabhedayoḥ iti sakāraśakārayornātibhedāt 
ekadeśavikṛtamananyavat iti nyāyena vṛkṣaviśeṣaḥ sugandhiḥ | mṛgamadaḥ 
kastūryavāntarabhedaḥ | yadvā otuviśeṣāvayavo mṛgamadaḥ 
mahārāṣṭrabhāṣayā javvāji iti prasiddhaḥ | kastūrī mṛganābhiḥ | ādipadena 
anyāni lokaprasiddhāni sugandhidravyāṇi | sarvāṅgīṇaṃ sarvāṅgasambandhi | 
sarvāṅgaśadbāt sambandhārthe khapratyaye sarvāṅgīṇam iti rūpaṃ sidhyati | 
tādṛśaṃ yat vilepanam | agaruḥ prasiddhaḥ | tanmadhye atyunnataḥ kālāgaruḥ | 
mallikā mālatītyādinā ṣaḍṛtusamudbhavakusumāni | sīmantaḥ 
keśapāśamadhyasaraṇiḥ tasmin sindūram | tilakasthāne ratnam | kālāñjanam 
atikṛṣṇāñjanaṃ sauvirāñjanaṃ vā | pālī karṇabhūṣaṇaṃ 
mahārāṣṭrabhāṣayā bālī iti prasiddham | tasyāḥ yugalaṃ yugmam | adhare 
oṣṭhe yāvakaṃ lākṣārasaṃ raktatvasaṃpādakam | prathamabhūṣaṇaṃ 
maṅgalasūtram | kanakacintākaṃ āndhrapuradhrībhiḥ dhṛto bhūṣaṇaviśeṣaḥ 
kaṇṭhasya āndhrabhāṣayā golakuttikaṇṭhū iti prasiddhaḥ | padakaṃ 
kaṇṭhabhūṣaṇaṃ mahārāṣṭrabhāṣayā tanmaṇi iti prasiddham | mahāpadakaṃ 
kaṇṭhabhūṣaṇaviśeṣaḥ | mahārāṣṭrabhāṣayā peṭayā iti prasiddhaḥ | 
muktāvaliṃ mahārāṣṭrabhāṣayā kaṇṭhā iti prasiddham | ekāvaliṃ 
saptaviṃśatimauktikaracitā mālā nakṣatramālā iti prasiddhā 
ekāvalyekayaṣṭikā saiva nakṣatramālā syāt ityamaraḥ | channavīraṃ ubhayato 
vaikakṣyadāmātmakaṃ bhūṣaṇam iti nibandhe sthitam | keyūrāṇām 
aṅgadānāṃ yugalaṃ yugmaṃ tasya catuṣṭayam ekaikabāhau dvayaṃ dvayam | 
balayāḥ kaṅkaṇāni teṣāmāvaliṃ paṅktim | ūrmikā aṅgulibhūṣaṇaṃ tasya 
āvalim | kaṭibhūṣaṇānyāha kāñcīti | saubhāgyābharaṇam adhare 
jaghanālambī bhūṣaṇaviśeṣa iti nibandhe sthitam | 
pādakaṭakaratnanūpurapādāṅgulīyottaramekavacanamavivakṣitam tadarthasya 
bādhāt | āyudhānyāha eketi | puṇḍrekṣuḥ citravarṇekṣuḥ | puṣpamayāḥ 
bāṇāḥ puṣpabāṇāḥ tān | āyudhakrama ukto dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāyām(-)

