kecit tu viśeṣārghya eva tatsaṃskārarūpaṃ tataḥ kiṃcit uddhṛtya pātrāntareṇa 
tatraiva nikṣeparūpaṃ tarpaṇaṃ vidhīyate ityūcuḥ | tanna 
viśeṣārghyaśodhanaprakaraṇābhāvena tathātve 
prakṛtahānyaprakṛtakalpanāpatteḥ etadarghyasaṃśodhanamiti 
pūrvasūtravirodhācca | na ca bindāviti kathaṃ jñātamiti śaṅkanīyam mūleneti 
turīyakūṭaśravaṇena (")tṛtīya(-)ba(.") tajjhānasambhavāt | paraṃ tu iyān viśeṣaḥ(-)
etadatirikte pūjayitveti atra santarpyeti śravaṇāt atra tarpaṇaṃ anyatra pūjanam | 
anuṣṭhāne viśeṣastu atra bindumātraprakṣepaḥ pūjanasthale 
bindupuṣpākṣatobhayaprakṣepaḥ | kiṃ ca

<p. 143>

mūleneti tṛtīyayā itaranairapekṣyaśravaṇāt śrīpāduketyādyaṣṭākṣaryāḥ 
(")anugate-82-patre(-)khaṇḍe(-)śrīgaṇanāyakapaddhatau-8-mūlasūtre 
uktoyamaṣṭhākṣarīmantraḥ |(") pūjāyāmeva yojanavidhānāt śvāhā home 
tarpaṇe ca tarpayāmīti coccaret iti dakṣiṇāmūrtisaṃhitāvacanena mūlānte 
tarpayāmītyeva yogaḥ ||

nanu tantrāntare ekakriyāyāmeva dvayoḥ padayoḥ prayogaḥ paryāyeṇa dṛśyate 
yathā kṣīreṇa brāhmaṇaistarpyā iti dravyeṇa sātvikenaiva brāhmaṇaḥ 
pūjayecchivām iti kvacit asminnevārthe yajdhāturapi dṛśyate yathā(-)
śurāghaṭasahasreṇa yakṣye tvāṃ parameśvari iti tathā ca 
tarpaṇapūjanayajanāni paryāyāṇīti (")paryāyāḥ iti sādhuḥ pāṭhaḥ |(") cet na | 
nahyekārthe prayogamātreṇa paryāyatā sidhyati lakṣaṇayā'pyanyasminnarthe 
prayogasambhavāt | anyathā gaṅgāratīrapadayorapi tathātvāpatteḥ | ata eva 
vāyavyaṃ śvetamālabheta bhūtikāmaḥ ityatra dhātoḥ sparśārthakatve'pi 
dravyadevatāyogasya yāgamantarā'nupapatteḥ ālabhatidhātoḥ yāge lakṣaṇā 
kalpitā | tathā anupapattyabhāvena agnihotre śrūyamāṇasya vatsamālabheta 
ityatra dhātoḥ yathāśrutārthatvamevāṅgīkṛtam | prakṛte'pi santarpyetyatra 
vāyavyādivākyavat bādhakābhāvāt vatsamālabheta itivat yathā 
śrutārthatvameva yuktam ||

nanu dravyasyātrāpyanuktatvāt tarpaṇaṃ pūjanaṃ vā kena kāryamiti cet ucyate | 
vihitatarpaṇādikaṃ sādhanamapekṣate | saṃskṛtaṃ viśeṣārghyaṃ ca 
kāryamapekṣate | evaṃ sākāṅkṣayostayoḥ naṣṭāśvadagdharathanyāyena 
viśeṣārghyaṃ saṃskṛtya tena devatāṃ yajet iti vākyaikavākyatā kalpyate ||

na ca evaṃ sati sāmānyārghyasyā'pi tulyatvena tasyāpi pūjāsādhanatvāpattiḥ 
iti vācyam tajjalena trikoṇeti viśeṣārghyamaṇḍalādau śrautaviniyogenāsya kiṃ 
kāryam ityākāṅkṣāvirahāt ||

na ca evaṃ tadbindubhiḥ triśaḥ gurupādukāmiṣṭvā iti tṛtīyayā 
viśeṣārghyasthāpi viniyogaśravaṇāt ubhayatra tulyam iti vācyam 
etadarghyasaṃśodhanamiti (")anugata-3-khaṇḍāntimena 32-sūtreṇetyarthaḥ |(") 
tadagrimasūtreṇa tāvatparyantaṃ viśeṣārghyasaṃskārasyaivoktatvena 
bindubhirityāderapi saṃskārāntaḥpātitvāt kiṃ ca śyāmākrame sthitena 
sarvacakradevatā'rcanāni (")idaṃ-6-khaṇḍe śrīśyāmākramasthaṃ-22 sūtram |(") 
vāmakarāṅguṣṭhānāmikāsandaṣṭadvītīyaśakalagṛhītaśrīpātraprathama(-)
bindusahapatitaiḥ dakṣakarākṣatapuṣpakṣepaiḥ kuryāditi vacanena dravyalābhasya 
niṣpratyūhatvāt ||

<p. 144>

na ca tasya śyāmāprakaraṇasthatvāt tatraiva viśrāntiḥ iti vācyam | śyāmāyā 
lalitopāstyaṅgatvaṃ pūrvameva vyavasthāpitam | aṅgasya prakaraṇaṃ nāstīti 
mīmāṃsakasiddhāntaḥ | ataḥ prabalena prakaraṇena sannidhiṃ bādhitvā sarvatra 
viniyoge bādhakābhāvāt ||

na ca tathā'pi śyāmāpadairubhayataḥ saṃdaṃśāt 
prayājābhikramaṇanyāyena avāntaraprakaraṇaṃ mahāprakaraṇabādhakaṃ 
bhaviṣyati iti vācyam sarvaśabdaśrutyā sarvaprabalayā 
avāntaraprakaraṇabādhasambhavāt ||

kiṃ ca anārabhya paṭhitena siddhāntagranthasthena tadabhivyañjakāḥ pañca 
makārāḥ tairarcanam ityanena dravyasya prāptatvena anupapattigandhābhāvāt ||

etā eva yuktayaḥ gaṇapatiprakaraṇasthe sarvatra devatānāmasu śrīpūrvaṃ 
pādukāṃ pūjayāmītyaṣṭākṣaraṃ yojayet iti vākye (")idaṃ vākyamanugate-81-
patre-2-khaṇḍe(-)gaṇanāyakapaddhatau 8-sūtre'pi |(") draṣṭavyāḥ || 

