ṣaḍaṅgapūjanamāha(-)

devyā agnīśāsuravāyuṣu madhye dikṣu ca ṣaḍaṅgāni pūjayitvā || 8 ||

atra pūjanaṃ nāma puṣpākṣatabinduprakṣepa (")etat(-)agre-6 khaṇḍe(-)śyāmāme(-)
22-sū(-)dṛśyam |(") eva na tu pañcopacārādyarpaṇarūpaṃ 
śyāmākramoktakalpasūtrānurodhāt tathā śiṣṭasampradāyācca ||

evaṃ sati atrādhunikāḥ yatra yatraitaduttaraṃ pūjayitveti tatra tatra 
pūrvasūtrasthaṃ santarpyetyanuvartyobhayavidhiḥ mūladevīsthale 
tarpaṇamātraṃ bindudravyadānaṃ tarpaṇaṃ puṣpākṣatadānaṃ pūjanaṃ 
itthaṃ ca tritārīśiromantrottaraṃ śiraśśaktiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
śiraśśaktiśrīpādukāṃ tarpayāmi ityanutiṣṭhanti | tadanuṣṭhānaṃ 
bhrāntimūlam tathā sati ardhajaratīyanyāyāt | tritārīmārabhya śiromantrāntaṃ 
sakṛdāvṛttiḥ śiraśśaktītyārabhya dvivāramiti kathanasyātihāsāspadatvāt | 
kiṃ ca pūjayāmīti mantreṇa pūjanaṃ agrimamantreṇa tarpaṇam iti 
pūjanatarpaṇayoḥ kramikatvaṃ prāptam | tathā sati bindupuṣpākṣatadānayoḥ 
ekakālabodhakena bindusahapatitaiḥ puṣpākṣataiḥ kuryāt iti sūtreṇa virudhyate | 
api ca vāmakarasambandhābhāvaprasaṅgaśca kramikatvena dvayorapi 
dakṣahastena kartuṃ śakyatvāt | 

<p. 145>

na ca vāmakarāṅguṣṭhānāmikāsandaṣṭaḥ iti sūtrānusāreṇa (")idaṃ-6 khaṇḍe 
śrīśyāmākrame 22-sūtram |(") vāmakarasyāvaśyakatā iti vācyam dakṣakarasya 
puṣpākṣataprakṣepavyāpṛtatvena sahatvānyathā'nupapattyā 
prāptavāmakarasya vidhānāsambhavenānuvādakatvāt | ata eva 
bahiṣpavamānastotrārthaṃ prasarpaṇāvasare chandogānāṃ sūtre savyaiḥ 
pāṇibhistṛṇanti ityatra bhāṣye dakṣahastasya adhvaryuṃ prastotā'nvārabhate 
prastotāraṃ pratihartā pratihartāramudgātā iti vākyena adhvaryvādyanvārambhe 
vyāpṛtatvāt arthaprāptaḥ savyapāṇiḥ anūdyate ityuktam ||

kecittu santarpyetyanuvartya tarpaṇapūjobhayaṃ vidhīyate 
ardhajaratīyanyāyabhītyā tritāryuttaraṃ hṛnmantrānte 
hṛdayaśaktiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi tarpayāmi namaḥ iti mantraṃ paṭhanti | 
tadaśuddham anuvṛttau pramāṇābhāvāt ||

kiṃ ca vidhau ādau tarpaṇaṃ paścāt pūjā mantre viparītakrama iti ca viruddham 
||

tasmāt pūrvavākye tarpaṇaṃ nāma binduprakṣepamātram | tasya anuvṛttau 
ākāṅkṣāvirahāt pūjanameva vidhīyate | pūjāpadārthaśca 
bindupuṣpākṣatasamudāyaprakṣepaḥ | itthaṃ ca ādau tritārī tato hṛnmantraḥ tato 
hṛdayaśaktiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti mantrasvarūpaṃ jñeyam | 
evamevāgre'pi sarvatra jñeyam ||

agnīśetyatra agnyādipadena tattaddevatāsambandhidiśāṃ grahaṇam | dikṣu 
ityanena prāgādidikcatuṣṭayagrahaṇam | ṣaḍaṅgayuvatīnāṃ agnyādicatasro 
vidiśaḥ madhyaṃ prāgādidikcatuṣṭayaṃ militvaikaṃ iti ṣaṭ sthānāni jñeyāni 
||

