yoniḥ kāraṇatvāni teṣāṃ prācuryato bhūyastvena | ata eva sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇyā 
bāhyasvarūpe aṅguligrathanātmake'pi aṅguṣṭhe 
kaniṣṭhānāmāmadhyamāgrāṇāṃ yoge yonibhūyastvaṃ 
pratyakṣeṇānubhūyate | etena adṛśyarūpamapi tathetyunneyam | dvitīyā 
sarvavidrāviṇī sarvānutpannān drāvayati vardhayati poṣaṇena sā sarvavidrāviṇī 
sarveṣāṃ vastūnāṃ pālakatvādṛjusvabhāvā jyeṣṭhāśaktipracurā ca | 
taduktaṃ yoginītantre kṣubdhaviśvasthitikarī jyeṣṭhā prācuryamāsthitā iti | 
kṣubdhasya utpannasyetyarthaḥ | yaśca saṃrakṣakaḥ sa ṛjuriti loke prasiddhā 
gāthā | ata eva asyā mudrāyāḥ bāhyarūpe'pi aṅguṣṭhena 
kaniṣṭhikānāmāyoge aṅgulicatuṣṭaye ṛjutvaṃ dṛśyate | evamādyatrikoṇe 
rekhātrayamadhye pūrvasyāṃ diśi sthitāyāṃ ṛjurekhāyāmeva tasyāḥ 
adhiṣṭhānaṃ śāstraprasiddham | tṛtīyā sarvākarṣiṇī sarvākarṣaṇaśīlā | 
iyaṃ jyeṣṭhā vāmobhayātmikā | taduktaṃ yoginītantre(-)

<p. 152>

jyeṣṭhā vāmāsamatvena sṛṣṭeḥ prādhānyamāsthitā
ākarṣiṇīti mudreyam(......................) || iti ||

pūrvoktamudrādvayavācakapadaśakyatā'vacchedakayoḥ dvayorapi 
sarvākarṣiṇīpadaśakyatā'vacchedakatvaṃ bodhyam puṣpavacchabdavat | tatrāpi 
jyeṣṭhātvaviśiṣṭavāmātvaṃ śakyatāvacchedakaṃ na tu viparītam | tathā sati 
jyeṣṭhāyā viśeṣyatvena pradhānyaṃ vācyam | prādhānye jyeṣṭhāyā 
atisaralatvena pradhānānusāreṇa viśeṣaṇībhūtavāmāyā api 
pradhānānuvartinyāḥ saralatayā tarjanīmadhyamayoḥ bāhyarūpe kuṭilatvaṃ na 
syāt | vāmāyāḥ prādhānye tu tasyāḥ kuṭilatayā tadanusāreṇa apradhānā yā 
jyeṣṭhāyāḥ pradhānānuvartinyāḥ kuṭilatvaṃ yuktam | ata eva bāhyasvarūpe 
aṅguligrathane sarvāsvaṅguliṣu kuṭilatvam | caturthī sarvavaśyakarī sarvān 
kṣityādiśivāntān vaśyaṃ svādhīnaṃ nayati prāpayatīti tathā | loke ākāśo 
dvividhaḥ dahraḥ prākṛtaśca | dahrākāśe'pi susūkṣmo'nyaḥ ākāśo'sti 
tasyānte suṣiṁū(?)sūkṣmam iti śrutiprasiddhaḥ | tanmadhye gāḍhamāśliṣṭā 
paraśivena yā ānandavigrahā mūrtiḥ sā sarvavaśyakarīpadavācyā | taduktaṃ 
uttaracatuśśatyām(-)

vyomadvayāntarālasthabindurūpā maheśvarī | 
śivaśaktyātmasaṃśleṣādeṣā vaśyakarī smṛtā || iti ||

bindurūpeti kathanāt kharūpamapi tathā | ata evāṅguli'grathanepi asyā 
bāhyarūpe bindvākāratā sarvāṅgulīnāṃ gāḍhasaṃśleṣo'pi vyaktaḥ | 
pañcamī uktaśivaśaktibindvormadhye sūkṣmarekhā nīvāraśūkavattanvī tasya 
madhye vahniśikhā iti śrutiprasiddhā | tasyāḥ śikhāyāḥ dvisvabhāvatvaṃ 
jyeṣṭhāsvabhāvatvaṃ ca | yathā loke ekasyaiva daṇḍasya 
ghaṭotpādakaśaktimattvaṃ tannāśakaśaktimattvaṃ cāsti tathā'pi sa daṇḍaḥ 
kadācidutpādakaśaktipradhāno bhūtvā ghaṭa mutpādayati 
kadācinnāśaśaktipradhānaḥ taṃ nāśayati | evaṃ loke bahusthale dṛṣṭam | 
tathā daṇḍasthānīyā uktarekhā | sā yadā 
jagadrakṣaṇakartṛtvaviśiṣṭajyeṣṭhāśaktipradhānā tadā sarvonmādinī 
padavācyā | taduktaṃ uttaracatuśśatyām(-)

bindvāntarālavilasatsūkṣmarūpaśikhāmayī | 
jyeṣṭhāśaktipradhānā tu sarvonmādanakāriṇī || iti ||

ata eva tadaṅguligrathanavelāyāṃ aṅguṣṭhānāmatarjanyaḥ saralāḥ dṛśyante 
bindudvayākāraṃ madhyamādvayaṃ ca bhavati | tatrāpi 
niruktaśikhāsthānāpannagrathanavelāyāṃ anāmādvayameva jñeyam | 
madhyamādvayasya tadānīṃ bindudvayarūpatvena 
tanmadhyavartyanāmādvayasya tasya madhye vahniśikhā iti prasiddhasikhātvaṃ 
yuktam | ṣaṣṭhī tu idameva pūrvoktaṃ śikhādvayaṃ yadā vāmāpradhānaṃ 
tadā sarvamahāṅkuśā | 

<p. 153>

sūkṣmarūpeṇa paramaśivakukṣau sthitaṃ jagat | yathā antastho gajaḥ aṅkuśena 
bahirākṛṣyate tathā sarvasya bahirākarṣaṇāt sarvamahāṅkuśetyucyate | 
paraśivakukṣisthajagato vamanāt vāmā tatpradhānā śikhā sarvamahāṅkuśā 
ityucyate | tadapyuktaṃ yoginītantre(-)

vāmāśaktipradhānā tu mahāṅkuśamayī punaḥ | 
tadvad viśvaṃ vamantī sā dvitīye tu daśārake || iti ||

ata eva pūrvamudrāyāṃ saralayoranāmayoḥ vakratā dṛśyate | loke 
vamanavelāyāṃ mānavo dhanurākāraḥ vakro bhavati | prasiddhametat | atrāyaṃ 
vivekaḥ kevalavāmātvaṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīpadapravṛttinimittaṃ 
jyeṣṭhātvaviśiṣṭavāmātvaṃ sarvākarṣiṇīpadapravṛttinimittaṃ 
sūkṣmākāśāntarvṛttibindudvayatvaṃ sarvavaśyakarapadapravṛttinimittaṃ 
jyeṣṭhāśaktipradhānakabindudvayamadhyavṛttirekhātvaṃ 
sarvonmādinīpadaśakyatā'vacchedakaṃ vāmāśaktipradhānatvaṃ 
sarvamahāṅkuśāpadaśakyatā'vacchedakaṃ evaṃ rītyā vailakṣaṇyaṃ 
sūkṣmadhiyā draṣṭavyam | saptamī sarvakhecarī jīvānāṃ 
svakarmajanitarogādiduḥkhanāśanakṣamā śaktiḥ | ata eva sarvarogaharacakrasthā 
bhavati | tadapyuktaṃ yoginītantre(-)

dharmādharmasya saṅghaṭṭādutthitā vittirūpiṇī |
vikalpotthakriyāloparūpadoṣa(")(?)(")vighātinī |
vikalparūparogāṇāṃ hāriṇī khecarī matā || iti ||

asyārthaḥ dharmaḥ śaktiḥ paraśivavṛttitvāt | na vidyate dharmo yatreti adharmaḥ 
paraṃ brahma paraśivaḥ | yadvā na kasyāpi dharmaḥ adharma iti nañtatpuruṣa eva 
yuktaḥ paraśive śaktirūpadharmasattvena pūrvakalpe svoktavyāghātāt | tayoḥ 
saṃghaṭṭaḥ melanaṃ tena utthitā | yāvadvikalpaḥ tenotthitāḥ yāḥ kriyāḥ 
nityanaimittikāḥ tāsāṃ lopena yatpāpaṃ tatsambhavāḥ rogāḥ tannāśinī 
khecarīti | ata evaitādṛśaśivaśaktisāmarasyadyotakaṃ bāhyarūpe 
bāhudvayaparivartanam | aṣṭamī bījamudrā jagataḥ ṣaḍvikāreṣu prāthamiko yo 
bhāvavikāraḥ sūkṣmarūpeṇa sattā tadabhimāninī śaktiḥ | 
taduktamuttaracatuśśatyām(-)

śivaśaktisamāśleṣasphuradvyomāntare punaḥ |
prakāśayantī viśvaṃ sā sūkṣmarūpasthitaṃ sadā |
bījarūpā mahāmudrā(................) || iti ||

ayamarthaḥ vaṭabīje susūkṣme'pi kiñcidākāśo'sti vibhutvāt | tasmin yathā 
mahāvṛkṣaḥ sūkṣmarūpeṇa tiṣṭhati tathā ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni śivaśaktigarbhe 
vidyante sūkṣmarūpeṇa | saiva sattā ghaṭo'sti paṭo'sti ityatra anuvartate | sā 
bījamudretyarthaḥ | sarvabījasthānāpannatvāt sarvabījā | sūkṣmatvādeva 
aṅgulipragrathanavelāyāṃ saṃkṣobhiṇyādyapekṣayā alpayonitvaṃ 
sūkṣmatvajñāpakam | yā 

<p. 154>

navamī yonimudrā tadvṛttyasādhāraṇo dharmaḥ mudrātve sati kalārūpatvam | 
mudrātvasvarūpamuktaṃ prāk | kalāpadārthaścocyate | śaktiviśiṣṭe 
prakāśarūpe paraśive śaktimapahāya kevalasvarūpamātraniṣkarṣaṇe sati 
turīyabindupadavācyatvaṃ yathā jalaniṣṭhaṃ dravatvamapahāya 
svarūpamātraniṣkarṣaṇe jalapadavācyatvam | atrāpahānaṃ nāma 
śakyatā'vacchedakakoṭipraveśābhāva eva na tataḥ pṛthak niṣkāsanaṃ 
asambhavāt | tasya śuddhaśivasya śaktisambandhitvena vivakṣāyāṃ 
kāmabindupadavācyatā | tasyaiva saṃbandhasyābhedatvena 
śakyatā'vabchedakakoṭipraveśe visargo hakāraḥ vimarśaḥ iti 
tāntrikavyavahāraḥ | tādṛśasāmarasyottaraṃ raktaśuklabindumiśraṇena 
āvirbhūtānandāntarbhāveṇa vivakṣāyāṃ kaletyucyate | īdṛśakalārūpā (")ṭ. 
kalāpadaśakyatā'vacchedakakoṭau ānandasyādhikasya niveśa iti viśeṣaḥ 
ityadhikaḥ(-)ba(.") yonimudrā | taduktaṃ nityāhṛdaye(-)

saṃpūrṇasya prakāśasya lābhabhūmiriyaṃ punaḥ |
yonimudrā kalārūpā(....................) || iti ||

sarvavaśyakarī kevalabindudvayarūpā asyāḥ śarīre 
bindudvayasaṃsargāvirbhūtānando'pi śakyatā'vacchedakakoṭipraviṣṭa iti tato 
vailakṣaṇyaṃ jñeyam | daśamī trikhaṇḍā pūrvamuktā | evaṃ 
daśamudrāṇāṃ svarūpaṃ śrīgurukṛpāviśeṣeṇāvirbhūtasphūrtikaṃ 
yathāmati lokānāṃ sukhabodhārthaṃ spaṣṭīcakāra | evaṃ 
svarūpajñānaphalaṃ tantreṣu anantaṃ prapañcitaṃ vistarabhayānneha likhitam | 
evaṃ daśamudrāścaturasre tṛtīye pūjyāḥ | atrāpi icchayā prāptau niyāmakaṃ 
vacanaṃ tantre(-)

purassavye ca vaṃśe ca vāme caivāntarālake |
ūrdhvādho daśamudrāśca(..................) || iti ||

pūrvadakṣiṇapaścimottareṣvāgneyādyantarālacatuṣke cordhvamadhaśca daśa 
mudrāḥ pūjyā iti tadarthaḥ || 1 ||

prathamāvaraṇasamaṣṭipūjā

prathamāvaraṇasya vyaṣṭipūjāmuktvā samaṣṭipūjāmāha(-)

etāḥ prakaṭayoginyastrailokyamohanacakre samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ 
saśaktayaḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ sarvopacāraiḥ sampūjitāḥ santviti 
tāsāmeva samaṣṭyarcanaṃ kṛtvā || 2 ||

etāḥ aṇimā'ditrikhiṇḍā'ntāḥ | prakaṭayoginya iti tāsāmeva samaṣṭināma 
yathā caitro maitra ityādipratyekanāmavatāmapi manuṣya iti samaṣṭināma tadvat | 
uktayoginīṣu prakaṭatvaṃ ca śivādiṣaṭtriṃśattattvānāṃ madhye yā sthūlā 
pṛthivī tadrūpe bhūpure caturaśre vartamānatvāt | taduktaṃ nityāhṛdaye(-)

<p. 155>

tatra prakaṭayoginyaścakre trailokyamohane |
yoginyaḥ prakaṭā jñeyāḥ sthūlaviśvaprathātmani ||
sthitatvāt(...................................) || iti ||

trailokyamohanamiti yogarūḍhibhyāṃ (")yogarūḍhiśaktyā 
bhūsadanātmakacaturasrarekhātrayasya nāma (-) ba(.") caturasratrayātmakaṃ 
sarvabāhyaṃ yaccakraṃ tasya nāma | samudrāḥ iti pūrvaṃ vistareṇa daśa yāḥ 
pratipāditāḥ tāsvekaikā mudrā ekaikacakre'sti | daśamī trikhaṇḍā 
sarvavyāpikā | asminnarthe pramāṇaṃ yoginītantre'sti | śrībhagavān 
paraśurāmo'pi tattaccakrapūjāyāṃ ekaikamudrāpradarśanaṃ vakṣyati 
(")adhastanāvaraṇārcaneṣu ityarthaḥ |(") | evaṃ ca yasmin yā mudrā'sti tayā sahitā 
ityarthaḥ | sasiddhaya iti atra siddhirnāma tattacchaktisādhyaṃ phalam | tacca 
svākāreṇa sūkṣmarūpeṇa tiṣṭhatyeveti śaktayo'pi sasiddhayaḥ | sāyudhā iti 
spaṣṭam | saśaktayaḥ atra śaktipadena aṇimā'diniṣṭhā yā tattatkāryajanakatā 
tadavacchedako yo dharmaḥ sa grāhyaḥ | na hi kāraṇatā niravacchinnā loke 
prasiddhā | ataḥ svaniṣṭhakāraṇatāyām avacchedakaṃ kiṃcidabhyupagantavyam 
| abhyupagataṃ ca yadrūpaṃ tat adhiṣṭhānādanyannavetyanyadetat | 
tādṛśaśaktyā sahitāḥ | savāhanāḥ iti spaṣṭam | parivārā anucarāḥ taiḥ 
sahitāḥ | śeṣo mantrārthaḥ spaṣṭaḥ | tāsāmaṇimā'ditrikhaṇḍā'ntānāṃ 
samaṣṭhyarcanaṃ samudāyanāmaghaṭitamantreṇārcanaṃ vidhāya | atra 
mantragataliṅgena prārthanāṅgatvaṃ pratīyate loṭśravaṇāt prārthaneṣu liṅ 
loṭa ca iti pāṇinismṛteḥ | tathā'pi mamāgne varcovihaveṣvastu(0) iti mantrasya 
vihavyā upadadhāti iti śrutyā liṅgaṃ bādhitvā upadhānāṅgatvavat 
arcanāṅgatvaṃ bodhyam | sampūjitāḥ santu iti samaṣṭhyarcanaṃ kṛtvā ityanena 
arcanāṅgatve pratīyamāne durbalaṃ loṭśravaṇaṃ na bādhakaṃ bhavati || 2 ||

karaśuddhimuccārya tripurācakreśvarīmavamṛśya drāmiti 
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīmudrāṃ pradarśayet | cakrayoginīcakreśīnāṃ nāmāni 
bhinnāni | śiṣṭaṃ samānam || 3 ||

atra karaśuddhipadena karaśuddhinyāsāṅgabhūto mantraḥ nyāsaprakaraṇoktaḥ 
(")ayaṃ karaśuddhinyāsamaṃtraḥ pāścātya-3-khaṇḍe śrīkramastha-15 sūtre 
tadbhaṣaye 102 patre'sti |(") tam uccārya | tripureti trailokyamohanacakrasya nāyikā | 
tripurā cāsau cakreśvarī ceti karmadhārayaḥ | tripuretyatra puṃvadbhrāvābhāva 
ārṣaḥ | īdṛśīṃ cakreśvarīm avamṛśya sampūjya | atrāpi pūjārūpatvāt 
śrīpāduketi mantraśeṣo'sti | paraṃ tu samaṣṭyarcane śrīpādukāmiti 
mantraśeṣo nāsti iti samaṣṭyarcanaṃ vidhāya ityatra iti śabdena 
śeṣavyavacchedāt | drāṃ iti sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīmudrābījaṃ tāṃ paṭhitvā 

<p. 156>

savaṃsaṃkṣobhiṇīmudrām aṅgulipragrathanarūpāṃ vakṣyamāṇarītyā 
pradarśayet | devyā iti śeṣaḥ | evaṃ vakṣyamāṇarītyā devyagrabhāge aṅguliṣu 
grathiteṣu tasyāḥ darśitaṃ bhavati | evamagrimeṣvavagantavyam | evaṃ prakṛte 
samaṣṭhyarcanamantraṃ prakṛtackreśyāśca mantramuktvā 
agrimasamaṣṭyarcanamantre (")āgāmi pañcamasūtre |(") cakreśīmantre ca keṣāṃcit 
varṇānāṃ paryudāsapūrvakaṃ kāṃścidvarṇānatidiśati cakreti | 
cakranāmāni sarvāśāparipūraketyādīni (")adhastana-4 
sūtrāditattadāvaraṇadarśakasūtreṣu vakṣyamāṇāni |(") yoginīnāṃ nāmāni 
guptetyādīni cakreśīnāṃ tripuretyādīni yāni nāmāni tadvarṇābhinnāni | 
samudrāḥ (")anugata 154 patre-2-sūtre uktaṃ samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ ityādi |(") 
ityādivarṇakūṭaṃ samānam | anena tattatprakaraṇe uktacakrādināmasthāne 
vakṣyamāṇanāmāni paṭhanīyānīti bhāvaḥ || 3 ||

dvitīyāvaraṇapūjā

atha dvitīyāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

ṣoḍaśapatre kāmākarṣiṇī nityākaleti nityākalā'ntāḥ buddhyākarṣiṇī 
ahaṅkārākarṣiṇī śabdākarṣiṇī sparśākarṣiṇī rūpākarṣiṇīrasākarṣiṇī 
gandhākarṣiṇī cittākarṣiṇī dhairyākarṣiṇī smṛtyākarṣiṇī nāmākarṣiṇī 
bījākarṣiṇī ātmākarṣiṇī amṛtākarṣiṇī śarīrākarṣiṇī etā guptayoginyaḥ 
sarvāśāparipūrake cakre samudrāḥ ityādi pūrvavat ātmarakṣāmuccārya 
tripureśīmiṣṭvā drīṃ iti sarvavidrāviṇīṃ (")dvi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15-8/6 viṣayo dṛśyaḥ |(") 
pradarśayet || 4 ||

nityākaleti varṇasamudāyaḥ ante yannāmnaḥ iti vyutpattyā 
buddhyākarṣiṇyādipañcadaśasvapi idaṃ viśeṣaṇamanuṣajya yojyam | sarvatra 
puṃvadbhāvo nā'sti prathamamantrapāṭhānurodhāt | śrīpāduketyādiśeṣaḥ 
pūrvavat | ṣoḍaśapatre kramastu vāmakeśvaratantre ṣoḍaśāre mahādevīṃ 
vāmāvartena pūjayet iti | tatrāpyārambhaḥ kasmāddalādārabhya kartavya iti 
viśeṣajijñāsāyāṃ devyagrakoṇamārabhyeti setubandhe sthitam | 
yoginīcakrayoḥ prakṛtamantrapraveśārthaṃ nāmanī āha etāḥ guptayoginya iti 
bhūpurāpekṣayā ṣoḍaśadalasya antaḥsthatvena tatrasthā yoginyaḥ guptāḥ | 
śiṣṭaṃ samānam iti pūrvasūtreṇaiva prāptamartham anuvadati samudrāḥ 
ityanena | anuvādaphalaṃ ca tadarthakānāṃ

