atra dikpadamaṣṭasaṅkhyālakṣakaṃ dikṣu aṣṭasaṅkhyāyāḥ sattvāt | tathā ca 
digvṛttisaṅkhyāni patrāṇi yasminniti vyutpattyā tṛtīyacakraparam | 
dikṣvaṣṭasaṅkhyā ca avāntaradiśo gṛhītvā catasro 
diśaścatasro'vāntaradiśāḥ iti śruteḥ | avāntaradikṣvapi adhikaṃ tu praviṣṭaṃ 
na taddhāniḥ iti nyāyena diktvamabādhitam | anaṅga iti pūrvaṃ yāsāṃ 
kusumādīnāṃ devatānāṃ nāmādau tāḥ devatā anaṅgapūrvāḥ | 
atrānyapadārtho dravyaḥ na kusumādivarṇasamudāyaḥ 
saṃmṛśyetyasyānanvayāpatteḥ | etaddevatāpūjākramaśca yoginītantre(-)

anaṅgakusumāṃ pūrve dakṣiṇe'naṅgamekhalām |
paścime'naṅgamadanāmuttare madanāturām ||
anaṅgarekhāmāgneye nair(-)ṛte'naṅgaveginīm |
anaṅgāṅkuśāṃ vāyavye īśāne'naṅgamālinīm || iti ||

pūrvacakradevatā'ntaraṅgatvāt āsāṃ guptataratvam | śeṣaṃ gataprāyam || 5 ||

caturthāvaraṇapūjā

caturthāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

bhuvanāre saṃkṣobhiṇīdrāviṇyākarṣiṇyāhlādinīsaṃmohinīstambhinī 
jṛmbhiṇīvaśaṅkarīrañjanyunmādinyarthasādhinī sampattipūraṇī 
mantrayīdvandvakṣayaṅkarīḥ (")atra(-)dīrghekārāntāḥ saṃkṣobhiṇītyato 
dvandvadvaddakṣayaṅkaryantāḥ-14-devatāḥ |(") sarvādīravamṛśyaitāḥ 
sampradāyayoginyaḥ sarvasaubhāgyadāyakacakre 

<p. 158>

samudrāḥ ityādi mantraśeṣaḥ cakrāsanamuccārya (")anugate 103 patre-3-
śrīkrame 18-sūtrabhāṣye'yaṃ cakrāsanamantro'sti |(") tripuravāsinīṃ 
cakreśvarīmiṣṭvā blūṃ iti sarvavaśaṅkarīmudrāmudghāṭayet (")dvi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15-
8/8 vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") || 6 ||

bhuvanāre caturdaśāre | bhuvanāni caturdaśa (")bhavanasaṅkhyāḥ ārā yatra tatra(-)
manvasre(-)ityarthaḥ |(") | śeṣaṃ dikpatravat (")uparitana-28-sūtravadityarthaḥ |(") | sarva 
ādiryannāmāvayavānāmityapi vyākhyātaprāyaṃ anaṅgapūrvāḥ ityanena | 
kramākāṅkṣāyāṃ yoginītantre vāmāvartakrameṇaiva paścimādeva 
dakṣiṇam iti paścime prārambhaḥ tatastato dakṣiṇaṃ grāhyamiti tadarthaḥ | 
paścimādārabhya aprādakṣiṇyeneti phalito'rthaḥ || 6 ||

pañcamāvaraṇapūjā

pañcamāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

bahirdaśāre 
siddhipradāsampatpradāpriyaṅkarīmaṅgalakāriṇīkāmapradāduḥkha 
vimocinīmṛtyupraśamanīvighnanivāriṇyaṅgasundarīsaubhāgyadāyinīḥ 
sarvapūrvāḥ sampūjyaitāḥ kulottīrṇayoginyaḥ sarvārthasādhakacakre (")cakre iti 
manu(-)śrī(.") manuśeṣamuktvā (")etatkhaṇḍe 154 patre-2-sūtre samudrāḥ(-)ityataḥ 
santvityantaṃ manuśeṣaṃ jñeyam |(") mantrāsanamuccārya (")anugate 103 patre-3-
khaṇḍe śrīkrame-18-sūtre cakrāsanamantro'sti |(") tripurā śrīcakreśvarīṃ 
pratyavamṛśya sa ityunmādinīmudrāṃ dadyāt || 7 ||

navacakreṣu daśāradvayamasti | tayormadhye yat bahirdaśāraṃ tatretyarthaḥ | 
śeṣaṃ vyākhyātaprāyam | atrāpi kramākāṅkṣāyāṃ pūrvacakravadeva 
kramaḥ | vāmakeśvaratantre tathaivetyanena pūrvacakrakramātideśāt || 7 || 

ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇapūjā 

ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

antardaśāre jñānaśaktyaiśvaryapradājñānamayīvyādhivināśinyādhāra(-)
svarūpāpāpaharā'nandamayīrakṣāsvarūpiṇīpsitaphalapradāḥ sarvopapadāḥ 

<p. 159>

yaṣṭavyā etāni garbhayoginyaḥ sarvarakṣākaracakre śiṣṭaṃ (")etatkhaṇḍe-154-
patre-2-sūtre samudrāḥ ityataḥ santvityantaṃ manuśeṣaṃ jñeyam |(") tadvat 
sādhyasiddhāsanamuccārya (")anugate-103-patre(-)śrīkramokte-18-sūtre ayaṃ 
sādhyasiddhāsanamantro'sti |(") tripuramālinī mānyā kromiti 
sarvamahāṅkuśāṃ (")dvi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15-7/6 vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") darśayet || 8 ||

sarvopapadāḥ sarvapūrvāḥ | mānyā pūjyā | kramastu pūrvavat 
(")vāmāvartenetyarthaḥ |(") pūrvoktena vidhānena iti yoginītantrāt | śeṣaṃ 
vyākhyātakalpam || 8 ||

saptamāvaraṇapūjā 

saptamāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

aṣṭāre vaśinyādyaṣṭakaṃ namaḥsthāne (")imā vaśinyādyaṣṭadevyaḥ 3 
khaṇḍe(-)śrīkrame-20-sūtre-104-patre santi |(") pūjāmantrasannāma etā 
rahasyayoginyaḥ sarvarogaharacakre śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭaṃ mūrtividyāmuccārya 
(")ayaṃ mūrtividyāmantraḥ 4 khaṇḍe-136-patre-2 sūtre'sti |(") tripurāsiddhā 
mārādhya śivabhṛgu(-)ṛddhiyukphreṃ iti khecarī deyā || 9 ||

yoginīnyāsaprakaraṇe ye vaśinyādīnāmaṣṭau mantrā uddhṛtāḥ teṣu 
namaḥpadasthāne pūjāmantrasya śrīpāduketi mantrasya sannāma ūhaḥ kāryaḥ 
| caturthīsahitanamaḥpadasthāne pūjāmantraḥ kārya ityarthaḥ anyathā 
caturthīśravaṇāpatteḥ (")caturthī pūrvaṃ śrūyamāṇā yā tasyāḥ 
bādhakābhāvena tacchravaṇaṃ syāt(-)a(.) śrī(.") ||

na ca namaḥpadanivṛttau tadyoganimittacaturthyapi nivartate nimittāpāye 
naimittikāpāyaḥ iti nyāyāt iti vācyam | na hi caturthīsattve namaḥpadaṃ nimittam 
kiṃ tu tadutpattau | tathā ca namaḥpadaṃ nimittīkṛtyotpannā yā caturthī tasyā 
nivartakaparyantaṃ sthitau bādhakābhāvāt ||

na ca caturthyutpatteḥ prāgeva namaḥpadaṃ nivartatām tathā 
satyutpādakābhāvāt na caturthī iti vācyam | nyāsamantrasya 
pūjāmantraprakṛtitve siddhe prakṛtito'tideśena caturthī namaḥ padasahitaprāptau 
namaḥpadaṃ yuktavinyāsenohena bādhitaṃ caturthī kena bādhyatām | śraute 
prakṛtito'gnipadasahitanirvāpamantrasya prāptau sūryayāge arthabādhāt 
agnipadamātrasya sūryapadena bādhaḥ na caturthyāḥ | tathā'trāpi | tasmāt 
caturthīsahitanamaḥpadabādhakaḥ pūjāmantraḥ | śeṣaṃ gataprāyam ||

<p. 160>

mūrtividyā mūrtikalpanamantraḥ āvāhanaprakaraṇe uktaḥ | śivo hakāraḥ 
bhṛguḥ sakāraḥ ṛddhiḥ khakāraḥ | atra pramāṇāni prāk (")atra prākvāma-103-
patre-3-khaṇḍe śrīkrame 18 sūtrabhāṣye iti jñeyam |(") darśitāni | tairyuktaḥ 
phremiti varṇaḥ hskhphreṃ iti | imamuccārya khecarīṃ darśayedityarthaḥ || 9 ||

āyudhapūjā 

āyudhapūjāmāha(-)

bāṇabījānyuccārya sarvajṛmbhaṇebhyo bāṇebhyo namaḥ dhaṃ thaṃ 
sarvasaṃmohanāya dhanuṣe āṃ hrīṃ sarvavaśīkaraṇāya pāśāya kroṃ 
sarvastambhanāyāṅkuśāya namaḥ iti mahātryasrabāhyacaturdikṣu 
bāṇādyāyudhapūjā || 10 ||

bāṇabījāni saṃkṣobhiṇyādipañcamudrābījāni kāmeśvarabāṇānāṃ 
(")taduktaṃ kulasāre(-)

saṃkṣobhiṇyādimudrāṇāṃ yāni bījāni pañca vai |
tāni sarvāṇi deveśi śarādau samprakīrtayet || iti ||

ityadhikaḥ(-)ba(.") bījāni | taduktaṃ mālinītantre(-)

thāntadvayaṃ samālikhya vahnisaṃsthaṃ krameṇa tu |
mukhavṛttena netreṇa bindunā paribhūṣitam ||
bāṇadvayamidaṃ proktaṃ mādanaṃ bhūmisaṃsthitam ||
caturthasvarabindvāḍhyaṃ nādarūpaṃ varānane |
phāntaṃ cakreṇa (")śakreṇa(-)śrī(.") saṃyuktaṃ vāmakarṇavibhūṣitam ||
bindunādasamāyuktaṃ sargavān candramāḥ priye ||
pañca bāṇānimān viddhi māmakān prāṇavallabhe || iti ||

asyārthaḥ thāntaḥ mātṛkākrame thakārāgrimo dakāraḥ tasya dvayaṃ likhitvā 
tayormadhye prathamadakāraṃ vahninā repheṇa saṃsthaṃ yuktaṃ 
mukhavṛttamākāraḥ mātṛkānyāse tasya tatsthānatvāt | binduśca tābhyāṃ 
sahitaḥ | drāmiti sampannam | dvitīyadakāre'pi vahnisaṃsthatvaṃ tallagnaṃ 
tadanantaraṃ netreṇa vāmanetreṇa īkāreṇa mātṛkānyāse tatsthānatvāt 
bindunā ca samanvitaṃ drīmiti sampannam | evaṃ sampannabījadvayaṃ 
bāṇadvayaṃ bhavati | ādyabāṇadvayabījaṃ bhavati | evaṃ mādanaṃ kakāraḥ 
bhūmiḥ lakāraḥ tasmin saṃsthitaṃ adho lakāraḥ upari kakāraḥ iti bhāvaḥ 
caturthasvaraḥ īkāraḥ binduḥ prasiddhaḥ tābhyām āḍhyaṃ yuktam klīmiti 
sampannam | phāntaṃ bakāraḥ 

<p. 161>

vyutpattiḥ thāntavat cakreṇa lakāreṇa yuktaṃ vāmakarṇa ūkāraḥ tena bindunā 
ca yuktaṃ vlūmiti sampannam | sargo visargaḥ tadvān candramāḥ sakāraḥ saḥ iti | 
evaṃ ca drāṃ drīṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ iti pañca māmakān bāṇān 
viddhītyarthaḥ | kāmeśvarībāṇabījāni yoginītantre(-)

tvagasṛṅmāṃsamedo'sthimajjārṇāntāḥ sureśvari |
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktā ete bāṇāstadīyakāḥ || iti ||

asyārthaḥ tvak yakāraḥ tvagvālī vyāpako vāyuḥ iti kośāt | asṛgrephaḥ ro 
raktaḥ krodhinī rephaḥ iti kośāt | māṃsaṃ lakāraḥ pinākī māṃsasaṃjñikaḥ 
iti kośāt | medo vakāraḥ vo medo varuṇaḥ sūkṣmaḥ iti kośāt | asthimajjānte 
caramadeśe sthitaṃ śukraṃ tadvarṇaḥ sakāraḥ daśapādo bhṛguḥ śukram iti 
kośāt | yadvā asthimajjārṇau saṣau śaṅkukarṇāsthisaṃjñaśca śakāro 
vidbhirīritaḥ iti tathā vṛṣaḥ śveteśvaraḥ pīto majjā iti ṣakārādhikāre ca 
kośāt | tayorante vartamānaḥ sa ityarthaḥ | uktāḥ varṇāḥ 
dvitīyasvarasaṃyuktāḥ ākāreṇa yuktāḥ bījarūpatvāt binduyogo'pi | itthaṃ ca 
yāṃ rāṃ lāṃ vāṃ sāṃ iti devyā bāṇabījāni | uktavarṇeṣu 
binduyogastantrāntare śarve'ntasthāstṛtīyoṣmābindvanantasamanvitāḥ | 
yaralavāḥ antasthāḥ tṛtīyoṣmā sakāraḥ anantaḥ ākāraḥ | atra bāṇabījapadena 
sarveṣāṃ grahaṇam setubandhe yāṃ rāṃ lāṃ vāṃ sāṃ 
sarvajṛmbhaṇebhyaḥ kāmeśvarībāṇebhyo namaḥ drāṃ drīṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ 
sarvajṛmbhaṇebhyaḥ kāmeśvarabāṇebhyo namaḥ iti mantradvayaṃ likhitvā agre 
idaṃ ca kalpasūtrānuguṇyenoktam iti likhitvā vastutastu svatantrānusāreṇa ādau 
dvitārī tato (")uparitanāni(-)yāṃ(-)ityādīni-5-drāṃ(-)ityādīni ca-5-iti-10 
bāṇabījānītyarthaḥ |(") daśabāṇabījānyuccārya 
sarvajṛmbhaṇabāṇaśaktiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti lekhāt ||

nibandhe tu kāmeśvarabāṇabījamātraṃ likhitvā sarvajṛmbhaṇebhyo bāṇebhyo 
namaḥ iti mantrasvarūpaṃ likhitam | tatra bāṇabījatvasyobhayasādhāraṇatvena 
bāṇabījānyuccāryetyanena śivabāṇānāmevoccāraṇaṃ na devyāḥ iti 
bhagavato rāmasyābhiprāyaniṣkāsane pramāṇagandhasyāpyabhāvāt pratyuta 
sthūlamānena vicāryamāṇe lalitopāsteḥ upakrāntatvāt tadīyabāṇapūjanameva 
yuktam | tānapahāya kevalaśivabāṇāneva lilekha | tadīyaṃ sāhasaṃ mahattaram 
||

na ca tathā sati uttaramantreṣu dhanuṣe 
pāśāyāṅkuśāyetyekavacanamanupapannam iti vācyam 
pāśādhikaraṇanyāyenopapattisambhavāt | yadvā bījadaśakamuccārya 
sarvajṛmbhaṇebhyo bāṇebhyo namaḥ iti dvayoḥ tantreṇaiva pūjanam | 
devatātvaṃ cāgnīṣomavadvyāsaktam | itthameva pāśādiṣu | evaṃ ca 
āśāsānāmedhapataye medham itivat dhanurdvayaniṣṭhadevatātvasya 
vyāsaktatvāt devatātvāvacchinnasyaikatvāt 

<p. 162>

tadabhiprāyeṇaikavacanopapattiḥ | bāṇapadottaraṃ bahuvacanaṃ ca 
devatātvādhiṣṭhānānvayīti medhapatibhyāṃ medhaṃ itivat na 
kā'pyanupapattiḥ ||

na ca nibandhakāraḥ śivabāṇabījānyullikhan babhrāmetyāstām | paraṃ tu 
lalitāprakaraṇasthatvāt śaktibāṇabījānāmevātra grahaṇam 
bāṇabījānyuccārya iti kalpasūtreṇāviśeṣeṇa śrutasyāpi prakaraṇena 
saṅkocasya āgneyyā'gnīdhramupatiṣṭhate ityādau dṛṣṭatvāt iti vācyam 

kāmabāṇān maheśāni dhanustatpāśameva ca |
cakramadhye catuḥkoṇe krameṇa paripūjayet ||

iti vāmakeśvaratantravacanena teṣāṃ śivāyudhānāmapi lalitāprakaraṇe 
pūjanaṃ vihitam prakṛte kalpasūtre bāṇabījānyuccāryeti aviśeṣeṇa śrutasya 
prakaraṇena saṅkoce kartavye tato'pi balavatā vākyāntareṇa 
śrūyamāṇārthasyaiva vyavasthāpanāt | āgneyyā'gnīdhramupatiṣṭhate ityatra 
prakaraṇabādhakaṃ vacanāntaraṃ nāstīti vaiṣamyam ||

na ca tantrāntarāśrayaṇaṃ na kriyata iti pratijñāhāniḥ sūtrārthanirṇayāya 
vacanāntarānusaraṇe pratijñāyāmanupapattyabhāvāt ||

kiṃ ca bahuṣu pustakeṣu kalpasūtrapāṭhaḥ dhaṃ thaṃ sarvasaṃmohanāya 
dhanuṣe namaḥ āṃ hrīṃ sarvavaśīkaraṇāya pāśāya namaḥ iti ayamapi 
bāṇadvayagrahaṇe liṅgam | anyathā dhanurbāṇayorubhayasambandhinoḥ 
grahaṇasūcakaṃ bījadvayaṃ kimiti paṭhet | dṛśyate ca bahuṣu pustakeṣvayameva 
pāṭhaḥ | tasmādubhayapūjanamāvaśyakam | yadi ca keṣucit pustakeṣu 
bījadvayapāṭhasyādarśanāt niśśaṅkaṃ paramatasiddhiriti vibhāvyate tadā'pi 
sarvapustakeṣvavivādena dhaṃ iti dhanurmantre śivadhanurbījamasti 
turīyamaruṇāvargāt dvitīyamapi pārvati | puṃstrīkodaṇḍayugalam iti 
vāmakeśvaratantrāt | asyārthaḥ aruṇāvargastavargaḥ tatra turīyo dhakāraḥ 
dvitīyaḥ thakāraḥ krameṇa puṃstrīdhanuṣī ityarthaḥ | anena dhaṃ iti 
śivadhanurbījaṃ siddham | evaṃ pāśe hrīṃ ityavivādena sarvapustakeṣvasti | 
tacca śaktipāśabījaṃ māyā strīpāśa ucyate iti yoginītantravacanāt | evaṃ 
kvacit pumāyudhabījakathanaṃ kvacit stryāyudhabījakathanaṃ pragrathanarūpam 
āyudhadvayagrahaṇe sarvapustakasādhāraṇaṃ liṅgam | tantrāntaravacanaṃ ca 
spaṣṭarūpaṃ likhitaṃ prāk | ekavacanagatiḥ darśitā ato 
virodhābhāvādāyudhadvayamatra pūjyamiti mamāsaṃśayaṃ pratibhāti | 
dharmasyātīndriyatvāt sādhavaḥ sudhiyaḥ pariśīlayantu ito'pyadhikam | itthaṃ 
ca yasmin pustake dhanurmantre kevalaṃ dhaṃ ityasti tat thaṃ 
ityasyāpyupalakṣakaṃ tṛtīyamantre hrīmiti āmityasyāpyupalakṣakaṃ tasya 
śivapāśarūpatvāt ādyantago mahāpāśaḥ pauruṣeyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ iti 
vāmakeśvaratantrāt |

<p. 163>

etadartho'pi prāk nīlapatākāmantroddhāre varṇitaḥ | aṅkuśabījaṃ tu 
ubhayorekaṃ kāmo'gnirvyāpakoṅkuśaḥ ityaviśeṣeṇa yoginītantrapāṭhāt | 
tasya tantreṇa sakṛdeva pāṭhaḥ | itthaṃ ca mantrasvarūpaṃ yāṃ rāṃ lāṃ 
vāṃ sāṃ drāṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ sarvajṛmbhaṇebhyo bāṇebhyo namaḥ 
bāṇaśrīpādukāṃ (")bāṇaśaktiśrī(-)śrī(.") pūjayāmi | thaṃ dhaṃ 
sarvasaṃmohanāya dhanuṣe namaḥ dhanuḥśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi | hrīṃ āṃ 
sarvavaśīkaraṇāya pāśāya namaḥ pāśaśrī(0) | kroṃ 
sarvastambhanāyāṅkuśāya namaḥ aṅkuśaśrī(0) iti | śaktibījānāṃ prāthamye 
tatprādhānyaṃ gamakam ||

kecittu tantrānuyāyinaḥ daśabījānyuccārya kāmeśvarakāmeśvarībāṇebhyo 
namaḥ iti paṭhanti | tadatīvāśuddham | kāmeśvarī ca kāmeśvaraśceti 
dvandvāpavādakatvāt pumān striyā ityekaśeṣaḥ syāt na dvandvaḥ ||

mahātryasram ādyatrikoṇaṃ tasya bāhyataḥ aṣṭāsratryasramadhye dikṣu 
paścimādiprādakṣiṇyena | taduktaṃ vāmakeśvaratantre(-)

paścimottarapūrvāśā dakṣiṇāśā krameṇa tu | iti |

atra nibandhe āyudhamantreṣu śrīpādukāmiti śeṣayojanābhāve mūlaṃ sa eva 
praṣṭavyaḥ ||

na ca aṣṭākṣarīprāpakaṃ sarvatra devatānāmasu śrīpūrvakaṃ 
pādukāmityādivākyaṃ tatra devatānāmasvityanena yatra devatāyā nāma 
gṛhyate tatraivāṣṭākṣarī (")ādau tattaddevatānāma saṃgṛhya(-)śrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi(-)ayamevāṣṭākṣarīmantra uktaḥ prāgapi |(")  nānyatra | prakṛte 
vidhāyakavākye bāṇādirūpanāmagrahaṇābhāvāt na tathā iti vācyam | 
devatānāmasvityasya devatānāmaghaṭitamantreṣviti nibandhakāreṇāpyavaśyaṃ 
vācyam | anyathā oghatraye tadyogaḥ tattvato virudhyate | tatra vidhivākye 
devatānāmagrahaṇaṃ nāsti kiṃ tvoghatrayamevāsti | tasmānna kiṃcidetat || 10 ||

aṣṭamāvaraṇapūjā

aṣṭamāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

trikoṇe vākkāmaśaktisamastapūrvāḥ 
kāmeśvarīvajreśvarībhagamālinīmahādevyaḥ bindau caturthī || 11 ||

yā paraśivarūpadīpasya prakāśarūpā parā śaktiḥ sā sṛṣṭyunmukhā tridhā 
jātā vāmā jyeṣṭhā raudrī ceti | kramāt rajassattvatamaḥpradhānāḥ tāḥ | 
tāsāṃ samaṣṭivācakaṃ padaṃ tantraśāstre ambiketi | imā eva kramāt 
icchājñānakriyāśaktayaḥ ityucyante | amūṣāṃ tripurasundarīvyaṣṭirūpatvaṃ 

<p. 164>

jñāpayitumeva yoginīṣu atirahasyeti viśeṣaṇaṃ agre dattavān | atra 
vāgbhavapadena (")atra(-)mūle(-)vāk(-)ityeva padaṃ(-)tatotra(-)vākpadeneti sambhāvyatām 
|(") prathamakūṭaṃ grāhyam kāmapadena dvitīyakūṭaṃ śaktipadena 
tṛtīyakūṭaṃ na tu bālāvarṇāḥ vāmakeśvaratantre kūṭānāmeva 
parigṛhītatvāt | yadyapi tantrāntare vāgbhavaṃ cādyakūṭaṃ ca iti samuccayo'pi 
dvayordṛśyate tathā'pi atra vāgādīnāmevoktatvāt yoginītantrānusāreṇa 
kūṭamātragrahaṇam | samastaṃ kūṭatrayam | imāni pūrvaṃ yāsāṃ 
nāmnāṃ tāḥ catasraḥ trikoṇe trikoṇakoṇatraye bindau ca pūjyā ityarthaḥ ||

nibandhakāraḥ caturthadevatāyā mantre samaṣṭimūlāntaraṃ lalitāśrī(0) iti 
lilekha | tattuccham | kāmeśvarī vajreśvarī bhagamālinī mahādevyaḥ iti sūtre 
krameṇa catasṛṇāṃ devatānāṃ nāmasu satsu śāstraprasiddhaṃ parityajya 
svakapolakalpitaṃ laliteti nāma mantre praveśayāmāsa | atra śāstraṃ na 
pramāṇam | acintyaśaktimantreṣvapi svecchāpravṛttiśīlo yaḥ tadvacanaṃ 
mahānto'pi viśvasanti | atra mūlaṃ śrībhagavanmāyāsamutpannālasyameva 
nānyat | na ca mahādevīparyāya eva lalitāśabdaḥ tatprayoge kiṃ bādhakam iti 
vācyam | agnimīle iti mantre vahnimīle ityapi prayogenāpūrvaṃ syāt | 
ityalamasadāveśena ||

kramastu vāmakeśvaratantre(-)

kāmeśvarīmagrakoṇe vajreśīṃ dakṣiṇe tataḥ |
bhagamālinīṃ tathā vāme madhye tripurasundarīm || iti || 11 ||

kāmeśvaryādīnāṃ mūladevyabhinnatvam

nanu pañcadaśanityānāṃ mantreṇa mūlavidyayā cābhyarcya iti vihitaṃ 
prakṛte'pi turīyadevatāyāḥ mūlena pūjanamuktaṃ binducakre'pi vakṣyati 
mūlena pūjanam evaṃ caramacakreśvaryā api | evaṃ ca ekamantrakaraṇakatvāt 
ekadevatākaṃ yāgatrayaṃ abhyāsarūpaṃ vā bhinnadevatākaṃ vā iti 
śaṅkāyāṃ devataikyaṃ pratipādayati(-)

tisṛṇāmāsāmanantaramabhedāya mūladevyāḥ pūjā | 
kāmeśvaryādicaturthīnityānāṃ ṣoḍaśī cakradevīnāṃ navamī 
binducakrasthā cetyekaiva | na tatra mantradevatābhedaḥ kāryaḥ | tanmahādevyā 
eva | caturṣu sthaleṣu viśeṣārcanamāvartate || 12 ||

<p. 165>

āsāṃ kāmeśvaryādīnāṃ tisṛṇāmanantaram āsāṃ 
mūladevyabhinnatvapratipādanāya mūladevyāḥ pūjā | evaṃ sthalāntare'pi 
tripurasundaryā ante pūjanaṃ tatra tatra svasvapūrvadevatākūṭābhedaṃ 
jñāpayati | imamevārthaṃ spaṣṭaṃ darśayati kāmeśvarīti | prakṛtacakre 
kāmeśvaryādibhyaḥ paraṃ caturthī pañcadaśanityābhyaḥ paraṃ ṣoḍaśī 
aṣṭacakrāt paraṃ navame bindau saiva cakārasūcitā punarbindāveva 
aṣṭacakreśīpūjā'nantaraṃ cakreśītvena pūjyā ekaiva | tatra eṣu sthaleṣu 
devatābhedaḥ mantrabhedaśca nāsti | itthaṃ ca nityāḥ samastāvaraṇadevyaśca 
tripurasundaryā avyatiriktā iti jñāpayituṃ tattadante uktamiti bhāvaḥ | nanu 
devataikye dravyaikye mantraikye sakṛdeva pūjanaṃ yuktaṃ kimiti pūjātrayaṃ ata 
āha caturṣu sthaleṣu viśeṣārcanamāvartate iti | darśitacatuḥsthaleṣvityarthaḥ | 
tathā ca yāgaikye'pi tadabhyāsasyāpūrvasādhanatvenāvaśyakatvāditi bhāvaḥ 
| na cābhyāse sati yathā prokṣaṇamantro nāvartate tathā mantrāvṛttirna syāt iti 
vācyam kriyā'ntaravyavadhāne abhyāse'pi mantrāvṛtteḥ agnihotrādau 
dṛṣṭatvāt | tathā'trāpi kriyā'bhyāsarūpatve'pi 
svavijātīyakriyā'ntaravyavadhānādyuktā mantrāvṛttiḥ || 12 ||

prāsaṅgikamuktvā prakṛtamāha(-)

etā atirahasyayoginyaḥ sarvasiddhiprade cakre | pariśiṣṭaṃ draṣṭavyam | 
āvāhanīmuccārya (")patre-4-khaḍe-3 sūtre tadbhāṣye ca eṣā āvāhanī vidyāsti(-)
tato grāhyā(-)athavā(-)ddi(.) pa(.) 15/3 vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") tripurāmbāṃ sambhāvya hsaum(-)iti 
bījamudrākṛtiḥ || 13 ||

pariśiṣṭamityanantaraṃ pūrvavat iti śeṣaḥ | āvāhanī tatprakaraṇoddhṛtā vidyā 
| sambhāvya pūjayitvā | kṛtiḥ kartavyetyarthaḥ || 13 ||

navamāvaraṇapūjā

navamāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

binducakre mūlena devīmiṣṭvā eṣā parāpararahasyayoginī sarvānandamaye 
cakre samudrā sasiddhiḥ sāyudhā saśaktiḥ savāhanā saparivārā sarvopacāraiḥ 
saṃpūjitā'stviti punarmūlamuccārya mahācakreśvarīmiṣṭvā vāgbhavena 
yoniṃ (")ime dve mudrepi(-)ddi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15-8/15-2 15-8/2 viṣayayordṛśye |(") pradarśya || 
14 ||

<p. 166>

atrāpi nibandhakāraḥ mūlānte śrīlalitāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi iti 
yojayāmāsa | tadaśuddham | etatpūrvasūtre na tatra mantradevatābhedaḥ kāryaḥ 
tanmahādevyā eva caturṣu sthaleṣu iti vākye sthalacatuṣṭaye'pi mahādevyāḥ 
pūjanam iti kaṇṭharaveṇoktam | śrutyā śrutaśabdaṃ parityajya aśrutaśabdasya 
kalpanaṃ aśāstrīyam | anyathā sauryaṃ caruṃ nirvapedbrahmavarcasakāmaḥ 
ityasmin yāge sūryaparyāyaśabdaṃ prakṣipya divākarāya juṣṭaṃ nirvapāmi iti 
syāt | na ca tatra sūryaśabdaḥ utpattivākye śrutaḥ iha tu pūrvasūtraṃ 
notpattivākyaṃ kiṃ tu abhyāsarūpaguṇavidhāyakamiti vaiṣamyam iti vācyam | 
nāyamaikāntiko niyamaḥ utpattivākya eva śravaṇamapekṣitamiti | 
nakṣatreṣṭyupahomotpattivākyaṃ śo'tra juhoti ityetāvanmātram | nātra 
devatāvācakaḥ śabdaḥ śrūyate | tathā'pi mantre(-) agnaye svāhā kṛttikābhyaḥ 
svāhā ityatra śrūyamāṇo yo'gnyādiśabdaḥ taṃ gṛhītvā 
prathamamanvādhāne'gnimājyena iti vyavaharanti na tu vahnimājyeneti | 
yadyutpattivākya eveti niyamaḥ tarhyatra svecchayā syāt | na ca asya kramasya 
utpattivākye śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ lalitāyāḥ kramamārabheta ityāsmin 
lalitāśabdasya śrutatvāt tadgrahaṇam iti nibandhābhiprāyaḥ varṇituṃ śakyaḥ | 
tathā sati pūrvasūtre lalitāyā eva caturṣu sthaleṣu iti vaktavye tamapahāya 
mahādevyā eveti kathanasya phalaṃ brahmaṇā'pi vaktuṃ aśakyam | manmate tu 
lalitāmahādevīśabdayoḥ ekārthakatve'pi yatra viśeṣo na śrutaḥ tatra 
lalitāśabdaprayogaḥ yatra śrutaḥ tatra śrutaśabdoccāraṇaṃ apūrvajanakamiti 
jñātvā lalitāśabdaparityāga iti | phalaṃ saṅkalpādau śrīlalitāprītaye iti 
vaktavyam | prakṛte mahādevī śabdasya niravakāśasya prayoga ucitaḥ | ata 
evānayā diśā navamyāḥ cakreśvaryāḥ mantre mahādevīprāptau 
viśeṣataścakreśīmiṣṭveti tatra śrutatvāt mahādevīśabdabādhaḥ 
sāvakāśaniravakāśayoḥ niravakāśaṃ balīyaḥ iti nyāyāt | na ca evaṃ sati 
caturṣu mantrābhedaḥ pradarśitaḥ idānīṃ triṣu mahādevīghaṭito mantraḥ ekatra 
mahācakreśvarīghaṭita iti mantrabhedaḥ patitaḥ kathametat iti vācyam 
nibandhakāreṇāpi lalitāmahācakreśvarīśrī(0) iti likhitatvena asya doṣasya 
ubhayasādhāraṇatvenācodyatvāt | pratyuta nibandhakāramantrasya 
lalitāpadaghaṭitatvena astyatyantavailakṣaṇyam | manmate devīsthāne 
cakreśvarīmātraprakṣepe ekadeśavikṛtamananyavat iti 
vaiyyākaraṇaparibhāṣāmāśritya nirvāho bhaviṣyatītyalamati vistareṇa ||

mahādevīśabdaniruktirdevībhāgavate(-)

bṛhadasya śarīraṃ yadaprameyaṃ pramāṇataḥ | 
dhāturmahati pūjāyāṃ mahādevī tataḥ smṛtā || iti ||

vāgbhavena aiṃ ityanena na prathamakūṭena pūrvāṣṭamudrābījeṣu 
varṇaikatvadarśanāt tatpaṅktisthasyāsyāpi tādṛśatvasyāvaśyakatvāt | ataḥ 
aiṃ ityasyaiva grahaṇaṃ yuktam || 14 ||

<p. 167>

dhūpādidānam

evaṃ navāvaraṇapūjāṃ vidhāya agre kartavyakriyāśeṣamāha(-)

pūrvavaddhūpadīpamudrātarpaṇanaivedyādi (")ddi(.) pari(.) 15 vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") dattvā || 
15 ||

dhūpādinaivedyānteṣu pūrvoktadharmāṇāṃ (")atra 
pūrvoktadharmāṇāmityanenaitatkramīyānugata-4-6-7-
sūtroktadharmāṇāmityartho jñeyaḥ ||(") prāptyarthaṃ pūrvavaditi | dhūpādiṣu 
ye pūrvoktadharmāḥ taddharmakāḥ te dhūpādayaḥ kāryā ityarthaḥ | te ca 
dharmāḥ dhūpadīpanaivedyeṣu pūrvamantrāḥ | mudrāsu pūrvavattvaṃ tarpaṇe 
mūlamantraḥ trirabhyāsaḥ ityevaṃrūpāḥ jñeyāḥ | ādipadena 
tāmbūlakarpūranīrājanādimaddravyaprajvalanaprabhṛtayo grāhyāḥ ||

nibandhakāraḥ ṣoḍaśyupāsakaḥ trikhaṇḍāmapi pradarśayet ityuvāca | saḥ 
babhrāma tathāvyavasthāyāḥ sūkte anuktatvāt ||

trikhaṇḍā'dimudrāṇāṃ svarūpam

atra saṃkṣobhiṇyādimudrāpradarśanārthaṃ 
(")etatsaṃkṣobhiṇyādiyonimudrāntasarvamudrāṇāmuddhāraḥ dvi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15-
viṣaye dṛśyaḥ |(") tatkathaṃbhāvajñānasyāvaśyakatvāt 
tanmudrādarśanaprakāraḥ sapramāṇaṃ saṃkṣepeṇa kathyate | tatrāvāhane 
prathamaṃ viniyuktā trikhaṇḍocyate | trikhaṇḍālakṣaṇamuktaṃ 
vāmakeśvaratantre(-)

parivartya karau spṛṣṭāvaṅguṣṭhau kārayet samau |
anāmā'ntargate kṛtvā tarjanyau kuṭilākṛtī ||
kaniṣṭhike niyuñjīta nijasthāne maheśvari |
trikhaṇḍeyaṃ samākhyātā tripurā'hvānakarmaṇi || iti ||

parivartanaṃ nāma hastadvayāṅgulimelanam | idaṃ sarvatrādhikārarūpaṃ 
sadanveti | aṅguṣṭhau saralau parasparaspṛṣṭau tathaiva kaniṣṭhe madhyame ca 
kuryāt | vāmānāmopari dakṣānāmāṃ tiryak prasārya tayoradhaḥpradeśāt 
tarjanīdvayamānīya kuṭilākārābhyāṃ tarjanībhyām anāmā'gradvayaṃ 
dhārayet | anāme antargate yathoriti vigraheṇa labdho'rthaḥ | asyā uktarītyā 
nirmāṇe khaṇḍatrayaṃ dṛśyate | upari saralāṅguṣṭhadvayayogaḥ | madhye 
tādṛśamadhyamāyogaḥ | adhaśca kaniṣṭhāyogastādṛśaḥ | evaṃ sati 
pūrvoktavāmājyeṣṭhāraudrīkalātrayarūpamasyāṃ sphuṭam | ata eva trayaḥ 
khaṇḍāḥ kalāḥ yasyām iti vigraheṇa trikhaṇḍeyam atra yadyapi 
khaṇḍadvayanirmāṇaprakāra uktaḥ | madhyamakhaṇḍaracanāprakāro noktaḥ | 
tathā'pi trikhaṇḍeti yogārthasampattaye tantrāntaraṃ śaraṇīkṛtya 
khaṇḍatrayaṃ sampādanīyam | khaṇḍatrayamuktaṃ jñānārṇave(-)

<p. 168>

pāṇidvayaṃ maheśāni parivartanayogataḥ |
yojayitvā tarjanībhyām anāme dhārayet priye ||
madhyame yojayenmadhye kaniṣṭhe tadadhastataḥ |
aṅguṣṭhāvapi saṃyojya tridhā yugmakrameṇa tu ||
trikhaṇḍā mama mudreyaṃ tripurā'hvānakarmaṇi || iti ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīsvarūpaṃ tatraiva(-)

madhyame madhyage kṛtvā kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭharodhite |
tarjanyau daṇḍavat kṛtvā madhyamoparyanāmike ||
eṣā tu prathamā mudrā sarvasaṃkṣobhakāriṇī || iti ||

tantrarāje tu(-)

kaniṣṭhā'nāmikāmadhyāḥ nakhairanyonyasaṅgatāḥ |
kṛtvā'ṅguṣṭhau kaniṣṭhāsthāvṛjū kuryācca tarjanī ||
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī mudrā trailokyakṣobhakāriṇī || iti ||

sarvavidrāviṇī mudrā tatraiva(-)

etasyā eva mudrāyā madhyame sarale yadi |
kriyate cenmaheśāni sarvavidrāviṇī tadā || iti ||

madhyame madhyame'prītyarthaḥ | etena tarjanīmadhyamayoḥ dvayoḥ saralatvaṃ 
jñeyam ||

tṛtīyamudrā'pi tatraivoktā(-)

madhyamā tarjanīyugme vakrīkuryāt sulocane ||
etasyā eva mudrāyāstadākarṣaṇakāriṇī || iti ||

tatraiva caturthī mudrā sarvavaśaṅkaryuktā(-)

puṭākārau karau kṛtvā tarjanyāvaṅkuśākṛtī |
parivartya krameṇaiva madhyame tadadhogate ||
krameṇa devi tenaiva kaniṣṭhā'nāmike api |
saṃyojya nibiḍāḥ sarvāḥ aṅguṣṭhāvagradeśataḥ ||
mudreyaṃ parameśāni sarvavaśyakarī smṛtā || iti ||

asyārthaḥ puṭākārau parasparaṃ pṛṣṭhasaṃlagnau ūrdhvāgrāṅgulikau hastau 
kṛtvā tato'ṅguṣṭhavyatiriktāṅgulayaḥ parasparamaṅgulisandhiṣu praveśya 
tarjanyādikaniṣṭhā'ntā aṅgulayaḥ aṅkuśākārāḥ kuryāt | evaṃ kṛtvā 
tato'ṅguṣṭhadvayaṃ adhomukhaṃ tarjanyupari sthāpayet | iyaṃ sarvavaśaṅkarī 
iti bhāvaḥ ||

<p. 169>

pañcamyapi tatraiva(-)

saṃmukhau tu karau kṛtvā madhyamāmadhyage'nuje |
anāmike tu sarale tadbahistarjanīdvayam ||
daṇḍākārau tato'ṅguṣṭhau madhyamānakhadeśagau |
mudraiṣonmādinī nāma kledinī sarvayoṣitām || iti ||

ayamarthaḥ vāmakaniṣṭhopari dakṣakaniṣṭhāṃ tiryaganāmādvayoparimārgeṇa 
madhyamāparyantaṃ prasārya tādṛśakaniṣṭhā'gradvayaṃ madhyamādvayena 
dṛḍhaṃ gṛhṇīyāt | gṛhītamadhyamānakhopari daṇḍākāramaṅguṣṭhadvayaṃ 
sthāpayet | tathā'nāmādvayaṃ parasparābhimukhyena sarale kuryāt | 
anāmikayoḥ pārśvadvaye tarjanīdvayamapi saralaṃ kuryāt | eṣā sarvonmādinī 
mudrā yoṣidvaśyakarī iti ||

ṣaṣṭhī mudrā'pi sarvamahāṅkuśā tatraiva prakaṭitā(-)

asyāstvanāmikāyugmamadhaḥ kṛtvā'ṅkuśākṛti |
tarjanyāvapi tenaiva krameṇa viniyojayet ||
iyaṃ mahāṅkuśā mudrā sarvakāryārthasādhinī || iti ||

asyāḥ sarvonmādinyāḥ | tenaiva krameṇa anāmikākrameṇa | 
anāmikā'ṅkuśākārā | tathaiva tarjanīdvayamapi kartavyam | śeṣaṃ 
pūrvamudrāvat iti bhāvaḥ ||

saptamīṃ khecarīmudrāṃ tatraiva vyācacakṣe(-)

savyaṃ dakṣiṇahaste tu dakṣiṇaṃ savyahastataḥ |
bāhū kṛtvā maheśāni hastau samparivartya ca ||
kaniṣṭhā'nāmike devi yuktvā tena krameṇa tu |
tarjanībhyāṃ samākrānte sarvordhvamapi madhyame ||
aṅguṣṭhau tu maheśāni kārayet saralāvapi |
iyaṃ sā khecarī nāma mudrā sarvottamā priye ||

asya tātparyam bāhū saralau prathamaṃ kṛtvā dakṣabāhūpari vāmaṃ 
sthāpayitvā punarvāmaṃ hasta dakṣahastādhomārgeṇa vāmapārśve 
nirgamayya hastadvayāṅgulīḥ vakṣyamāṇarītyā grathnīyāt | tadyathā 
vāmānāmākaniṣṭhe dakṣamadhyamādhomārgeṇa dakṣatarjanyāṃ nītvā 
evaṃ dakṣānāmākaniṣṭhe vāmamadhyamā'dhomārgeṇa vāmatarjanyāṃ 
nītvā hastadvayatarjanībhyāṃ svasamīpāgatānāmākaniṣṭhe dṛḍhaṃ 
gṛhṇīyāt | madhyame sarvordhvaṃ sarale evāgrābhyāṃ parasparasaṃlagne 
sthāpayet | aṅguṣṭhau saralau kṛtvā yonisādṛśyaṃ sampādayet | iyaṃ 
khecarīmudrā | yadyapyuktārthaḥ sarvo'pi pūrvalikhitavacane nāsti tathā'pi(-)

<p. 170>

vāmaṃ bhujaṃ dakṣabhuje dakṣiṇaṃ vāmadeśataḥ |
niveśya yojayet paścāt parivartya krameṇa hi ||
kaniṣṭhā'nāmikāyugme tarjanībhyāṃ nirodhayet |
madhyame sarale kṛtvā yonivat saralau tataḥ ||
aṅguṣṭhau khecarīmudrā pārthivasthānayojitā ||

iti jñānārṇavavacanena saha ekavākyatāṃ sampādya niṣkāsito'rtho jñeyaḥ ||

aṣṭamīmudrā'pi tatraiva prakaṭitā(-)

parivartya karau spṛṣṭāvardhacandrākṛtī priye |
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayugalaṃ yugapat kārayet tataḥ ||
adhaḥkaniṣṭhā'vaṣṭabdhe madhyame viniyojayet |
tathaiva kuṭile yojye sarvādhastādanāmike ||
bījamudreyamacirāt sarvasiddhipravartinī || iti ||

asyārthaḥ anāmāmadhyamāmārgeṇa vyatyaste kaniṣṭhike svādhobhāge 
madhyamā yathā tiṣṭhati tathā kuryāt | tato madhyamādvayaṃ 
kaniṣṭādvayāvaṣṭambhakaṃ yathā tathā kuryāt | sarvādhaḥsthite anāme 
yāvatkuṭile bhavataḥ tāvat kuryāt | aṅguṣṭhatarjanīyugalaṃ ardhacandrākṛti 
yathā bhavati tathā yojayet | iyaṃ bījamudrā bhavati ||

navamīṃ yonimudrāṃ tatraiva viśinaṣṭi(-)

madhyame kuṭilākāratarjanyupari saṃsthite |
anāmikāmadhyagate tathaiva ca kaniṣṭhike ||
sarvā ekatra saṃyojya aṅguṣṭhaparipīḍitāḥ |
eṣā tu prathamā mudrā yonimudreti yā sthitā || iti ||

asyārthaḥ anāmike madhyamā'dhomārgeṇa kuṭilākāratarjanyupari vyatyaste 
sthāpayet | anāmikāpṛṣṭhalagne vyatyaste kaniṣṭhike saṃyojayet | 
aṅguṣṭhāgradvayaṃ madhyamāmadhyaparvadvaye yojayet | iyaṃ yonimudrā 
bhavati | yadyapi etāvānartho na labhyate tena vacanena tathā'pi(-)

anāmikāpṛṣṭhabhāge madhyamāmadhyaparvaṇi |
kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhasaṃśleṣānmahāyonistrikhaṇḍikā ||

iti sthalāntare | asyārthaḥ yā trikhaṇḍā sā mahāyoniḥ | tato viśeṣastviyān 
madhyamāmadhyaparvaṇī aṅguṣṭhasaṃyogaḥ anāmikāpṛṣṭhabhāgena 
kaniṣṭhikāsaṃyogaḥ | śeṣaṃ trikhaṇḍayā samamityarthaḥ | anena saha 
pūrvavacanasyaikārthatāyāṃ kriyamāṇāyāṃ pūrvalikhitārthaḥ saṃpadyate || 

<p. 171>

evaṃ daśamudrāḥ paramagahanāḥ yathāmati saprapaccaṃ sapramāṇaṃ 
prapañcitāḥ prāsaṅgikāḥ | prakṛtamanusarāmaḥ || 15 ||

kāmakalādhyānam

atha kāmakalādhyānaṃ vaktumupakramate(-)

bindunā mukhaṃ bindudvayena kucau saparārdhena yoniṃ kṛtvā kāmakalāmiti 
dhyātvā || 16 ||

sūkṣmaṃ kalādhyānaṃ sthūlaṃ ceti dvividham | tatra 
sūkṣmakāmakalādhyānasya asmatparameṣṭhigurubhiḥ 
uttaracatuśśatīvyākhyāne vistareṇa setubandhe varivasyārahasye ca 
vyākhyātatvāt tādṛśadhyānakartuḥ upāsakadhaureyasya sāmprataṃ 
śaśaśṛṅgakalpatvena tallekhanasya kevalasvapāṇḍityamātrakhyāpakatvam 
idānīntanavedāntaśāstrādhyayanavat syāt | ataḥ prathamaṃ parityajya 
sthūlameva mandādhikāriṇāmupayogāya varṇayiṣyāmaḥ | tadyathā turīyasvare 
hakāre vā aṃśatrayaṃ parikalpya tatra strīrūpaṃ parikalpya urdhvāṃśe 
mukhakalpanāṃ madhyamāṃśe kucadvayakalpanāṃ jaghanyāṃśe 
yonikalpanāṃ ca kṛtvā dhyāyet | taduktaṃ kuṇḍalinīvimarśe(-)

śaktimadhyaparikalpitāṃśakeṣvantaraṅgaparibhāvane paṭuḥ |
ūrdhvamadhyatadadho vibhāgaśaḥ cintayenmukhakucāvadhomukham ||

asmin śloke śaktiśabdārthaḥ īkāraḥ iti bahavaḥ | hakāra ityapi kecit | 
adhomukhaṃ yonimityarthaḥ | śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | mukhaṃ binduṃ kṛtvā 
kucayugamadhastasya tadadho harārdhaṃ dhyāyedyoharamahiṣi te manmathakalām 
iti śrībhāgavatpādairapyuktam | setubandhe tu īkāra eva sthūladhyānamuktam 
īkārasya binduvisargātmanaḥ śivaśaktyoḥ sāmarasyarūpasya svātmatvena 
bhāvanāyāṃ paramānandānubhavaḥ iti paṅktyām | sālagrāme viṣṇubuddhivat 
bhagavatyāḥ dhyānādhiṣṭhānaniyamo'yam | evaṃ sthūladhyānena 
jitāntaḥkaraṇastādṛśopāsakamakuṭamaṇiḥ sūkṣmakalāṃ 
setubandhādilikhitāṃ gurumukhāt jñātvā kāmamupāsīta | nānye 
idānīntanāḥ tadyogyāḥ | tādṛśadhyānaṃ ca 
paradevatāśrīguruprasādaikalabhyam | ayamarthastripurārṇave suspaṣṭamuktaḥ(-)
sūkṣmadhyāne'samarthaścet sthūlaṃ dhyāyedyathoktavit iti | itthaṃ ca 
pūrvoktānyataravarṇe mukhaṃ kucau yoniṃ cāṃśatraye kṛtvā manasā 
nirmāya kāmakalām iti vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa (")sannihitādhastha-17-sūtra 
bhāṣyobhayoktyanusāreṇetyarthaḥ |(") dhyātvā yathā'vakāśamiti śeṣaḥ || 16 ||

varṇaviśeṣe pūrvoktāvayavakalpanānantaraṃ viśiṣṭe dhyānaprakāramāha(-)

saubhāgyahṛdayamāmṛśya || 17 ||

<p. 172>

saubhāgyasya dharmādisakalapuruṣārthasya hṛdayaṃ sthānaṃ 
upādānakāraṇamiti yāvat | īdṛśaṃ pūrvoktarūpam āmṛśya dhyātvā | 
pūrvasūtrasthetiśabdasya atrāpyanuvṛttiḥ | ayamevārthaḥ spaṣṭamuktaḥ 
yoginītantre(-)

evaṃ kāmakalārūpam akṣaraṃ yat samutthitam |
kāmādiviṣamokṣāṇāmālayaṃ parameśvari || iti ||

etaduttaraṃ nibandhe homaḥ pākṣika uktaḥ saḥ nirmūlaḥ yadyagnikāryasampattiḥ 
iti sūtrasya gaṇapatiprakaraṇasthasya anyatra prāpakapramāṇābhāvāt || 17 ||

balidānam

atha baliprakāramāha(-)

vāmabhāgavihitatrikoṇavṛttacaturasre gandhākṣatārcite vāgbhavamuccārya 
vyāpakamaṇḍalāya namaḥ ityardhabhaktabharitāmbhasā ādimopādimamadhya 
mabhājanaṃ tatra nyasya || 18 ||

atra vāmabhāgetyanena śīghropasthitatvāt svasyaiva vāmabhāgo grāhyaḥ | vihite 
nirmite trikoṇavṛttacaturasre | nirgamarītyā trikoṇaṃ svābhimukhaṃ grāhyam 
tathā śiṣṭasampradāyāt ||

kecittu trikoṇe yā baligrāhiṇī devatā sā 
tiryagrekhādvayasaṃyogarūpakoṇābhimukhī trikoṇavartidevatānāṃ 
tathātvaniyamāt | evaṃ ca tantrāntare(-)

mūladevyunmukhāṃ dhyātvā nyasyāgre balipātrakam ||

iti vacanena tasyā devatāyā mūladevyunmukhatvaniyamāt | trikoṇamapi 
devyunmukhameva na svābhimukhamityāhuḥ | tanna 
anaṅgakusumādiśrīcakrasthakoṇeṣu koṇaparāṅmukhīnāṃ 
mūladevyabhimukhīnāṃ devatānāṃ bahvīnāṃ dṛṣṭatvena 
tādṛśaniyamāsiddheḥ | na kiṃcidetat ||

gandhākṣatetyanena taditaravyāvṛttiḥ darśitā | arcane mantramāha(-)
vāgbhavamityādi | vāgbhavaṃ aiṃ iti | śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | ardhaṃ bhaktena annena 
bharitāmbhasā ca sahitamiti śeṣaḥ | idaṃ bhājane viśeṣaṇam | ekasmin pātre 
ardhāṃśam annena ardhāṃśaṃ jalena pūrayet | īdṛśamekaṃ pātraṃ 
kṣīrādipātratrayaṃ ca tatra maṇḍale nyasya | atra balipātraṃ tāmramayam 

balipātraṃ tāmrabhavaṃ naivānyattu kadācana ||

iti tripurārṇavavacanāt | vyañjanādimiśraṇaṃ na kāryam etattantre 
uktadravyeṇaiva dravyākāṅkṣāśānteḥ ||

<p. 173>

atra nibandhakāraḥ bāṇamudrayā balidānaṃ vāmapārṣṇighātādikaṃ lilekha | 
saḥ praṣṭavyaḥ kimatra pramāṇam iti | sa yadi brūyāt śyāmāprakaraṇe sūtre 
uktatvāt atrāpi te dharmā gṛhyante iti tarhi tadgrahaṇaṃ ākāṅkṣayā uta 
anākāṅkṣayā | ādye balidāne dravyadevatāmantrāṇāmākāṅkṣoditā 
prakṛtavākyaireva śāntā | bāṇamudrāyā vāmapārṣṇighātasya ca grahaṇaṃ 
kurvataḥ tasyaiva kīdṛśī ākāṅkṣoditeti ca na vidmaḥ | kiṃ ca 
śyāmāprakaraṇasthapārṣṇighātādidharmeṇa kimapakṛtam | 
kṣetrapālavāgīśvaryādibalayo'pi tatra santi | uktavyatiriktā anye'pi mantrāḥ 
santi | taiḥ nibandhakṛto'parādhaḥ ko'nuṣṭhitaḥ | śyāmāprakaraṇasthatvasya 
tulyatve'pi keṣucit anugṛhṇan jagrāha keṣucit ruṣṭaḥ tatyājeti mūlaṃ na vidmaḥ 
| kiṃ ca tata eva trikoṇādimaṇḍaladharmāṇāṃ prāptau punarvidhānamatra 
kimartham iti cet vāgbandhanamevottaraṃ nānyaditi | tasmāt svecchayā 
dharmapravartakasaraṇiḥ aśraddheyā | yāvaduktaṃ kāryam || 18 ||

balidāne mantramāha(-)

praṇavamāyā'nte sarvavighnakṛdbhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyo huṃ svāhā iti triḥ 
paṭhitvā baliṃ dattvā || 19 ||

triḥ ityanena mantrābhyāso vihitaḥ | tena triḥpāṭhānte balidānam | devatā ca 
mantraliṅgena jñeyā || 19 ||

pradakṣiṇādi

pradakṣiṇanamaskārajapastotraiḥ santoṣya || 20 ||

pradakṣiṇamekaṃ kāryam

ajeśaśaktigaṇapabhāskarāṇāṃ pradakṣiṇe |
vedārdhacandravahnyadrisaṅkhyāḥ sarvārthasiddhayaḥ ||

iti śaktisaṅgamatantre uktatvāt | ajaḥ viṣṇuḥ | vedāḥ catasraḥ | ardhaṃ tadardhaṃ 
dvayam | candraḥ ekaḥ | vahniḥ tisraḥ | adriḥ sapta | imāḥ saṅkhyāḥ 
ajādipradakṣiṇe kramāt jñeyāḥ ityarthaḥ | śrīmacchaṅkarabhagavatpādairapi 
pradakṣiṇaṃ te paritaḥ karomi ityekavacanāntamevoktam (")śrībālā(-)
mānasapūjā(-)stotre(-)matkṛtabālātantracandrikāyāṃ(-)cāyaṃ ślokosti |(") ||

namaskāre tu icchaiva niyāmikā śāstropalabdhiparyantam | namaskāre 
kaścidviśeṣaḥ paramānandatantre(-)

<p. 174>

pūjāgṛhādbahirdevīṃ praṇamet daṇḍavadbhuvi |
maṇḍale namanaṃ naiva sāṣṭāṅgaṃ daṇḍavat caret ||
jānubhyāṃ ca padābhyāṃ ca mūrdhnā hastayugena ca |
caturaṅgapraṇāmo'yaṃ maṇḍale vihitaḥ śive || iti ||

maṇḍalalakṣaṇaṃ yoginītantre(-)

pūjyate yatra sā devī taccaturdikṣu śaṅkari |
dhanuśśatapramāṇena maṇḍalaṃ parikīrtitam || iti ||

dhanurmānaṃ tu hastacatuṣṭayam | bṛhadvāmakeśvare tu(-)

maṇḍalaṃ tadvijānīyāt yāvadṛśyā hi devatā || iti ||

rahasyārṇave tu(-)

dvārapūjā yatra kṛtā tadantarmaṇḍalaṃ viduḥ || iti ||

ayaṃ ca deśataḥ pariccheda uktaḥ | kālataḥ paricchedastu śaktisaṅgamatantre(-)

dvārapūjāṃ samārabhya yāvadudvāsanaṃ bhavet |
tāvattanmaṇḍalaṃ viddhi(..................) || iti ||

tripurārṇave'pi(-)

idaṃ tanmaṇḍalaṃ devi prārabhyaitasya pūjanam |
mārtaṇḍamaṇḍalārdhyāntaṃ (..............) || iti ||

idameva maṇḍalaṃ vakṣyamāṇamaṇḍaladharmeṣu jñeyam |

pūjāgṛhaṃ tato gatvā cakrarājaṃ samarcayet |
vidyāṃ japet sahasraṃ vā triśataṃ śatameva vā ||

iti brahmāṇḍapurāṇoktajapasaṅkhyā jñeyā | ayaṃ japaḥ karmāṅgabhūtaḥ 
aṅgairubhayataḥ sandaṃśāt | yadvā(-)

āvṛttirgurunityā'rcā samayāmnāyayorapi |
pūjātrayaṃ japaścaiva pradhānaṃ pūjane matam ||

iti svatantratantre trayodaśollāse japasya prādhānyakathanāt pratyakṣavacanena 
kathanasya sarvabādhakatvāt ||

stotrāṇi gaṇeśagrahanakṣatretyādivāmakeśvaratantroktāni sahasranāmapāṭhaḥ 
aparādhastutiḥ satyavakāśe saptaśatīpāṭho'pi tataḥ kṛtāñjalirbhūtvā stuvīta 
caritairimaiḥ iti tatraiva vihitatvāt | evamādibhiḥ santoṣya || 20 ||

<p. 175>

śaktipūjā

atha śaktipūjāmāha(-)

tadrūpiṇīmekāṃ śaktiṃ bālayopacāraiḥ sampūjya tāṃ mapañcakena 
santarpya || 21 ||

tadrūpiṇīṃ tripurasundarīrūpiṇīṃ ekavacanena ekāmityanena advitīyāṃ 
saundaryeṇetyarthaḥ | pratipādyate | etena tantrāntaroktaśaktilakṣaṇāni sūcitāni | 
bālayā mantreṇa upacāraiḥ yathāsambhavaiḥ | mapañcakena santarpaṇaṃ 
tasyāḥ icchāyāṃ satyāṃ jñeyam | ayaṃ bhāvaḥ santarpyetyanena jñāpitaḥ | 
tarpaṇaṃ tṛptisampādanaṃ tat śaktiniṣṭhatattadviṣayakecchānivartako 
vyāpāraḥ | tasyā icchāyāmasatyāṃ tannirvartakavyāpārasyāpi asambhavāt 
icchāyāmeva iti sidhyati | anyathā mapañcakairupacāraiśca pūjayet ityeva vadet | 
tasmādayamarthaḥ siddhaḥ | śaktilakṣaṇāni kulārṇave(-)

surūpā (")etadādiślokāḥ kulārṇavatantre-7 ullāse(-)mudritapustake 64 patre santi |(") 
taruṇī śāntā'nukūlā muditā śuciḥ | 
śaṅkāhīnā bhaktiyuktā guruśāstraparāyaṇā ||
priyākṣarā (")priyekṣaṇā(-)śrī(.") viśeṣajñā devatāpūjanotsukā |
manoharā sadācārā śaktirevaṃ sulakṣaṇā || iti ||

yoginītantre'pi

savarṇā hīnavarṇā vā kulasthā kulaṭā'pi vā |
mantropāsanasaṃyuktā pūjyā syāt gaṇikā'pi ca || iti ||

doṣā api kulārṇave

dūṣyā (")emepi ślokāḥ pūrvatanoktapatrasthale eva santi |(") ca karkaśā lajjāhīnā 
ca kuladūṣiṇī |
durācārā durārādhyā bhītā kruddhā calā'lasā ||
nidrāsaktā'tidurmeghāḥ hīnāṅgī vyādhipīḍitā |
durgandhā duḥkhitā mūḍhā vṛddhonmattā rahasyabhit ||
īdṛśīṃ mantrayuktāṃ ca pūjākāle (")mudritakulārṇavapustaketra(-)śaktiyoge 
vivarjayediti pāṭhosti |(") vivarjayet || iti ||

yaśca yoginītantre(-)

yogyā vā'pi niṣiddhā vā bahudoṣākulā'pi vā |
kāle suvāsinīṃ prāptāṃ sarvathā bhaktito'rcayet || iti ||

<p. 176>

saḥ mukhyālābhe pūrvavacanaiḥ niṣiddhāyā abhyanujñāparaḥ vivāhe 
anṛtavadanavat | yadvā pūrvavacanaiḥ niṣedhaḥ pratipādito yaḥ saḥ 
śaktipūjāparaḥ | yogyā vā ityanena tadatiriktaṃ suvāsinīmātre pūjanaṃ 
tatkāle pratipādayati | yuktaścāyameva pakṣaḥ || 21 ||

haviśśeṣapratipattiḥ

haviśśeṣapratipattimāha(-)

śiṣṭaiḥ sārdhaṃ cidagnau haviśśeṣaṃ hutvā || 22 ||

atra śiṣṭatvaṃ kulārṇave darśitam(-)

aho bhuktaṃ tu yanmadyaṃ mohayet tridaśānapi |
tanmaireyaṃ śivaṃ pītvā yo na vikriyate naraḥ ||
japan śivaparo bhūtvā sa muktaḥ sa ca kaulikaḥ || iti ||

īdṛśaṃ śiṣṭatvaṃ sāmayikaniṣṭham | etena viśeṣaṇena ādhunikāḥ 
kaulikaṃmanyāḥ kevalaṃ jihvācapalāḥ maṇḍale na praveśyāḥ iti jñāpitaṃ 
bhavati | sāmayikaiḥ saheti sahatvaṃ ekajātīyakriyākartṛtvaṃ putreṇa saha yāti 
ityādau tathā dṛśṭatvāt | prakṛte'pi homarūpaikajātīyakriyākartṛtvamastīti 
sahatvaṃ upapannam | cidagnau cillakṣaṇe'gnau haviśśeṣaṃ devatoddeśena 
saṃskṛtārpitaśeṣam | hutvetyanena tatra kevalahomabuddhireva vidheyā | 
indriyatṛptiviṣayiṇīcchā na kadā'pi kāryeti sūcitaṃ bhavati | maṇḍale praveśe 
indriyatṛptīcchāyāṃ patita eva syāt iti bhāvaḥ | ayaṃ ca 
upayuktadravyasaṃskāraḥ āgneyaṃ caturdhā karoti itivat haviśśeṣam iti 
dvitīyāśravaṇāt || 

etenedānīntanāḥ ekaṃ kalaśaṃ asaṃskṛtadravyeṇa paripūrṇaṃ sthāpayitvā 
tasmin viśeṣārghyabinduṃ kiñcinnikṣipya taddravyaṃ sāmayikebhyaḥ 
prayacchanti | teṣāmanukūlatayā nibandhakāro'pi kṣīrakalaśādikaṃ devyāḥ 
paścādbhāge nidhāyeti viśeṣārghyapātrāt kiñcit kṣīraṃ kalaśe nikṣipet iti ca 
vākyadvayaṃ lilekha | idaṃ mūlaṃ kṛtvā ya īdṛśo'nācāraḥ patanahetuḥ 
pravṛttaḥ saḥ likhitasūtravirodhena nirastaḥ tasmin haviḥśeṣatvābhāvāt | yadi ca 
bindumātraprakṣepeṇa haviśśeṣatvaṃ syāt tarhi āpaṇasthadravye'pi 
binduprakṣepaṃ kṛtvā dravyasvīkāre doṣābhāvena mahānupaplavaḥ syāt ||

yacca tripurārṇave(-)

tathā pūjānimittaṃ vai prathamādyamupāhṛtam |
yajñiyaṃ tat pavitraṃ syāt dṛṣṭvā spṛṣṭvā śucirbhavet ||

<p. 177>

tathaiva maṇḍale prāptaṃ sarvaṃ tadamṛtaṃ bhavet |
vipreṇānyena vā'nītaṃ devatāyai nivedayet ||
prathamādyaiḥ saṃskṛtaistu yuktaṃ tattadagātmaje |
aviśeṣeṇa sarvaistu grāhyaṃ śaṅkāvivarjitaiḥ || iti ||

saṃskṛtadravyeṇa yuktaṃ asaṃskṛtaṃ saṃskṛtaṃ bhavatīti kathayatīti 
yadyucyate tathā'pi saṃskṛtadravyasaṃyogo dvedhā | saṃskṛtadravyasya 
asaṃskṛtadravyapātre prakṣepe sati ekaḥ saṃskṛte viśeṣārghyapātre 
asaṃskṛtadravyaprakṣepeṇāparaḥ | tatra pūrvasmāt pakṣāt uttarapakṣo 
variṣṭhaḥ śraute karmaṇi some droṇakalaśe darśapūrṇamāse dhruvādau tathā 
dṛṣṭatvāt | kiṃ ca yadi saṃskṛtadravyeṇa laukikaṃ bahiṣṭhaṃ saṃskṛtaṃ 
bhavet tarhi atiprasaṅgo darśitaḥ pūrvameva (")pūrvameva nāma 176 patrasthe(-)
āpaṇadravye'pi(-)ityāditaḥ(0) mahānupaplavaḥ syādityantena lekhenetyarthaḥ |(") 
bahirdravyasya pātre prakṣepapakṣe pūrvoktātiprasaṅgo'pi nāsti idamapi 
sādhakam | tasmāt dvitīyapakṣa eva śreṣṭhaḥ | tatrāpi pūjānimittaṃ 
bhaktenānītasthala eva ayaṃ prakāro nānyatra aśāstrīyatvāt | idānīntanāḥ 
buddhyā yathecchaṃ dravyaṃ sampādya manaḥpūtaṃ vyavaharanti | 
tatpatanāyaivālaṃ bhaviṣyatīti ||

vastutastu idamapi tantrāntarānuyāyināṃ na tu sūtrānuyāyinām | sūtre 
haviśśeṣaṃ hutvetyuktyā kalaśasthāsaṃskṛtadravye haviśśeṣatvaṃ 
gīrvāṇaguruṇā'pi pratipādayitumaśakyam śāstroktavidhinā saṃskṛtya 
devatāyai dattaśeṣasyaiva haviśśeṣatvāt | tasmāt yāgaśeṣeṇaiva 
homapratipattisaṃskāraḥ sūtrānuyāyināṃ nānyadravyeṇa iti rāddhāntaḥ ||

nanu tarpaṇe āvaraṇapūjane ca kṛte sati yadā tatraiva viniyogaḥ tadā idaṃ karma 
luptaṃ syāt iti cet na | yathā aśvaśaphamātraṃ puroḍāśaṃ karoti 
aṅguṣṭhaparvamātramavadyati iti vidhibhyāṃ anuṣṭhite haviśśeṣo niyataḥ tathā 
tantrāntare(-)

sāmānyakalaśaṃ pañcapalānyūnajalairyutam |
dikpalādadhikaṃ naiva hetukumbhaṃ tadardhakam |
tadardhaṃ ca viśeṣārghyam(..........................) ||

iti mānānusaraṇe sūtrānuyāyināṃ hetukumbhasthānāpannaviśeṣārghye 
hetukumbhamānāṅgīkāre ṣoḍaśaśataguñjāparimitaṃ viśeṣārghyadravyaṃ 
bhavati | yadi ca viśeṣārghyamānameva asya tulyanāmatvāt aṅgīkriyate tadā'pi 
aṣṭaśataguñjāparimitamityavivādam | āvaraṇapūjādiṣu ekaikadevatoddeśena 
ekaikabinduviniyogo dṛśyate | tathā sati sāmayikānāmātmanaśca homāyālaṃ 
dravyaṃ śiṣyata eva | asmin śāstre dravyasvīkārajanito'vasthāviśeṣaḥ ullāsaḥ 
| so'pi dravyasyātyuttamatve bhavitumarhati iti na kā'pyanupapattiḥ ||

<p. 178>

atra hometikartavyatāyāḥ (")kartavyatāyām(-)iti saptamyarthotrāvadheyaḥ |(") 
śiṣṭānāṃ maṇḍale praveśadharmāṇāṃ ca anukteḥ kathaṃ śiṣṭaiḥ saha 
homaṃ kuryāt ityākāṅkṣāyāṃ tantrāntaraṃ tadviṣaye śaraṇīkāryam | tathā 
sati ādau maṇḍaladharmāḥ ucyante | te coktāḥ paramānandatantre(-)

kṣatāṅgo jvaritāṅgaśca malināmbaramūrdhajaḥ | 
āśaucāṅgastathoṣṇīṣī kañcukī kṛtabhojanaḥ ||
pūyitāṅgastathocchiṣṭamukho maraṇasūtakī |
apasmārī kleśayuktaḥ chardyatīsārarogavān ||
prāyaścittī tathā'snāto na viśenmaṇḍale kvacit |
sakṛnmohāt praviṣṭo'pi devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||
yadi teṣāṃ tu bhaktiḥ syādutkaṭā darśanādiṣu |
pūjāgṛhadvāradeśādbahiḥ pūjāṃ samācaret || iti ||

tripurārṇave bhuktasya viśeṣaḥ(-)

atarkito divā bhukto yadā rātrau samāgataḥ |
tadā gurvādyājñayā tu snātvā sevenna cānyathā || iti ||

idamapi sevanaṃ maṇḍalādbahireva |

bhuktvā na maṇḍalaṃ gacchet sarvathā parameśvari |

iti maṇḍalapraveśaniṣedhabādhakaśāstrābhāvāt ||

yacca kulārṇave(-)

asnātvā vā'pi bhuktvā vā abhaktyā (")abhyaṅktvā(-)śrī(.") vā kuleśvari |

yaḥ seveta kuladravyaṃ sa dāridryamavāpnuyāt ||

iti bhuktasya kuladravyasevananiṣedhaśāstraṃ kāmaṃ bādhatāṃ 
praveśaniṣedhabādhakābhāvāt praveśo na kartavyaḥ | na ca maṇḍalāt bahiḥ 
svātmīkāravidhyabhāvena svātmīkāravidhinā praveśo'pyākṣipyate iti 
vācyam | tathā sati tripurārṇave bhuktvā na maṇḍalaṃ gacchet iti 
praveśaniṣedhenaiva svātmīkāraniṣedhe siddhe(-)

kuladravyaṃ tathā bhuktvā mohādapi pramādataḥ |
yaḥ seveta sa vai devi devatāśāpamāpnuyāt ||

ityanena unnītaḥ kuladravyasevananiṣedho vyarthaḥ syāt | ato'nenaiva jñāpakena 
bahirapi sevanaṃ dravyasya siddham ||

<p. 179>

evaṃ praveśāyogyānuktvā praveṣṭṛguṇānapyāha paramānandatantre(-)

snātaḥ śucirdhautavastro dhṛtapuṇḍraḥ śubhāśayaḥ |
kṣālitāṅghrikaro devīṃ dhyāyan bhaktyā praṇamya ca ||

ācāryājñā'nurūpeṇa maṇḍalāntarviśet tataḥ |
bhāvayan devatārūpaṃ maṇḍalaṃ praṇamet budhaḥ ||

puṣpāñjaliṃ tataḥ kuryāt tadvidhānaṃ nigadyate |
sāmānyakumbhatoyena karau prakṣālya bhaktitaḥ ||

surabhīkṛtya gandhādyaiḥ puṣpāṇyādāya bhaktitaḥ |
utthāya ca tato devi devatā'bhimukhasthitaḥ ||

śrīnāthādigurutrayaṃ gaṇapatiṃ pīṭhatrayaṃ bhairavaṃ siddhaughaṃ 
baṭukatrayaṃ padayugaṃ dūtīkramaṃ maṇḍalam |

vīrān hyaṣṭacatuṣkaṣaṣṭinavakaṃ vīrāvalīpañcakaṃ 
śrīmanmālinimantrarājasahitaṃ vande gurormaṇḍalam ||

samprāptapañcadaśyādiḥ sādhakastu maheśvari |
samaṣṭiyoginīvidyāmapi tatra paṭhecchive ||

devatāṃ dhyānoktarūpāṃ dhyāyan sampūjya śaṅkari | 
ācāryādīṃstato dhyātvā pūjayet parameśvari ||

praṇameduktavidhinā jñātvā sarvaṃ śivātmakam |
sa dvitīyaṃ samādadyāt pātramācāryasattamāt ||

pātraṃ grāhyaṃ dakṣakare dīkṣāyuktena śaṅkari |
anyena tu samādeyaṃ vāmahastena śaṅkari ||

athavā vāmahastena sarvairgrāhyaṃ maheśvari |
hastāntareṇa tvācchādya gṛhṇīyāt dāpayedapi ||

anācchāditapātraṃ tu bhavedasurabhāgakam |
tarpaṇādyupayoge tu chādanaṃ tu parityajet ||

upaveśakramaṃ devi śṛṇu saṃyatamānasā |
maṇḍalākārato vā'pi caturasratayā'thavā ||

ācāryaṃ madhyataḥ kṛtvā viśet jyeṣṭhakrameṇa tu |
jyeṣṭheṣu satsu na viśet ācāryasya samīpataḥ ||

<p. 180>

na sāmyena guroḥ stheyaṃ strīṇāṃ madhye tathaiva ca |
nāgratastu gurordevi nājñāmullaṅghya vai guroḥ ||

evaṃ jñātvā sampradāyaṃ niṣīdenmaṇḍale śive |
ācāryo'pi tathā jyeṣṭhānutthāya praṇipatya ca ||

teṣāmājñāṃ gṛhītvaiva svāsane'tha samāviśet | 
tasmai ca pātraṃ dadyādvai jyeṣṭhāyotthāya sādhakaḥ ||

jyeṣṭhān kaniṣṭho'pi devi gṛhṇīyādutthito naman |
sarvān saṃpūjya pātrāṇi dātavyāni maheśvari ||

asampūjya śiṣyamapi yo dadyāt pātramambike |
tasmai kupyati sā devī yasmāt sarvaṃ hi tanmayam ||

prakṣālya pātraṃ puṣpādiyutamācchādya yatnataḥ |
ācāryāya tathā dadyāt namaskuryācca bhaktitaḥ ||
svīkṛtya tatprasādaṃ vai japtvā stotrādikaṃ paṭhet || iti ||

tripurārṇave(-)

śaktyā svarṇādisaṃyuktamarpayet pātramambike |
yatkiṃcidvā'pi pātrasthaṃ datvā'nantaphalaṃ labhet || iti ||

suvāsinīnāṃ viśeṣo yoginītantre(-)

evaṃ santarpya hutvā tu suvāsinyaḥ saśeṣakam |
dadyustṛtīyaṃ turyaṃ vā pātraṃ pīṭhādhikāriṇe || iti ||

tripurārṇave kaścidviśeṣaḥ(-)

vīrāt jyeṣṭhāt tathā'cāryāt grāhyaṃ śeṣaṃ ca carvaṇam |
tadabhāve'pi cānyasmāt jyeṣṭhāt grāhyaṃ nagātmaje ||

bṛhadvāmakeśvaratantre(-)

gurvādyabhāve jyeṣṭhāttu carvaṇaṃ śeṣamarpayet |
tadabhāve guruṃ mūrdhni dhyātvā taccheṣakaṃ (")māharet(-)śrī(.") nyaset ||
ādau vā guruśeṣaṃ syāt sarvānte vā nagātmaje |
pibedaśabdaṃ pātraṃ tu sakṛnniravaśeṣakam ||
sāvaśeṣaṃ tu yatpātraṃ surāpānasamaṃ tu tat || iti ||

<p. 181>

pātrasya oṣṭhāsparśe'pi niṣedhastatraiva(-)

dūrādoṣṭhāsparśanena pānaṃ tu paśupānavat ||

kulārṇave'pi(-)

kareṇa pātraṃ dhṛtvā'tha na tiṣṭheta ciraṃ priye |
nālapan pātrahastaḥ san tiṣṭheta kvacidambike ||
pādena na spṛśet pātraṃ na binduṃ pātayedadhaḥ |
nānyonyaṃ tāḍayet pātraṃ na pātraṃ pātayedadhaḥ ||
sādhāraṃ noddharet pātraṃ nirādhāraṃ na nikṣipet |
riktaṃ pātraṃ na kurvīta na pātraṃ bhrāmayet priye ||
na pātraṃ laṅghayedvidvān pātraṃ notpātayet priye |
prakṣālya gopayet pātramityājñā pārameśvarī || iti ||

paramānandatantre kaścana viśeṣaḥ(-)

arghyasthāpanamārabhya yāvat pātravisarjanam |
sarvaṃ śivamayaṃ paśyedanyathā patito bhavet ||
sarve varṇā dvijāstatra na bhedaṃ cintayet kvacit |
udvāsānantaraṃ naikyaṃ kuryādvidvān kadācana ||
svātmīkārastridhā devi divyavīrapaśukramāt |
udvāsāvadhi divyaḥ syāt tatpaścādvīra ucyate ||
asaṃskṛtaḥ paśuḥ prokto viprāṇāmādya eva tu |
apaśuḥ kṣatriyaviśāṃ śūdrāṇāṃ tritayaṃ bhavet || iti ||

kulārṇave'pi(-)

bhuktimuktipradaṃ (")muktiprada bhaveddivyaṃ(-)śrī(.") divyaṃ vīraṃ bhuktipradaṃ 
bhavet || iti ||

rahasyārṇave'pi(-)

sampūjyaivaṃ vidhānena vipraścodvāsanāvadhi |
dravyaṃ pibet tadante'pi kṣatriyo vaiśya eva ca |
śūdrastvicchā'nurodhena vidhinā vā'nyathā'pi vā ||
nivedya devatāyai tat saṃtarpya prapibedanu || iti ||

<p. 182>

etāvantaḥ atyāvaśyakadharmāḥ nirūpitāḥ | ito'dhikā anekatantrāvalokanena 
jñeyāḥ | granthavistarabhayānneha likhyante ||

atra sāmayikānāṃ kalpasūtrānuyāyinām anyeṣām uktāḥ maṇḍaladharmāḥ 
tulyāḥ | homamantraḥ sūtrānuyāyinām ārdraṃ jvalati iti mantra eva 
mantrākāṅkṣāyāṃ tantrāntaramantrāt asya sannikṛṣṭatvāt | anyeṣāṃ 
svasvatantroktā saraṇiḥ | atreyaṃ vyavasthā cintyate pīṭhādhikāriṇā 
svakartṛkapūjāphalasiddhaye pratipattisaṃskārasya avaśyamanuṣṭheyatayā sa 
maṇḍale dhyānasamartho'samarthaḥ vā kāmaṃ dravyasvīkāraṃ karotu | 
sāmayikastu dravyahomānantaraṃ śāstroktadhyānasamartha eva dravyaṃ hunet | 
nānyaḥ | tathā hi(-)

antarnirantaramanindhanamedhamāne mohāndhakāraparipanthini saṃvidagnau |
kasmiṃścidadbhutamarīcivikāsamāne viśvaṃ juhomi vasudhā'di 
śivāvasānam ||

dharmādharmahavirdīptāvātmāgnau manasā srucā |
suṣumṇāvartmanā nityamakṣavṛttīrjuhomyaham ||

iti mantraliṅgena kalpito dhyānaprakāra āvaśyakaḥ | devīyāmale'pi(-)

homena cetanāṃ jitvā dhyāyedātmānamātmanā || iti ||

kulārṇave'pi(-)

tanmaireyaṃ śivaṃ pītvā yo na vikriyate naraḥ |
japan śivaparo bhūtvā sa muktaḥ sa ca kaulikaḥ || iti ||

paramānandatantre'pi(-)

svīkṛtya tatprasādaṃ vai dhyāyenniścalamambikām || iti ||

vīracūḍāmaṇau gaṇeśvarasaṃhitāyām(-)

dravyamāsvādya vidhinā mano niścalatāṃ nayet |
tato dhyāyet paraṃ jyotirātmajyotiḥ sanātanam ||

ityādimanonigrahapūrvakadhyānavidhāyakavacanāni bahūni(-)

yāvat suṣuptatā na syādavikāritvameva ca |
tāvadeva hunet devi niṣphalaṃ tvanyathā bhavet || iti ||

vikāre tu samutpanne dhyānayogabahiṣkṛtaḥ |
yoginīnāṃ paśurdevi maṇḍalācca bahiṣkṛtaḥ ||

ityadhikapātrahome dhyānabhraṃśamūlānartho'pi tantre | tenāpi 
dhyānāvaśyakatā sidhyati | evamādīni bahūni santi | granthavistarabhayānneha 
likhitametāvadalamiti ||

<p. 183>

itthaṃ ca dravyasevanasya prathamaphalaṃ cittaikāgryaṃ tena vinā 
dhyānāsambhavāt | ata eva paramānandatantre(-)

tāvadeva hunet devi yāvadānandasamplutaḥ |
mano niścalatāṃ yāti cittaṃ cāpi prasādatām ||
vikāre tu samutpanne dhyānayogavihīnataḥ |
yoginīnāṃ paśurdevi maṇḍalācca bahiṣkṛtaḥ |

iti ayogyasya dravyasvīkāre aniṣṭaṃ phalaṃ darśayati | yoginītantre'pi(-)

kuladravyaṃ samāśritya mano niścalatāṃ nayet || iti ||

tripurārṇave'pi(-)

ayaṃ sarvottamo dharmaḥ kaulamārgo maheśvari |
asidhārāvratasamo manoniścalahetukaḥ ||
tatra saṃyatacittatvaṃ sarvathā hyatiduṣkaram |
bhaktiśraddhāvihīnasya(......................) ||

ityevamādīni tantravacanāni dravyasevanaṃ manonigrahadvārā dhyānārthaṃ 
kartavyaṃ viparīte bādhata iti koṭiśaḥ upalabhyante | 
evamāditantravacanārthānāṃ saṅgrahaṃ kurvanneva śrīparaśurāmaḥ 
śiṣṭaiḥ saha ityuvāca | īdṛśadhyānasamartho vratādidivaseṣvapi avicāreṇa 
anādṛto'pi maṇḍalaṃ praviśya pātraṃ yācitvā hutvā dhyānaṃ sampādayet | 
taduktaṃ tripurārṇave(-)

evaṃ sāmayiko bhaktyā mānadambhavivarjitaḥ |
anāhūto'pi (")anādṛto'pyanāhūto(-)śrī(.") vā'hūto vrajenmaṇḍalamuttamam ||
vratī vā'pi hunedeva na doṣastatra vidyate |
vratādiśaṅkayā yastu na vrajedādṛto'pi san ||
vrataṃ tasya pratihatamanarthaṃ ca samāpnuyāt |
tasmāt kaniṣṭhāhūto'pi praviśedeva maṇḍale || iti ||

atra jyeṣṭhatvaṃ kaniṣṭhatvaṃ ca viprāṇāṃ dīkṣāpūrvāparabhāvena 
jñeyam | taduktaṃ rudrayāmale(-)

bālo'pi dīkṣitaḥ pūrvaṃ jyeṣṭhaḥ sa tu kulāgame || iti ||

dvijo'pi dīkṣitaḥ paścādantyajaḥ pūrvadīkṣitaḥ |
dvijaḥ kaniṣṭhaḥ sa jyeṣṭha iti śāstraviniścayaḥ || iti ||

<p. 184>

tatraiva vacanāt kṣatriyādīnāṃ paścāt dīkṣito'pi dvija eva jyeṣṭhaḥ | 
kvaciducchiṣṭagrahaṇe yonisambandhādapi jyeṣṭhatvaṃ pratipādayati | taduktaṃ 
tripurārṇave(-)

vidyāsambandhato vā'pi yonisambandhatastathā |
jyeṣṭhānāmapi cocchiṣṭaṃ dīkṣitānāṃ ca bhakṣayet || iti ||
dīkṣāhīnasya cocchiṣṭaṃ janakasyāpi dīkṣitaḥ |
na bhakṣayet sakṛdvā'pi bhuktvā pātityamāpnuyāt || iti ||

atha prasaṅgāt kena kiyaddravyasevanaṃ kāryaṃ (?) tadvivicyate | tatra bālopāstau 
tripātraṃ pañcadaśīmantropadeśavataḥ catuṣpātraṃ ṣoḍaśyādidīkṣāvataḥ 
pañcapātram | taduktaṃ paramānandatantre(-)

saubhāgyatopāsakasya catustattvaṃ bhavecchive |
bālādyupāsakānāṃ tu tatpūjoktavidhānataḥ ||
teṣāṃ tu tattvatritayaṃ anyat sarvaṃ samaṃ bhavet || iti ||
dīkṣāvatāṃ pūrṇapātraṃ pañcamaṃ tu bhavecchive |
hutvā śivāgnau kramaśaḥ tricatuḥpañcapātrakam || iti ||

nanu(-)

pītvā pītvā punaḥ pītvā yāvat patati bhūtale |
utthāya ca punaḥ pītvā punarjanma na vidyate ||
ānandāt tṛpyate devī mūrcchayā bhairavaḥ svayam |
vamanāt sarvadevāstu tasmāt tritayamācaret ||

ityādikulārṇavaprabhṛtitantreṣvaniyatapānasyoktatvāt kathaṃ pātraniyama iti cet 
śṛṇu śāstrābhiprāyaṃ ajñastattvabubhutsuścet | pītvā pītveti likhitavacanam 
āgalāntaṃ pibeddravyaṃ sa mukto nātra saṃśayaḥ ityādikulārṇavavacanaṃ 
yathecchayā'nurūpaṃ na sarveṣāṃ kiṃ tu pūrṇārūḍhānām | ata eva 
kulārṇave āgalāntam ityasyāvyavahitaprāk pūrṇābhiṣekayuktānāṃ pānaṃ 
devi nigadyate iti pratijñāya āgalāntaṃ pibet dravyam ityādivacanāni likhitāni | 
pūrṇābhiṣekalakṣaṇamapi tatraiva kulārṇave(-)

yo nindāstutiśītoṣṇasukhaduḥkhādisambhave |
samaḥ sarvatra yogīśo harṣāmarṣavivarjitaḥ || ityādinā
tattvatrayaśrīcaraṇamūlamantrārthatattvavit |
devatāgurubhaktaśca śāmbhavīmudrayā'nvitaḥ ||
sa ca pūrṇābhiṣiktaḥ syāt kauliko na tu dīkṣayā || iti ||

<p. 185>

īdṛśo yaḥ pūrṇābhiṣiktaḥ sa eva pūrṇārūḍhaḥ tasyaiva āgalāntamiti 
vidhānam | ata eva amṛtārahasye(-)

brahmajñānī surāṃ pītvā kulācāre caran muhuḥ |
bhūmau patati tasyāṅge laganti yadi reṇavaḥ |
tāvatkālaṃ reṇusaṅkhyaṃ brahmaloke sa modate ||

iti vacane brahmajñānīti samaṣṭiśabdena kulārṇavoditaṃ viśiṣṭārthamāha | 
idānīntanāḥ tantrārthamajānanto rāgāndhāḥ svādhikāram avicārya pītvā 
pītveti tantravacanāni lokānāṃ darśayitvā svayaṃ yathecchā'cāraṃ kurvantaḥ 
pareṣāṃ buddhimapi tirodadhire | te yāvaccandradivākarau 
tāvannarakayātanāmupalabheyuḥ (")atra upalabheran(-)iti vyākaraṇadṛṣṭyā syāt |(") | 
atra pramāṇaṃ paramānandatantre(-)

yāvanna calate dṛṣṭiryāvanna calate manaḥ |
tāvatpānnaṃ prakurvīta paśupānamataḥ param ||
yāvannendriyavaikalyaṃ yāvanna mukhavaikṛtiḥ |
tāvadeva pibet dravyamanyathā patanaṃ bhavet || iti ||

yathā sādhakaḥ svayogyatā'nusāreṇa dravyaṃ svīkuryāt evamācāryo'pi 
yogyatāṃ dṛṣṭvaiva pātraṃ dadyāt | taduktaṃ kumārītantre(-)

kaulike pātramadhikaṃ prayacchatyavicārayan |
tadiyamadhikāraṃ saḥ saha tenaiva majjati || iti ||

tatraiva(-)

pānamekaprayatnena yāvat dravyasya vai bhavet |
tadārambhe bhavet pātraṃ na nyūnaṃ nādhikaṃ śive || iti ||

pānapātramānaṃ nīlātantre | ekaprayatnasādhyapānasādhanadravyamānaṃ 
pātraṃ bhavati iti tadarthaḥ | kiṃ ca tantrāntare(-)

ullāsabhedamajñātvā prāpya mūḍhatvamambike |
jihvālolupabhāvena cendriyaprīṇanāya ca |
yaḥ pibettaṃ tu tāmisre mātṛkāḥ pātayanti vai || iti ||

itthaṃ ca idānīntanānāṃ atijitendriyāṇāmapi (")ajitendriyāṇāmāra(-)śrī(.") 
ārambhollāsaparyantānudhāvanameva yuktam | 

ata evoktaṃ tantre(-)

<p. 186>

aśaktābudhabālānāmārambhaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

ārambhollāsalakṣaṇaṃ tatraiva(-)

yasya yāvat pātramuktamārambhastasya tāvatā || iti ||

prasaktānuprasakte alaṃ pallavitena | itaḥ śeṣamagre ullāsavilāse caramakhaṇḍe 
(")atra caramakhaṇḍe ityanena 10-khaṇḍe-68-sūtre bhāṣye ca ityartho jñeyaḥ |

sūtrasya punarāvṛttau śodhyaṃ sūcayitavyakam |
pariśiṣṭasthalaṃ caiva pūrṇamādyāprasādataḥ || [iti pañcamaḥ khaṇḍaḥ](-)śrīḥ 
||(") vakṣyāmaḥ || 22 ||

devīvisarjanam

khecarīṃ baddhvā kṣamasveti visṛjya tāmātmani saṃyojayet iti śivam || 23 ||

|| [iti (.....) kalpasūtre lalitānavāvaraṇapūjā nāma pañcamaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||

khecarīṃ baddhvā bandhanānantaraṃ(-)

jñānato'jñānato vā'pi yadyadācaritaṃ śive |
tava kṛtyamiti jñātvā kṣamasva parameśvari ||

iti kṣamāpya visṛjet | visargo nāma pūjārthamāhūtāyāḥ punaḥ svasthānaṃ 
prati nayanam |
ātmani hṛtkamale yojayet sthāpayet | śivamiti prakaraṇasamāptidyotakam ||

|| [iti(...)kalpasūtravṛttau śrīlalitānavāvaraṇapūjā nāma pañcamaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||





[ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ(-)śyāmākramaḥ]

śyāme saṅgītamātaḥ paraśivanilaye mukhyasācivyabhāro(-)
dvāhe dakṣe dayāpūritanijahṛdaye māmakīṃ dainyavṛttim |
śrīmatsiṃhāsaneśyāṃ bhavavanapatitān dāvadagdhānnamaste
trātuṃ pīyūṣavarṣaiḥ kathaya parikaraṃ baddhavatyāṃ vivikte ||

śyāmopāstividhiḥ

śrībhagavān paraśurāmaḥ śyāmākramaṃ vivakṣuḥ 
tasyāmupāsakānāmupāsyatvajñānotpattaye aṅgīkṛtaśrīvidyopāsanasya yo 
vai svāṃ devatāmatiyajate prasvāyai devatāyai cyavate na parāṃ prāpnoti 
pāpīyān bhavati iti śrutyā 
svīkṛtaikadevatopāsteranyadevatopāsanamaniṣṭajanakamiti yat pratipāditaṃ tena 
kaluṣitacetasāṃ kāluṣyanivṛttaye ca ādau tadguṇasvarūpaṃ varṇayati(-)

iyameva mahatī vidyā siṃhāsaneśvarī sāmrājñī tasyāḥ pradhānasacivapadaṃ 
śyāmā tatkramavimṛṣṭiḥ sadā kāryā || 1 ||

parāśakteḥ svarūpaṃ udāsyatvaṃ ca

iyaṃ vakṣyamāṇā | iyamityuttaraṃ yeti śeṣaḥ | yā mahatī 
niravadhikamahattvavatī siṃhāsanaṃ paraśivaḥ svādhiṣṭhānarūpatvāt tasya 
īśvarī tanniṣṭhasṛṣṭisthititirodhānasaṅkalpanirvāhakartrī | taduktaṃ 
śaṅkarabhagavatpādaiḥ(-)

śivaḥ (")ayaṃ ślokaḥ saundaryalaharyāṃ prāthamikaḥ tatpūrvārdhamidam |(") 
śaktyā yukto yadi bhavati śaktaḥ prabhavituṃ |
na cedevaṃ devo na khalu kuśalaḥ spanditumapi || iti ||

agastyasaṃhitāyāmapi vidyāvatīstutau(-)

yayā devyā virahitaḥ śivo'pi hi nirarthakaḥ |
namastasyai sumīnākṣyai devyai maṅgalamūrtaye || iti ||

iyaṃ māyāto vilakṣaṇā cidrūpā na jaḍasvabhāvā | taduktaṃ 
sūtasaṃhitāyām(-)

sadākārā parānandā saṃsārocchedakāriṇī |
sā śivā paramā devī śivābhinnā śivaṅkarī |
śivābhinnā tayā hīnaḥ śivo'pi hi nirarthakaḥ || iti ||

<p. 188>

nanu mukhyaṃ śive sṛṣṭyādikartṛtvaṃ tannirvāhakatvamātraṃ yadi śakteḥ 
tarhi mukhyajagatkartṛtvaniyantṛtvādi śivaniṣṭham | iyaṃ ca sahakāriṇī | tathā 
sati mukhyatvāt śivaḥ evopāsyaḥ na śaktiḥ iti cet śṛṇu | kṣityādikāryajātaṃ 
kāraṇamantareṇānupapannam ityanupapattyaiva hi śivasya śaktervā kalpanam | na 
hi carmacakṣuṣā śaktiṃ śivaṃ vā paśyāmaḥ | evaṃ kalpayitumārambhe atra 
vedāntinaḥ parasya cidrūpasya brahmaṇaḥ dharmo māyā saivāvidyā 
jaḍasvabhāvā saiva jagadupādānaṃ paraṃ brahma tu vivartopādānaṃ ata eva 
jaḍopādānatvāt jagadapi jaḍasvabhāvaṃ māyopādānatvāt mithyātvaṃ ca iti 
prāhuḥ | taṃ pakṣaṃ tāntrikāḥ na kṣamante | tathā hi yā māyā'vidyetyucyate 
sā ciddharmo'nyadharmo vā ādye dharmadharmiṇorabhedasya 
vedāntināmapyanumatatvena ciddharmasya jaḍatvānupapattiḥ | aciddharmatve 
advaitahāniḥ māyāṃ tu prakṛtiṃ vidyānmāyinaṃ tu maheśvaram iti 
pramāṇavirodhaśca | ataḥ gatyabhāvāt sā māyā ciddharma ityavaśyaṃ 
vācyam | tathā sati tasyā jaḍatvaṃ dūrato nirastam | na ca cidatiriktā śaktiḥ nāsti 
iti vācyam vayamapi tamevārthaṃ brūmaḥ | paraṃ tu 
pṛthivīvyatiriktagandhābhāve'pi dharmo dharmī iti vyavahārānurodhena 
īṣadbhedaḥ kalpyate evaṃ dvayoḥ cidrūpatve'pi īṣadbhedo vyavahārārthaṃ 
kalpyaḥ | evaṃ ca jagadupādānatvaṃ dvayorapi na sambhavati jaḍasvabhāvatvāt 
jagataḥ | na hi prakāśāt tamo bhavitumarhati | ataḥ citi jagat sūkṣmarūpeṇa bīje 
vaṭavṛkṣavat sarvadā astyeva | 
tadavayavaśaithilyapūrvakavistārasaṅkocakartṛtvameva citi na tu tadupādānatvaṃ 
yathā vaṇijaḥ prabhāte krayyavastūnāṃ prasāraṇaṃ rātrau saṅkocaḥ 
tādṛśaṃ kartṛtvaṃ citaḥ | tatsahakāriṇī cicchaktiḥ ||

nanu cidatiriktā īṣadbhedavatī tanniṣṭhakartṛtvanirvāhikā śaktiḥ 
kimityaṅgīkriyate cityeva tatkartṛtvamāstām | anyathā tulyayuktyā kulālādiṣvapi 
ghaṭakartṛtvāśrayā ekā śaktiḥ sidhyet iti cet na śrutismṛtilokavyavahārāṇāṃ 
sattvāt | parā'sya śaktirvividhaiva śrūyate iti śrutiḥ | devībhāgavate'pi(-)

śaktiḥ karoti brahmāṇḍaṃ sā vai pālayate'khilam |
icchayā saṃharatyeṣā jagadetaccarācaram ||
na viṣṇurna haraḥ śakro na brahmā na ca pāvakaḥ |
na sūryo varuṇaḥ śaktāḥ sve sve kārye kathaṃcana ||
tayā yuktā hi kurvanti svāni kāryāṇi te surāḥ |
kāraṇaṃ saiva (")naiva(-)śrī(.") kāryeṣu pratyakṣeṇāvagamyate ||

<p. 189>

vastujālaṃ śaktihīnaṃ (")hīnaiḥ(-)śrī(.") śaktaṃ kartuṃ na kiñcana |
śaktaṃ tu parameśāni śaktyā yuktaṃ yadā bhavet ||

iti bahuvistareṇa | ā gopālaṅganamāca (")atrāśuddhāni akṣarāṇi saṃśodhya 
vācyāni |(") paṇḍitam idaṃ kāryaṃ kartuṃ mama śaktirasti mama śaktirnāsti iti 
vyavaharantyavivādena | tasmāt bahupramāṇasiddhā śaktiḥ tannirvāhyaṃ 
jagadapi śivakukṣau sadā sūkṣmarūpeṇāstyeva ||

atha vā cito yā śaktiḥ tatpariṇāmarūpaṃ jagat | taduktaṃ vāsiṣṭhe(-)

cidvilāsaḥ prapañco'yaṃ sakhe (")sa ca te(-)śrī(.") te duḥkhadaḥ katham || iti ||

etena cicchaktyoḥ īṣadbhedāṅgīkārāt cito nirvikāratvabodhakaśrutiraviruddhā 
atyantabhedānaṅgīkārāt advaitapratipādakaśrutayo'pyabādhitāḥ | etādṛśī 
śaktiḥ vastumātre anubhūyate kāryotpattyanantaraṃ na tataḥ prāk | 
amumevārthaṃ bhūtapañcakaviveke śrīvidyāraṇyasvāmicaraṇāḥ apyāhuḥ(-)

nistattvā kāryagamyā'sya śaktirmāyā'gniśaktivat | 
na hi śaktiṃ kvacit kaścit budhyate kāryataḥ purā || iti ||

evaṃ śivaniṣṭhāyāṃ tadabhinnāyāṃ taddharmarūpāyāṃ 
tanniṣṭhakartṛtvanirvāhikāyāṃ siddhāyāṃ saivopāsyā | na cidrūpaḥ śivaḥ 
tasyānupāsyatvāt (")tasya nāma śaktyanavachinnasya brahmaṇaḥ ityarthaḥ |(") 
upāsanā nāma upāsyaniṣṭhaguṇanāmakīrtanam | śaktirahite kevale 
guṇābhāvāt nirguṇasya dhyānastutikīrtanādi kathaṃ bhavet | taduktaṃ 
yoginītantre(-)

śaktyā vinā śive sūkṣme nāma dhāma na vidyate || iti ||

yato vāco nivartante aprāpya manasā saha || iti śrutiśca |

neti neti iti sarvaniṣedhaśeṣatvenaiva tasya jñeyatvāt 
kevalaśivaviṣayakajñānasyopāsanādikarmavirodhitvena 
tādṛśacaramavṛtterupāsanāsādhyatvāt kevalaśivastvanupāsyaḥ | taduktaṃ 
devībhāgavate'pi(-)

śivo'pi śavatāṃ yātaḥ kuṇḍalinyā vivarjitaḥ || iti ||

yoginītantre'pi(-)

yajjñāne'pi mahādevi śarma varma na kiṃcana || iti ||

kiṃ ca yathā kathaṃcit valayākāreṇa manasaḥ nirākāragrahaṇārthaṃ 
preraṇe'pi śubhāśubhadharmahīnatvāt kṣaṇamātramapi na sthātumarhati | 
taduktaṃ śrībhagavadgītāyām(-)

<p. 190>

kleśo'dhikatarasteṣāmavyaktāsaktacetasām || iti ||

atastasyaiva manasaḥ sthairyārthaṃ kiñcidrūpaṃ kalpanīyam | yacca 
parabrahmaṇi kalpitaṃ rūpaṃ nāmadhāmasahitaṃ tadeva śaktipadavācyam | 
tadapyuktaṃ bhāgavate(-)

evaṃ sarvagatā śaktiḥ sā brahmeti vivicyate |
saguṇā nirguṇā ceti dvidhoktā sā manīṣibhiḥ |
saguṇā rāgibhiḥ sevyā nirguṇā tu virāgibhiḥ |
dharmārthakāmamokṣāṇāṃ svāminī sā nirākulā ||
dadāti vāñchitānarthānarcitā vidhipūrvakam || iti ||

evamuktapramāṇayuktikalāpaiḥ upāsyā parā śaktiḥ | paraśivaśca nirguṇaḥ | 
tadviṣayiṇī vṛttistu paramapuruṣārtharūpatvāt ambopāsanāsādhyetyupapannaṃ 
siṃhāsaneśvarītvaṃ sāmrājñītvam ||

nirguṇa eva śivaḥ yaḥ bahu syāṃ prajāyeya iti icchāśaktyā yuktaḥ 
sṛṣṭhyunmukhaḥ sa eva śaktipadavācyaḥ śiva eva śaktirūpeṇopāsyaśceti 
tattvamavagantavyam ||

yā īdṛśī tasyāḥ pradhānasacivapadam atra sacivapadaṃ 
sācivyarūpadharmaparaṃ tasya padaṃ āśrayaḥ śyāmeti | tasyāḥ yaḥ kramaḥ 
tasya yā vimṛṣṭiḥ anusaraṇaṃ tat sadā kāryam | atra sadetyanena yāvajjīvaṃ 
prāptau yathā agnihotravidheḥ yāvajjīvaṃ prāptau sāyaṃ juhoti prātarjuhoti iti 
vākyāntareṇa saṅkocaḥ tathā asyā eva śyāmāyāḥ prakaraṇe agre evaṃ 
nityasaparyāṃ kurvan lakṣajapaṃ japtvā iti vākyena (")idamatraiva ṣaṣṭhakhaṇḍe(-)
37 mūlasūtresti |(") lakṣajapaparyantaṃ sakṛtpūjā kāryā na tu taduttaramiti 
saṅkocaḥ || 1 ||

śyāmāyāḥ upāsyatopapattiḥ 

nanu yā sāmrājñī sarvaniyantrī svatantrā tāṃ parityajya kiṃ tadanuvartinyāḥ 
śyāmāyāḥ upāsanenetyāśaṅkāyāṃ tadupāsanāmupapādayiṣyan 
prathamaṃ lokadṛṣṭāntena dṛḍhayati(-)

pradhānadvārā rājaprasādanaṃ hi nyāyyam || 2 ||

loke rājadarśanotsukāḥ ādau pradhānamupasevya tadvārā rājadarśanaṃ 
gṛhṇanti | tena phalaṃ satvaraṃ anāyāsena bhavatīti dṛṣṭaṃ loke | tadvadatrāpi 
prathamaṃ tatpradhānabhūtāyāḥ śyāmāyāḥ prathamamupāsanaṃ 
nyāyyamiti bhāvaḥ | dvāretyanena pradhānopāsanapūrvavṛttitvaṃ sūcitaṃ 
nyāyyam ityanena atyantamanāvaśyakatā'pi sūcitā | paraṃ tu yaḥ ko'pi 
samarthaḥ sacivādīnanādṛtya svayameva rājakṛpāṃ sampādya tasmāt phalaṃ 
sampādayatītyayamapi pakṣo loke kvacidasti | tathā'pi pradhānadvārā 
rājaprasādanaṃ nyāyyaṃ varamityarthaḥ | ayaṃ bhāvaḥ yaśca 
pradhānadevatākṛpāṃ sākṣāt sampādayitumasamarthaḥ 

<p. 191>

saḥ prathamaṃ dīkṣāṃ sampādya śrīgaṇapatyupāstiṃ kṛtvā tataḥ 
śyāmopāstiṃ vārāhyupāstiṃ paropāstiṃ ca vidhāya tāsāṃ kṛpāṃ 
sampādya paścāt śrīlalitopāstiṃ ārabheta | samarthastu dīkṣottaraṃ 
gaṇapatyupāstyanantaraṃ śrīlalitākramamārabheta | atirātre ṣoḍaśinaṃ 
gṛhṇāti nātirātre ṣoḍaśinaṃ gṛhṇāti itivadvikalpaḥ iti tattvam | 
phalādhikyakāmaḥ uktakrameṇa lalitopāstiṃ kuryāt | nyunaphalakāmaḥ 
gaṇapatyupāstyanantaraṃ lalitopāstiṃ kuryāt iti vyavasthā || 2 ||

prātaḥkṛtyaṃ sandhyā'ntam

evamupāstyadhikāriṇaṃ pradarśya upāstiprakaraṇaṃ vaktuṃ prakramate(-)

brāhme muhūrte cotthāya śayane sthitvaiva śrīpādukāṃ praṇamya 
prāṇānāyamya mūlādidvādaśāntaparyantaṃ jvalantīṃ parasaṃvidaṃ 
vicintya manasā mūlaṃ triśo japtvā bahirnirgatya 
vimuktamalamūtrodantadhāvanajihvāgharṣaṇakaphavimocananāsāśodhana(-)
viṃśatigaṇḍūṣān vidhāya || 3 ||

śrīpādukāṃ gurupādukām (")gurupādukāmityasya gurutrayapādukāmityarthe 
tātparyam |(") | prāṇāniti prāṇāyāmalakṣaṇamuktaṃ sanatkumāratantre(-)

prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kuryāt mūlena praṇavena vā |
atha vā mantrabījena yathoktavidhinā sudhīḥ ||
pūrayet ṣoḍaśabhirvāyuṃ kumbhayecca caturguṇaiḥ |
recayet kumbhakārdhena aśaktastatturīyataḥ ||
tadaśaktau taccaturthaiḥ syādevaṃ prāṇasaṃyamaḥ |
prāṇāyāmaṃ vinā naiva pūjanādiṣu yogyatā || iti ||

samayāṅkamātṛkāyām(-)

iḍayā pūrayedvāyuṃ sakṛdvai mūlavidyayā |
madhyanāḍyā kumbhayecca vedasaṅkhyā varānane ||
netrasaṅkhyākrameṇaiva recayet piṅgalā'dhvanā |
punaḥ punaḥ krameṇaiva yathā vāratrayaṃ bhavet || iti ||

dantadhāvanādīnāṃ smṛtiprāptānāmuktakramalābhārthaṃ pāṭhaḥ | ataḥ 
pāṭhakrameṇānuṣṭheyam | yadyapi prāṇāyāmaprakārastvagre (")agre 
nāmaitatkhaṇḍīya-9-sūtre-194-patre(-)ityarthaḥ |(") sūtre'pi vakṣyate tathā'pi 
vāyudhāraṇasamarthānāṃ vistṛtatayā pradarśanaṃ aśaktānāṃ sūtrasthaṃ 
jñeyam | viṃśatigaṇḍūṣānityantaḥ śeṣaḥ spaṣṭārthaḥ || 3 ||

<p. 192> 

mantrabhasmajalasnāneṣviṣṭaṃ vidhāya vastraṃ paridhāya || 4 ||

mantrasnānamuktaṃ tripurārṇave(-)

vastreṇārdreṇa cāṅgānāṃ kṛtvā proñchanamāditaḥ |
mūlaṃ japan saptadhā tu āpādatalamastakam ||
talābhyāṃ saṃspṛśet devi mantrasnānaṃ prakīrtitam |
etatsnānamaśaktasya vihitaṃ śuddhihetave || iti ||

bhasmasnānamuktaṃ śivarahasye(-)

śuddhaṃ bhasma kare dhṛtvā mūlamaṣṭaśataṃ japet |
sarvāṅgeṣvanulepena bhasmasnānamudāhṛtam || iti ||

jalasnānaṃ śrīlalitāprakaraṇoktam (")idaṃ śrīkrame 3 khaṇḍe-88-patre-4 
mūlasūtre bhāṣye ca uktam |(") | atra mukhyaṃ jalasnānaṃ jalādyalābhe 
karmakāle prāpte aśaktau gurukāryārthaṃ kṣipraṃ gacchatā ca mantrasnānādi 
kāryam | taduktaṃ nāradapāñcarātre atha māntraṃ śubhaṃ śṛṇu 
ityupakramya 

toyābhāve tu samaye durgamārge'vasīdataḥ |
gamane kṣiprasiddhyarthaṃ gurukāryeṣvatandritaḥ |
mantrasnānaṃ prakurvīta(..............) iti ||

ito'pi laghusnānaṃ vīratantre(-)

maṇibandhādadhohastau pādau gulphau tathā'nanam |
śodhayet snānametat syāt pañcāṅgaṃ śuddhidāyakam || iti ||

imāni snānāni śaktitāratamyāt aśucitvatāratamyācca vyavasthitāni jñeyāni | 
anyānyapi mānasikadhyānasnānādīni (")jñānasnānādīnītyarthaḥ |(") 
granthavistarabhayāt neha likhitāni tantrāntarāt draṣṭavyāni || 4 || 

sandhyāṃ vidhatte(-)

sandhyāmupāsya savitṛmaṇḍale devīṃ sāvaraṇāṃ vicintya mūlena trirarghyaṃ 
dattvā yathāśakti santarpya || 5 ||

sandhyāmitīdamutpattivākyaṃ atra kathambhāvākāṅkṣāyāmāha 
savitṛmaṇḍale ityārabhya santarpyetyantena | tarpaṇamapi mūlamuccārya 
śrīśyāmāṃ tarpayāmi svāhā iti mantreṇa | mālinītantre 
tarpaṇamantroddhārasya mūlānte mālinīṃ procya tarpayāmyagnivallabhām iti 
lekhāt | prakṛte 

<p. 193>

mantrasyānuktatvāt mantrākāṅkṣāyāḥ tantrāntarasthamantrādaraḥ | 
yathāśakti ityanena saṅkhyāyāḥ tarpaṇavṛtteranaṅgatvaṃ sūcitam ||

atra nibandhakāraḥ etadantamāhnikaṃ svatantropāstau puraścaraṇakāle ca na tu 
śrīkramāṅgatvena sahānuṣṭhāne iti jagau | tanna | 
pūrvoktalaukikanyāyadṛṣṭāntena lalitopāsteḥ pūrvaṃ śyāmopāstiḥ sidhyati | 
tadanuṣṭhānamaryādā lakṣajapaparyantamiti agrimavākyena (")agrimavākyena 
nāma(-)etatkhaṇḍīya-37-sūtrasthavākyena(-)ityartho jñeyaḥ |(") vyavasthitam | itthaṃ 
ca śaṅgītamātṛkāmiṣṭvā saṃvitsāmrājñīm (ityādi) kolamukhīṃ varivasyeta 
ityagrimasūtre (")agrimasūtre nāma(-)agratana-7-
khaṇḍīyavārāhīkramasthaprathamasūtragatasaṅgītamātṛkāmiṣṭvā 
ityetadvākyāntastha ktvā pratyayena(-)iti(-)jñeyam |(") ktvāpratyayena 
vārāhyupāstipūrvavṛttitvaṃ spaṣṭam | itthaṃ sati 
kolamukhīvarivasyāpūrvakālasambandhinī yā śyāmāvarivasyā japaśca sa 
sarvo'pi śrīlalitākramārambhāṅgabhūtaḥ nānyo lalitākrameṇa saha 
anuṣṭīyamānaḥ śyāmākramagandho'pi sūtre pratīyate | evaṃ sati 
puraścaraṇādikāle āhnikam anyatra neti kiṃ pramāṇamanusṛtya lilekha | 
tadabhiprāyaṃ sa eva jānāti | vastuno lalitāprayogānaṅgabhūtaśyāmākramaḥ 
sūtre aprasiddhaḥ | aṅgabhūtakramamuddiśyāhnikapāṭhāt aṅgabhūte'pi 
krame sarvamāhnikaṃ niśśaṅkaṃ pravartata eva || 5 ||

yāgagṛhapraveśādi prāṇāyāmāntaṃ kṛtyam

sandhyāmuktvā pūjāṃ vaktumārabhate(-)

yāgagṛhaṃ praviśyāsane ādhāraśaktikamalāsanāya nama ityupaviśya || 6 ||

atha prāṇāyāmaprakāramāha(-)

samastaprakaṭaguptasiddhayoginīcakraśrīpādukābhyo (")cakra iti nāsti(-)a(.") nama iti 
śirasyañjalimādhāya svagurupādukāpūjāṃ (")gaṇapatipūjāṃ ca(-)śrī(.") ca 
vidhāya || 7 ||

svagurupādukāpūjāṃ vidhāya | śyāmāgurupādukā vakṣyamāṇā 
(")etatkhaṇḍīya 32 sūtre-203-patre ||(") | tena svamūrdhni puṣpākṣatān kṣipet || 7 ||

aiṃ hraḥ astrāya phaṭ ityastramantreṇa aṅguṣṭhādikaniṣṭhāntaṃ karatalayoḥ 
kūrparayoḥ dehe ca vyāpakatvena vinyasya || 8 ||

<p. 194>

vyāpakatvalakṣaṇaṃ pūrvamuktam (")pūrvaṃ nāma-2-khaṇḍe 
gaṇanāyakapaddhatau 4 sūtrabhāṣye-75-patre(-)iti jñeyam |(") | aṅgulyādibhedena 
mantrāvṛttiḥ pratipradhānamiti nyāyāt || 8 ||

yaṃ iti vāyuṃ piṅgalayā'kṛṣya dehamupaviśoṣya raṃ iti vāyumākṛṣya 
dehaṃ dagdhvā vaṃ iti vāyumākṛṣyamṛtena dagdhadehabhasma siktvā laṃ iti 
vāyumākṛṣya dṛḍhaṃ vidhāya haṃsa iti vāyumākṛṣya śivacaitanya mutpādya 
|| 9 || 

yaṃ ityasya viśoṣya ityanenānvayaḥ vāyubījatve śoṣaṇakāyakṣamatvāt | 
śoṣaṇaṃ nāma jalāṃśasyākarṣaṇam | vāyvākarṣaṇaṃ tu tūṣṇīmeva | 
iḍāpiṅgale nāradīye nirūpite(-)

piṅgalā vāmanāsā syādiḍā taditarā smṛtā || iti ||

raṃ iti vahnibījena dehadāhaḥ | amṛtena amṛtabījena vaṃ ityanena 
dagdhabhasmasecanaṃ punaḥ śarīrotpādanārtham | laṃ iti pārthivabījena 
siktabhasmani kāṭhinyasampādanam | tataḥ tasmin haṃsaḥ iti mantreṇa 
śivacaitanyasampādanam ||

etāvatparyantaṃ bhūtaśuddhiṃ vidhāya śrīkramoktāṃ prāṇapratiṣṭhāṃ ca 
kuryāt || 9 ||

mūlamekaśa uccārya vāyumākṛṣya triśaḥ uccārya kumbhayitvā sakṛduccārya 
recayet | evaṃ recakapūrakakumbhakaṃ tridhā saptadhā daśadhā ṣoḍaśadhā 
vā viracya tejomayatanuḥ || 10 ||

ekaśaḥ ekavāram | evamagre'pi recakapūrakakumbhakamiti dvandvasamāsāt 
sāhityalābhaḥ | atra yadyapi pūrakaṃ madhye patitaṃ recakaṃ prathamaṃ 
kumbhakaṃ caramam iti vyutkramaḥ tathā'pi nātra krame tātparyaṃ kiṃtu 
sāhitye | kramastu pūrvapāṭhānusāreṇaiva | tridhetyārabhya saṅkhyāvṛddhau 
phalādhikyam | tejomayatanuḥ ityanena prāṇāyāmakriyāyāḥ pāpaśodhakatvaṃ 
sūcitam || 10 ||

ṣaḍaṅgādinyāsapañcakam

atha nyāsajālaṃ vadati(-)

ṣaḍaṅgaṃ bālāsahitāṃ mātṛkāṃ mūlahṛnmukheṣu ratiprītimanobhavān 
vinyasya || 11 ||

<p. 195>

vinyasya iti sarvatrānuṣajya yojyam | tathā ca ṣaḍaṅgaṃ vinyasyetyarthaḥ | 
etanmantrasvarūpaṃ (")etadarthametatkhaṇḍasthapurastana-15-20-sūtre tadbhāṣye ca 
dṛśye |(") upariṣṭāt spaṣṭīkariṣyāmaḥ | ayameko nyāsaḥ | bālāsahitāṃ 
mātṛkāṃ vinyasya iti dvitīyo nyāsaḥ | mātṛkāṃ bahirmātṛkām | 
nyāsasthānāni tantrāntarādavagantavyāni | 
agrevakṣyamāṇatritārīkumārīkevalakumāryo (")ayaṃ tritārīkumārīmantraḥ 
pratyakṣaḥ atraiva khaṇḍe 20 sūtrabhāṣye spaṣṭaḥ | kumārīśabdena ca 
tryakṣaro bālāmantro jñeyaḥ | so'pi atraivādhaḥ tatrāpi ca spaṣṭaḥ |(") vikalpena 
prāptau tadbādhakaṃ kevalabālāsahitāmiti viśeṣaṇam | tena 
mātṛkānyāsamantre sadā bālāyoga eva anyatra vikalpena bālāyogaḥ | 
vyāsasthānānāṃ bahuprasiddhyā nātra lekhaḥ | mantrasvarūpaṃ ca aiṃ klīṃ 
sauḥ aṃ namaḥ | evamagre'pi | mūlaṃ mūlādhārasthānam | tadāditriṣu 
ratyāditrayaṃ vinyaset | ayaṃ tṛtīyo nyāsaḥ || 11 ||

mūlaṃ saptadaśadhā khaṇḍayitvā ṣaṭ brahmabile trīṇi lalāṭe catvāri 
bhrūmadhye dakṣavāmekṣaṇayoḥ ṣaṭ cāṣṭau saptāsye 
dakṣavāmaśrutikaṇṭheṣvekaikaṃ dakṣavāmāṃsayoraṣṭau ca daśa hṛdi daśa 
dakṣavāmastanayoraṣṭāvaṣṭau nava nābhau dviḥ svādhiṣṭhāne ṣaḍādhāra 
evaṃ vinyasya || 12 ||

khaṇḍayitvā vibhajya | vibhāgaprakāraṃ vibhaktakhaṇḍaiḥ 
kriyamāṇanyāsasthānāni cāha ṣaḍityādinā | ṣaḍityādisaṅkhyāvācakāni 
padāni mūlasthavarṇaparāṇi | ādimaṣaḍvarṇān namo'ntānuccārya 
brahmarandhre nyaset | evamagre'pi | dakṣavāmekṣaṇayoḥ ṣaṭ cāṣṭāvityatra 
dakṣanetre ṣaḍvarṇāḥ kramaprāptāḥ vāmanetre aṣṭau yathāsaṅkhya yojyam | 
evameva dakṣavāmāṃsayoḥ ityādau draṣṭavyam | sarvatra tritārīkumārīyogaḥ 
kāryaḥ | svādhiṣṭhānaṃ ṣaḍdalakamalaṃ guhyasthānastham | ādhāro 
mūlādhāraḥ sa (")etadādhārasvarūpajñānāya 88-patre śrī gaṇeśakrame-3-
sūtrabhāṣye tathā ca-111-patre(-)śrīkrame-28sūtrabhāṣyaṃ ca paśyantu |(") 
pūrvaṃ vyākhyātaḥ | ayaṃ caturtho nyāsaḥ || 12 ||

pañcamamāha(-)

punarādhārādibrahmabilaparyantaṃ saptadaśakhaṇḍānuktasthāneṣu vinyasya || 
13 ||

pūrvasmādvailakṣaṇyaṃ mūlādhārādisthānavaiparītyamātraṃ na 
(")khaṇḍakramaśca pūrvavat khaṇḍavaiparītyabodhakapramāṇābhāvāt(-)ba(.") tu 
saptadaśakhaṇḍavaiparītyaṃ pramāṇābhāvāt ||

nibandhakāraḥ khaṇḍavaiparītyaṃ lilekha | tasya pramāṇaṃ tadīyecchaiva na 
tvanyat | ayaṃ pañcamo nyāsaḥ || 13 ||

