cakramadhye iti āvāhyetyanenānvitam | śrī(0) ityārabhya ityantaḥ uktvetyapahāya 
mūrtikalpanamantraḥ | dvitīyaśrī(0) ityārabhya āvāhayāmītyantaḥ uktvāvarjam 
āvāhanamantraḥ | ṣoḍaśopacārāḥ sapramāṇaṃ dvitīyakhaṇḍe 
(")dvitīyakhaṇḍe-9 sūtrabhāṣye-82-patre(-)darśitā iti jñeyam |(") darśitāḥ | 
āśuśukṣaṇiḥ agniḥ tryakṣaḥ īśānaḥ rakṣaḥ nir(-)ṛtiḥ prabhañjano vāyuḥ 
eṣāṃ dikṣu uktakrameṇa vidikṣviti bhāvaḥ | devyā maulau madhye ityarthaḥ | 
prāgādidikṣu aṅgadevyaḥ ṣaḍaṅgadevyaḥ pūjyāḥ | tāsāṃ mantrān vaktuṃ 
prakramate tanmantrā iti | mūlamantreṇa sarvajanetyārabhya ṣaṭ khaṇḍāni 
ṣaḍaṅgadevīnāṃ mantrā bodhyāḥ | tatraikaikaṃ kūṭaṃ kiyadvarṇakamiti 
jijñāsāyāmāha aṣṭāviti | sarvajanetyādiṣaṭkhaṇḍāni 
kramādaṣṭādisaṅkhyākānītyarthaḥ prathamakhaṇḍam aṣṭavarṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ 
saptavarṇaṃ tṛtīyam ekādaśavarṇaṃ caturthapañcamau daśavarṇau ṣaṣṭham 
aṣṭāviṃśativarṇakamiti phalitam | na kevalaṃ 
mūlamantraghaṭakoktasaṅkhyākavarṇāḥ eva mantrasvarūpam anye'pi varṇā 
yojyāḥ ityāha tritārīkumārīvācaḥ ādau eṣāṃ khaṇḍānāṃ jātiḥ hṛdayāya 
śirase(0) ityādiḥ taiḥ sahitāḥ sajātayaḥ sāmānyamanavo namaḥ svāhā 
vaṣaḍityādayaḥ taiḥ krameṇa yuktāḥ | itthaṃ ca mantrasvarūpam aiṃ hrīṃ 
śrīṃ aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ aiṃ sarvajanamanohāri hṛdayāya namaḥ | uktabījāni aiṃ(0) 
ityādīni sapta ādau sarvatra yojyāni | 7 sarvamukharañjini śirase svāhā | 7 klīṃ 
hrīṃ śrīṃ sarvarājavaśaṅkari śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | 7 sarvastrīpuruṣavaśaṅkari 
kavacāya huṃ | 7 sarvaduṣṭamṛgavaśaṅkari netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | 7 
sarvasattvavaśaṅkari sarvalokavaśaṅkari amukaṃ me vaśamānaya svāhā | sauḥ 
klīṃ aiṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ astrāya phaṭ iti mantrasvarūpam | yadyapi mantre 
trayastriṃśadvarṇāḥ dṛśyante sūtroktāṣṭāviṃśatisaṅkhyayā virudhyante 
tathā'pi svāhā'ntāḥ saptaviṃśativarṇāḥ agrimaṣaḍbījāni militvā 
śrīṣoḍaśākṣaryāṃ praviṣṭapañcadaśavarṇātmakakūṭatraye 
ekaikakūṭasyaikaikavarṇatvavat ṣaṇṇāṃ varṇānāmaikavarṇatvam | itthaṃ ca 
aṣṭāviṃśatisaṅkhyopapannā ||

<p. 201>

nibandhakāraḥ svāhā'ntaṃ khaṇḍaṃ cakāra tathā saptaviṃśativarṇātmake 
uktagaterapyabhāvaḥ || 20 ||

āvaraṇapūjā

paścādāvaraṇapūjāṃ kuryāt || 21 ||

paścāditīdaṃ sūtraṃ vyartham eva dṛśyate tathā'pi na tathā mantavyam | tathā 
hi idam āvaraṇapūjotpattivākyam agrimavākyāni 
taditikartavyatāprapañcarūpāṇi somena yajeta aindravāyavaṃ gṛhṇāti itivat | 
etena ekavidhivihitatvena ekapadārtharūpatvāt madhye 
āvaraṇāvayavaikadevatālope'pi punaḥ sarvānuṣṭhānaṃ siddham || 21 ||

atha sarvopayoginīṃ kāṃcit paribhāṣāmāha(-)

sarvacakradevatā'rcanāni vāmakarāṅguṣṭhānāmikāsandaṣṭadvitīyaśakala 
gṛhītaśrīpātraprathamabindusahapatitaiḥ dakṣakarākṣatapuṣpakṣepaiḥ kuryāt || 
22 ||

sarvacakradevatāḥ gaṇapatyādiparā'ntāḥ sāmānyapaddhatyā yakṣyamāṇā 
anyāśca | śrīpātraṃ viśeṣārghyapātram | sahapatitairityanena 
bindupuṣpākṣatayoḥ patanam ekakāle iti sūcitam || 22 ||

prathamāvaraṇadevatāḥ tatsthānaṃ cāha(-)

trikoṇe ratiprītimanobhavān || 23 ||

trikoṇe trikoṇakoṇeṣvityarthaḥ | atra kramasyānuktatvāt 
svāgrādiprādakṣiṇyakramaḥ | yadvā āgneyakoṇe tataḥ paścimakoṇe tata 
aiśāne tenodagapavargalābhaḥ | iti prathamāvaraṇam || 23 ||

dvitīyāvaraṇapūjāsthānādikaṃ darśayati(-)

pañcāramūle pura ādikrameṇa drāṃ drāvaṇabāṇāya drīṃ 
śoṣaṇabāṇāyaklīṃ bandhanabāṇāya blūṃ mohanabāṇāya saḥ 
unmādanabāṇāya namaḥ iti tadagre māyākāmavāgblūṃ strīmupajuṣṭāḥ 
kāmamanmathakandarpamakaraketanamanobhavāḥ || 24 ||

namaḥ iti sarvamantreṣvanuṣajyate | puraḥ prācī | mūle pañcārakoṇamūle | 
tadagre iti pañcārakoṇāgreṣvityarthaḥ | māyā'dipañcakaiḥ krameṇa yuktāḥ 
kāmādayaḥ pūjyā ityarthaḥ | mantrasvarūpaṃ tu hrīṃ kāmaśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi | evamagre'pi | pūrvavat caturthyantanamo'ntarahitaṃ jñeyam | iti 
dvitīyāvaraṇam || 24 || 

<p. 202>

tṛtīyāvaraṇapūjādeśādīnāha(-)

aṣṭadalamūle brāhmī māheśvarī kaumārī vaiṣṇavī vārāhī māhendrī 
cāmuṇḍā caṇḍikāḥ sendusvarayugmāntyādayaḥ pūjyāḥ | tadagre 
lakṣmīsarasvatī rati prīti kīrti śānti puṣṭi tuṣṭayaḥ || 26 ||

indunā anusvāreṇa sahitāḥ ye svarayugmeṣu aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ uṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ṝṃ 
ḷṃ ḹṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ auṃ aṃ aḥ ityaṣṭasu antyāḥ āṃ īṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ḹṃ aiṃ 
auṃ aḥ ityaṣṭau varṇāḥ ādau ebhiḥ krameṇa yuktā brāhmyādayaḥ pūjyāḥ | 
mantrasvarūpam āṃ brāhmīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti | evamagre'pi | tadagre 
aṣṭadalāgre ityarthaḥ | jātāvekavacanam | pūjyā ityasyānuṣaṅgaḥ | iti 
tṛtīyāvaraṇam || 25 ||

caturthāvaraṇapūjāsthānānyāha(-) 

ṣoḍaśadale vāmā jyeṣṭhā raudrī śānti śraddhā sarasvatī kriyāśaktilakṣmī(-)
sṛṣṭi mohinī pramathinī āśvāsinī vīcī vidyunmālinī surānandā 
nāgabuddhikāḥ || 25 ||

atra kriyāśaktiḥ vidyunmālinī surānandā ityekaikā devatā | śeṣā devatāḥ 
spaṣṭāḥ | kramasyānuktatvāt devyagradalamārabhya prādakṣiṇyena | iti 
caturthāvaraṇam || 26 ||

pañcamāvaraṇadeśādīnāha(-)

aṣṭadale asitāṅga ruru caṇḍa krodhana unmatta kapāla bhīṣaṇa saṃhārāḥ 
sadaṇḍisvarayugmādisaṃyuktā bhairavāntāśca bhāvanīyāḥ || 27 ||

sadaṇḍītyatra daṇḍī anusvāraḥ daṇḍī pañcadaśaḥ śūnyaḥ iti medinīkośāt | 
anusvāreṇa sahitāḥ ye pūrvoktasvarayugmādayaḥ aṃ iṃ uṃ(0) ityādayaḥ ādau 
taiḥ yuktāḥ bhairavāntāśca ye mantrāḥ taiḥ pūjyāḥ ityarthaḥ | yathā aṃ 
asitāṅgabhairavaśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi | evamevāgrimasaptamantrāḥ ūhyāḥ 
| iti pañcamāvaraṇam || 27 ||

ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇadevatāmantrādīnāha(-)

caturdalaṃ māyuktataṅgī siddhalakṣmīśca mahāmāyuktataṅgī 
mahāsiddhalakṣmīśca || 28 ||

ubhayatra yukteti jñeyam | tathā ca mātaṅgī mahāmātaṅgīti siddham | śeṣaṃ 
spaṣṭam | mātaṅgī siddhalakṣmī mahāmātaṅgī mahāsiddhalakṣmyaḥ catasraḥ 
pūjyāḥ iti vivekaḥ | iti ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇam || 28 ||

<p. 203>

saptamāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

gaṃ gaṇapati duṃ durgā baṃ baṭuka kṣaṃ kṣetrapālāḥ caturasre sampūjyāḥ || 
29 ||

kramastu āgneyakoṇamārabhyaiśānāntakoṇeṣu | iti saptamāvaraṇam || 29 ||

āvaraṇabahirbhūtadevatāyajanam

śrīkrame tantrāntare āmnāyādidevatāvat 
āvaraṇabahirbhūtadevatāyajanamāha(-)

sāṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ iti prabhṛti vāstupataye brahmaṇe namaḥ iti paryantaṃ 
punastatraivābhyarcya || 30 ||

tatraiveti pūrvaṃ (")pūrvaṃ nāma 196-patre(-)anugana-14-sūtre yathoktaṃ tadvat |(") 
yatra nyāsottaraṃ pūjitāḥ tatra taireva mantraiḥ śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti 
sahitaiḥ | yathā sāṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ sarasvatīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti | 
evamagre'pi namaḥpadānte śrīpādukāmiti yogastu sūtre namo'ntānukaraṇena 
sūcitaḥ ||

nibandhe caturasre amīṣāṃ pūjanamuktaṃ tanmandam pūrvaṃ yatraikavāraṃ 
pūjitāḥ tatraiva punaḥ pūjyā iti svarasato lābhāt | loke'pi caitraṃ gṛhāt bahiḥ 
sthāpaya maitraṃ gṛhe bhojaya caitraṃ tatraiva bhojaya ityuktau kathamanubhavaḥ 
śrutuḥ iti sūkṣmabuddhyā vicārayantvāryāḥ || 30 ||

śyāmāvidyā'cāryapūjā

śrīśyāmāvidyāpravartakācāryapūjāṃ (")pravartakapūjā'cārya iti kośeṣu(.") 
teṣāṃ sthānaṃ cāha(-)

haṃsamūrtiparaprakāśapūrṇanityakaraṇasampradāyagurūṃścaturasrapūrva(-)
rekhāyāmabhyarcya || 31 ||

haṃsamūrtiśca paraprakāśaśca pūrṇaśca nityaśca karuṇaśca ye te 
sampradāyaguravaḥ tān caturasrapūrvarekhāyām udagapavargaṃ pūjayet iti 
tadarthaḥ | mantrasvarūpaṃ ca haṃsamūrtisampradāyaguruśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi | evamagrimamantreṣvapi sampradāyagurviti yojyam dvandvānte 
śrūyamāṇaṃ pratyekaṃ sarvatra sambadhyate iti nyāyāt || 31 ||

gurupādukāpūjā

evaṃ cakrapūjāṃ samāpya gurupādukāpūjāmāha(-)

svaśirasi sāmānyaviśeṣapāduke abhyarcayet || 32 ||

<p. 204>

sāmānyagurupādukāmantraḥ dīkṣākhaṇḍe (")dīkṣākhaṇḍe 66-patre sūtre 
tadbhāṣye ca |(") pratipāditaḥ | viśeṣagurupādukāmantraḥ caramakhaṇḍe 
śyāmāgurupāduketyuddhṛtaḥ | tābhyāṃ mantrābhyāṃ svaśirasi 
pādukādvayaṃ sampūjayet || 32 ||

devyāḥ punaḥpūjā

evaṃ gurupādukā'rcanāntam āvaraṇapūjāmuktvā 
pradhānadevatāpūjāpurarasaraṃ balipradānaṃ vivṛṇoti(-)

punardevīmabhyarcya bālayā ṣoḍaśopacārān vidhāya || 33 ||

mūleneti śeṣaḥ | punarityanena ṣaḍaṅgadevatābhyaḥ prāk 
pradhānadevyarcanaṃ jñāpitam | bālayeti spaṣṭam || 33 ||

balidānam 

balidānaprakāraṃ darśayati(-)

śuddhajalena trikoṇavṛttacaturasraṃ vidhāyārdhānnapūrṇasalilaṃ (")ya tasmin 
puṣpāṇi vikīryārdhā(-)śrī(.") sādimopādimamadhyamaṃ su(")sa(")gandhapuṣpaṃ 
sādhāraṃ pātraṃ nidhāya || 34 ||

śuddhajalena kalaśasthena | ardhānnapūrṇaṃ salilaṃ yasmiṃstat | ādimaṃ 
prathamam upādimaṃ dvitīyaṃ madhyamaṃ tṛtīyam ebhiḥ sahitaṃ 
sugandhapuṣpaṃ yatra īdṛśam ādhārasahitaṃ balipātraṃ nidhāya sthāpayitvā 
|| 34 ||

balidānamantrān taditikartavyatāṃ ca darśayati(-)

śrīmātamuktvā gīśvarīmaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa huṃ phaṭ svāhā 
śrīmātamuktvā gīśvari śaraṇāgataṃ māṃ trāhi trāhi huṃ phaṭ svāhā 
kṣetrapālanāthemaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa phaṭ svāhā iti mantratrayeṇa 
vāmapārṣṇighātakarāsphoṭasamudañcitavaktranārā ca mudrābhiḥ baliṃ 
pradāya || 35 ||

śrīmātamiti huṃphaṭ svāhetyantaṃ mantratrayam | nārācamudrā 
paramānandatantre(-)

vimuṣṭyaṅguṣṭhatarjanyāvūrdhvāṅguṣṭhāgratarjanī |
hastadvayagatā caivaṃ mudrā nārāca saṃjñitā || iti ||

ayamarthaḥ prathamaṃ hastadvaye muṣṭibhāvaṃ sampādya tasyā nirgate vimuṣṭī 
ye aṅguṣṭhatarjanyau tayormadhye ūrdhvāgramaṅguṣṭhaṃ prāgagrām 
ṛjurūpāṃ tarjanīṃ kuryāt | iyaṃ nārācamudretyarthaḥ || 35 ||

<p. 205>

suvāsinīpūjādi

evaṃ balipradānakramamuktvā suvāsinīpūjā'dikamupadiśati(-)

śyāmalāṃ śaktimāhūya bālayā tāmabhyarcya tasyā hasta ādimopādimau 
dattvā tattvaṃ śodhayitvā taccheṣamurarīkṛtya yogyaiḥ saha haviśśeṣaṃ 
svīkuryāt || 36 ||

abhyarcyeti viśeṣānukteḥ yathāvibhavam | tattvaṃ śodhayitvā ityanena 
tattvaśodhanamantrāḥ api prāptāḥ te ca mantrāścatvāraḥ prasiddhāḥ (")ime 
tattvamantrāḥ trayaḥ dīkṣāprakaraṇe-62-patre 39 sūtrabhāṣye santi caturthaśca 
mantra sarvatattvāyasvāheti jñeyaḥ || iti tattvamantracatuṣṭayaṃ jñeyam ||(") | taiḥ 
pātracatuṣṭayaṃ grāhayitvā caturthapātraṃ saśeṣaṃ grāhayitvā taccheṣaṃ 
svayam urarīkuryāt | haviśśeṣapratipattimāha yogyairiti | yogyapadārthaḥ 
śrīkramoktaśiṣṭapadena vyākhyātaḥ (")176-patre(-)pāścātyapañcamakhaṇḍīya 
22 sūtre tadbhāṣye ca(-)śiṣṭapadārthaḥ sphoṭitaḥ |(") | itthaṃ ca tasya prayojanaṃ 
taditikartavyatā tat sarvamapi śrīkramoktaprakāreṇāvagantavyaṃ bhavati || 36 ||

śyāmāpūjā'vadhiḥ

evaṃ saṅgītamātṛkāpūjā kiyatkālaṃ kartavyā ityavadhyākāṅkṣāyāṃ 
tadavadhimāha(-)

evaṃ nityasaparyāṃ kurvan lakṣajapaṃ japtvā taddaśāṃśakrameṇa ca 
homatarpaṇabrāhmaṇabhojanāni vidadhyāt || 37 ||

evam uktaprakāreṇa nityasaparyāṃ nityapūjām | atra kurvannityanena pūjanasya 
japāṅgatvaṃ gamayati | tathā hi yadi pūjā pradhānaṃ japaścāṅgaṃ syāt tarhi 
yāvatparyantaṃ lakṣajapaḥ tāvat pūjeti kathanaṃ virudhyeta | na hi 
aṅgānusāriṇī pradhānāvṛttiḥ loke vede ca dṛṣṭā | yāvat bhaṭo dhāvati tāvat 
rājā dhāvati iti na hi brūte | yāvat rājā dhāvati tāvat bhaṭo dhāvati iti 
vyavahāro'sti | ato japaḥ pradhānaṃ tadavadhitvasya pūjāyāṃ kathanāt | ata eva 
japasamāptau pūjānivṛttiḥ | lakṣajapaṃ japtveti lakṣasaṅkhyāviśiṣṭajapo'nena 
vidhīyate | taddaśāṃśakrameṇa homo japadaśāṃśaṃ taddaṃśāṃśaṃ 
tarpaṇaṃ taddaśāṃśaṃ brāhmaṇabhojanamityarthaḥ || 37 ||

śyāmāmanujāpidharmāḥ

athaitanmanujāpidharmānāha(-)

etanmanujāpī na kadambaṃ chindyāt girā kālīti na vadet 
vīṇāveṇunartanagāyanagāthāgoṣṭhīṣu na parāṅmukho gacchet gāyakaṃ na 
nindyāt || 38 ||

<p. 206>

etanmanujāpī śyāmāmanujāpītyarthaḥ | ete dharmāḥ na japasamakālikāḥ kiṃ 
tu japamārabhya yāvajjīvaṃ tasmādagnicid varṣati na dhāvet itivat || 38 ||

lalitopāsakadharmāḥ

evaṃ śyāmopāsakānāṃ dharmānuktvā prasaṅgāt prādhānyācca 
lalitopāsakadharmānapyāha(-)

lalitopāsako nekṣukhaṇḍaṃ bhakṣayet na divā smared vārtālīṃ na jugupseta 
siddhadravyāṇi na kuryāt strīṣu niṣṭhuratāṃ vīrastriyaṃ na gacchet na taṃ 
hanyāt na taddravyamapaharet nātmecchayā 
mapañcakamurarīkuryātkulabhraṣṭaiḥ saha nāsīta na bahu pralapet yoṣitaṃ 
sambhāṣamāṇāmapratisambhāṣamāṇo na gacchet kulapustakāni gopāyet iti 
śivam || 39 ||

[iti(...)kalpasūtre śyāmākramo nāma ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||

ikṣukhaṇḍamityanena tadvikārāṇāṃ guḍaśarkarādīnām adoṣaḥ sūcitaḥ | 
vārtālīṃ vārāhīm | siddhadravyāṇi mapañcakarūpāṇi na 
jugupsetasvamanasā'pi na nindyāt | niṣṭhuratāṃ nāsikācchedanādi | 
vīrastriyamiti ṣaṣṭhītatpuruṣaḥ na karmadhārayaḥ | tathā sati agre na taṃ hanyāt 
ityatra puṃstvasyānanvayāpatteḥ | ato bādhakasattvāt laghorapi karmadhārayasya 
tyāgaḥ | vīrastriyam ityatra vīrapadārthaśca nirmūlaparāhatadvaitabhāvaḥ | 
taduktaṃ tantre(-)

ahami pralayaṃ kurvan idamaḥ pratiyoginaḥ |
saḥ vīra iti vijñeyaḥ svātmānandanimagnadhīḥ ||

taṃ vīram | taddravyaṃ vīradravyam | ātmecchayā svendriyatṛptaye urarīkuryāt 
svīkuryāt | kulabhraṣṭaiḥ prathamaṃ kulamārgamaṅgīkṛtya janmāntarāṃhasā 
tatrotpannāviśvāsāḥ santoye svīkṛtaṃ mārgaṃ parityajanti te kulabhraṣṭāḥ | 
taduktaṃ devībhāgavate(-)

kulamārgaṃ samāśritya janmāntarakṛtāṃhasā |
tanmārgaṃ tyajatā sākaṃ na tiṣṭhenna ca saṃvadet |
tato varaḥ paśurjñeyaḥ taṃ dṛṣṭvā'paḥ (")apsu saṃviśet śrī(.)

sūtrasyapunarāvṛttau śodhyaṃ sūcayitavyakam |
pariśiṣṭasthalaṃ caiva pūrṇamādyāprasādataḥ || [iti ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] || śrīḥ(-)
(") susaṃspṛśet || iti ||

na bahuvacanaṃ pralapet iti taiḥ sākameva | bahupadena svamārgaguptaye 
tajjanitānarthaparihārārthaṃ yāvadarthasambhāṣī bhavet iti jñāpitam | 
apratisambhāṣamāṇaḥ pratyuttaramadattvā | kulapustakāni kulaśāstrapustakāni | 
śivamityasya vyākhyānaṃ pūrvavat ||

[iti(...)kalpasūtravṛttau śyāmākramo nāmaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||

oṃ 

śrīmahātripurasundaryai namaḥ |

{śrīparaśurāmakalpasūtram 

rāmeśvarakṛtavṛttisahitam} |

paraśūjjvalahastābjo jaṭāmaṇḍalamaṇḍitaḥ | 
dadātu cirajīvitvaṃ prasannātmā bhṛgūdvahaḥ ||

[prathamaḥ khaṇḍaḥ(-)dīkṣāvidhiḥ] |

vṛttibhūmikā (")atra vṛttiśabdena etanmūlagranthasyopari 
saubhāgyodayanāmakaṃ vivaraṇaṃ jñeyam | 
etadattikārābhidhānavṛttiracanāsamayādijñānāya agre dvitīyapariśiṣṭe 1-
viṣayo dṛśyaḥ |(")

atra maṅgalam 

śrīvallabhāpayodharasaṃliptāleparañjitoraskam |
vande gajendravadanaṃ bālasahasrāṃśukoṭisacchāyam ||

yā paraśive sphurattā pūrṇā'hantāpadena saṃśliṣṭā |
dvaitaṃ bhāvaṃ prāptā paścādambāṃ parāmimāṃ kalaye || 

yā pañcapretasaṃsthā paraśivanilayapā śaktayaḥ kāmabuddhi(-)
karmādyā yanmayūkhāḥ samudayaparirakṣā'ntakartryo babhūvuḥ |

yā paśyantyādirūpā sakalajanavacojālamāviṣkaroti 
sā me vāgdevateyaṃ vilasatu vadane cittamālinyahantrī ||

śrīmadyaśovadambābhāsuravāmāṅkamajñatā'dripavim |
mama vidhisuṣirasaroruhakalpitanilayaṃ namāmi nāthendram ||

yo bhṛgavaṃśe bhūtvā kṣatraṃ jaghne trisaptakṛtvastam |
ṣaṣṭhaṃ śrīmadviṣṇoravatāraṃ naumi vīrendram || 

<p. 2>

subrahmaṇyaṃ ca pitaraṃ guruvāmbāṃ ca mātaram |
praṇamāmi phalāvāptyai tāveva śaraṇaṃ mama || 

vicārya nānātantrādīn mīmāṃsānyāyavistaram |
nānādeśasamānītapustakaiḥ pariśodhya ca ||

jāmadagnyena racitaṃ kalpasūtraṃ yathāmati |
vistārayati gūḍhārthaṃ śrīvidyopāstisiddhaye ||

rāmeśvaraḥ śrīlalitāpreritaḥ kāśyapodbhavaḥ ||

dīkṣā'dhikāraḥ 

iha khalu śrībhagavān śrīparaśurāmaḥ ādhunikeṣu mandamatiṣu kṛpāluḥ 
śrīśivanirmitānyasaṃkhyāni (")etāvatedaṃ pratīyate sarvatantragranthānāṃ 
kartā bhagavān śivaḥ iti(-)atra dvi(0) pariśiṣṭe-3 vi(-) dṛśyaḥ |(") tantrāṇi paryāloḍya 
sarvāṇyupasaṃhṛtya turīyapuruṣārthasādhanaṃ laghumadhvānaṃ darśayan 
pratijānīt(-)

athāto (")ito granthamārabhate bhagavān śrījāmadagnyo rāmaḥ(-)
taddhyānaprakāraḥ(-)tatpituḥ śrījamadagnimaharṣeḥ pūrvajanmakathā ca(-)dvi(0) 
pariśiṣṭe-2-viṣaye(-)dṛśyā |(") dīkṣāṃ (")ita ārabhya purastana-33 
sūtrabhāṣyāntaṃ yāvaddīkṣāvidhau jñātavyamasti dīkṣāprayogārambhastu(-)
34-sūtrādastīti jñeyam |(") vyākhyāsyāmaḥ || 1 ||

atha athaśabdaḥ maṅgaladyotakaḥ(,)

oṅkāraścāthaśabdaśca dvāvetau brahmaṇaḥ purā |
kaṇṭhaṃ bhittvā viniryātau tasmānmāṅgalikāvubhau || 

iti smaraṇāt | ataḥśabdaśca ānantaryadyotakaḥ | ānantaryasyāvadhyapekṣāyāṃ 
samīpavartitvāt maṅgalācaraṇaṃ nānātantrapariśodhanaṃ vā avadhitvena 
anveti | yadvā(-) athāta iti militvā ārambhadyotakaḥ athāto darśapūrṇamāsau 
vyākhyāsyāmaḥ ityāpastambasūtrabhāṣye athātaśśabdo'yaṃ 
prakaraṇārambhe prāyaḥ prayujyate vṛddhaiḥ | kvacidānantarye'pi yathā(-) ime 
bhṛgavo vyākhyātāḥ athātoṅgirasām ityādau | tathā na 
punarihānantaryamarthaḥ pūrvapravṛttasya kasya cidanantarasyānupalambhāt iti 
lekhāt | dīkṣāpadārthaṃ sūtrakāro'gre vivecayiṣyati | vyākhyāpadārthaśca 
nigūḍhābhiprāyakaśabdasya vivicya kathanam | prakṛte gūḍhārthānāṃ 
tantrāṇāmupasaṃhāreṇa vivicya kathanaṃ kalpasūtre iti lakṣaṇasamanvayaḥ | 
dīkṣāviṣayajñānānukūlaśabdaprayogakartā'hamiti 

<pa. 3>

phalito'rthaḥ | vyākhyāsyāmaḥ iti 
bahuvacanamupāsanāpravartakācāryānanyānapi saṃgrahītum | yathā loke 
gurutarakāryanirmāṇe vayaṃ kūrmaḥ ityanye'pi saṃgṛhyante tathā | etena 
dīkṣāvyākhyānamatikaṭhinamiti sūcitam | yadvā(-) asmado dvayośca ekatve dvitve 
ca vivakṣite asmado bahuvacanaṃ syāditi tadarthaḥ | tathā ca asmacchabdasya 
kartṛvācakasya bahuvacanāntatvāt tatsamānavacanatvopapattaye 
vyākhyāsyāmaḥ iti bahuvacanam || 

tantrāprāmāṇyaśaṃkānirāsaḥ 

nanu kalpasūtravyākhyānaṃ vaidikānāmayuktaṃ tasya tantreṣu parigaṇitatvena 
tantrāṇāṃ kevalalobhaikamūlatvenāprāmāṇyāt | taduktaṃ vārtike 
bhaṭṭapādaiḥ(-)

lobhādikāraṇaṃ cātra bahvevānyat pratīyate |
yasmin sannihite dṛṣṭe nāsti mūlāntarānumā ||

śākyādayaśca sarvatra kurvāṇā dharmadeśanām |
hetujālavinirmuktāṃ na kadācana kurvate ||

na ca tairvedamūlatvamucyate gautamādivat |
hetavaścābhidhīyante ye dharmāddūrataḥ sthitāḥ ||

eta eva ca te yeṣāṃ vāṅmātreṇāpi nārcanam |
pāṣaṇḍino'pi karmasthā haitukāścaita eva hi ||

iti | evaṃ yānyanyāni trayīvidbhiḥ na parigṛhītāni 
kiṃcittanmiśrakañcukachāyāpatitāni 
lokopasaṃgrahalābhapūjākhyātiprayojanaparāṇi 
trayīviparītāsaṃbaddhadṛṣṭalobhādipratyakṣānumānopamānārthā(-)
pattiyuktimūlopanibaddhāni 
sāṃkhyayogapāñcarātraśākyagranthaparigṛhītadharmādharmanibandhanāni 
viṣacikitsāvaśīkaraṇoccāṭanonmādanādisamarthāni 
kādācitkasiddhidarśanabalena 
ahiṃsāsatyavacanadamadānadayā'diśrutismṛtisaṃvādistokārthagandhavāsita(-)
jīvikāprāyārthāntaropadeśīni yāni 
mlecchācāramiśrakabhojanācaraṇanibandhanāni 
teṣāmevaitacchrutivirodhahetudarśanābhyāmanapekṣaṇīyatvaṃ pratipādyate iti 
ca granthena | evaṃ śrīsūtasaṃhitāyāṃ brahmagītādvitīyādhyāye'pi(-)

vedamārgamimaṃ muktvā mārgamanyaṃ samāśritaḥ |
hastasthaṃ pāyasaṃ tyaktvā lihet kūrparamātmanaḥ ||

vinā vedena jantūnāṃ muktirmārgāntareṇa cet |
tamasyapi vinā'lokaṃ te paśyanti ghaṭādikam || 

<p. 4>

tasmādvedodito hyarthaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ mayoditam |
anyena vedito hyarthaḥ na satyaḥ paramārthataḥ || iti ||

tatra tatraiva tarkāṃśca pravadanti yathābalam |
sarve vādāḥ śrutismṛtyorviruddhā iti me matiḥ || iti ||

yajñavaibhavakhaṇḍe ekacatvāriṃśe'dhyāye(-)

bahunā'tra kimuktena śrutismṛtyuditaṃ vinā |
yatkiṃcidapi kurvāṇaḥ pātakī syānna saṃśayaḥ || 

iti vaidikānyamārganindā śrūyate | agnipurāṇe'pi vedarāśinā sākaṃ 
nārakiṇāṃ saṃvāde(-)

tantradīkṣāmanuprāptāḥ lobhopahatacetasā |
tyaktvā vaidikamadhvānaṃ tena dahyāmahe vayam || iti ||

padmapurāṇe puṣkaramāhātmye(-)

ye ca pāṣaṇḍino loke tāntrikā nāstikāśca ye |
tairduṣprāpamidaṃ tīrtham(...................................) ||

iti tāntrikapuruṣanindayā tantrasyāśraddheyatvaṃ spaṣṭam | evamanyeṣvapi 
bahupurāṇeṣu tantranindāyāḥ bahulamupalambhāt | 
mapañcakādaravidhāyakaśāstrasya lobhaikamūlatvaṃ suspaṣṭam | 
visarjanīyavāsograhaṇaśāstrasya lobhaikamūlatvaṃ sādhitam | kimu 
mapañcakasevakasya lobhamūlatve pratirodhaḥ | tasmāt idaṃ śāstramāstikaiḥ na 
vyākhyeyam iti cet(-)maivam (")itastantraśāstraprāmāṇyasvīkaraṇaśāstrārthaḥ(") | 
kiṃ bhaṭṭapādānāṃ purāṇāni pādmādīni pramāṇatvena abhimatāni na vā (?) 
yadi pramāṇatvena abhimatāni tarhi teṣu tantraprāmāṇyaṃ bahuśaḥ 
adhikāriviśeṣaviṣaye śrūyate | tathāhi sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ 
brahmagītādvitīyādhyāye(-)

tathā'pi svapnadṛṣṭaṃ hi vastu svarganivāsinaḥ |
sūcakaṃ hi bhavatyeva jāgratsatyārthasiddhaye ||

tathaiva mārgāt saṃbhrāntā api vedoditasya tu |
arthasya prāptisiddhyarthā bhavantyeva na saṃśayaḥ ||

tasmādvedetarā mārgā naiva tyājyā nirūpaṇe || iti (")etāvatā 
vedavadvedetaradharmyamārgāśrayaṇamapyaśāstrīyaṃ neti sidhyati ||(") ||

<p. 5>

sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ śivamāhātmyakhaṇḍe pañcamādhyāye(-)

pūjā śakteḥ parāyāstu dvividhā parikīrtitā |
bāhyābhyantarabhedena bāhyā ca dvividhā matā ||

vaidikī tāntrikī ceti dvijendrāstāntrikī tu sā |
tāntrikasyaiva nānyasya vaidikī vaidikasya hi ||

itthaṃ samastadevānāṃ pūjā viprā vyavasthitā || iti ||

evaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ muktikhaṇḍe(-)

pāñcarātrāditantrāṇāṃ (")etena nāradapāñcarātrāditāntrikagranthānāṃ 
vedamūlatvaṃ tebhyaśca vaidikānāṃ 
vedāviruddhāṃśagrahaṇoktiścetyubhayamapi paraśivoditamiti sidhyati |(") 
vedamūlatvamāstike |
na hi svatantrāste tena bhrāntimūlā nirūpaṇe ||

tathā'pi yoṃ'śomārgāṇāṃ vedena na virudhyate |
soṃ'śaḥ pramāṇamityuktaṃ keṣāṃcidadhikāriṇām || iti 

tāntrikāṇāmahaṃ devi labhyo'smi vyavadhānataḥ |
labhyo vedaikaniṣṭhānāmahamavyavadhānataḥ || iti ca ||

evaṃ tatraiva yajñavaibhavakhaṇḍe viśe'dhyāye(-)

śaivāgamodito dharmo dvidhā pūrvamudīritaḥ |
adhaḥsrotodbhavastveka ūrdhvasrotodbhavo'paraḥ ||

adhaḥsrotodbhavāddharmādūrdhvasrotodbhavo varaḥ |
kāmikādiprabhedena sa bhinno'nekadhā dvijāḥ ||

adhaḥsrotodbhavo dharmo bahudhā bheditastathā |
ūrdhvasrotodbhavāddharmāt smārtā dharmā mahattarāḥ || iti 

tatraiva dvāviṃśe'dhyāye(-)

tasmānmārgāntarāṇāṃ tu pramāṇyaṃ vedavittamāḥ |
mukteranyatra nātraiva krameṇaivātra mānatā ||

ato vedāntamārgastho mahādevo'cireṇa tu |
muktiṃ dadāti nānyatra sthitaḥ so'pi krameṇa tu ||
dadāti paramāṃ muktimityeṣā śāśvatī śrutiḥ || iti ||

<p. 6>

tatraiva(-)

ato vedasthito martyo nānyamārgaṃ samāśrayet |
ato'dhikāribhedena mārgā mānaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||

tatraivaikasmin parivṛtte tatratyaślokāḥ(-)

īśvarasya svarūpe ca brandhahetau tathaiva ca |
jagataḥ kāraṇe muktau jñānādau ca tathaiva ca ||

mārgāṇāṃ ye viruddhāṃśā vedāntena vicakṣaṇāḥ |
te'pi mandamatīnāṃ ca mahāmohāvṛtātmanām ||

vāñchāmātrānuguṇyena (")idamatrāvadheyaṃ yat tantraśāstraṃ 
vedasiddhāntān kiyadāśrayatīti |(") pravṛttā na yathā'rthataḥ |
darśayitvā tṛṇaṃ martyo dhāvantīṃ gāṃ yathā'grahīt ||

darśayitvā tathā kṣudramiṣṭaṃ pūrvaṃ maheśvaraḥ |
paścāt pākānuguṇyena dadāti jñānamuttamam ||

tasmāduktena mārgeṇa śivena kathitā amī |
mārgā mānaṃ ca cāmānaṃ mṛṣāvādī kathaṃ śivaḥ || iti ||

tathā brahmāṇḍapurāṇe(-)

svamātṛjāravad gopyā vidyaiṣetyāgamā jaguḥ ||

ityāgamānāṃ pramāṇatvenopanyāsaḥ | tathā (")tāntrikasaraṇyā 
śāntikapauṣṭikakarmakaraṇopadeśaḥ tena phalaprāptiścātra nirūpiteti bodhyam 
||(") brahmottarakhaṇḍe pradoṣamāhātmye pradoṣapūjā tāntrikasaraṇyā 
brāhmaṇarājaputrayorupadiṣṭā | tena ca phalaprāptiriti itihāsaḥ suspaṣṭaṃ 
pratīyate | śrīmadbhāgavate gajendrastutau śarvāgamāmnāyamahārṇavāya iti | 
āgamāḥ pāñcarātrāditantrāṇi iti śrīdharasvāmivyākhyā | tathā 
brahmastutau 

rūpaṃ tathaitatpuruṣarṣabhejyaṃ śreyo'rthiṃbhirvaidikatāntrikeṇa || iti ||

tathā ekādaśaskandhe karabhojanopadeśe dvārapūjāvidhāne kalipūjāyāṃ ca 
vacanāni yathā(-)

yajante vedatantrābhyāṃ paraṃ jijñāsavo nṛpa |
nānātantravidhānena kalāvapi tathā śṛṇu || iti ||

nānātantravidhāneneti kalau tantramārgaprādhānyaṃ darśayatīti 
śrīdharasvāmivyākhyānam | evamekādaśaskandhe uddhavopadeśe'pi(-)

<p. 7>

vaidikastāntriko miśra iti me trividho makhaḥ || 27 a(.) 7 ślo(.)

iti vaidikatāntrikabhedena dviprakārapūjā śrībhagavatopadiṣṭā (")etāvatā 
bhagavatastāntrikyapi pūjā'bhimateti pramāṇīyate |(") sarvaiṃrupalabhyate | 
śrīmahābhārate arjunastutau(-)

āmnāyāgamavedyāya śuddhabuddhāya te namaḥ || iti ||

evamādīni tantraprāmāṇyapratipādakavacanāni sahasraśa upalabhyante | 
granthavistarabhayānneha prapañcyante | evaṃ 
yogamārgaprāmāṇyavyavasthāpakāni vacanāni śrīmanmahābhārate 
bhagavadgītāsu mokṣadharmādau ca asakṛcchrūyante | tathā bhāgavate 
kāśīkhaṇḍādinikhilapurāṇeṣu ca pade pade upalabhyante | evaṃ sati 
bhaṭṭapādāḥ kathaṃ sāṃkhyayogatantrāṇāmaprāmāṇyaṃ brūyuḥ | na vā 
purāṇānāmaprāmāṇyamiti śakyate vaktam 

purāṇaṃ dharmaśāstraṃ ca vidyā hyetāścaturdaśa ||

iti vidyāsuparigaṇanāt yadatharvāṅgiraso brāhmaṇānītihāsān purāṇāni iti 
vede'pi purāṇasya pramāṇamadhyaparigaṇanāt (")etena 
tantraśāstrabrāhmaṇetihāsapurāṇadharmaśāstrāṇāṃ vedaniṣṭhaṃ 
pramāṇamupalabhyate eva(") | evaṃ uktavacanakalāpaiḥ evaṃvidhairanyaiśca 
tantrāṇāṃ siddhe prāmāṇye aprāmāṇyaṃ brahmaṇā'pi vyavasthāpayituṃ 
na śakyam ||

sarvatantrāṇāṃ vedabāhyatvaśaṃkānirāsaḥ 

nanu bhavatvadhikāriviśeṣe vedabhraṣṭe puruṣe strīśūdrāṇāṃ saṃkareṣu ca 
tantrāṇāṃ prāmāṇyaṃ na vaidike | na ca vaidikātirikte tantrasya 
adhikārasaṃkocakapramāṇābhāva iti vaktuṃ śakyam | pūrvaṃ 
sūtasaṃhitāvacanasya tāntrikasyaiva nānyasya vaidikī vaidikasya hi iti likhitasya 
sattvāt | evaṃ sūtasaṃhitāyāmeva muktikhaṇḍe(-)

atyantagalitānāṃ tu prāṇināṃ vedamārgataḥ |
pāñcarātrādayo mārgāḥ kālenaivopakārakāḥ || iti ||

tatraiva sūtagītāyām(-)

śrutipathagalitānāṃ mānuṣāṇāṃ tu tantraṃ 
gurugururakhileśaḥ sarvavit prāha śaṃbhuḥ |
śrutipathaniratānāṃ tatra naivāsti kiṃcit 
hitakaramiha sarvaṃ puṣkalaṃ satyamuktam ||

iti pramāṇāntaravacanāt | tasmāt pramāṇānyapi tantrāṇi vedamārgagalitasyaiva 
na vaidikasyeti cet |

<p. 8>

na | yacca śrutipathagalitānāmiti sūtagītāvacanaṃ tatratyaṃ tantrapadaṃ 
tantraviśeṣam | tacca tantraṃ śaivāgama (-) iti prasiddham dakṣiṇadeśe ca 
bhāṣayā jaṅgama (-) iti prasiddhairanuṣṭhitam | kathamidameveti jñāpakamiti cet 
asti jñāpakaṃ pūrvoktavacanasamīpa eva(-)

śrutipathagalitānāṃ sarvatantreṣu liṅgaṃ 
kathitamakhiladuḥkhadhvaṃsakaṃ tatra dhāryam |
śrutipathaniratānāṃ tat sadā naiva dhāryam || iti ||

tatra liṅgadhāraṇaṃ śaivāgamena bahuphalasādhanamiti pratipāditam | 
tatsaṃpradāyānuvartino liṅgaṃ dakṣiṇabāhau gale vā dhārayanti 
ityācāro'pyupalabhyate | yathā cāsmin vacane śrutipathagalitānāṃ sarvatantreṣu 
ityuttaraṃ pratipāditam iti śeṣaḥ | evaṃ ca yasmin tantre liṅgadhāraṇaṃ 
pratipāditaṃ tattantraṃ śrutibhraṣṭānāmityatra liṅgam | yathā chāgasya 
vaṣāyā medasaḥ iti mantraliṅgena paśuśabdasaṃkocaḥ tathā | kiṃ ca 
śrīmadadhyātmarāmāyaṇe śrīlakṣmaṇapraśnaḥ(-)

brahmakṣatrādivarṇānāmāśramāṇāṃ ca mokṣadam |
strīśūdrāṇāṃ ca rājendra sulabhaṃ muktisādhanam ||
tava bhaktāya me bhrātre brūhi lokopakārakam || iti ||

taduttaraṃ 'śrīrāma uvāca ityārabhya 

daśāvaraṇapūjāṃ vai hyāgamoktāṃ prakārayet |
homaṃ kuryāt prayatnena vidhinā tantrakovidaḥ |
āgamoktena (")agastyoktena iti kvacit |(") mārgeṇa kuṇḍenāgamavittamaḥ || iti ||

eva brāhmaṇādīnāṃ varṇānāṃ brahmacaryādīnāmāśramāṇāṃ ca 
mokṣopāyapraśne āgamoktapūjā kartavyeti taduttaramananyagatikaṃ vaidike'pi 
tāntrikaṃ yat pratipādayati tanmātsaryaśūnyena tattvabubhutsunā 
tyaktumaśakyam | nahi caitraḥ kuśalo vā (-) iti praśne maitraḥ kuśalaḥ iti 
prāmāṇikaḥ san brūyāt | tasmāt śrīrāmottaraṃ brāhmaṇādiviṣayam | na 
hyavaidiko brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyaśca loke prasiddhaḥ | na ca brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo 
vā brahmahatyā'dimahāpātakena pātityaṃ gataḥ vedamārgabhraṣṭaḥtatra 
brāhmaṇatvaṃ vedamārgagalitatvamubhayaṃ cāstīti sa eva tantroditeṣvadhikārīti 
vācyam brahmakṣatrādikalyāṇapraśne taduttararūpapūjāvidhāne(-)

<p. 9>

svagṛhyoktaprakāreṇa dvijatvaṃ prāpya mānavaḥ |
prātaḥsnānaṃ prakurvīta prathamaṃ dehaśuddhaye |
vedatantroditairmantrairmṛllepanavidhānataḥ ||

iti dvandvasamāsena ekasyaiva puruṣasya vaidikamantrasahitatāntrikamantrāṇāṃ 
snānakaraṇatvaṃ vidhīyate | tathā ca vedabāhyamuddiśya  
tantrasāmānyānuṣṭhānavidhiḥ iti svīkṛtya śrīrāmavākyaprāmāṇyanirvāhaḥ 
gīrvāṇagurūṇāmapyaśakya eva | evaṃ śrībhāgavate ekādaśaskandhe 
uddhavopadeśe(-)

ubhābhyāṃ vedatantrābhyāṃ mahyaṃ tūbhayasiddhaye || iti ||

upasaṃhāre tatraiva(-)

evaṃ kriyāyogapathaiḥ pumān vaidikatāntrikaiḥ |
arcannubhayatassiddhiṃ matto vindatyabhīpsitām || iti ||

tasmāt śrutipathagalitānāmiti vacanaṃ jaṅgamādiliṅgadhāriparam | evaṃ 
muktikhaṇḍasthapūrvoktātyantagalitānāmitivacane pāñcarātrādayo mārgāḥ 
iti ādipadena śaivāgamasya jaṅgamaparigṛhītasya grahaṇaṃ na 
jñānārṇavakalpasūtrādīnām tasmin vedabhraṣṭādhikārikatvasya kḷptatvena 
tena sahaikavākyatvāt | yacca śivamāhātmyakhaṇḍe pūjā śakteḥ parāyāstu 
ityārabhya 

vaidikī tāntrikī ceti dvijendrāstāntrikī tu sā |
tāntrikasyaiva nānyasya vaidikī vaidikasya hi || 

iti vacanaṃ tasya ayamabhiprāyaḥ (-) vaidikaḥ svagṛhyoktopanayanādisaṃskṛtaḥ | 
tāntrikaḥ tantrodīritakuṇḍamaṇḍapādipurassaraṃ dīkṣāsaṃskṛtaḥ | na tāntriko 
nāma śrutipathagalitaḥ tasya pūrvameva nirastatvāt | tathā ca anena vacanena 
upanayanādinimitte vaidikasnānapūjā'dinaimittikam | tantradīkṣānimitte 
naimittikaṃ tāntrikasnānapūjā'di vidhīyate | yatraikaṃ nimittaṃ tatraikaṃ 
kevalavaidike | śūdrādau kevalatāntrikam | yatra ubhayaṃ tatra ubhayānuṣṭhāne 
na kimapi bādhakam (")sidhyatyetāvatā ca traivarṇikānāṃ 
vaidikatāntrikobhayakarmopadeśaḥ (-) dvipariśiṣṭe (-) 2 (-) vi(0) dṛśyaḥ | 2 pa(.") | 
asyaivārthaḥ spaṣṭīkṛtaḥ tripurārṇave(-)

traivarṇikairvaidikānte tāntrikaṃ kriyate'khilam || iti ||

imamevārthaṃ saṃkṣepeṇa śrīrāmo'pyāha (-) vedatantroditairmantrairiti | tasmāt 
sarvatantrānuṣṭhānaṃ vedabāhyaparamiti siddhānto 
vacanāntarānavalokanavyāmohavilāsarūpa eva | pāñcarātrādīnāṃ tu 
śrutipathagalitamuddiśyaiva pravṛttiḥ tannāma gṛhītvā āhatyavidhānāt | 
evameva kāpālamapi(-)

<p. 10>

pāñcarātre ca kāpāle tathā kālamukhe'pi ca |
adhikāro vaidikānāṃ nāsti nāsti munīśvarāḥ || 

ityagastyasaṃhitāvacanāt | tathā ca nirṇīta evārthe bhaṭṭapādānāmabhiprāyaḥ 
| ata eva pāñcarātrasyaiva tantramadhye pṛthak nāma gṛhītam | na tu 
sarvatantrāṇāṃ grahaṇaṃ kṛtaṃ tatraiva vedaviruddhānāṃ 
smṛtiviruddhānāṃ ca dharmāṇāṃ bhūriśa upalabhyamānatvāt | na hi 
śākyādivat śāktāditantreṣu vedaviruddhamanuṣṭhānamamīṣadapyupalabhyate | 
yāni tu vedamārgamimaṃ tyaktvā ityādivacanāni tāni vaidikasya 
vaidikamārgaṃ sarvathā tyaktvā kevalatantramārgāśrayaṇe tannindāparāṇi 
muktvā vinetyādiśravaṇāt | yadvā(-)

pūrvaṃ vedamārgaṃ vinindya tasmādvedodito hyarthaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ na 
saṃśayaḥ iti sarveṇa nindāpraśaṃsārūpaviśiṣṭārthavādena militvā 
vedamārgācaraṇaṃ kartavyamityekavidhikalpane lāghavam | pūrvapakṣe nindayā 
tāntrikakarmaṇaḥ samuccayaḥ tasmād vedodita iti stutyā vaidikakarmaṇo vidhiḥ 
kalpyaḥ iti gauravaṃ syāt | pūrvoktāgnipurāṇavacanaṃ pādmaṃ ca 
tantraviśeṣaparaṃ pūrvoktayukteḥ | ata eva tantreṣu dīkṣitaḥ ityādivacanāni 
nindārūpāṇi vaidikapraśaṃsāparāṇi iti śrīvidyāraṇyasvāmibhirapi tatraiva 
vyākhyātam | evameva bhaṭṭapādaiḥ yogasya nirastaprāmāṇyasyāpi 
viṣayāntaraṃ sudhībhirūhyam | aprakṛtatvāt granthavistarabhayānneha likhyate | 
bhaṭṭapādoktyapekṣayā purāṇānāṃ tantrāṇāṃ ca prāmāṇaṃ variṣṭham | 
ato durbalapramāṇasya prabalapramāṇānusāreṇa saṃkoco yukta eva | anyathā 
tasminneva adhikaraṇe aṣṭācatvāriṃśadvarṣāṇi brāhmaṇo brahmacaryaṃ caret 
iti smṛtiḥ jātaputraḥ kṛṣṇakeśo'gnīnādadhīta iti śrutiḥ anayorvirodhaḥ ittham(-)
nahyaṣṭācatvāriṃśadvarṣānantaraṃ vivāhe jātaputraḥ kṛṣṇakeśaśca 
puruṣaḥ prasiddho'gnyādhānādhikārī | ato dvayorvirodhe 
prabalaśrutyanusāreṇa smṛtisthabrāhmaṇapadamandhādiparam | 
tasyāgrimaśrautakarmānadhikāritvena śrutyavirodha iti taireva pratipādito grantho 
virudhyeta | tasmādvaidikānāṃ 
śāktagāṇeśāditantrapratipāditakarmasvadhikāra iti 
bhaṭṭapādānāmastyabhiprāya iti pūrvayuktibhiḥ siddham (")etena vaidikānāṃ 
tāntrikakarmaṇyanadhikāra iti durapalapanto dūraṃ parāstāḥ |(") | etena 
bhaṭṭojidīkṣitalikhitatantraprāmāṇyakhaṇḍanamapi parāhatamūhyaṃ sūribhiḥ 
| purāṇavacanānāmapi vyavasthoktaiva | yaccoktaṃ dṛṣṭaikaprayojanakatvaṃ 
mapañcakasvīkāravidhāyakaśāstrasya lobhamūlatayā praṇītatvaṃ ceti tacca 
agnīṣomīyaṃ paśumālabheta iti surāgrahā gṛhyante ityatrāpi vede tulyam | na hi 
idaṃ pramāṇamiti śraddhāmutsṛjya prāmāṇyavyavasthāṃ kartuṃ brahmāpi 
samarthaḥ | ato vaidikānāṃ pūrvasaṃskāravaśāt utpanno vedaḥ pramāṇam iti 
śraddhāviśeṣa eva prāmāṇyavyavasthāpakaḥ prathamaḥ | tataśca 
tadaviruddhānāmeva tanmūlakatayā prāmāṇyaṃ tadviruddhaṃ tu vaidikasya 

