śrībhāgavate asyaivārthasyoktatvāt | tathāhi(-)

devānāṃ guṇaliṅgānāmanuśravikakarmaṇām |
sattva evaikamanaso vṛttiḥ svābhāvikī tu yā |
bhaktirbhāgavatī saiva(............................) || iti ||

guṇāḥ viṣayāḥ liṅgyante jñāyante yaisteṣām indriyādhiṣṭhātṛdevānāṃ 
satvamūrtau harāveva yā vṛttiḥ animittā niṣkāmā svābhāvikī ayatnasādhyā 
sā bhaktirityarthaḥ | anuśravo vedaḥ taduditaṃ karma ānuśravikaṃ karma 
yeṣāmiti devaviśeṣaṇam | etena bhaktau prayojakaṃ ānuśravikaṃ karmeti 
sūcitam | ato bhagavadākārā manovṛttireva bhaktiriti siddham | evam(-) athāto 
bhaktijijñāsā sā parā'nuraktirīśvare iti śāṇḍilyasūtram ||

upāsanasya bhaktisādhanatvam 

etādṛśabhaktibhūmikāmārurukṣuḥ tatsādhanībhūtāṃ bhagavadupāstiṃ 
kuryāt | upāstirnāma (-) bhagavaduddeśena niṣkāmaṃ sarvavastutyāgaḥ 
bhagavatkathāśravaṇaṃ bhagavanmantrajapaḥ 
bhagavannāmastotrakīrtanamityetadanyatamam | etasya bhaktihetutvaṃ 
śrīmadbhāgavate(-)

punaśca kathayiṣyāmi madbhakteḥ kāraṇaṃ param |
śraddhā'mṛtakathāyāṃ me śaśvanmadanukīrtane |
pariniṣṭhā ca pūjāyāṃ stutibhiḥ stavanaṃ mama |
ādaraḥ paricaryāyāṃ sarvāṅgairabhivandanam |
madarthe'rthaparityāgo bhogasya ca sukhasya ca |
iṣṭaṃ dattaṃ hutaṃ japtaṃ madarthaṃ yad vrataṃ kṛtam |
evaṃ dharmairmanuṣyāṇāmuddhavātmanivedinām |
mayi saṃjāyate bhaktiḥ ko'nyo'rtho'syāvaśiṣyate || iti ||

