tathā'pyanumiteḥ visaṃvādipravṛtteḥ kadācitsaṃbhavāt dīkṣāgrahaṇe yaḥ 
pravartate saḥ svādhikāraṃ samyagvicāryaiva pravṛttiṃ kuryāt | anyathā 
