sāranāmakanibandhanirmāṇamapi sādhu saṃgacchate | na ca vedapathagalitopari 
yathā kṛpayā śivena tantrāṇi nirmitāni tathā tadupari kṛpayaiva bhagavatpādaiḥ 
nirmitamiti vaktuṃ śakyate nedaṃ sādhakamiti vācyam | bhagavatpādānāṃ 
vaidika eva pakṣapāto na tadanyasmin | tathā'sati buddhādiśāstrānusāryapi 
nibandharacanaṃ syāt | kiṃ ca svakṛtamānasapūjāyām(-)

mantrāṃstāntrivaidikān paripaṭhan sānandamatyādarāt |
snānaṃ te parikalpayāmi janani snehāt tvamaṅgīkuru ||

iti śloke tāntrikavaidikayoḥ samuccayalekhanena tāntrikatvaṃ 
vaidikatvamaviruddhaṃ tadabhipretaṃ suspaṣṭam | tasmāt vaidikaiḥ idaṃ 
vyākhyeyaṃ kalpasūtram ||

tantrānuṣṭhānasya kalivarjyatvaśaṃkānirāsaḥ 

nanu brāhmaṇānāṃ bhavatu tantre adhikāraḥ tathā'pi na kaliyuge | taduktaṃ 
brāhme kalivarjyagaṇanāvasare(-)

mantrādīkṣā ca sarveṣāṃ kamaṇḍaluvidhāraṇam |
mahāprasthānagamanaṃ gosaṃjñaptiśca gosave ||

<p. 15>

ityeteṣāṃ kaliyuge varjyatvaśravaṇāt pūrvavacanāni sarvāṇi 
kṛtādiparatvenopasaṃhāryāṇi | na ca niṣedhasya prāptimujīvyaiva pravṛtteḥ 
pūrvavacanaiḥ prāptau anena niṣedhe tulyabalatvena na tau paśau karoti iti 
dāśamikacaramapādanyāyatulyatvena vikalpa eva kiṃ na syāt iti vācyam | yadi 
niṣedho bhavet tarhi vikalpo bhavet | nāyaṃ niṣedhaḥ | kiṃtu yajatiṣu ye yajāmahe 
karoti nānuyājeṣu itivat | dīkṣāṃ kurvīta matimān iti vacanaṃ kalau 
mantradīkṣā na kartavyā iti vacanaṃ tayorekavākyatāyāṃ kriyamāṇāyāṃ 
kalibhinne kartavyamiti paryudāsasaṃbhavena vikalpānavakāśāt iti cet maivam | 
brāhme bhūripustakeṣu mantradīkṣā ca sarveṣām (-) iti nopalabhyate | 
ato'lpapustakeṣu upalabhyamāna īdṛśapāṭho'prāmāṇika eva | yadi ca 
prāmāṇika ityāgrahaḥ tathāpi (-) laiṅge 

kalāvārādhanaṃ (")etāvatpramāṇajālena viprādīnāmapi(-)kalāvapi 
tāntrakarmopadiśyate(-)smaryate ca |(") śaṃbhorāgamenaiva nānyathā || iti ||

śrīmadbhāgavate kaliyuge tantreṇaiva pūjā kartavyā iti vacanaṃ 
pūrvatraivodāhṛtam |

kalau yuge mahādevi brāhmaṇādyaiḥ supūjitā |

iti rahasyārṇavavacanam evaṃ rudrayāmalādibahutantreṣu kalau 
kartavyatvopalabdheḥ (-) bahuvacanānusāreṇa brāhmapurāṇasthavacanaṃ 
kalāvatisāvadhānena indriyādīn jitvā kartavyatāṃ pratipādayati | ata eva 
brāhmavacanāvasāne kalau na kartavyaṃ iti noktam | kiṃtu imāni 
lokaguptyarthaṃ kalerādau mahātmabhiḥ nivartitāni iti nivṛtteḥ phalaṃ 
lokopakāra uktaḥ | upakāraścettham | yaḥ kaścana jitendriyaḥ ime dharmāḥ 
avaśyaṃ kartavyāḥ iti śāstre bhāraṃ nikṣipya pravṛttaścet anyo'pi rāgāndho 
rāgaṃ puraskṛtya pravṛttaścet patedeveti tadanugrahāyaiva tyāgaḥ | (")na(") 
naikādaśyāṃ bhojanaṃ kāryaṃ itivanniṣedhaparaḥ | imamevārthaṃ śrīśivaḥ 
tantreṣu prakaṭitavān(-)paramānandatantre 

asidhārāvratasamo manonigrahahetukaḥ |
sthiracittasya sulabhaḥ saphalastūrṇasiddhidaḥ |
anyasya viphalo duḥkhahetuḥ syāt parameśvari || iti ||

tripurārṇave'pi 

ito madyamito māṃsaṃ bhakṣyamuccāvacaṃ tathā |
taruṇyaścāruveṣāḍhyā madāruṇavilocanāḥ |
tatra saṃyatacittatvaṃ sarvathā hyatiduṣkaram |
bhaktiśraddhāvihīnasya kathaṃ syādetadīśvari || iti ||

tasmāt kaliyuge'pi saṃyatendriyāṇāṃ dīkṣāyāṃ na kimapi bādhakam 
(")etāvatā ca sthiracitta eva tantroktakarmādhikārīti dhvanyate |(") ||

<p. 16>

dīkṣāyāḥ prathamasopānatvam 

nanu dīkṣāṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ ityanucitaṃ yasya vyākhyānaṃ pratijñātaṃ 
tasyaivāgre kathanīyatvena dīkṣābhinnānāṃ gaṇeśaśrīvidyopāstyādīnāṃ 
bahūnāṃ kathanena saṃdarbhavirodhāt iti cet (-) ucyate | atra 
śrīlalitābhaktisādhanībhūtakriyāmātraṃ ajahatsvārthavṛttyā arthaḥ | atra 
dīkṣāpadoccāraṇaṃ ca dīkṣāyāḥ sarvāditvajñāpanārtham | etena adīkṣitena 
upāstirna kāryeti tadabhiprāyaḥ | ata eva paramānandatantre 

muktisaudhasya sopānaṃ prathamaṃ dīkṣaṇaṃ bhavet || iti ||

ata eva hiraṇyakeśisūtravyākhyāne (-) yajñaṃ vyākhyāsyāmaḥ ityatra 
etādṛśānupapattyaiva yajñaśabde ajahatsvārthā vṛttiraṅgīkṛtā vaijayantīkṛtā 
|| 1 ||

traipurasiddhāntasya paramaśivakartṛkatvam 

tatra dīkṣāyāṃ tadaṅgatvena traipurasiddhāntaṃ śrāvayedityasti | tatra ko nāma 
traipurasiddhāntaḥ (?) tasya kutaḥ prāmāṇyaṃ (?) ityākāṅkṣāyāṃ tatrādau 
tādṛśasiddhāntasya śivoditatvena prāmāṇyaṃ iti vaktuṃ bhūmikāṃ racayati(-)

bhagavān paramaśivabhaṭṭārakaḥ śrutyādyaṣṭādaśavidyāḥ 
(")etatsūtrādhastanabhāṣye aṣṭādaśavidyāsarvadarśanapañcāmnāyānāṃ 
saṃkṣepato darśanamasti |(") sarvāṇi darśanāni līlayā tattadavasthā'pannaḥ 
praṇīya saṃvinmayyā bhagavatyā bhairavyā svātmābhinnayā pṛṣṭaḥ 
pañcabhiḥ mukhaiḥ pañcāmnāyān (")ime āmnāyāḥ kutaḥ sambhūtāḥ kiṃ 
prayojanāḥ(-)ityādyarthaṃ(-)dvipariśiṣṭavi 4 dṛśyaḥ |(") paramārtha (")sārarūpān(-)
ba(.") sārabhūtān praṇanāya || 2 ||

atra pratipāditavidyāsu aprāmāṇyaśaṅkāsparśo'pi mā bhavatu ityetadarthaṃ 
bhagavāniti | 

aiśvaryasya samagrasya dharmasya yaśasaḥ śriyaḥ |
jñānavairāgyayoścaiva ṣaṇṇāṃ bhaga iti smṛtaḥ ||

ityetādṛśaṣaḍguṇaiśvaryasaṃpanno bhagavān | nanu paramaśivaḥ tattvātītaḥ 
tasya vidyākartṛtvaṃ na saṃbhavati upādhiśūnyatvāt ityata āha(-)bhaṭṭāraka iti | 
rājetyarthaḥ rājā bhaṭṭārako devaḥ iti kośāt | jagadīśvaratvarūpadharmavān 
māyopādhikaḥ iti tadarthaḥ | yadvā (-) bhaṭṭārako jagadrūpanāṭyarañjakaḥ 
bhaṭṭārakaśabdasya prasannarāghavanāṭake nāṭyarañjake re bhaṭṭāraka iti 
saṃbodhanāt rājā bhaṭṭārakaḥ ityasya nāṭyavargasthatvācca | tasya yathā 
jagatkartṛtvaṃ tathā vidyākartṛtvamapi saṃbhavatyeva | yadvā (-) īśvarasya 
paramaśivasya pūrṇatvena kartavyavastuno'bhāvāt kathaṃ 

<p. 17>

vidyākartṛvaṃ (?) ata āha(-)bhaṭṭāraka iti | rājetyarthaḥ | yathā rājñaḥ svasya 
anapekṣite'pi pareṣāṃ hitāya kṛtirdṛśyate tadvat | śrutyādyaṣṭādaśavidyāḥ(-)
śrutiḥ ādiḥ yāsāmiti tadguṇasaṃvijñānabahuvrīhiḥ | tathā ca śrutayaḥ 
catvāri tadaṅgāni śikṣā vyākaraṇaṃ kalpaḥ chandaḥ jyotiṣaṃ niruktaṃ ceti 
ṣaṭ mīmāṃsā nyāyaḥ purāṇaṃ dharmaśāstraṃ iti caturdaśavidyāḥ | 
āyurvedaḥ dhanurvedaḥ gāndharvaṃ nītiśāstraṃ ceti catasraḥ | 
evamaṣṭādaśavidyāḥ | sarvāṇi darśanāti śāktadarśanādīni | dṛśyate aneneti 
darśanaṃ jñānasādhanaṃ śāstramityarthaḥ śaktidarśanaśāstramiti yāvat | 
evamevāgre'pi | śaivadarśanaṃ vaiṣṇavadarśanaṃ brāhmadarśanaṃ 
sauradarśanaṃ bauddhadarśanaṃ ceti ṣaḍ (?) darśanāni | līlayā anāyāsena 
tattadavasthā'pannaḥ īśvarāvasthā'panno vedān pāṇinivyāsādisvarūpān 
gṛhītvā vyākaraṇapurāṇādīni praṇīya nirmāya ||

vedasya (")atra bhagavato vedasyāpauruṣeyapauruṣeyatvayoḥ (-) dvipariśiṣṭavi(.)-5 
dṛśyaḥ |(") pauruṣeyatvasamarthanam 

nanu vedasya nityatvena apauruṣeyatvāt īśvaranirmitatvaṃ katham (?) na ca tasya 
nityatvameva asiddhamiti śaṅkyam vācā virūpanityayā iti śruteriti cet (-) na | 
vedāstu īśvareṇa nirmitāḥ chandāṁsi jajñire tasmāt iti śruteḥ

aṣṭādaśānāmetāsāṃ vidyānāṃ bhinnavartmanām |
ādikartā (")kaviḥ sā(-)a(") śivaḥ sākṣācchūlapāṇirmaheśvaraḥ ||

iti smṛteḥ | vedaḥ pauruṣeyaḥ vākyasamūhatvāt bhāratādivat ityanumānasyāpi 
pramāṇatvāt | ata eva īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāmīśvaraḥ sarvabhūtānām iti 
śrutau īśānatvaṃ kartṛtvarūpameva | na ca tasya pauruṣeyatve puruṣadoṣāṇāṃ 
bhramapramādavipralipsākaraṇāpāṭavānāṃ saṃbhavāt 
aprāmāṇyaśaṅkā'spadatvaṃ syāditi vācyam īśvare 
doṣasādhanānāmavidyā'dīnāmabhāvena doṣāsaṃbhavāt | etena 
tantrāṇāmapi nityatvaṃ pratyuktam | vācā virūpanityayā ityatra nityatvaṃ 
doṣavatpuruṣāpraṇītatvarūpaṃ gauṇaṃ kalpyaṃ 
uktapramāṇakalāpānurodhena | na ca vaiparītye kiṃ vinigamakamiti vācyam 
bhūyo'nugrahasya nyāyyatvāt | tasmāt sarvā api vidyāḥ puruṣapraṇītā eva ||

tantrapraṇayane prayojanaviśeṣaḥ 

nanu aṣṭādaśasu vidyāsu satīṣu punarāmnāyapraṇayanaṃ vyarthamata āha(-)
saṃvinmayyeti | ayamabhiprāyaḥ (-) puruṣārthaḥ sukhaṃ tacca naisargikaṃ 
kṛtrimaṃ ceti | naisargikaṃ mokṣarūpam | kṛtrimaṃ yastṛtīyapuruṣārthaḥ 
kāmaḥ ityucyate | ubhayoḥ sādhanaṃ dharmaḥ | tasyāpi sādhanamarthaḥ | evaṃ 
sākṣāt paraṃparayā vā puruṣairabhilaṣaṇīyā arthāścatvāraḥ | tatra 
kṛtrimapuruṣārthasādhanānyeva aṣṭādaśavidyābhiḥ prākaṭyena pratipāditāni 
| akṛtrimapuruṣārtho yaḥ tatsādhanaṃ akṛtrimaṃ 

<p. 18>

spaṣṭaṃ na pratipāditam | kṛtrimopadeśaścākiṃcitkaro lokānāmiti jagadeva 
duḥkhapaṅkanimagnamuddidhīrṣurāmnāyavidyāṃ praṇināya | yadvā(-)
nikhilavedārthānabhijñānāṃ tatrānadhikāriṇāṃ ca muktyupāyaṃ 
nikhilavedasārāmāmnāyavidyāṃ (")etadarthaṃ dvipariśiṣṭavi(.)-4 dṛśyaḥ |(") 
praṇināya | tatrāpi saṃvit aparicchinnaṃ caitanyaṃ prakāśa iti yāvat tanmayyā 
tadabhinnayā | etena vimarśāṃśena svātmānaṃ pṛcchatītyarthaḥ siddhaḥ | 
taduktaṃ ratnatrayaparīkṣāyāmappayadīkṣitaiḥ(-)

nityaṃ nirdoṣagandhaṃ niratiśayasukhaṃ brahmacaitanyamekaṃ 
dharmo dharmīti bhedadvayamiti ca pṛthagbhūya māyāvaśena | 
dharmastatrānubhūtissakalaviṣayiṇī sarvakāryānukūlā śaktiścecchā'dirūpā 
bhavati guṇagaṇaścāśrayastveka eva || iti ||

nanu jīvānāṃ asmadādīnāmapi saṃvinmayatvaṃ astyevevi śrībhairavyā 
jīvebhyaḥ ko viśeṣaḥ ityataḥ āha bhagavatyeti viśeṣaṇam | 
bhagavacchabdārthaśca vyākhyātaḥ pūrvam | tathā ca 
jīvādivadāṇavādimalairāvṛtajñānā satī na pṛcchati kiṃtu sarvajñā'pi 
kenacidabhiprāyeṇa gūḍhena pṛcchatīti bhagavacchabdo jñāpayati | tathā hi(-)
śivaḥ prakāśarūpaḥ svayameva vimarśo bhūtvā praśnamavatārayati | tatra 
prayojanamidaṃ (-) vidvān samartho'pi pustakavācanādinā saṃpannajñāno na 
kṛtārtho bhavitumarhati kiṃ tu gurūpadiṣṭamārgeṇaiveti jñāpayituṃ 
svasvarūpāntaraṃ gṛhītvā praśnaḥ | taduktaṃ svacchandatantre(-)

guruśiṣyapade sthitvā svayameva sadāśivaḥ |
praśnottaraparairvākyaistantraṃ samavatārayat || iti ||

tadvijñānārthaṃ sa gurumevābhigacchet ityevakāro'pi śrutau 
amumevārthamāha | imamevārthaṃ dyotayituṃ bhagavatyā svātmābhinnayeti 
viśeṣaṇadvayam | bhairavyā (-) bhairavīśabdārthaśca jagato bharaṇādramaṇāt 
pralaye paramaśivakukṣisthitasya sṛṣṭisamaye vamanācca (")atra 
śrīlalitāsahasranāma (-) 126 (-) ślokagatamahāpralayasākṣiṇī(-)
ityanyatantrādisthādīni ca bahupramāṇāni santi |(") bhairavīti jñeyam | tayā 
pṛṣṭaḥpraśnamavatāritaḥ | idaṃ pūrvavartiparamaśivabhaṭṭāraka ityasyaiva 
viśeṣaṇam | pañcabhiḥ mukhaiḥ sadyojātavāmadeva(-)aghora(-)tatpuruṣa(-)
īśānasaṃjñakaiḥ pañcāmnāyān pūrvāmnāya(-)dakṣiṇāmnāya(-)
paścimāmnāyottarāmnāyordhvāmnāyanāmakān 
(")etatpañcāmnāyanāmārthopayogīyajñānāya(-)dvipariśiṣṭavi(.)-4-dṛśyaḥ |(") | 
āmnāyaśabdo vede yadyapi mukhyaḥ śrutiḥ strī veda āmnāyaḥ iti kośāt | 
tathā'pi āmnāyasārapratipādakatvāt (")arthāttantrāṇāṃ 
vaidikaviṣayamarmodghāṭanādāmnāya pratipādakatvaṃ mokṣapradatvaṃ ca 
sidhyatyeva |(") atrāpi āmnāyaśabdaḥ upacaryate | etena 

<p. 19>

keṣāṃcit tantrāṇi vedavat svatantrapramāṇānīti matamapāstam | paramārthaḥ 
akṛtrimasturīyapuruṣārthaḥ tasmin sārabhūtān (")sārarūpān(-)ba(.") abhyarhitān | 
etena puruṣasya viśeṣeṇa abhilaṣaṇīyatvaṃ atigopyatvaṃ ca sūcitam | 
nikhilavedārthaṃ grahītuṃ aśaktān prati kṛpayā śivaḥ tatsārabhūtamarthaṃ 
gṛhītvā pañcāmnāyān praṇināya nirmame || 2 ||

traipurasiddhāntapratipādanam 

tatrāpyakṣamān mandatarān prati paramakṛpāluḥ śrīparaśurāmaḥ 
tatratyānarthān saṃgṛhya vaktuṃ prakramate(-)

tatrāyaṃ siddhāntaḥ || 3 ||

tatra pañcāmnāyeṣu ayaṃ vakṣyamāṇaḥ siddhāntaḥ 
vicāryavādajanitanirṇayaviṣayo'rthaḥ ||

etadantena granthena vakṣyamāṇasiddhāntārthasya (")nāma(-)uparitana 2-
sūtrabhāṣyāntagranthena(-)evamarthaḥ |(") 
svakapolakalpitatvaprayuktāprāmāṇyaśaṅkā nirastā ||

ayaṃ bhāvaḥ(-)yasmin kāle idaṃ viśvaṃ paraśivakukṣisthaṃ sūkṣmarūpeṇa 
tiṣṭhati sa eva pralayaḥ | īdṛśapralayaśca śāstraikavedyaḥ | evameva sṛṣṭirapi | 
tatra pralayo nāma parabrahmaṇaḥ kevalanijasvarūpeṇa avasthānaṃ jīvasya 
suṣuptāviva | tadānīṃ jīvarāśiḥ tadadṛṣṭaṃ pañcabhūtāni sarvāṇi vaṭabīje 
vaṭavṛkṣa iva sūkṣmarūpeṇa tiṣṭhanti | taduktaṃ śaktisūtrabhāṣye(-)paramaśivo 
jagat kabalayannapi na sārvātmyena api tvaṃśena saṃskārātmanā tat sthāpayati 
iti | sa eva saṃskāraḥ īśvarasisṛkṣāyāṃ sahakāribhūtaḥ anyathā 
vaiṣamyanairghṛṇyāpatteranivāraṇāt | evaṃ sthite loke dampatyoḥ sāmarasye 
vidhibilasthitaśuklabindoraṃśaḥ yoniṃ praviśya raktabindunā saha ekībhāvaṃ 
prāpnoti yadā tadā bāhyābhyantara (")bhāva(-)ba(.") bhānavihīnaṃ kevalaṃ 
brahmaiva bhāsate | tasya garbhotpādakatvaṃ dṛṣṭam | tathā sṛṣṭiprākkāle 
śivaśaktyoryogo'pi prāṇyadṛṣṭavaśāt bhavati || 3 ||

ṣaṭtriṃśattatvāni (")teṣāṃ pratyekeṣāṃ sphoṭārthaścādhastāt 
etattatsūtrabhāṣyāntāvadhi dṛśyaḥ |(") 

tadeva prapañcayituṃ tattvajālaṃ vyaṣṭumupakramate(-)

ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni viśvam || 4 ||

taditthaṃ(-)kevalanijarūpeṇa avasthitasya yadā bahu syāṃ prajāyeya iti 
icchājñānakriyā'tmikāḥ śaktayaḥ tābhiryoge krameṇa arthaśabdasṛṣṭī 
aṅkuracchāyāvat yugapadbhavataḥ |

<p. 20>

nanu icchājñānakriyāśaktīnāṃ sāditvena anityatvāpattiriti cet(-)iṣṭāpattiḥ | 
tattritayakāraṇībhūtā sūkṣmarūpā śāntānāmnī tasyā eva 
paraśivarūpāyā nityatvāt | tathā ca tādṛśasisṛkṣārūpopādhiviśiṣṭaḥ 
paramaśiva eva kevalaśivapadavācyo bhavati | sa eva tattvānāṃ madhye ādimaḥ |

sā pūrvoditā sisṛkṣā prapañcavāsanārūpā śaktiriti dvitīyaṃ tattvam | 
taduktaṃ ratnatrayaparīkṣāyām(-)

kartṛtvaṃ tatra dharmī kalayati jagatāṃ pañcasṛṣṭyādikṛtye 
dharmaḥ puṃrūpamādyāt (")atra(-)prathamalikhitaṃ(-)vi(-)ityakṣaramivābhāti |(") 
sakalajagadupādānabhāvaṃ bibharti |
strīrūpaṃ prāpya divyā bhavati ca mahiṣī svāśrayasyādikartuḥ 
proktau dharmaprabhedāvapi nigamavidāṃ dharmivadbrahmakoṭī || iti ||

pūrvoktatādṛśajagataḥ ahantayā yaddarśanaṃ tadahamiti 
tādṛśaspaṣṭavṛttimān sadāśivapadavācyaḥ tṛtīyaṃ tattvan |

idaṃ jagaditi kevalaṃ bhedaviṣayiṇī yā vṛttiḥ tadvān īśvarapadavācyaḥ 
turīyaṃ tattvam |

jagadahamevetyākārikā yā sadāśivasaṃbandhinī vṛttiḥ sā vidyāpadavācyā 
pañcamaṃ tattvam |

idaṃ jagadityākārikā īśvaraniṣṭhā bhedaviṣayiṇī vṛttiḥ māyāpadavācyā 
ṣaṣṭhaṃ tattvam |

pūrvoktavidyātirodhānaśaktimatī tadvirodhidhī avidyāpadavācyā saptamaṃ 
tattvam |

jīvaniṣṭhaṃ sarvakartṛtvaṃ yatkiṃcitkartṛtvena saṃkucitaṃ tadeva 
kalāpadavācyaṃ aṣṭamaṃ tattvam |

pūrvoktarītyā jīvaniṣṭhā yā nityatṛptiḥ saiva keṣucidviṣayeṣu atṛptyā 
saṃkucitā rāgapadavācyā navamaṃ tattvam |

jivaniṣṭhā yā nityatā tasyā ācchādane sati saiva nityatā asti jāyate vardhate 
vipariṇamate apakṣīyate vinaśyatīti ṣaḍabhāvayogāt saṃkucitā 
kālapadavācyā daśamaṃ tattvam |

paraśivajīvayoḥ abhedāt yathā paraśive sarvasvātantryaṃ tathā jīve'pyasti tasya 
sarvasvātantryasya vi(")atra(-)ādyā(-)ityādyanekapadāni pāṭhāntare 
pṛthaksantyanyatra |(")(pi)dhānaṃ pūrvoktavidyayā kṛtaṃ tadeva 
kāraṇāntarāpekṣaṃ yatkāraṇamapekṣate tanniyatipadavācyaṃ ekādaśaṃ 
tattvam |

etādṛśaniyatikālarāgakalā'vidyā'śrayo jīvaḥ dvādaśaṃ tattvam |
satvarajastamoguṇānāṃ sāmyarūpā prakṛtiḥ cittāparaparyāyā trayodaśaṃ 
tattvam |

yadā satvatamasī abhibhūya rajaḥpradhānaṃ tanmanaḥpadavācyaṃ 
saṃkalpahetuścaturdaśaṃ tattvam |

<p. 21>

rajastamasī abhibhūya satvapradhānamantaḥkaraṇaṃ tadbuddhipadavācyaṃ 
niścayahetuḥ pañcadaśaṃ tattvam | 

yadā rajassatve abhibhūya tamaḥpradhānamantaḥkaraṇaṃ 
tadahaṃkārapadavācyaṃ vikalpakāraṇaṃ ṣoḍaśaṃ tattvam |

śabdagrāhakamindriyaṃ śrotraṃ saptadaśaṃ tattvam |
sparśagrāhakamindriyaṃ tvagaṣṭādaśaṃ tattvam |
rūpagrāhakamindriyaṃ cakṣurekonaviṃśaṃ tattvam |
rasagrāhakamindriyaṃ rasanaṃ viṃśaṃ tattvam |
gandhagrāhakamindriyaṃ ghrāṇaṃ ekaviṃśaṃ tattvam |
vyaktavāguccāraṇānukūlavāgindriyaṃ dvāviṃśaṃ tattvam |
grahaṇatyāgānukūla mindriyaṃ pāṇiḥ trayoviṃśaṃ tattvam |
gamanānukūla mindriyaṃ pādaḥ caturviṃśaṃ tattvam |
malavisargajanaka mindriyaṃ pāyuḥ pañcaviṃśaṃ tattvam |
maithunajanakamindriyaṃ upasthaḥ ṣaḍviṃśaṃ tattvam |
sūkṣmākāśarūpaḥ śabdaḥ saptaviṃśaṃ tattvam |
sūkṣmavāyurūpaḥ sparśaḥ aṣṭāviṃśaṃ tattvam |
sūkṣmatejorūpaṃ rūpaṃ ekonatriṃśaṃ tattvam |
sūkṣmajalarūpo rasaḥ triṃśaṃ tattvam |
sūkṣmapṛthvīrūpo gandhaḥ ekatriṃśaṃ tattvam |
avakāśātmakākāśaḥ sthūlaḥ dvātriṃśaṃ tattvam |
sadāgatimattvātmakaguṇavān vāyuḥ trayastriṃśaṃ tattvam |
uṣṇatvavat tejaḥ catustriṃśaṃ tattvam |
dravatvavajjalaṃ pañcatriṃśaṃ tattvam |
kāṭhinyaguṇavatī pṛthvī ṣaṭtriṃśaṃ caramaṃ tattvam (")atragranthe mūle 
bhāṣye ca-36-ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni sārthāni nirdiṣṭāni |(") |

etādṛśatattvasaṃghāto viśvaṃ jagaditi vyavahāraviṣayābhinnam | uktārthe 
pramāṇaṃ paramānandatantre(-)

yatkaṭhinyaṃ taddharā syāddravo vai jalamucyate |
uṣṇaṃ tejassaṃcalanaṃ vāyurvyomāvakāśakam ||
eteṣāṃ sūkṣmarūpaṃ tu anudbhinnavibhāgakam (")vibhāvakam(-)ba(.") |
gandhasparśau rūparasau śabdastanmātrakāṇi vai |

<p. 22>

pañcajñānendriyāṇyeṣāṃ ghrāṇaṃ jihvā ca locanam |
tvak śrotraṃ ceti pañcānāṃ grahaṇavyāpṛtāni vai ||

vacanādānagamanavisargānandapañcakam |
karmasvadhiṣṭhānarūpamatastannapṛthakkṛtam ||

vākpāṇipādapāyūpasthākhyaṃ tatkaraṇaṃ bhavet |
sarvadehagataṃ cāpi sphuṭavyakterudāhṛtam ||

manassaṃkalpakaraṇaṃ buddhirniścayakāriṇī |
vikalpapratibimbānāṃ bhūmirdarpaṇavacchive ||

etāvadabhimānātmā cāhaṃkāra udāhṛtaḥ |
duḥkhanirvṛtimohākhyarajassatvatamomayam ||

antaḥkaraṇamityuktaṃ tattadādhikyasaṃbhavam |
kāraṇānāṃ guṇānāṃ tu sāmyaṃ prakṛtirucyate ||

tadbhinnaḥ puruṣaḥ proktaḥ pūrṇaḥ saṃkṣiptaśaktikaḥ |
cidānandastathecchā ca jñānaṃ tadvat kriyā'pi ca || 

paripūrṇāśśaktayastu saṃkocāttu kalādikāḥ |
sarvakartṛtvarūpā vai kriyāśaktiḥ kalā'bhavat ||

kiṃcitkartṛtvarūpeṇa jñānaṃ sarvajñatā tathā |
buddhistatpratibimbānāṃ (")buddhita(-)ba(.") vastūnāmeva bodhakaḥ (")bodhataḥ(-)ba(.") ||

saṃkocanāttu vidyā'khyā saivāvidyeti gīyate |
icchā tu nityatṛptyākhyā saiva saṃkocaśālinī ||

rāgaḥ kvacidatṛptyākhyā kvacidrañjanarūpiṇī |
cicchaktirnityasattā'khyā kālaḥ ṣaḍbhāvayogataḥ || 

ānandaśaktissvātantryaṃ sārvatrikamudīritam |
anyāpekṣaṇahetostu saṃkocānniyatiḥ smṛtā ||

akhaṇḍarasametāvadetadbhedananaipuṇā |
svatantrarūpā tvaṃ devi māya bhairavavallabhā ||

bhedanena svarūpasya gopanāt tattvarūpiṇī |
svarūpabhedanaṃ hitvā caikyāvagamanodyatā ||

<p. 23>

paramārthaprathārūpā śuddhavidyeti śabditā |
spaṣṭabhedaprathān bhāvān svābhedenāvabhāsayan ||

īśvaraḥ kathito devi tāna spaṣṭānahaṃ (")tān aspaṣṭān(-)iti padacchedo'tra 
kāryaḥ |(") tvidam |
iti prabodhanātmā tu sadāśiva itīritaḥ ||

svasvarūpābhedamayānahamityeva paśyatī ||
prapañcavāsanārūpā śaktirityabhidhīyate ||
niṣprapañcaścidekātmā śivatattvaṃ samīritam || iti ||

eteṣāṃ śivādikṣityantānāṃ svarūpanirūpaṇaṃ mṛgendrasaṃhitāyāṃ 
vistareṇāsti vistarabhayādatra na likhitaṃ yāvadupayuktaṃ tāvadeva likhitam ||

tattvasaṃkhyānirṇayaḥ 

nanu sāṅkhyaiḥ caturviṃśatitattvānīti siddhāntitaṃ kathaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni 
(?) iti cet (-) ucyate caturviṃśatyatiriktāni puruṣādiśivāntāni dvādaśa tattvāni na 
santi pramāṇābhāvāditi tavoktiḥ uta caturviṃśatitattveṣu antarbhūtānīti | 
nādyaḥ śrībhagavataḥ paraśurāmasya uktereva pramāṇatvāt 
ṣaṭtriṃśattattvaprāsādabhūnāthāya namo namaḥ iti skānde śrutatvāt 
ṣaṭtriṃśadvidhametadvai tattvacakraṃ samīritam iti paramānandatantre 
śrutatvācca | na dvitīyaḥ puruṣādiśivāntānāṃ 
pūrvoktalakṣaṇarūpaviruddhadharmavatāmantarbhāvāsaṃbhavāt | na ca 
caturviṃśatitattvāni puruṣastu tataḥ paraḥ iti mahābhāratavacanavirodhaḥ iti 
vācyam agrimadvādaśatattvānāmatikaṭhinavedyatvena mandamatīnāṃ 
prakṛtyantasugamavedyatattvānāmeva kathanīyatayā tatraiva viśrāmāt evaṃ ca 
adhikāribhedena vacanadvayasyāpi prāmāṇyāt | etena (-) sarvatra pañca bhūtāni 
ṣaṣṭhaṃ kiṃcinna vidyate iti vāsiṣṭhavacanamāśritya pañcaiva tattvānīti vadan 
parāstaḥ tasya atyantamandamatiparatvāt ||

nanu viruddhadharmavattvaṃ yadi tattvavibhāge prayojakaṃ tarhi 
ghaṭatvapaṭatvarūpaviruddhadharmavatoḥ ghaṭapaṭayorapi tattvāntaratvāpattiḥ iti 
cet (-) na | kiṃ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvātiriktatvamāpādyate (?) athavā 
ghaṭarūpatattvāpekṣayā paṭatattvamatiriktaṃ syādityāpādyate (?) nādyaḥ yaḥ 
kṣiterasādhāraṇo dharmaḥ kāṭhinyaṃ tena sākaṃ ghaṭatvapaṭatvayoḥ 
virodhābhāvena tadatiriktatvāsiddheḥ | dvitīye tu iṣṭāpattireva | eṣa evārthaḥ 
uktaḥ sūtasaṃhitāyāṃ tattvalakṣaṇakathanapūrvam(-)

āpralayaṃ yattiṣṭhati sarveṣāṃ bhogadāyi bhūtānām |
tattattvamiti proktaṃ na śarīraghaṭādi tattvamataḥ || iti ||

etena iyamāśaṅkā sutarāṃ parāhatā ||

<p. 24>

yadyapi tantrāntare prathamaṃ trīpyeva tattvāni (-) ātmatattvaṃ vidyātattvaṃ 
śivatattvaṃ ceti | tatra ātmatattvaṃ caturviṃśatidhā kṣityādiprakṛtyantam | 
tadsādhāraṇo dharmaḥ kevalajaḍatvam | puruṣamārabhya māyā'ntaṃ 
vidyātattvaṃ saptadhā | tallakṣaṇaṃ ca jaḍatvaprakāśakatvobhayavattvam | 
tathāhi (-) yathā ayaḥpiṇḍe vahnitādātmyāpanne jaḍe'pi prakāśakatvaṃ 
ayaḥpiṇḍe jaḍatvaṃ ca vahnitādātmyānāpannatvadaśāyāṃ spaṣṭam | evaṃ 
vahnau ayaḥpiṇḍatādātmyāpannatvadaśāyāṃ jaḍatvaṃ prakāśakatvaṃ ca 
spaṣṭam | tathā puruṣe prakāśarūpe tattādātmyāpanneṣu jaḍeṣu niyatyādiṣu 
prakāśakatvaṃ puruṣe ca jaḍatvam | niyatyādiṣu jaḍatvaṃ puruṣe 
prakāśakatvaṃ ca spaṣṭam | evaṃrītyā vidyātattvasya miśratvam | 
śuddhavidyā'diśivāntaṃ śivatattvaṃ pañcadhā | tadasādhāraṇo dharmaḥ 
kevalaprakāśakatvamityavāntaravibhāgaḥ kṛtaḥ | tathā'pi 
tatrāpyupasaṃhāravelāyāṃ 

ṣaṭtriṃśadvidhamevaṃ vai tattvacakraṃ maheśvari ||

iti yo dharmaḥ uktaḥ sa eva atrāpyuktaḥ iti na tena sākaṃ virodhaḥ ||

vastutastu bhāgavate ekādaśaskandhe dvāviṃśe'dhyāye 

kati tattvāni viśveśa saṃkhyātānyṛṣibhiḥ prabho |
kecit ṣaḍviṃśatiṃ prāhurapare pañcaviṃśatim ||
saptaike nava ṣaṭ caike(...........)

ityārabhya uddhavapraśne svamate aṣṭāviṃśatitattvāni pratipādya śrībhagavān 
saptādiviruddhasaṃkhyāvādināṃ matānāmupapattiṃ kṛtvā 

iti nānāprasaṃkhyānaṃ tattvānāmṛṣibhiḥ kṛtam |
sarvaṃ nyāyyaṃ yuktimattvādviduṣāṃ kimaśobhanam (")etāvatā naiko 
muniryasya vacaḥ pramāṇamiti munivacasāmapramāṇatāvādino durarthakartāro 
dūraṃ yāpitā iti mārmikam tādṛśāśca guhāśabdatathyārthe'pi 
bhramantyeva sāṃpratikāḥ kecit |(") ||

ityuvāca | idamevātra samādhānaṃ draṣṭavyam || 4 ||

jīveśvarasvarūpam 

evaṃ tattvānāṃ vibhāgamuktvā jīveśvarasvarūpaṃ vaktumārabhate(-)

śarīrakañcukitaḥ (")kaṃcukito jī(-)a(.") śivo jīvo niṣkañcukaḥ (")nirṣkacukaḥ śivaḥ(-)
a(.") paraśivaḥ ||

evaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśattattvānāmapi sāmānyarūpeṇa punardvisvabhāvatvaṃ (-) 
keṣucit kevaladṛśyatvaṃ keṣucit kevaladraṣṭṛtvameva | ādyaṃ jaḍeṣu dvitīyaṃ 
kevalamiti ||

<p. 25>

nanu jīvasya tattvāntaḥpatitvāt paraśivasyātathātvāt dvayorbheda āyātaḥ | 
evaṃ sati kathamadvaitasiddhāntaḥ tāntrikāṇām (?) ata āha (-) śarīreti | ayaṃ 
bhāvaḥ (-) sarvasvatantaḥ paraśivaḥ svasya māyayā durghaṭayā svaniṣṭhaṃ 
yadanyānapekṣatvarūpaṃ pūrṇaṃ svātantryaṃ tadācchādayati | tatastirohitaṃ 
yatsvātantryaṃ parimitaṃ svātantryaṃ tadāṇavamalamucyate | āṇavamalameva 
avidyetyapyucyate ||

nanu pūrṇasvātantryaṃ svīyaṃ svayameva kathāmācchādayati iti cet (-) ucyate | 
yathā sūryaḥ svamayūkhaireva sṛṣṭaiḥ meghaiḥ svayamāvṛto bhavati evameva 
svāvidyayā svasyāvaraṇe vādhakābhāvāt | tathā ca aupādhiko bhedo na 
vāstavaḥ | tathā ca nādvaitahāniḥ iti bhāvaḥ ||

nanu aparicchinnacitsvarūpaparaśivaḥ kathaṃ paricchinnena āṇavamalena tirohita 
iti cet (-) ittham | māyāyāḥ sāmarthyamanirvacanīyam | ato na tatra 
aghaṭitaghaṭanāyāmapi kathaṃbhāvaśaṅkā asti | ata evoktam(-)

durghaṭaikavidhāyinyāṃ māyāyāṃ kimasaṃbhavi || iti ||

subhagodaye'pi(-)

māyāvibhinnabuddhirnijāṃśabhūteṣu nikhilabhūteṣu |
nityaṃ tasyā niraṅkuśavibhavaṃ veleva vāridhiṃ rundhe || iti ||

evamāṇavena malena channaḥ tadā svayamaṇurdehaparimitaḥ san anyān 
dehaparimitān anantān jīvān svabhinnatvena paśyati | tanmāyikaṃ malam | evaṃ 
bhedaprathārūpamāyikamalena malinā śubhāśubhakarma anutiṣṭhantaḥ 
tajjanitasaṃskāravanto bhavanti | tadetat kārmaṃ malam | etādṛśatrividhamalaṃ 
śarīrapadenocyate | tadrūpaṃ yat kañcukam ācchādanaṃ tena āvṛtaḥ śiva eva 
jīvaḥ | taduktaṃ paramārthasāre(-)

paramaṃ yatsvātantryaṃ durghaṭasaṃpādanaṃ maheśasya |
devī māyāśaktiḥ svātmāvaraṇaṃ śivasyaitat || iti ||

subhagodaye'pi(-)

sa tayā parimitamūrtissaṃkocitasamastaśaktireṣa pumān |
raviriva sandhyāraktassaṃhṛtaraśmissvabhāsane'pyapaṭuḥ iti ||

<p. 26>

yadvā (-) śarīraṃ trividhaṃ sthūlaṃ sūkṣmaṃ paraṃ ceti | ādyaṃ 
dhyānaślokapratipāditam | dvitīyaṃ mantrarūpam | tṛtīyaṃ vāsanā'tmakam | 
etaiḥ śarīraiḥ kañcukitaḥ śivaḥ ādyatattvaṃ so'pi jīva evetyarthaḥ | tasminneva 
jīvatvamasti kā kathā anyeṣviti bhāvaḥ | etena śivasvarūpalābho'pi na 
paramapuruṣārtha iti dhvanitam ||

etādṛśajīvāḥ trividhāḥ (-) śuddhāḥ aśuddhāḥ miśrāśca iti | ādyāḥ 
śivādisadāśivāntāḥ teṣām ajñānābhāvāt | aśuddhāḥ manuṣyādayaḥ | 
miśrāḥ vasiṣṭhādayaḥ | etādṛśakañcukarahito yaḥ sa tattvātītaḥ paraśivaḥ 
ityarthaḥ || 5 ||

puruṣārthasvarūpam

evaṃ jīveśvarayoḥ svarūpamuktvā kaḥ puruṣārthaḥ iti taṃ nirdiśati(-)

svavimarśaḥ puruṣārthaḥ || 6 ||

svasya paraśivasvarūpasya vimarśaḥ pratyabhijñānaṃ so'hamityākārakaṃ(-)
yathā kaṇṭhasthaṃ cāmīkaraṃ vismṛtya tadanveṣaṇāya deśāddeśaṃ dhāvan  
kenacit udbuddhasaṃskāraḥ kaṇṭhasthaṃ paśyati tathā 
vismṛtasvarūpajñānasya punarlābhaḥ(-)puruṣārthaḥ akṛtrimaḥ ityarthaḥ | 
etādṛśapuruṣārthalābhaśca na bhagavatkṛpāmṛte bhaviṣyati | taduktaṃ 
bhagavatā śrīkṛṣṇena(-)

māmeva ye prapadyante māyāmetāṃ taranti te || iti || a(.) 7-14

bhagavatprītiśca bhagavadārādhanenaiva bhavati | ato bhagavadārādhanaṃ 
paraṃparayā mokṣasādhanam || 6 ||

mantraguṇavarṇanam 

nanu yogādinā'pi (")ādiśabdena 
vedāntanyāyasāṃkhyamīmāṃsāvaiśeṣikādīni jñeyāni |(") 
īdṛśapuruṣārthalābho bhavatīti śāstraṃ bahūpalabhyate (")arthāt(-)
mokṣarūpapuruṣārthapratipādakatattacchāstroktakarmāṇi sapramāṇāni 
bhūyāṃsi bhavantītyarthaḥ |(") | kimupāsanāyā āvaśyakatvaṃ varṇyate iti cet(-)
astyupāsanāyā āvaśyakatā | yogādibhiḥ labhyamokṣastu na punarāvṛttirahitaḥ | 
taduktaṃ svacchandasaṃgrahe(-)

muktaṃ ca pratibandhāttaṃ punarbadhnāti ceśvaraḥ |
baddhaḥ saṃsarate bhūyo yāvaddevaṃ na vindati || iti ||

evaṃ sthalāntarepi(-)

sāṃkhyayogādisaṃsiddhān śrīkaṇṭhastadaharmukhe |
sṛjatyeva punastena na sadṛṅmuktirīdṛśī || iti ||

<p. 27>

ataḥ upāsanāyā eva mukhyopāyatve siddhe upāsanāyāṃ japasyāpi sattvāt tatra 
mukhyasādhanaṃ mantra (")itaḥsaptamāṣṭanavamasūtrairbhagavān rāma 
upāsanāhṛdayībhūtatattaddevatāmantrāvaśyakatvagauravamavatārayatītya(-)
vadheyam |(") iti tatra upāsakasya śraddhotpattaye tadvṛttiguṇān varṇayati(-)

varṇātmakā nityāḥ śabdāḥ || 7 ||

varṇātmakāḥ varṇasamudāyarūpāḥ śabdāḥ mantrāḥ nityāḥ(-)
mūlāvidyāsamasattākāḥ ityarthaḥ | na tu kālatrayābādhyatvaṃ 
ajñānanivṛttau svasvarūpātiriktadevatāyāḥ tadvācakamantrāṇāṃ ca asattvāt 
| na ca ānupūrvīviśeṣaviśiṣṭavedādīnāṃ nityatvasya ekakalparathāyitvaraya 
varṇitatvena asyāpi tādṛśatvena kathaṃ tato'pi cirasthāyitvarūpaṃ nityatvam iti 
vācyam mantrāṇāṃ devatāsūkṣmaśarīrarūpatvena devatāśarīrasya 
avidyāsamakālatvāt || 7 ||

athavā(-)

saptakoṭimahāmantrāḥ śivavaktrādvinirgatāḥ |

iti skāndāt mantrāṇāmapi sāditvena nāvidyāsamakālikatvaṃ tasyā anāditvāt 
| ata eva itarasādhāraṇaguṇatvena nāneti stutiḥ saṃbhavatīti aparitoṣeṇa 
mantrāṇāmasādhāraṇaṃ guṇāntaramāha(-)

mantrāṇāmacintyaśaktitā || 8 ||

mantrāṇāmiti ṣaṣṭhī saptamyarthe mantreṣvityarthaḥ | na cintyā acintyā 
śaktiryatra te(-)acintyaśaktayaḥ mantrāḥ teṣāṃ bhāvaḥ tattā astīti śeṣaḥ | 
śaktau acintyatvaṃ ca tarkāviṣayatvam | etena pūrvoditamāyā atarkyā durvārā 
tathā'pi tannivāraṇa samarthā tato'pi adhikaśaktikā mantreṣu līlayā 
jñānāvarakāvidyānivartakatvaśaktirastīti pratipāditam || 8 ||

mantrasiddhau sahakārikāraṇāni 

mantreṇa īpsitakārye jananīye sahakārikāraṇānyāha(-)

saṃpradāyaviśvāsābhyāṃ sarvasiddhiḥ || 9 ||

saṃpradāyaḥ guruparaṃparā'cārānusaraṇam | viśvāso mantreṣu 
phalasādhanatvaviṣayako niścayaḥ | ābhyāṃ sahitamantreṇa sarvasiddhiḥ 
bhavatīti śeṣaḥ | yadyapi loke ekena daṇḍena ekavyāpāreṇa ghaṭa eva bhavati na 
paṭaḥ | evaṃ turīvemādinā paṭa eva na ghaṭa iti | evaṃ sarvakāraṇeṣu loke 
niyataikakāryajanakatvaṃ dṛṣṭam | tathā'pi mantreṣu na tathā eka eva mantraḥ 
yadyadīpsitaṃ tatsarvaṃ janayati iti jñāpayituṃ sarvapadam | etena 
śrotṛpravṛttaye mantravartiguṇo'pi pratipādito bhavati || 9 ||

<p. 28>

nanu kathaṃ lokaviruddhārthakamidaṃ vākyaṃ pramāṇaṃ bhavitumarhati ityata 
āha(-)

viśvāsabhūyiṣṭhaṃ prāmāṇyam || 10 ||

prāmāṇyaṃ saṃvādipravṛttijanakatadvatitatprakārakajñānajanakatvam | 
sarvasiddhiriti pūrvoktavākyaniṣṭhaṃ viśvāsabhūyiṣṭham | atra 
viśvāsapadārthaśca vākyaprayoktari āptatvaniścayaḥ | bahuśabdāt atiśayārthe 
iṣṭhan pratyayaḥ | tatra(-)pāṇinisūtraṃ atiśāyane tamabiṣṭhanau 
atiśayaviśiṣṭārthavṛtteḥ svārthe etau staḥ iti tadarthaḥ | evaṃ svārthe iṣṭhani 
jāte iṣṭhasya iti bahoḥ parasya iṣṭhasya lopaḥ syāt | bahorlopo bhū ca bahoḥ iti 
iḍāgamo bhūrādeśaśca iti tadarthaḥ | evaṃ bhūrādeśe iḍāgame ca 
bhūyiṣṭhaśabdena atyantabahutvaviśiṣṭaḥ puruṣārthaḥ | puruṣe 
viśvāsabhūyiṣṭhatvaṃ ca svottarotpannatvasvaviṣayaviṣayakatvasaṃbandhena 
viśvāsaviśiṣṭaśaṅkā'nadhikaraṇatvaṃ tadāśrayapuruṣeṇa 
samamabhedānvayasya bādhitatvāt | bhūyiṣṭhapadasya 
bhūyiṣṭhāśrayajñānaviṣaye lakṣaṇā | tasya prāmāṇye abhedānvayaḥ | 
atyantaviśvāsavatpuruṣaikavedyaṃ etacchāstraprāmāṇyamityarthaḥ | 
kutarkaśālināṃ śāstraprāmāṇyaṃ sarvathā agamyamiti bhāvaḥ | taduktaṃ 
bhaṭṭapādaiḥ(-)

śāstraikagamyā ye hyarthā na tāṃstarkeṇa dūṣayet || iti ||

kecittu(-)viśvāsasya bhūyiṣṭhaṃ bāhulyaṃ yatreti bahuvrīhimāhuḥ | taccintyam | 
bhūyiṣṭhapadasya pāṇinyanuśāsanena puruṣaparatvena 
bāhulyarūpadharmaparatvāyogāt | yadi ca dharme lakṣaṇā tadā 
madāśritalakṣaṇāpakṣa eva śreṣṭhaḥ | na saḥ | tathā sati bāhulye ekatra 
lakṣaṇāyāmapi dharmasyāpi prāmāṇyena samaṃ abhedānvayāsaṃbhavāt 
bahuvrīhau anyapadārthe lakṣaṇā vācyābāhulyasaṃbandhiprāmāṇyamiti | 
saṃbandhaśca svāśrayavṛttijñānavedyatvameva vaktavyam | tathā ca 
manmatatulyam | etadaṃśe dharme lakṣaṇādhikyaṃ 
kliṣṭavyadhikaraṇabahuvrīhyāśrayaṇaṃ ca | tasmādidameva vyākhyānaṃ 
varam ||

īdṛśameva śraddhābhūyastvamiti suspaṣṭamuvāca śrīskanda :(-)

agastya kiṃ bahūktena śṛṇu me niścitaṃ vacaḥ |
saṃśayo nātra kartavyaḥ sandigdhāddhi phalaṃ na hi ||
yāvanti martye tantrāṇi mantrajālānyanekaśaḥ |

sahakāryantaramāha(-)

gurumantradevatā'tmamanaḥpavanānām 
aikyaniṣphālanādantarātmavittiḥ || 11 ||

<p. 29>

gurvādayaḥ spaṣṭāḥ | pavanāḥ pañcaprāṇāḥ | eteṣām aikyaniṣphālanaṃ 
bhāvanayā ekatvasaṃpādanam tena antarātmanaḥ pratyagātmanaḥ vittiḥ 
vedanaṃ bhavatīti śeṣaḥ ātmano devatāyāśca aikyamupādhinirāse spaṣṭam | 
devatāyā mantrasya caikyaṃ vācyavācakabhāvāpannatvena | tathā gurorapi | 
manaḥpavanayoraikyaṃ viṣṇupurāṇe darśitam(-)

nabhasvānmanaso nātibhinno'tastannirodhanāt mano niścalatāmeti || iti ||

yadyapi īdṛśaniścayaḥ upāsanāvelāyāṃ na bhavitumarhati tathāpi āhāryaṃ 
kṣaṇamātraṃ kāryamidamupāsanāyāmaṅgam ||

japarūpopāstiphalam 

yadvā (-) saṃpradāyaviśvāsasahitamantrakaraṇakopāsteḥ phalamāha (-) 
gurumantreti | aikyaniṣphālanaṃ aikyanirṇayaḥ tadvārā pratyagātmajñānaṃ 
bhavatīti viśiṣṭārthaḥ ||

umānandanāthāstu (-) gurumantretyasya āraṃbhollāse 
gurumantradevatā'tmanāmaikyabhāvanam (-) ekaṃ sādhanaṃ manaḥpavanayoḥ 
ekayatnaniroddhavyatvajñānaṃ cāparaṃ dvābhyāṃ kāryasiddhiḥ iti 
vyācakruḥ | taccintyam | niṣphālanādityekakriyāyā eko'rthoṃ bhāvanārūpaḥ 
ekayatnaniroddhavyatvajñānarūpo vā budhyeta nānekaḥ śakṛduccaritaśśabdaḥ 
sakṛdevārthaṃ gamayati iti nyāyāt | anyathā haripadāt 
caturdaśānāmapyarthānāṃ yugapadbodhaprasaṅgāt | kiṃca(-)
dvandvaghaṭakībhūtapadārthānāṃ yadi bhinnakriyayā'nvayaḥ tadā 
bhikṣāmaṭa gāṃ cānaya itivat anvācaya eva syāt kriyābhede anvācayaḥ iti 
tallakṣaṇāt | ekakriyāyāṃ yugapadanvayitvaṃ hi dvandvalakṣaṇaṃ 
tannirvāhastu sarvathā kartumaśakyaḥ tanmate | na ca (-) dhavakhadirau chindhi paśya 
iti prayogo na syāt iti vācyam īdṛśaprayogo'prāmāṇika eva iti 
sarvairvyavasthāpitatvāt || 11 ||

arcanarūpopāstividhiḥ 

etāvatparyantaṃ mantrastutyā tatsahakārikāraṇakathanena ca 
mantrakaraṇakakriyātadvidhirunneyaḥ | tathā ca tādṛśī japarūpaiva | evaṃ 
japarūpopāstiṃ nirūpya pūjārūpāmupāstiṃ hi vidhatte(-)

ānandaṃ brahmaṇo rūpaṃ tacca dehe vyavasthitaṃ tasyābhivyañjakāḥ pañca 
makārāḥ tairarcanaṃ guptyā prākaṭyānnirayaḥ || 12 ||

yathā cidrūpaṃ brahma evam ānandarūpamapi vijñānamānandaṃ brahma iti 
śruteḥ | yathā cidrūpamāvṛtamajñānena na jānāti evamānandasvarūpamapi 
duḥkhenāvṛtaṃ na jānāti | yadā kadācit bhārādirūpaduḥkhāpagame 
brahmaṇa eva paricchinnaṃ rūpaṃ śarīrāvacchedena saṃpratyapi 

<p. 30>

jānāti tādṛśānandaḥ paricchinno dehe dehāvacchedena vyavasthitaḥ | tasya 
abhivyañjakāḥ tadviṣayakasākṣātkārajanakāḥ pañcamakārāḥ | etadantena 
vidhīyamānadravyastutiḥ anuṣṭhātṛpravṛttaye yata īdṛśāḥ śreṣṭhāḥ pañca 
makārāḥ ataḥ tairarcanaṃ guptyā aprākaṭyena kurvīteti śeṣaḥ | 
guptidravyobhayaviśiṣṭārcanarūpaṃ karma anena vidhīyate ||

nanu viśiṣṭakarmavidhau karmaṇa eva stutirapekṣitā vidheyasyaiva 
stutyatvaniyamāditi cet (-) na viśiṣṭavidhau viśeṣaṇavidherākṣiptatvena 
asyārthavādasya taccheṣatvasaṃbhavāt yathā vāyavyaṃ śvetamālabheta ityatra 
devatāviśiṣṭakarmavidhāvapi vāyurvai kṣepiṣṭhā ityanena devatāstutiḥ tadvat | 
karmaṇi guptiśca paśuvṛttijñānaviṣayatāsāmānyajñānaśūnyatvam | asya 
viśiṣṭavidhirūpatvāt guptiḥ kratvarthā | tasyaiva prākaṭyānnirayaḥ iti 
nindārūpā stutiḥ | yathā (-) yad grāmyāṇāṃ paśūnāṃ carmaṇā saṃbhared 
grāmyān paśūñchucā'rpayet iti nindārūpaḥ san kṛṣṇājinena saṃbharati iti 
stutiśeṣaḥ tathā tena daivāt prākaṭye kratvaṅgalopajanitaṃ prāyaścittaṃ na 
narakanirāsāya anyat prāyaścittam ||

prākaṭyāt guptiviparītāt | hetau pañcamī | nirayaḥ nirakaḥ ityarthaḥ ||

śrībhāsurānandanāthapādāstu (-) dīkṣā'ntaravatāṃ svadharmaprakaṭane 
kratuvaiguṇyamātraṃ iha tu tadvaiguṇye naraka eva tathā ca bhagavān 
paraśurāmaḥ prākaṭyānnirayaḥ ityūcuḥ | tanmate vākyabhedaḥ 
prakṛtahānyaprakṛtapuruṣārthatvakalpanādidoṣaparihāropāyamalpamatirahaṃ na 
jāne || 12 ||

upāsakadharmāḥ (-) bhāvanādārḍhyam 

evamupāsanāmuktvā upāsakadharmān prāha(-)

bhāvanādārḍhyādājñāsiddhiḥ || 13 ||

ahamidaṃ jānāmi ityetādṛśavṛttiṣu idaṃ padārthāpekṣayā ahaṃtayā 
bhāsamānaṃ śreṣṭhamiti vivecanam (-) sarvavṛttiṣu idameva bhāvanāpadārthaḥ | 
tasya dārḍhyaṃ aśithilatā | anena ājñāsiddhiḥ nigrahānugrahasāmarthyaṃ 
bhavatīti śeṣaḥ | bhāvanādārḍhyastutyā sarvadā īdṛśabhāvanāvidhirunneyaḥ 
|| 13 ||

sarvadarśanā(")nānindanam(-)a | ito bhagavatastāntrikaśāsanagauravaṃ 
mananīyataram |(")nindā

upāsakasya niyamāntaramāha(-)

<p. 31>

sarvadarśanānindā || 14 ||

itaradevatopāsanāvidhāyakāni yāni darśanāni śāstrāṇi teṣāṃ nindā na 
kartavyetyarthaḥ | tannindane tadadhikāriṇāṃ saṃśayotpattyā 
svālambitadarśaneṣvanāśvāsaḥ | asmin śāstre anadhikārāt ubhayabhraṣṭaḥ 
chinnābhramiva naśyet | imamevārthaṃ śrīkṛṣṇo'pyāha(-)

na buddhibhedaṃ janayedajñānāṃ karmasaṅginām || iti ||

lokānna nindyāt itiśrutirapi ||

nanu pareṣāṃ buddhibhraṃśajanitapratyavāyābhāvo'sya phalamiti siddham | 
ayaṃ puruṣārthaḥ | katham upāsakadharmāṇāṃ kratusādguṇyajanakānāṃ 
madhye pāṭha iti cet(-)ucyate | ayamapi upāsanājanyasarvātmabhāve upayujyate | 
katham (?) iti cet itthaṃ (-) yadi chinnābhravat pareṣāṃ nāśe svasyopekṣā tadaiva 
nindāyāṃ pravṛttiḥ | tathā ca paranāśe upekṣāyāṃ ātmavat 
sarvabhūtadarśanaṃ nāgataṃ iti sarvātmatāyāḥ asiddhyā 
upāsanājanmaphalāsiddhiḥ | prayājādiṣu kratvarthatvam | idameva 
kratusādhyāpūrvasādhakatvam | prakṛte uktarītyā kratvarthatvaṃ siddhamiti na 
ko'pi doṣaḥ || 14 ||

kasyāpagaṇanam 

tṛtīyaṃ dharmamāha(-)

agaṇanaṃ kasyāpi || 15 ||

svaśāstraviruddhaṃ yadi gīrvāṇagururvadettarhi sa gururiti gaṇanaṃ na 
krartavyam | ata eva śrutirapi (-) na gaṇayet kamapi iti || 15 ||

sacchiṣye rahasyakathanam 

caturthamāha(-)

sacchiṣye rahasyakathanam || 16 ||

kartavyamiti śeṣaḥ | parisaṃkhyāvidhirayam | ātmarahasyaṃ na vadet iti 
niṣedhasyāpavādo'yaṃ na tu guptyārcanam ityasyāpavādaḥ tathā sati 
śiṣyātirikteṣu sāmayikeṣu pūjāprākaṭyānāpatteḥ | ataḥ idamātmarasyaṃ 
svasiddhāntarūpaṃ sāmāyikeṣu śiṣyabhinneṣu na kathayet | sacchiṣye 
kathayedityarthaḥ | śiṣye sattvaṃ pratipāditaṃ tantrarāje(-)

<p. 32>
 
sundaraḥ sumukhaḥ svacchaḥ śraddhāvān susthirāśayaḥ |
alubdhaḥ sthiragātraśca prekṣyakārī jitendriyaḥ ||

āstiko dṛḍhabhaktiśca gurau mantre'tha daivate |
evaṃvidho bhavecchiṣyaḥ itaro duḥkhakṛdguroḥ || iti ||

ātmapurāṇe'pi 

brahmavidyā'tisaṃkhinnā brahmiṣṭhaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ yayau |
gopāya māṃ sadaiva tvaṃ kulajāmiva yoṣitam ||

ityārabhya(-)

evamādyā yeṣu doṣāstebhyo varjaya māṃ sadā |
evaṃ hi kurvato nityaṃ kāmadhenurivāsmi te || iti ||

asattvalakṣaṇāni śiṣyadoṣāḥ kulārṇavāt vistareṇa jñeyāḥ 
(")anarhaśiṣyalakṣaṇajñānāya dvi(0) pariśiṣṭe 6 vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") || 16 ||

sadā vidyā'nusaṃdhānam 

pañcamaṃ dharmamāha(-)

sadā vidyā'nusaṃhatiḥ || 17 ||

sadā sarvakālaṃ pūjādivihitanityakarmānuṣṭhānakālavyatirikte sarvadetyarthaḥ 
| vidyāyāḥ svopāsyadevatāvācakamantrasya anusaṃhatiḥ tatpratipāditārthasya 
anusaṃdhānaṃ kartavyamiti śeṣaḥ |

yadvā (-) sadā anusaṃhatiḥ manasā japaḥ kāryaḥ ityarthaḥ | na ca 
āsanādiniyamarahitasya japo yuktaḥ iti śaṅkanīyam mānase kasyāpi 
niyamasyābhāvāt | taduktaṃ paramānandatantre(-)

mānase'nantaguṇitaṃ niyamastatra naiva tu |
gacchan śayāna āsīno bhukto vā yatra kutracit |
asnātaścāpavitraśca na doṣastatra vidyate ||

bṛhadvāmakeśvaratantre'pi(-)

sarvakālaṃ japedvidyāṃ manasā yastu kevalam |
niyato vāpyaniyato'pyatha kurvaṃśca nityakam |
tathā'pi tasya śuddhasya tarasā saṃprasīdati || iti ||

<p. 33>

yadi sadāpadasya saṃkoco na syāttarhi nityakarmānuṣṭhānalopāpattiḥ | ataḥ 
sarve hāryojanaṃ lipsanti ityatreva saṃkoca āvaśyakaḥ || 17 ||

satataṃ śivatāsamāveśaḥ 

ṣaṣṭhaṃ dharmamāha(-)

satataṃ śivatāsamāveśaḥ || 18 ||

satatam asyāpyarthaḥ pūrvasūtrasthasadāśabdavat | śivatāyāḥ samāveśaḥ 
āvirbhāvaḥ kartavya iti śeṣaḥ | nityakarmānuṣṭhānavyatiriktakāle 
śivo'hamasmīti bhāvayet iti tātparyam ||

vastutastu(-)pūrvadharmeṇa sahāyaṃ vikalpyate anyathā ubhayorbhāvanayoḥ 
yugapatsaṃpādanāsaṃbhavāt | pūjā'divyatiriktakāle 
anyatarasyānuṣṭhānamitibhāvaḥ (")arthādantaḥsthamātmānaṃ pūjanāya 
mūrtyādau bahirapi saṃbhāvya saṃpūjyānantaraṃ sa evāhaṃ devaḥ ātmā 
veti vedāntasiddhāntāviruddhabhāvanāvirbhāvostu bhaktānāmiti tātparyam | (") ||

yadvā (-) pūrvadharmo mandādhikāriṇaḥ ayaṃ mukhyādhikāriṇaḥ || 18 ||

kāmādīnāṃ varjanam 

saptamamāha(-)

kāmakrodhalobhamohamadamātsaryāvihitahiṃsāsteyalokavidviṣṭavarjanam 
(")lokaviruddhastrīvidvi(-)a(") || 19 ||

kāmaḥ vaiṣayikī icchā idaṃ me bhūyāt ityākārikā | krodhaḥ tamasa udrekeṇa 
janito'sau antaḥkaraṇadharmaḥ | lobhaḥ 
dravyādiniṣṭhasvatvatyāgapratibandhako'tyantamanurāgaviśeṣaḥ | mohaḥ 
kāryākāryāvicāraṇam madaḥ garvaḥ | mātsaryaṃ dveṣajanito guṇini 
doṣāropaḥ | avihitahiṃsā rāgeṇa bhakṣaṇārthaṃ paśvādivadhaḥ | steyaṃ 
parānanumatyā paradravyaharaṇam | lokavidviṣṭaṃ mātṛbuddhyā'pi ekānte 
parastrīsaṃlāpādi | eteṣāṃ varjanaṃ tyāgaḥ kartavya iti śeṣaḥ || 19 ||

ekagurūpāstiḥ 

aṣṭamaṃ dharmamāha(-)

ekagurūpāstirasaṃśayaḥ (")etatsūtrabhāṣyasamāptyavadhi(-)
ekagurūkaraṇādyupadeśo'sti |(") || 20 ||

<p. 34>

na vidyate saṃśayo yatreti vigraheṇa asaṃśayaḥ ityekagurūpāstiviśeṣaṇam | 
bhinnaliṅgatvamārṣam ||

ayaṃ bhāvaḥ (-) anekagurūpāstau pūrvagurūktavirūddhaṃ yadi vadet tarhi 
saṃśayo bhavedeva |

ekagurūpāstau na saṃśayo bhavet | ataḥ ekagurūpāstiḥ kāryeti bhāvaḥ | 
gurūpāsteḥ śaṃpradāyaviśvāsābhyām iti pūrvasūtreṇaiva prāptau 
punarvidhānam ekaṃ gurumāśritya na gurvantaramāśrayet iti 
itaragurvāśrayanivṛttiphalakeyaṃ parisaṃkhyā ||

ekagurūpāstividhyarthavicāraḥ 

nanu(-)na parisaṃkhyā'śrayaṇaṃ yuktaṃ doṣatrayāpatteḥ 
(")atroktaparisaṃkhyāyāmuktaṃ laugākṣibhāskarapraṇītārthasaṃgrahe 15 panne 
parisaṅkhyāvivecanāyāṃ yathā śrutārthasya 
parityāgādaśrutārthaprakalpanāt || prāptasya bādhādityevaṃ parisaṅkhyā 
tridūṣaṇā | atraitacchlokārthopi sukhāvagamyaḥ |(") | kiṃ tu 
upāsyagurumanūdyaikatvamātraṃ vidhīyate itaranivṛttistu aṅgalopabhiyā 
ekatvasya aṅgatvena itaragurūpāstau tallopāpatteḥ | na ca 
gurūdvayādyāśrayaṇe'pi pratyekaṃ guruṣu pratyekamekatvamastīti 
kathamaṅgalopaḥ iti vācyam ekatvaṃ hi na saṃkhyārūpaṃ vidhīyate tasya 
vastumātrasādhāraṇyena avyāvartakatvāt kiṃtu sajātīyadvitīyarahitatvaṃ 
gurvantarāśrayaṇe tallopastvanivāryaḥ | ato na gurvantarāśrayaṇamiti 
ekatvavidhireva śreṣṭhaḥ iti cet(-)

āstāṃ vā ekatvavidhiḥ | imamevārthaṃ śrīśivaḥ tantreṣu bhaṅgyantareṇa 
prakaṭitavān | rudrayāmale(-)

na deyaṃ paraśiṣyebho deyaṃ śiṣyebhya eva ca || iti ||

kulārṇave(-)

labdhvā kulaguruṃ samyak na gurvantaramāśrayet ||

yoginītantre'pi(-)

na deyaṃ paraśiṣyebhyo nāstikāya kuleśvari || iti ||

upaniṣadyapi (-) gururekaḥ iti | kvacicchiṣyadharme imamevārthaṃ prāha | 
kvacidgurudharme paraśiṣyāya na vadet iti bhaṅgyantareṇa | dvayoḥ 
ekagurūpāstirūpaphale eva paryavasānaṃ bhavati | ayamabhiprāya eṣāṃ 
vacanānāṃ pratibhāti (-) pūrvoktarudrayāmalakulārṇavayoginītantreṣu 
svasaṃśayacchettari gurau satītyadhyāhāryam | anyathā(-)

<p. 35>

madhulubdho yathā bhṛṅga puṣpāt puṣpāntaraṃ vrajet |
jñānalubdhastathā śiṣyo gurorgurvantaraṃ vrajet || iti ||

tantrāntare śaktirahasye'pi(-)kaulike guravo'nantāḥ iti vacanānāṃ 
niravakāśatā'patteḥ | etena pūrvaguruḥ asarvajñaḥ 
svasaṃśayacchedane'samarthaḥ yadvā samarthaḥ svasya saṃśayamacchittvā 
mṛtaḥ tādṛśaśiṣyaḥ madhulubdhaḥ iti vacanānusāreṇa gurvantaramāśrayet | 
tatrāpyalpajñe'pi gurau jīvati tadanumatyā gṛhṇīyādanyoktam | tadapyuktaṃ 
kulārṇave(-)

mantrāgamādi cānyatra śrutaṃ nāthe nivedayet ||
gurvājñayā tadgṛhṇīyāt tadaniṣṭaṃ vivarjayet || iti ||

gurāvalpatātāratamyaṃ nirṇetuṃ svayamasamarthaścet yaṃ parigṛhṇāti 
tanmārgatyāgo na kāryaḥ | tādṛśanirṇayasamarthaścet tasmin 
sopapattikamarthaṃ rahasi saṃbodhya tadanumatyā yathāśāstramarthaṃ 
gṛhṇīyāt | yadi jīvannapi guruḥ asūyā'dinā nānujānāti tamullaṃghya 
śāstrīyaṃ sapramāṇaṃ mārgamanusaret | taduktaṃ spaṣṭaṃ tripurārahasye(-)

gurūktaṃ śāstrasaṃśuddhaṃ samālocya dhiyā budhaḥ |
kurvītopāsanaṃ samyaganyathā parihīyate || iti ||

ete'rthāḥ sarve'pi madhulubdhaḥ iti vacanena jñāpitāḥ | ekagurūpāstiḥ ityasya 
sūtrasya asminnevārthe tātparyamuktayuktigaṇavaśādvarṇanīyam ||

ye ca śrībhāskararāyāṇām anyāyo nyāyaḥ iti kaulopaniṣacchrutibhāṣye 
gurusaṃpradāyaḥ asādhuścedapi grāhyaḥ iti lekhanābhiprāyaṃ varṇayanti te 
tadabhiprāyatattvaṃ na viduḥ | ko'yamabhiprāyaḥ iti cet (-) ucyate | 
kaulikācāramadhye svasiddhāntaviruddhaṃ yadyācaret svaguruḥ anyaśca kauliko 
dayāparavaśaḥ san bodhayeccet gurau nivedya jīvati gṛhṇīyāt | yadi 
vāvadūṃko'nyaḥ kaulamārgaṃ dūṣayituṃ pravṛttaḥ syāt svayaṃ 
tatkhaṇḍena apaṭurapi tatra prāmāṇyabuddhiṃ na tyajet | ata eva kaulikācāraṃ 
(")na (?)(") dūṣayet ityeva likhitam | evaṃ gurau svasya kiṃcijjñatvasaṃśayo nāsti 
kiṃtu bahutantravettṛtvaṃ niścitaṃ ciravāsena | sa ca na jīvati | 
tadācāraviruddhaṃ yadi tantre kvacidupalabdhaṃ vacanaṃ tadā ācārasya 
durbalatvāt tanmūlabhūtapramāṇopalabdhiparyantaṃ 
tasyānanuṣṭhānarūpamaprāmāṇyaṃ śrautasmārtānuṣṭhāne 
pūrvamīmāṃsānusāreṇa | kaulike tu pūrvoktaniścayadaśāyāṃ 
śāstraviruddho'pyanuṣṭheya eveti viśeṣaḥ | na tu gurau mandamatitvaniścaye | 
tathā īdṛśo'bhiprāyaḥ tatraiva sadgurusaṃpradāyaikalabhyatvena ityatra gurau 

<p. 36>

sattvaviśeṣaṇena jñāpitaḥ | idaṃ tattvaṃ(-)gurau asarvajñatvānumāpako hetuḥ 
prabhūtaśāstraviruddhācāravattvaṃ sarvajñatvānumāpakaśca sarvāṃśena 
śāstrānumatatve sati tadviruddhakvācitkatvam ||

nanu sundaraḥ sumukhaḥ svacchaḥ sulakṣo (")sulabhaḥ(-)iti kvacit |(") bahutantravit iti 
kādimate gurulakṣaṇasyoktatvāt bahuśaḥ tantraviruddhānuṣṭhātāraṃ kathaṃ 
guruṃ śiṣyaḥ kuryāt | na hi sevārthaṃ vatsaroṣitasya viduṣaḥ ajñānaṃ 
saṃbhavati | kathamīdṛśamudāharaṇaṃ saṃbhavadyuktikamiti cet (-) na 
pūrvamajñatādaśāyāṃ kevalaśraddhodrekeṇa dīkṣitasya tādṛśaguruṃ 
svīkṛtavataḥ paścādadhyayanādisaṃpādita jñānasya pūrvoktahetunā 
anumānasaṃbhavāt | tādṛśena pūrvācāraḥ 

tyājya eva | yadyutpathaṃ daivāt pratipannaḥ tadā sadgurorapi saṃpradāya 
utpathapratittyuttarakālīnaḥ tyājya eva aśāstrīyatvanirṇayāt | ityalaṃ pallavitena 
||

amṛtānandanāthāstu (-) yoginītantravyākhyāne na deyaṃ paraśiṣyebhṇaḥ ityasya 
ye vidyā'ntareṣu pāraṃparyakrameṇa adhigatāśeṣarahasyāśeṣaparamārthāḥ 
saṃprāptapūrṇābhiṣekāśca te paraśiṣyāḥ tebhyo na deyam | 
kulārṇavavacanaṃ caitatparam | etadbhinneṣu deyaṃ madhulubdho yathā bhṛṅgaḥ 
iti vacanāt | īdṛśavyavasthāyāṃ mānaṃ ca pūrṇābhiṣekakartā yo guruḥ 
tasyaiva pāduketyāhuḥ ||

tanna | pūrṇābhiṣekakartari gurutvasyaiva jñāpakamidaṃ vacanam | tarhi tasyaiva 
pādukā iti bhāgo vyarthaḥ | yadi gurutvaṃ gurupādukāmantre tannāma ca 
vidhīyate tadā yo dīkṣākartā sa guruḥ ityekaṃ tasya nāma pādukāyāṃ 
yojyam(-)ityaparaṃ vākyam | tathā ca vākyabhedaḥ sa ityasya adhyāhāraḥ 
gurutvamātravidhau vacanāntareṇa gurunāmapādukāmantre yojyamityanenaiva 
siddhau śeṣavaiyyarthyaṃ durvāraṃ ca | tasmāt madhulubdhaḥ iti vacanena 
nānāguruṣu siddheṣu pādukāmantre sarveṣāṃ nāmnāṃ pakṣe prāptau 
niyāmakamidam | tathā sati na parasamīhitasiddhiḥ | pratyuta anena vacanena 
nānāguruprāptireva jñāpyate | tasmāt asmaduktā saraṇireva sādhīyasī ||

dṛśyate cādhunikānāṃ śāstraviruddhānāmācārāṇāṃ prāmāṇyaṃ 
pūrvamīmāṃsāvidāmapi yathā āndhrāṇāṃ mātulakanyāpariṇayaḥ | tathā 
drāviḍasuvāsinīṣu kañcukadhāraṇābhāvaḥ 

sa kañcukayatiṃ dṛṣṭvā akañcukasuvāsinīm |
sakeśāṃ vidhavāṃ dṛṣṭvā sacelasnānamācaret ||

ityāṅgirasavacanaviruddhaḥ | ato na kiṃcidbādhakam ||

<p. 37>

yadi kevalaṃ gurau viśvaseccet tarhi sa tiṣṭhanneva mūtrapurīṣotsargaṃ kuryāt 
cet tadā svasyāpi karaṇāpattiḥ | yadi ca bahutantraviduṣi kacidvacanaṃ 
tadviruddhaṃ dṛṣṭvā tadācāre aprāmāṇyagrahaḥ sa kiṃ tāvadaṃśe 
svīkriyate uta sarvāṃśe | nādyaḥ loke 
kvaciccaitrādāvajñātāprāmāṇyagrahācāre kadācidaprāmāṇyagrahe sarvatra 
aprāmāṇyaśaṅkayā na viśvasantīti dṛṣṭaṃ loke | tadvadatrāpi 
sakṛdvyabhicāre sarvatra śaṅkayā ananuṣṭhānāpattiḥ | sā ca śaṅkā sarvatra 
mūladarśanamantarā nāpaiti | sarvatra mūlaśodhanārthe udyuktaścet tatra 
saṃpradāyānusaraṇavidhiḥ vyarthaḥ syāt | na ca yatra pakṣadvayarūpo vikalpaḥ 
tatra svagurusaṃpradāyācaraṇavidhiḥ sārthakaḥ syāt iti vācyam 
evamadhikāribhedena yadi pakṣadvayaṃ vyavasthitaṃ tadā tantraśāstre 
vikalpaviṣayatvaṃ sarvathā na syāt | yathā viśeṣārghyapātrādhāre tripadaṃ 
catuṣpadam apadaṃ veti pakṣāstatra guruṇā tripadamevānuṣṭhitaṃ tathaiva 
śiṣyeṇāpyanuṣṭhitam | kadācit tripadaṃ gataṃ (-) catuṣpadaṃ labdhaṃ tena 
anuṣṭhānaṃ syāt guruṇā ananuṣṭhitatvāt | vikalpasya udbheda evaṃ na syāt | 
ekapuruṣakartṛke karmaṇi prayogabheyena pakṣadvayasamāveśa eva hi vikalpaḥ ||

kiṃca (-) guruvākye viśvāsavidhirvyarthaḥ | śaṅkānivṛttyarthe 
mūlānveṣaṇārthamudyuktasya kathaṃ kimiti guruvākye ativiśvāsaḥ | tasmāt 
guroryogyatāmanumāya (")atroktaguruḥ kīdṛśaścikīrṣitastajjñānārthaṃ 
dvipariśiṣṭe 6 vi(.) dṛśyaḥ |(") ca sadguruvākyaṃ viśvaset ||

umānandanāthāstu ekagurūpāstiḥ itivākyaṃ samāpya asaṃśayassarvatra iti 
yojayitvā guruvākye śāstrādau sarvatra asaṃśayaḥ iti vyācakruḥ | tanna 
saṃpradāyaviśvāsābhyāṃ sarvasiddhiḥ viśvāsabhūyiṣṭhaṃ prāmāṇyam 
ityābhyāmeva asyārthasya prāptatvena punaruktyāpatteḥ || 20 ||

sarvatra niṣparigrahatā 

navamaṃ dharmamāha(-)

sarvatra niṣparigrahatā || 21 ||

sarvatra mapañcakādiṣu niṣparigrahatā nirgataḥ parigrahaḥ icchā yasya saḥ 
niṣparigrahaḥ tasya bhāvaḥ tattā patnīparijanādānamūlaśāpāḥ parigrahāḥ 
ityamaraḥ | atrādānasya parigrahasya mūlam (-) icchaiva | etādṛśakośānusāreṇa 
parigrahaśabdaḥ icchāvācakaḥ | mapañcakaṃ me bhūyāt itīcchayā na 
svīkāryamityarthaḥ | ayamevārtho bhāgavate spaṣṭaṃ pratipāditaḥ(-)

<p. 38>

yad ghrāṇabhakṣovihitassurāyāstathā paśorālabhanaṃ na hiṃsā |
evaṃ vyavāyaḥ prajayā na ratyai imaṃ viśuddhaṃ nu viduḥ svadharmam ||

ye tvanevaṃvidaḥ puṃsaḥstabdhāḥ sadabhimāninaḥ |
paśūn druhmanti vistrabdhāḥ pretya khādanti te ca tān ||

iti ghrāṇabhakṣaḥ śāstreṇa kathitaṃ kartavyamiti bhakṣaṇam ālabhanaṃ 
devatoddeśena tyāgabuddhyā paśvādihananam ||

yadvā(-)sarvatra vastumātre niṣparigrahatā svīyabuddhityāgaḥ saṃpādanīyaḥ | 
sarvatra mamatā tyājyeti yāvat ||

yacca nityotsavanibandhe svabhogabuddhyā dhanaṃ na 
saṃpādanīyamityarthakathanaṃ taccaturthādhyāye dravyārjanaṃ kratvarthamiti 
pūrvapakṣīkṛtya dravyārjanaṃ kevalapuruṣārtha iti jaiminisiddhāntaviruddham || 
21 ||

phalatyāgapūrvakakarma 

daśamaṃ dharmamāha(-)

phalaṃ tyaktvā karmakaraṇam || 22 ||

phalaṃ pūrvoktaṃ kṛtrimaṃ tatsādhanaṃ ca dharmārthakāmā iti yāvat | 
phalaviṣayiṇī icchā phalapadasyārthaḥ | taṃ tyaktvā karmaṇaḥ vihitasya 
karaṇaṃ bhavatīti śeṣaḥ | kāmyaṃ karma na kartavyamityarthaḥ | kāmyaṃ karma 
na kartavyam iti vaktavye phalaṃ tyaktvā kartavyamiti kathanāt kāmyānāmapi 
karmaṇāmīśvarārpaṇabuddhyā anuṣṭhānaṃ kartavyamiti jñāyate ||

nanu bhagavadgītāyāṃ 

caturvidhā bhajante māṃ janāḥ sukṛtino'rjuna |
ārto jijñāsurarthārthī jñānī ca bharatarṣabha ||

iti sakāmopāsanā bhagavatā pratipāditā tadvirodha iti cet (-) na caturvidhā bhajanto 
māṃ ityanena lokasvabhāvo darśitaḥ | kāmyaṃ karma na kartavyam (-) iti jagau | ata 
eva 

yaśca karmaphalatyāgī sa tyāgītyabhidhīyate ||
teṣāṃ jñānī nityayukta ekabhaktirviśiṣyate || 

iti kāmarahitakarmaṇaḥ stutiḥ || 22 ||

<p. 39>

nityakarmālopaḥ 

ekādaśaṃ dharmamāha(-)

anityakarmalopaḥ || 23 ||

nityaṃ ca tatkarma ca nityakarma snānasandhyāpūjā'di tasya lopaḥ 
ananuṣṭhānaṃ nityakarmalopaḥ na vidyate nityakarmalopo yasminnupāsake saḥ 
anityakarmalopaḥ | bhavediti śeṣaḥ | nityakarma avaśyaṃ kartavyamityarthaḥ | 
nityakarma kartavyamiti vaktavye vyatirekamukhena kathanaṃ tyāge na kevalaṃ 
kratuvaiguṇyaṃ pratyavāyo nirayaśceti jñāpayati || 23 ||

nanu nityakarmasādhanībhūtamapañcakālābhe kathaṃ 
kāryamityāśaṅkāyāmāha(-)

mapañcakālābhe'pi nityakramapratyavamṛṣṭiḥ || 24 ||

mapañcakālābhe mukhyaṃ nāstīti na karmalopaḥ | kiṃ tu pratinidhinā'pi 
nityakramaḥ nityapūjā tasyāḥ pratyavamṛṣṭiḥ anuṣṭhānaṃ kartavyamiti śeṣaḥ 
|| 

nanu ṣaṣṭhādhyāye darśapūrṇamāse vrīhīṇāmabhāve karmalopa iti 
pūrvapakṣaṃ kṛtvā teṣāṃ dṛṣṭapuroḍāśaniṣpattiphalakatvena nīvārairapi 
tatsaṃbhavāt nityakarmaṇi vrīhiniyamalope'pi nityakarmaṇaḥ 
kiṃcidaṅgalopasahiṣṇutvāt nityanaimittike pratinidhinā'pi kārye iti siddhāntitam 
| tādṛśyanyāyamūlakatayā śrautasmārtakarmasu pratinidhipracāro'pi dṛśyate 
atrāpi tādṛśayuktyaiva pratinidhisiddhau vacanaṃ vyarthamiti cet(-)

na | nityavannyāyena naimittike'pi prāptau tatra pratinidhinā 
naimittikakramanirvṛttirmā bhavatu etadarthakatvāt | na caivaṃ sati alābhe 
nityātiriktaṃ na kāryamityāyātam | tathā sati śrautaparisaṃkhyārūpatvena 
(")atraiva khaṇḍe'nugata 20 sūtrabhāṣye ṭippaṇyāṃ kārikā dṛśyā |(") 
svārthatyāgaḥ parārthakalpanā prāptabādhaḥ iti doṣatrayāpattiḥ iti vācyam 
tantraratne pārthasārathinā abhyudayeṣṭyadhikaraṇe tredhā taṇḍulān vibhajet iti 
vākyavaiyyarthyabhiyā pratyuddeśaṃ vākyaparisamāptirūpo 
vākyabhedo'ṅgīkṛtaḥ | kimu tādṛśabhītyā doṣatrayāṅgīkāre | ata eva 
(")vijñāyaitāvataitadbhāṣyakṛtaḥ śrīpūjyapādapaṃ(.) bhāskararāyapādāḥ 
paramagurava (-) iti |(") asmatparamagurubhiḥ uttaracatuśśatīsetubandhe 
dviśatottaradvitīyaśloke naimittikaprakaraṇe cakrapūjāṃ viśeṣeṇa yoginīnāṃ 
samācaret iti mūlasthaviśeṣeṇetipadasya nityapūjāmapekṣya 
yoginīvīrādhikyabhakṣyabhojyādyādhikyādineti prathamaṃ vyākhyāya 
tatrāparitoṣeṇa 

<p. 40>

viśeṣadravyeṇa vetyarthaḥ | tena nityapūjāyāṃ viśeṣadrayālābhe'pi 
pratinidhinā nirvāhaḥ sūcitaḥ iti nityapūjāyāmeva abhyanujñāṃ natvanyatra iti 
vyākhyāya asminnarthe sādhakatvena idameva vākyaṃ darśitam || 24 ||

sarvatra nirbhayatā 

dvādaśaṃ guṇamāha(-)

nirbhayatā sarvatra (")sarvataḥ(-)ba |(") || 25 ||

sarvatra sarvataḥ mapañcakasvīkāre kaulamārgāvalambane ca 
narakādipratipādakāni yāni śāstrāṇi tebhyaḥ sarvebhyaḥ nirgataḥ bhayaṃ 
yasmāt saḥ nirbhayaḥ tasya bhāvaḥ tattā saṃpādanīyeti śeṣaḥ | tāni sarvāṇi 
śāstrāṇi rāgiṇaṃ bhīṣayanti kāmaṃ bhīṣayantu ahantu na rāgī kiṃtu 
śāstreṇa pravartito na me bhītiriti nirdhāraṇena nirbhayatā saṃpādanīyeti 
bhāvaḥ || 25 ||

sarvasārabhūto dharmaḥ svasya śivāgrau homaḥ 

sakalasiddhāntasārabhūtaṃ dharmamāha(-)

sarvaṃ vedyaṃ havyam indriyāṇi srucaḥ śaktayojvālāḥ 
svātmā śivaḥ pāvakaḥ svayameva hotā (")etatsūtrāditāntrikangrathānāṃ 
śrībrahmabhāvanāgauravaṃ dṛśyamatraṃ |(") || 26 ||

iti bhāvayediti śeṣaḥ | antaḥkaraṇavṛttibhiriti 
(")etatsūtrasthavedyādipadānāmartho'dhastanabhāṣye susphuṭo'sti |(") 
vedyamityasyādau pūraṇīyam | antaḥkaraṇavṛttivedyaṃ sarvaṃ haviṣṭvena 
bhāvayet | yathā agnau prakṣiptaṃ haviḥ tadākāraṃ bhavati evaṃ 
vṛttivedyānāṃ sarveṣāṃ śivarūpe'gnau home sati śivākārasaṃpatteḥ teṣu 
haviṣṭvena bhāvanaṃ yuktam ||

tādṛśahaviṣaḥ ādhārabhūtahomasādhanībhūtajuhureva srukpadena gṛhyate 
dhruvā'dayaḥ teṣāṃ srukpadavācyatve'pi homasādhanatvābhāvena 
homabhāvanāprakaraṇe dhruvā'dīnāmayogyatvāt (")ito'gratana(-)
aprakṛtavicāreṇa(-)ityantabhāṣyagranthena(-)
viśeṣaṇībhūtaikapadaniṣṭhaikavacanabahuvacanayoḥ svalpaḥśāstrārtho'sti |(") | 
na ca srucaḥ ekatvena bahuvacanamanupapannamiti vācyam indriyāṇāmanekatvena 
tadviśeṣaṇasya tatsamānavacanakatvārthaṃ bahuvacanam | na ca 
āropyāropasthale na casamānavacanatvaniyamaḥ ata eva naiṣadhe(-)

<p. 41>

atraivakāreṇa(-)karmāntare svasyānuṣṭhānāsāmarthye putra priyādīn 
kartṛpratinidhitvena yojayanti tena ca tatkarmajaṃ phalaṃ bhavatīti śāstrasiddham | 
asmin yajñe pratinidhinā anuṣṭhite karmajanyaphalaṃ svasya na bhavatīti sūcitam || 
26 ||

bhāvanāphalam ātmalābhaḥ 

evamanuṣṭhitabhāvanāyāḥ phalamāha(-)

nirviṣayacidvimṛṣṭiḥ phalam || 27 ||

nirviṣayāyāḥ nirvikalparūpāyāḥ citaḥ vimṛṣṭiḥ phalam |

pūrvoktabhāvanāyā (")pāścātya-30-patrastha 13 sūtrādetat 27-
sūtrāntoktasadbhāvanāyāḥ ityarthaḥ(") iti śeṣaḥ || 27 || 

nanu kimīdṛśaphalalābhenetyata āha(-)

ātmalābhānna paraṃ vidyate || 28 ||

ātmalābhāt svarūpalābhāt paraṃ śreṣṭhaṃ phalam(-)iti pūrvasūtrastham 
anuṣajyate na vidyate nāstītyarthaḥ | puruṣānna paraṃ kiṃcit sā kāṣṭhā sā 
parā gatiḥ iti tamevaṃ vidvānamṛta iha bhavati iti ca śrutiḥ(-)imamarthaṃ 
pratipādayati | mokṣaḥ paramapuruṣārthaḥ ityatra na ko'pi vivādaṃ karoti | 
atastādṛśabhāvanayā paramapuruṣārthalābhaḥ iti bhāvaḥ | pūrvaṃ 
(")pūrvaṃnāma-1-khaṇḍe 26-patre 6 sūtre(-)ityarthaḥ(-)(") śvavimarśaḥ puruṣārthaḥ 
ityanena puruṣārthasvarūpaṃ pratipāditaṃ atra stutiriti na paunaruktyam ||

etāvatparyantaṃ (")etatpañcāmnāyānāṃ nāmārthamāhātmyādikṛte ddi(.)(-)pa-4 
vi(.)(-)dṛṣyaḥ(") pañcāmnāyasiddhāntarūpaśrīparaśurāmoktayorvicārya 
vikhyātāḥ | keśavaśarmā kaścit tadabhiprāyajñānāsamarthaḥ tā dūṣayāmi 
iti kevalerṣyayā yuktiśūnyān pralāpānabhāṇīt sudhiyāṃ taddarśanenaiva 
yuktirahitatvajñānaṃ bhaviṣyati | mandadhiyāṃ śaṅkānivṛttyarthaṃ mayaiva 
tadyuktiṣu kevalapralāparūpatvaṃ darśitaṃ matkṛtasiddhāntaśiromaṇau | 
granthavistarabhayānneha likhyate | ye tadbubhutsavaḥ te tata eva jānantu || 28 ||

siddhāntopasaṃhāraḥ 

atrāyaṃ siddhāntaḥ ityārabhya prakrāntamartham upasaṃharati(-)

saiṣā śāstraśailī || 29 ||

saiṣā pūrvoktā śāstraśailī śāstīti śāstraṃ pañcāmnāyarūpaṃ tasya 
śailī rītiḥ bhavatīti śeṣaḥ || 29 ||

<p. 42>

eṣā vidyā atiguptā 

etādṛśaṃ śāstraṃ śrotṛpravṛttaye praśaṃsati(-)

veśyā iva prakaṭā vedādividyāḥ |
sarveṣu darśaneṣu gupteyaṃ vidyā || 30 ||

veśyā iva prakaṭāḥ sulabhāḥ vedādividyāḥ | ādinā smṛtyādiḥ | 
veśyopabhogodravyādivyayena yathā sulabhaḥ evaṃ vedādividyālābhaḥ 
dravyādidānena sulabhaḥ ityarthaḥ | adhyayanasya lobhamūlatā śāstreṇaiva 
pratipāditā ṣaṇṇāṃ tu karmaṇāṃ madhye trīṇi karmāṇi jīvikā iti | asyāḥ 
mokṣasādhanībhūtabrahmavidyāyāstu na koṭikanakavyayenāpi lābhaḥ kiṃ tu 
gurukṛpaikalabhyatvam ||

nanu adhikadravyavyaye guruḥ kṛpāṃ kimiti na kuryāditi cet(-)na kuryādeva | yena 
guruṇā brahmavidyā prāptā tasya koṭisuvarṇaṃ tṛṇādapi tucchataram | tasmin 
lobhaḥ kathaṃ bhavet || 

nanu lobhena pravṛttimān bhavatu tathā'pi parecchayā vidyādāne pravṛttau svasya 
hānyabhāvāt pravartatām tathā ca pūrvavidyā dravyavataiva labhyā iyaṃ tu 
nirdhanenāpi labdhuṃ śakyeti prakaṭatareti cet (-) na vidvān parecchayā 
pravartamānaḥ svapravartitavastuni kāryasiddhiṃ dṛṣṭvaiva pravarteta na viphale | 
prakṛte iyaṃ brahmavidyā malināntaḥkaraṇeṣu pravartinā na kevalaṃ viphalā 
pratyuta gurorapi vidyāṃ nāśayati | udāhṛtā etadviṣaye yāskena śrutiḥ(-)

vidyā ha vai brāhmaṇamājagāma gopāya māṃ śevadhiṣṭe'hamasmi |
asūyakāyānṛjave'yatāya na māṃ brūyā vīryavatī tathā syām |

iti | asyārthaḥ suspaṣṭaḥ ||

brahmavidyā'tisaṃkhinnā brahmiṣṭhaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ yayau |
gopāya māṃ sadaiva tvaṃ kulajāmiva yoṣitam |
śevadhistvakṣayaste'ham iha loke paratra ca |

ityārabhya(-)

evamādyā yeṣu doṣāstebhyo varjaya māṃ sadā |
evaṃ hi kurvato nityaṃ kāmadhenurivāsmi te |
