deśakālau samullikhya cāṣṭāṅgasthitimeva ca iti paramānandatantrānusāreṇa | 
tanna deśakālāvityatra kālaḥ kīdṛśaḥ ityākāṃkṣāpūrakaṃ 
tantrasthāṣṭāṅgapadaṃ na tu samuccayavidhāyakam evakārasvārasyāt ||

evamagre amukagotro amukaśākhā'dhyāyī amukaśarmādirahaṃ 
caturvidhapuruṣārthasiddhyarthaṃ sveṣṭānugrahāya amukagotra 
amukaśākhā'dhyāyinaṃ amukaśarmāṇa tvāṃ gurutvena vṛṇe iti saṃkalpaḥ 
kiṃ kalpasūtrānusāreṇa(-)

bahvalpaṃ vā svagṛhyoktaṃ yasya yāvat prakīrtitam |
tasya tāvati śāstrārthe kṛte sarvaḥ kṛto bhavet ||

<p. 49>

iti vacanamanusṛtya tantrāntarānupasaṃhāreṇa ayaṃ prayogaḥ kiṃ 
sarvatantramupasaṃhṛtya kiṃ svecchayā | nādyaḥ sūtre varaṇasya anuktatvāt | 
dvitīye tantrāntare 
pratimābrahmādivaraṇacarunirmāṇatadbhakṣaṇādityāgo'nucitaḥ | tṛtīyaśca 
svakapolakalpito'śraddheya eva | kiṃ ca tantrāntare(-)

kartuṃ kārayituṃ caiva dīkṣākarma maheśvari |
ācāryatvena tvāṃ vṛṇe iti pādasamīpataḥ ||

iti varaṇe kariṣyamāṇe'pi dīkṣākarmaṇi ācāryaṃ vṛṇe ityeva vaktavyamiti 
vadati | sarvatra śraute smārte ca ṛtvigvaraṇe(-)asminnagnyādhāne'dhvaryuṃ tvāṃ 
vṛṇe asminnudyāpanākhye karmaṇi ācāryaṃ tvāmahaṃ vṛṇe ityācāro 
dṛśyate | iha tu karma nāma tyaktvā phalavācakaṃ puruṣārthasiddhyartham(-)
anugrahārthaṃ ceti varaṇavākye likhitam | tadatīva citram | tasmāt 
sūtrānusāribhiḥ varaṇaṃ na kāryam | na ca varaṇābhāve guruṇā avṛtena 
karma kathaṃ kāryam(-)iti vācyam tvaṃ mama dīkṣāṃ kuru iti laukikavaraṇenāpi 
tatsaṃbhavāt | na hi vayaṃ sarvathā nirākurmo varaṇaṃ karmāṅgamityeva 
brūmaḥ ||

evameva puṇyāhavācananāndīśrāddhe na kārye anuktatvāt | na ca 
tantrāntaropasaṃhāro mā bhavatu tathā'pi smṛtiprāptaṃ puṇyāhavācanaṃ 
nāndīśrāddhaṃ ca anivāryam anyathā(-)kṣute ācāmet iti prāptācamanamapi na 
syāt iti vācyam yadi puṇyāhavācananāndīśrāddhe tāntrike smṛtiprāpte 
evānuvartete tarhi tantrāntare(-)

gaṇeśaṃ pūjya puṇyāhaṃ vācya nāndīmukhān yajet |

iti vidhiḥ vyartha eva syāt | tasmāt smārtapuṇyāhādidharmāḥ karmāṅgatvena 
nāyānti ityatra idameva jñāpakam | yacca kṣute ācāmet na kalañjaṃ bhakṣayet 
iti puruṣārthaṃ tacca prāptamaparihāryam ||

na ca evaṃ śiṣyagurulakṣaṇadharmāṇāmapi prāptiḥ na syāt iti vācyam asti 
tasya prāptyavakāśaḥ | tatra yena vinā ākāṃkṣā na pūryate tacca 
tantrāntarasthamapi gṛhītvā ākāṃkṣāṃ pūrayet | śābdabodhe ākāṃkṣā 
dvividhā utthitā utthāpyā ceti | yathā ādyā pacatītyukte kaṃ pacati kena pacati 
kaḥ pacatīti | dvitīyā stokaṃ pacatīti | tatra stokapadasya vaiyyarthyabhiyā kathaṃ 
pacati ityākāṃkṣā utthāpyā | prathamasthale svata utthitāyāḥ 
śābdākāṃkṣāyāḥ śabdamantarā'nivṛtteḥ adhyāhṛtasya sthalāntarasthasya 
vā śabdasya pūraṇamāvaśyakam | tatra adhyāhārāt varaṃ 
tantrāntarasthaśabdenaiva ākāṃkṣāpūraṇam | evaṃ sati matimān (")idamanugata(-)
43-patrasthaṃ 31 sūtram |(") dīkṣeta ityukte matimattvasya kevalasya 
avyāvartakatayā kīdṛśaṃ matimattvam(-)ityākāṃkṣā avaśyamudeti | 

<p. 50>

uditākāṃkṣāpūrakaṃ tantrāntaroktaśiṣyalakṣaṇavattvameva matimattvaṃ 
kalpyate | evaṃ gurau sadguruḥ (")idamapyagre-53-patrasthaṃ 34 sūtram |(") kramaṃ 
pravartya ityagrimasūtre uktatvāt sattvaṃ kim(-)ityākāṃkṣāpūrakatayā 
gurulakṣaṇāni ca yojyāni | ata eva baudhāyanācāryāḥ(-)tānna mithaḥ 
saṃsādayet ityāhuḥ | atra bhavasvāmī tān śālikīśākhoktān pakṣān 
tadanyaśākhī na saṃsādayet ekaprayoge melanaṃ na kuryāt | brāhmaṇānāṃ 
bahutvāt śākhānāmanantatvāt tadarthasya cāsarvajñena 
upasaṃhartumaśakyatvāt tāvanmātraṃ sukhaṃ buddhvā anuṣṭhāya sarve 
karmaphalaṃ prāpnuyuḥ iti kalpasūtrāṇyārabdhāni ācāryaiḥ iti |

asyāpavādastatraiva aviśeṣoktaiḥ viśeṣoktāśca śeṣatvena saṃbadhyante iti | atra 
bhavasvāmī(-)aviśeṣoktaiḥ viśeṣoktāḥ sāmānyata uktasya guṇaviśeṣāḥ 
anyasūtroktā api śeṣatvena aṅgatvena saṃbadhyanta iti | tānna mithaḥ 
saṃsādayet ityasyodāharaṇaṃ yathā baudhāyane somābhiṣavārthaṃ 
kevalavasatīvarīgrahaṇam | sūtrāntare vasatīvarīṇāṃ ekadhānānāmapi 
samuccayaḥ | tadanusāreṇa baudhāyanānāmekadhānāprāptau tānna mithaḥ 
saṃsādayet iti | evaṃ baudhāyane kevalaṃ śākhāchedanamātramuktam | 
anyasūtre śākhāchedanamāharaṇaṃ ca samantrakam | tānapi na saṃsādayet | 
anayā diśā anyānyapyudāhāryāṇi | etadapavādodāharaṇaṃ yathā 
baudhāyane palāśaśākhaiva sānnāyye vihitā tasyāstatsūtriṇāmalābhe 
sūtrāntaroktaśamīśākhā grāhyeti | tatra mūlam(-)uktalābhe kīdṛśī śākhā 
grāhyeti utthitākāṃkṣāvattvāt tatpūrakaṃ sūtrāntaraṃ 
śamīśākhāvidhāyakam | evaṃ baudhāyane(-)agnīnanvādadhāti ityaviśeṣeṇa 
vihitam | kathamanvādhānaṃ kartavyamiti viśeṣākāṃkṣāyām(-)apareṇa 
gārhapatyamupasthaṃ kṛtvā iti ūrdhvajñurāsīno'nvāhāryapacanam(-) 
(")atrādhvaryu(-)iti saṃbhāvyet |(") iti sūtrāntaroktadharmāḥ śeṣatvenānvetumarhanti 
| na tathā pūrvoktaikadhānā'kāṃkṣā'sti | ato na samuccayaḥ |

etena etatsūtrānusāribhirapi tantrāntaroktaṃ pātratrayaṃ pātracatuṣṭayaṃ 
vāsādanīyamiti yadabruvan tadasādhviti sphuṭam | yadyaviśeṣeṇa 
pātrāsādanaṃ kuryādityeva syāt tadā kati pātrāṇi kathamāsādayet iti 
viśeṣākāṃkṣā udeti | tadā tadapavādaśāstrapravṛttirapi syāt | na caivamihāsti 
yena tathā syāt |

etena nibandhe sāmayikānāṃ svasya ca tattvaśodhanārthaṃ devyāḥ 
paścādbhāge laukikaṃ kalaśaṃ saṃsthāpya saṃskṛtadravyaṃ kiṃcit kṣipet iti 
lekho'pi nirmūlaḥ śiṣṭaiḥ sārdhaṃ cidagnau haviḥśeṣaṃ hutvā iti 
viśeṣārghyaśeṣasyaiva pratipattikathanāt |

<p. 51>

ata eva baudhāyanācāryāḥ śāstrasaṅkaraṃ na kuryādityuktvā saṅkarakaraṇe 
pratyavāyamapyāhuḥ(-)

svaśāstre vartamāno yaḥ paraśāstreṇa vartate |
bhrūṇahatyāsamaṃ tasya svaśāstramavamanyataḥ || iti ||

na caivaṃ pūrvoktarītyā anuṣṭhitirudāsīnasthale bhavatu yasyākaraṇe 
śāstrāntare nindā bahvī tasyānuṣṭhānaṃ sarvaiḥ kāryam iti vācyam 
ātañcanaprakaraṇe tadyatkvalaiḥ (")tadva(-)a(.") rākṣasam iti kvalanindāṃ kṛtvā 
dadhnā'tanakti iti śākhā'ntare vihitam | tadanyaśākhāyāṃ auṣadhayaḥ 
pūtikāḥ kvalāḥ iti kvalaiḥ ātañcanaṃ vihitam | evaṃ 
patnīsaṃyājāsamiṣṭayajuranuṣṭhāne (")pitryāyāṃ sami(-)ba ba 1(.") bahunindā 
kvacicchrūyate | baudhāyanairnindā na kṛtā | tāvataiva paranindāmanādṛtya 
samiṣṭayajuranuṣṭhānaṃ baudhāyanānuyāyinaḥ kurvanti śiṣṭāḥ | tasmāt 
paraśāstre nindā akiñcitkarā |

na ca tripurārahasye(-)

tantrānuktaṃ sūcitaṃ tu tathā'nyeṣvapi dūṣitam |
akṛtaṃ karma yadrāma (")ḍāmarivi(-)a a 1(.") vikalpanavivarjitam |
tadanyasmādupādeyameṣa śāstrasya nirṇayaḥ ||

ityasyāḥ gativiraha iti vācyam yasyānanuṣṭhāne paraśāstre nindā svaśāstre ca 
vikalpaḥ tasya tatra nindā yadviṣaye paraśāstre tadādartavyaṃ tāvatā 
svaśāstrahānivirahāt | yathā āpastambasūtre vājapeye agnicayananindā 
baudhāyane na nindā kṛtā kiṃtu codakaśāstreṇa uttaravedyā saha vikalpitam | 
tatra svaśāstrasya uttaravedyanuṣṭhāne'pi hānyabhāvāt 
niṣedho'pyanugrāhyaḥ(-)uttaravedirevānuṣṭheyā ca cayanamiti ||

tathā atrāpi tādṛśasthale anuṣṭhānārtham idaṃ vacanam na nityavacchrutasya 
śāstrasya bādhārtham | etadvacanasya gatyataraṃ śrīvidyāprakaraṇe vistareṇa 
vakṣyāmaḥ ||

astu vā (")asyādhastanabhāṣyagataphalādhikyam(-)ityanenānvayaḥ |(")(-)

niṣiddhaṃ varjayettantrāntare kiṃcinmaheśvari |
yatastadekaśāstraṃ vai mantraikyāddevataikyataḥ |
tasmāt svaśāstre yatkiṃcinniṣiddhaṃ parivarjayet 

<p. 52>

anyatsvatantrānuktaṃ tu samartha upasaṃharet |
svatantreṇāviruddhaṃ tu yāvadanyat samācaret |
tāvadabhyudayādhikyaṃ bhavettasya tu niścitam |
ākāṃkṣitaṃ cāpyanyasmādāharedeva kiṃcana ||

iti tantrāntaravacanānusāreṇa puṇyāhavācanādīnām upasaṃhāre 
phalādhikyam | ananuṣṭhāne avaiguṇyamiti rahasyam |

pātrādhikyaṃ ca svaśāstraviruddhaṃ heyameva vastuto likhitatantravacasām agre 
(")agre nāma(-)āgāmini 3 khaṇḍastha śrīkramīye 31 sūtrabhāṣyāntagranthe |(") 
pātrāsādanaprakaraṇe vakṣyamāṇarītyā gatisaṃbhavāt 
anupapattileśābhāvāt | ekaprayoge yatsūcitam ākāṃkṣitaṃ karmasāmānye 
avyabhicaritasaṃbandhaṃ ca (")tat(") anyasmāt grāhyaṃ nānyaditi rāddhāntaḥ | 
etadvitatyāgre spaṣṭīkariṣyāmaḥ |

itthaṃ ca yaḥ puruṣaḥ sarvatantrāṇyupasaṃhṛtya yāvadaṅgeṣviyattāṃ 
saṃpādya ekarūpaṃ prayogavidhiṃ nirmāya anuṣṭhātuṃ samarthaḥ tasya 
sarvajñasya tādṛśakarmaṇaḥ śreyo'dhikyaṃ bhaviṣyatveva | 
yastvetādṛśe'samarthaḥ saḥ tvākāṃkṣitādimātraṃ tantrāntarāt gṛhītvā 
svaśāstramātrānuṣṭhānena kṛtārtho bhaviṣyatyeva | na tu tantrāntarasthānāṃ 
keṣāṃcidupasaṃhāraḥ keṣāṃcidanupasaṃhāraḥ ityardhajaratīyanyāyo yuktaḥ 
| nibandhakāro nyāyagandhamajānan svecchayā kānicidupasaṃharan kānicit 
parityajan devānāṃ priya iti mantavya ityalamatilekhanena ||

sarvathetyanena (")etatpracaladekatriṃśasūtrasthaḥ sarvathā śabdo'tra bodhyaḥ |(") 
dīkṣāṃ vinā nātyantikī muktiḥ iti sūcitam | tatra spaṣṭaṃ pramāṇaṃ 
tripurārahasyasthaṃ pūrvameva likhitam || 31 ||

dīkṣātrayam 

evaṃ dīkṣāṃ vidhāya tatra avāntarabhedavatīṣu tāsu ekakālasaṃbandhaṃ 
vidhātum ādau tāṃ vibhajya vibhāgaprayojakaṃ dharmaṃ ca pradarśya tāsu 
tisṛṣvapi ekakālasaṃbandharūpaṃ guṇaṃ vidhatte(-)

dīkṣāstisraḥ śāktī śāṃbhavī māntrī ceti |
tatra śāktī śaktipraveśanāt śāmbhavī caraṇavinyāsāt 
māntrī mantropadiṣṭayā sarvāśca kuryāt || 32 ||

cetītyantena vibhāgaṃ kṛtvā tāsāṃ nāmakathanam | tatra tāsu madhye 
śāktītyasyārthaṃ vivṛṇoti śaktipraveśanāt | jāteti śeṣaḥ | yadvā(-)
śaktipraveśanāt iti hetau pañcamī |

<p. 53>

śaktipraveśanādyā dīkṣā śaktipraveśahetukītyarthaḥ | evamevāgre'pi | 
praveśanāditi svārthe lyuṭ | śaktipraveśanaṃ nāma agre (")agre nāmātraiva 
dīkṣāvidhau-35-36 sūtrayorityarthaḥ |(") tadamṛtakṣālitam ityārabhya pāśān 
dagdhvā ityantapratipāditā kriyā | caraṇavinyāso nāma śiṣyaśirasi 
gurukartṛkaṃ kāmeśvarīkāmeśvarayoḥ raktaśuklacaraṇabhāvanam | 
mantropadeśastu spaṣṭaḥ 
śiṣyamātraśrāvaṇaviṣayagurukartṛkaśabdoccāraṇarūpaḥ | sarvāḥ 
pūrvoktāḥ | tisraścetyanena ekakālasaṃbandhaḥ tāsu bodhyate | ca śabdaḥ 
sāhityavācī | sāhityaṃ ca ekakālasaṃbaddhatvarūpam | tathā ca sarvāḥ 
dīkṣāḥ saha kuryāditi phalito'rthaḥ || 32 ||

pareṣāṃ matamāha(-)

ekaikāṃ vetyeke || 33 ||

vīpsayā trayāṇāṃ samuccayaḥ kālabhedamātramiti jñāpitam | vākāreṇa 
madhye cirakālavyavadhānaṃ kāryaṃ na tu divasatraya iti sūcitam || 33 ||

itaḥ paraṃ gurukartṛkāṃmāha(-)

sadguruḥ (")ito gururdīkṣādānavidhimārabhate |(") kramaṃ pravartya sāṅgaṃ hutvā 
taruṇollāsavān śiṣyamāhūya vāsasā mukhaṃ baddhvā 
gaṇapatilalitāśyāmāvārtālīparāpātrabindubhistamavokṣya siddhāntaṃ 
śrāvayitvā || 34 ||

sāṅgam aṅgaiḥsahitaṃ kramaṃ pradhānadevatāpūjāṃ pravartya kṛtvā | atra 
aṅgāni gaṇapatiśyāmāvārtālīparāḥ | pradhānaṃ ca lalitā | atra aṅgapadena 
aṅgakramo lakṣyate | aṅgakramasahitaṃ pradhānakramamityarthaḥ || 

nanu idaṃ kathaṃ jñātamiti cet(-)śṛṇu | atraiva dvitīyakhaṇḍārambhe itthaṃ 
(")dvitīyakhaṇḍasya prathamasūtre itthaṃ sadityādi 1 sūtramasti |(") 
sadgurorāhitadīkṣaḥ mahāvidyā'rādhanapratyūhāpohāya gāṇanāyakīṃ 
paddhatimāmṛśet ityatra vighnāpohāya yatkriyate tatpradhānam (")aṅgaṃ(") loke 
dṛṣṭam | yathā rājadarśanārthamudyuktasya madhye dvārapālaiḥ nirodhe kṛte 
sati tadupāsanaṃ rājadarśanāṅgamiti | na ca prāṇimātrasya 
vighnaśaṃkāsattvāt vighnanāśako gaṇapatiriti ghaṇṭāghoṣāt 
vighnaparihārārthaṃ yathā karmamātre gaṇapatyārādhanaṃ tathā atrāpi 
prāptameveti idaṃ vacanaṃ vyarthamiti vācyam vināyakastavapāṭhenāpi 
kvacidvighnanāśapratipādanāt ārādhanasya pakṣe prāptau 
śrīvidyopāstivighnanirāso'nenaiva kārya iti niyamavidhisaṃbhavāt | evaṃ 
tṛtīyakhaṇḍādau evaṃ gaṇapatimiṣṭvā vidhūtasamastavighnavyatikaraḥ 
śakticakraikanāyikāyāḥ śrīlalitāyāḥ 

<p. 54>

kramamārabheta iti ktvāpratyayenāpi agniṃ citvā sautrāmaṇyā yajeta itivat 
lalitopāstyaṅgatvaṃ spaṣṭam | na ca agniṃ citveti vākye pūrvakarmaṇaḥ 
pradhānatvam uttarakarmaṇo'ṅgatvaṃ 
tadvadatrottaramanuṣṭhīyamānalalitopāsteḥ gaṇapatyārādhanāṅgattvāpattiḥ iti 
vācyam na hi ktvāpratyayenaiva pūrvavartinaḥ cayanasya prādhānyanirṇayaḥ 
kiṃ tu prajākāmaścinvīta paśukāmaścinvīta iti phalavattvāt citeḥ 
pradhānatvaṃ tatsannidhau aphalasautrāmaṇeḥ phalavatsannidhāvaphalaṃ 
tadaṅgam iti nyāyena sautrāmaṇyā aṅgatvam | tathā lalitopāsteḥ 
muktiphalakatvaśrutyā vighnopāstidvārā śrīlalitopāsanāyāḥ yatphalaṃ tadeva 
tasyetyaṅgatvaṃ kḷptam | ata eva revatīṣu vāravantīyaṃ sāma kṛtvā 
paśukāmo hyetena yajeta ityatra vāravantīyasāgno na prādhānyam | na ca 
darśapūrṇamāsābhyāmiṣṭvā somena yajeta itivat kevalapaurvāparyavidhireva 
kiṃ na syāt iti vācyam | tatra somena yajeta ityanena somasya darśapūrṇamāsayoḥ 
yadāgneyādivākyaiḥ utpannatvāt kevalakramamātravidhāyakatvam prakṛte ca 
lalitākramotpattivākyāntarābhāvāt kramaviśiṣṭakarmavidhānāt | kiṃ ca tatra 
dvayoḥ svatantraphalavattvena atra tathātvābhāvācca na 
kramamātravidhāyakatvaṃ na vā aṅgāṅgibhāvahāniḥ || 

etena itthaṃ (")idaṃ 7 khaṇḍe śrīvārāhīkrame-1 sūtrastham |(") 
saṅgītamātṛkāmiṣṭvā kolamukhīṃ vidhivad varivasyeta ityatrāpi 
parasparāṅgāṅgībhāvāpattiriti nirastā ubhayorapi 
rājadarśanarūpaphalakattvena svatantraphalābhāvāt || 

na ca evaṃ sati sautrāmaṇivat pratiprayogamāvṛttyāpattiḥ iti vācyam | na hi 
vayaṃ pradhānāṅgamiti brūmaḥ kiṃtu lalitākramārambhāṅgaṃ 
anvārambhaṇīyāvat | ata eva tasmin vākye lalitākramamārabheta iti śrutam | 
svakartṛkopāstikriyādhvaṃsānadhikaraṇakṣaṇasaṃbandhikramaṃ nirvartayiṣya 
iti saṃkalpa eva āraṃbhapadārthaḥ | ayaṃ sakṛdeva | ato nāvṛttyāpattiḥ ||

etena brāhme muhūrte gaṇapatyupāsanāṅgattvena hṛdayakamale 
gaṇeśadhyānaṃ lalitopāsto tasyā dhyānaṃ caikakāle prāptaṃ viruddhamiti 
śaṃkā'pi nirastā ||

evaṃ śyāmāyā apyaṅgattvaṃ śyāmopāstikhaṇḍe tasyāḥ 
pradhānasacivapadaṃ śyāmā ityanena kolamukhyāśca tatsaparyākhaṇḍe 
mahārājñyāḥ daṇḍanāyikāsthānīyā ityanena parāyāśca 
śiṃhāsanavidyāyāḥ hṛdayaṃ ityanena ca suspaṣṭam ||

tasmādimā aṅgadevatāḥ | tāsāṃ kramasahitaṃ pradhānadevatāyāḥ kramaṃ 
kṛtvā ityarthaḥ phalitaḥ ||

<p. 55>

yadyapi pradhānadevatopāstau imāḥ aṅgadevatā iti aṅgapadena vyavahāro 
bhavatu | prakṛtapūjāyāṃ pañcāpi (")atra pañcaśabdena gaṇapati lalitā śyāmā 
vārtālī pareti pañcakaṃ jñeyam |(") samapradhānāni | anyatra kḷptāṅgatvaṃ 
gṛhītvā tenaiva rūpeṇa gaṇapatyādīn bodhayitvā sahaśabdena sarveṣāṃ 
tantrānuṣṭhānamātraṃ vidhīyate | tantre sati devatākramaḥ pāṭhakrama eva | 

agre vakṣyamāṇa yāvadaṅgakalāpo nāmātideśena prāptaḥ | tatrāṅgānāṃ 
yeṣāṃ tantraṃ saṃbhavati teṣāṃ tathaivānuṣṭhānam | yeṣāṃ 
viruddhadharmāṇāṃ na saṃbhavati teṣāṃ padārthānusamayena (")idaṃ 
padārthānusamayakāṇḍānusamayalakṣaṇaṃ(-)ddi(.) pariśiṣṭe 8-viṣaye dṛśyam |(") | 
yeṣāṃ ca padārthānusamayo na saṃbhavati teṣāṃ kāṇḍānusamayena | 
yathāyathaṃ buddhimatā hi kāryaṃ granthavistarabhayānneha likhyate || 

kramaṃ (")kramaṃ pravartya(-)ityādi anugata 53-patrasthaṃ-34-sūtrasthaṃ padam |(") 
pravartyetyanenaiva homasya prāptau hutvā (")idamapyadhastāddṛśyam(-)(") iti 
homottarakālasya śiṣyāhvānāṅgatā siddhyartham ||

adyapyagre kramāvasare homasya vaikalpikatvāt atrāpi vikalpena prāptau 
nityatvadyotanāya hutvetyapi vaktuṃ śakyam tathā'pi agre gaṇapati(-)lalitā(-)
śyāmā(-)vārtālī(-)parā(-)pātrabindubhiḥ tamavokṣya iti vacanāt 
kramasamāptirnāstīti siddham | tarhi kadā śiṣyāhvānaṃ kāryamiti 
kālākāṃkṣāsattvāt tadvidhānamevocitaṃ na tūbhayavidhiḥ 
vākyabhedaprasaṅgāt | homasyākaraṇapakṣe'pi tadupalakṣitakālottaratvaṃ 
saṃbhavati vatsairamāvāsyāyām itivat |

etena nibandhe viśeṣapātravisarjanānte śiṣyamāhūyeti nirastaḥ | sarveṣāṃ 
viśeṣārghyapātrodvāsanena taccheṣābhāvena 
pātrapañcakasāmānyārghyodakabindubhiḥ tamavokṣyeti svalekhanasyaiva 
sandarbhaviruddhatvācca || 

vastutastu hutveti svātmani haviśśeṣaṃ hutvetyarthaḥ svarasaḥ | ata eva 
tādṛśāhutijanitataruṇollāsavān iti vakṣyamāṇaḥ svarasaḥ 
taruṇollāso'vasthāviśeṣaḥ | tasya vivaraṇaṃ caraṇakhaṇḍavyākhyāne 
spaṣṭam (")idaṃ-10-khaṇḍe-82-sūtre-18-khaṇḍe-18-sūtre ca kiñcit kiñcit |(") ||

śiṣyamāhūya ityanena tāvatparyantaṃ śiṣyasyāntaḥpraveśo nāstīti jñāpitam 
| tannāma sambuddhyantamuccārya ehīti vadet | yathā pravargye gavāmāhvānaṃ 
karmāṅgam idamapi tathā karmāṅgam | tenopāyāntareṇa āgamanaviṣayaṃ 
svābhiprāyaṃ na prakaṭayet ityarthaḥ ||

<p. 56>

etena nibandhe varaṇānantaraṃ tadaiva saśiṣyo viviktaṃ dīkṣāpradeśamāsadyeti 
lekhaḥ parāstaḥ samīpavartiśiṣyasya āhvānāsaṃbhavāt na ca adṛṣṭārtham 
āhvānam iti vācyam dṛṣṭe saṃbhavati adṛṣṭakalpanāyā anyāyyatvāt ||

śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam || 

atra pātrapadena (")pātraśabdenātrānugata 53-patrastha-34-sūtrastha(-)
pātrabindumirityetatpadastha pātraśabdotra grāhyaḥ |(") viśeṣārghyapātraṃ 
grāhyam | kathametaditi cet(-)ittham | yadi sāmānyārghyapātrameva syāt tasya 
praṇītāvat tantrasiddheḥ tasya sarvasaṃbandhina ekatvāt 
sāmānyārghyabindubhiriti laghu sūtritaṃ syāt | na ca tvatpakṣe'pi 
viśeṣārghyapātrāṇāṃ bindubhiriti laghusūtrasaṃbhavāt 
gaṇapatilalitetyādiprayāso vyartha iti vācyam evaṃ sati 
vidheyasaṃkhyāvācakabahutvasya tritve kapiñjalādhikaraṇanyāyena 
paryavasānāt pañcapātrāṇāmalābha eva | na ca evamapi 
pañcaviśeṣārghyapātrairiti laghusūtraṃ saṃbhavati iti vācyam na vayaṃ sūtre 
akṣarādhikyaṃ nyūnatvaṃ vā hetutvenopadiśāmaḥ kiṃ tu 
sāmānyārghyapakṣe tasyaikatvāt parā'ntaṃ vyartham | viśeṣārghyapakṣe 
pañcapātralābhāyeti sārthakam | akṣarādhikyaṃ ca svatantreccheṣu 
niyantumaśakyam ||

vastutastu na praṇītāvattantraṃ sāmānyapātrasya gaṇapatilalitā'diṣu 
sāmānyārghyasaṃskārasya ekarūpatvābhāvāt bhinnadharmayoḥ 
tantrāsaṃbhavāt | na ca bhinnadharmāṇāṃ pradhānānāṃ kathaṃ tantramiti 
śaṅkyam | pradhānānāṃ sahānuṣṭhānaṃ tantraṃ na tu sakṛdanuṣṭhānam | 
iha tu sakṛdanuṣṭhānamuktam ayuktameva sahānuṣṭhānaṃ tu bhavatyeva | ato 
nedaṃ gamakaṃ pātrapadena viśeṣārghyagrahaṇe kiṃtu hutvā 
taruṇollāsavānityuktvā paścāt pātrabindubhirityuktatvāt 
homasādhanībhūtadravyaṃ buddhisthaṃ pātrapadena lakṣyate natvabuddhisthaṃ 
sāmānyārghyadravyam | kiṃ ca binduśabdo mukhyadravye tāntrikāṇāṃ 
saṃketasiddhaḥ bindutarpaṇasaṃtuṣṭā iti lalitā sahasranāmni vyavahārāt | ata 
eva binduśabdo'pi gamakaḥ | itthaṃ ca viśeṣārghyagrahaṇe idameva jñāpakam ||

ta śiṣyam avokṣya prokṣya | idaṃ śiṣyasaṃskārarūpatvāt gurukarma | śeṣaṃ 
sugamam ||

etena nibandhe gaṇapatyādimūlamuccārayan 
pātrapaṃcakasāmānyārghyodakabindubhiḥ tamavokṣya iti yā paṅktiḥ tatra 
mūlamuccārayanniti svakapolakalpitā sarvā nirmalā ||

siddhāntaṃ siddhāntapratipādakavākyasamūhaṃ pūrvoktaṃ (")pūrvoktaśabdena 
anugata-3-sūtrataḥ-31-sūtrāntoktajñānaśikṣādivākyānītyarthaḥ |(") 
śrāvayitvā | idaṃ śrāvaṇam adṛṣṭārthaṃ kḷptīrvācayati itivat 
nā'rthajñānārtham atigahanasyārthasya tāvatā kālena bodhāsaṃbhavāt | 
tasmāt pūrvoktavākyāni (")pūrvoktaśabdena anugata-3-sūtrataḥ-31-
sūtrāntoktajñānaśikṣādivākyānītyarthaḥ |(") 
dīkṣā'pūrvasahakāryapūrvajanakatvena śrāvayet || 34 ||

<p. 57> śāmbhavī dīkṣā

atha śāmbhavīdīkṣāmāha(-)

tacchirasi raktaśuklacaraṇaṃ bhāvayitvā tadamṛtakṣālitaṃ 
sarvaśarīramalaṅkuryāt || 35 ||

tacchirasi śiṣyasya śirasi | raktaśuklacaraṇaṃ(-)raktaṃ kāmeśvaryāḥ 
rajassvabhāvāt | taduktaṃ(-)raktacaraṇāṃ dhyāyet parāmambikām iti | 
śyāmārahasye'pi(-)

raktaṃ tu caraṇaṃ devyā rajorūpaṃ prakīrtitam |
śuklaṃ ca tadadhiṣṭhānacaraṇaṃ sātvikaṃ bhavet || iti ||

etena śuklacaraṇamapi vyākhyātam | prāṇyaṅgatvādekavadbhāvaḥ bhāvayitvā 
dhyātvā tadamṛtaṃ caraṇasaṃbandhi yadamṛtam udakaṃ tena kṣālitaṃ 
nāśitaṃ sarvapātakaṃ yasya | īdṛśaṃ śiṣyaṃ kuryādityarthaḥ | 
yadyapyanyapadārthasya śiṣyasya karaṇaṃ na saṃbhavati tathā'pi saviśeṣaṇe hi 
vidhineṣedhau sati viśeṣye bādhe viśeṣaṇamupasaṃkrāmataḥ iti nyāyena 
śiṣyaviśeṣaṇasya pāpanāśasya karaṇaṃ saṃbhavatīti bhāvaḥ | tasya sarvaṃ 
yāvaccharīraṃ gandhavastrabhūṣaṇakusumādibhiḥ guruḥ alaṅkuryāt bhūṣayet 
|| 35 ||

śāktī dīkṣā 

śāktīṃ dīkṣāmāha(-)

tasyāmūlamābrahmabilaṃ prajvalantīṃ prakāśalaharīṃ jvaladanalanibhāṃ 
dhyātvā tadraśmibhistasya pāpapāśān dagdhvā || 36 ||

tasya śiṣyasya mūlaṃ pāyūpasthamadhyavarticaturdalakamalādhāradeśaḥ 
tanmaryādati āmūlam | evam(-)adhomaryādāmuktvā ūrdhvamaryādāmāha(-)
brahmabilaṃ sahasradalakamalādhārabhūtaṃ maryādā asyeti ābrahmabilaṃ 
prajvalantīm ata eva prakāśānāṃ laharyaḥ ūrmayo yasyāṃ tādṛśīm ata eva 
jvālāyukto yo'nalo'gniḥ tannibhāṃ tadupamāṃ dhyātvā saṃvidamiti śeṣaḥ | 
jvaladanalanibhatvādeva pāpapāśadāhakatvamupapannam | pāpapāśasya dāha 
eva na bhāvanam(-)ata eva dagdhveti ||

yadyapi atratyapāṭhakramamanusṛtya ādau śāmbhavī tataḥ śāktīti pratibhāti 
tathā'pyupakrame dīkṣāvibhāgavelāyāṃ śāktī śāmbhavī māntrī ceti 
coktatvāt upakramānusāreṇa upasaṃhāro'nyathā neyaḥ 
vedopakramādhikaraṇanyāyena | ata eva tatpāśadāhānantaraṃ 
tadbhasmarūpamalasya 

<p. 58>

sattvāt caraṇanirgatajalena tatkṣālanarūpārthavattvādarthakramo'pyupapannaḥ | 
tathā cādau śāktīṃ dīkṣāṃ saṃpādya paścācchāmbhavīṃ kuryāditi 
siddham || 

guruḥ kramaṃ pravartya ityārabhya siddhāntaṃ śrāvayitvā 
ityetadanto'ṅgakalāpo'nayoreva prakaraṇasannidhibhyāṃ śundhanamantrasyeva 
sānnāyye iti kecit | tanna | tathā sati tṛtīyāyāṃ dīkṣāyām(-)uttaratra 
prathamasiktān dvitīyakhaṇḍāgrān grāsayitvā iti vihitaṃ tadanupapannam 
sāṅgakramavidheḥ tadanaṅgatvena tatra kramaprāptyabhāvena 
prathamadvitīyayorabhāvāt | na ca asaṃskṛtaṃ laukikaṃ grahītuṃ śakyam | 
tasmāt liṅgena sannidhiṃ bādhitvā trayāṇām aṅgam | itthaṃ ca yadā ekaikāṃ 
veti pakṣānusaraṇaṃ tadā tṛtīyadīkṣāyāṃ pūrvoktānyaṅgānyanuṣṭheyāni 
||

etena nibandhe amṛtakṣaraṇena bāhyamābhyantaraṃ ca malaṃ dūrīkuryāt atha 
śiṣyasyāmūlādhāramityārabhya tatkiraṇaiḥ (")tasyāḥ prakāśalaharyāḥ 
kiraṇairityarthaḥ |(") tasya pāśān dahet ityasya dvitīyatvaṃ likhitaṃ nirastam | 
pūrvadīkṣayaiva bāhyābhyantaramaladūrīkaraṇe asmin malasyābhāvena 
uttaradīkṣayā dāhāsaṃbhavācca | na ca pūrvadīkṣayā dūrīkṛtaṃ malaṃ 
bahistiṣṭhati tasyottaradīkṣayā dāha iti vācyam śarīre vibhāvitāgninā 
śarīrasthamalasyaiva nāśo bhavet na dūrīkṛtasya | tasmādasmatsaraṇireva 
sādhvīti yuktamutpaśyāmaḥ || 36 ||

māntrī dīkṣā 

māntrīdīkṣāprayogaṃ vaktumupakramate(-)

trikaṭu (")1(") triphalā (")2(") caturjāta (")3(") takkola (")4(") madayantī (")5(") sahadevī (")6(") dūrvā 
(")7(") bhasma (")8(") mṛttikā (")9(") candana (")10(") kuṅkuma (")11(") rocanā (")12(") karpūra (")13(") 
vāsitajalapūrṇaṃ vastrayugaveṣṭitaṃ (")navīnavāso(-)a(.) śrī(.") nūtanakalaśaṃ 
bālāṣaḍaṅgenābhyarcya śrīśyāmāvārtālīcakrāṇi nikṣipya 
tisṛṇāmāvaraṇamantrairabhyarcya saṃrakṣyāstreṇa 
(")astradhyenuyoniprabhṛtyanekamudroddhārajñānāya dvi(.) pariśiṣṭa-15 viṣayaḥ 
svatantro dṛśyaḥ |(") pradarśya dhenuyonī || 37 ||

trikaṭuḥ pippalīśuṇṭhīmarīcyaḥ | triphalāḥ harītakīdhātrīvibhītakyaḥ | 
taduktaṃ vaidyasāre(-)

śuṇṭhīmarīcipippalyaḥ proktastrikaṭusaṃjñakāḥ |
triphaleti samākhyātā pathyādhātrīvibhītakaiḥ || iti ||

caturjātaṃ uśīrailālavaṅganāgakesarāṇi | taduktaṃ madanamahārṇave(-)

<p. 59>

lavaṅgamelośīraṃ ca trisugandhaṃ prakīrtitam |
nāgakesarasaṃyuktaṃ caturjātaṃ pracakṣate || iti ||

takkolaḥ (")takkolaḥ gurjaradeśe(-)cinīkabālā(-)iti nāmnā(-)suviditaḥ atra ca prāyaḥ 
kaṅkolaśabdo'vadheyaḥ |(")(-)marīcisadṛśaḥ tāmbūlena saha bhakṣyaḥ 
śaityopacārahetuḥ vastuviśeṣaḥ | 

madayantī sahadevī vaidyake prasiddhe āraṇyake | dūrvā bhasma mṛttikāḥ 
prasiddhāḥ ||

yattu mṛttikāpadena nibandhe saptamṛttikāgrahaṇaṃ tannirmūlam | yadi 
mṛttikāpadena sarvatra saptamṛttikāgrahaṇaṃ tarhi mūlanakṣatrajananaśāntau(-)
saptamṛdbhiḥ samāyuktaṃ pañcapallavasaṃyutam ityatra saptagrahaṇaṃ vyartham 
| evaṃ snānārthaṃ mṛdamāharet ityatrāpi tathā'pattiśca ||

etairyuktamiti jalena sākaṃ madhyamapadalopasamāsaḥ vāsitamityanena 
dūrvā'dīnāmanvayāsambhavāt | candanaṃ prasiddham | kuṅkumaṃ 
kāśmīram | rocanā gorocanam | karpūraṃ prasiddham | etairvāsitaṃ yajjalaṃ tena 
pūrṇaṃ vastrayugena veṣṭitaṃ nūtanam(-)abhuktaṃ kalaśaṃ bālāṣaḍaṅgena 
(")etacchrībālātryakṣarīmantraṣaḍaṅganyāsaprātyakṣyataddevatā(-)
mantroddhāraṇarṣicchandoviṣayādijñānāya dvi(.) pariśiṣṭe-9-vi(.) dṛśyaḥ|(") aiṃ 
hṛdayāya namaḥ iti krameṇa bījatrayadvirāvṛttyā agre (")agre nāma 
mantranirdeśamantarā ṣaḍaṅganyāsakaraṇetikartavyatāmātraṃ tvagre-3-khaṇḍe 
śrīkrame 19 sūtre tadbhāṣye cāstītyato'vagamyam(-)pratyakṣaṃ tu(-)dvi(-)pa(-)śi(.) 9-
viṣaye vidyate |(") vakṣyamāṇarītyā agnīśāsuravāyukoṇeṣu madhye 
pūrvādidikṣu ca krameṇa | atra ṣaḍaṅganāmnā uktadharmātideśaḥ | śrīśca 
śyāmā ca vārtālī ceti tāsāṃ cakrāṇi nikṣipya sthāpayitvetyarthaḥ | 
kutretyākāṃkṣāyāṃ samīpavartitvāt kalaśe eva | tatrāpi na 
pūrṇapātrādyupari nikṣipyeti svārasyāt kiṃ tu jale (")atra jale eva nāma(-)
kalaśasthajale eveti bodhyam(") eva ||

yadyapi uddharaṇasyānuktavāt yogyatābalācca kalaśasamīpadeśe ityapi vaktuṃ 
śakyam tathā'pi pūjāyāṃ bhūmau cakrasthāpanaṃ vinā 
pūjā'saṃbhavenārthāpattyā'tideśena vā sthāpanasya prāptatvena kṣiptatvena 
kṣiptvetyasya vaiyyarthyabhiyā jale prakṣepa āvaśyakaḥ || 

na ca yatra kvacana sthāpanam(-)arthāpattyādinā prāptaṃ na kalaśasamīpadeśe 
tadarthaṃ tat iti vācyam kalaśasamīpadeśāpekṣayā kalaśasyaiva 
ādhāratvakalpane lāghavāt || 

kiṃ ca kalaśasamīpasthacakrapūjā na kalaśasaṃskāro bhavitumarhati 
tadasaṃyuktatvāt | atra pūrvaṃ ṣaḍaṅgairabhyarcyeti kalaśasaṃskāraḥ | 
saṃrakṣyāstreṇetyādirapi tathā | ubhayataḥ sandaṣṭaṃ kathaṃ 
tatsaṃskārabhinnaṃ vijātīyaṃ bhavet | tato jala eva cakrāṇāṃ kṣepaḥ tatraiva 
pūjanaṃ pūjā'rambhasamaya eva jale prakṣepaḥ | tena āvāhanottaraṃ kathaṃ 
cakracālanamiti śaṅkā'navakāśaḥ ||

<p. 60>

yadvā(-)kalaśe kṣiptveti vacanaṃ visarjanaparyantaṃ na cālayet ityasya bādhakaṃ 
bhavitumarhati | yuktaścāyameva pakṣaḥ | anyathā sāṅgaṃ kramaṃ 
nirvartyetyasya samīpa eva kalaśe nikṣipyeti vadet |

tisṛṇāṃ (")imāḥ śrīlalitādayastisro devyaḥ(-)anugate-53-patre 34 sūtroktā 
śrīlalitāśyāmāvārtālyaḥ | iti(-)jñeyāḥ |(") lalitā'dīnām 
āvaraṇamantrairityanena kevalapañcopacārapūjāvyāvṛttiḥ | abhyarcya 
pūjayitvā ||

idaṃ pūjanam apūrvam anena vidhīyate | pūjanottaram uddharaṇam ārthikam | 
pūjanaṃ tu kuladravyeṇaiva tattadviśeṣārghyapātrasthena kusumākṣataiśca 
apūrvapūjāmātravidhānāt | tāvanmātraṃ kṛtvā cakroddharaṇaṃ kāryam | 
jalāduddhṛtacakrāṇāmupari gandhapuṣpākṣatanikṣepo nyāyasiddhaḥ ||

astreṇa (")etadastramudrārthaṃ tatpurataḥsthadhenuyonimudrārthaṃca dvi(.) pa(.) śi(.) 15-
7/14 15-8/1-2 15-8/2 vi dṛśyāḥ |(") phaṭ iti mantreṇa saṃrakṣya 
rakṣobhūtapiśācānāṃ durādharṣaṃ kṛtvā | dhenuyonimudreprasiddhe te 
pradarśya tadupari kṛtvā || 37 ||

mātṛkāyantram 

mātṛkāyantramāha (")tadanantarakṛtyamāha(-)a śrī(.")(-) 

śivayuksauvarṇakarṇike svaradvandvajuṣṭakiñjalkāṣṭake 
ka ca ṭa ta pa ya śa lākṣaravargāṣṭayuktāṣṭadale 
digaṣṭakasthita ṭhaṃ vaṃ caturaśre mātṛkāyantre 
(")adhastanabhāṣyāvalokanenedaṃ mātṛkācakraṃ(-)suviditameva(-)syāt |(") śiṣyaṃ 
niveśya 
tena kumbhāmbhasā tisṛbhiḥ vidyābhiḥ snapayet || 38 ||

śivo hakāraḥ tena yuktaḥ sauvarṇaḥ sau(-)iti varṇaḥ saḥ karṇikāyāṃ 
kamalamadhyadeśe yasya etādṛśe | atra pūrvoktavarṇopari visargo'pi yojanīyaḥ 
vyomendvaurasanārṇakarṇikam(-) iti śrīśaṅkarabhagavatpādaiḥ uktatvāt (")evaṃ 
ca(-)hasauḥ(-)iti niṣpannaṃ(-)jñeyam |(") | imāni sarvāṇi kamalaviśeṣaṇāni | svarāḥ 
akārādivisargāntāḥ ṣoḍaśa teṣāṃ dvaṃdvaṃ dvayaṃ dvayaṃ tena juṣṭaṃ 
yuktaṃ kiñjalkāṣṭakaṃ patrayugamadhyavartideśaviśeṣaḥ yasyeti bahuvrīhiḥ | 
kaśca caśca ṭaśca taśca paśca yaśca śaśca laśca iti dvandvaḥ dvandvānte 
śrūyamāṇaṃ pratyekaṃ saṃbadhyate iti nyāyena vargapadaṃ sarvaiḥ 
sambadhyate | tathā ca kavargamārabhya 

<p. 61>

pavargaparyantaṃ pañca pañca varṇāḥ yavargaścatvāraḥ śavargo'pi tathā 
lakṣ iti lavargaḥ evam(-)aṣṭavargairyuktāni aṣṭadalāni yasyeti bahuvrīhiḥ | 
ekaikadale ekaikaṃ vargaṃ likhet iti phalitārthaḥ ||

kesareṣu daleṣu ca varṇalekhane kramākāṃkṣāyāṃ prācyadikrama eva 
dhartavyaḥ | yadyapi dalakesarayoḥ dvayorapi prācī na saṃbhavati tathā'pi 
padmakuṇḍalekhanaprakāreṇa lekhane karṇikāyāḥ prācī tadanusāreṇaiva 
daleṣu varṇalekhanakramo'nusandheyaḥ ||

diśāṃ yadaṣṭakaṃ prācyādīśānadigantaṃ teṣu sthitau vakāraṭhakārau 
yasmin īdṛśaṃ caturaśraṃ (")atrāgāmigranthe ca asraśabdo dantyasakārānto 
jñeyaḥ |(") yasminniti bahuvrīhiḥ | īdṛśe mātṛkāsaṃjñake yantre śiṣyaṃ 
niveśya sthāpayitvā ||

taditthaṃ(-)padmakuṇḍavadaṣṭadalaṃ padmaṃ vilikhya tadbahirdvārarahitaṃ 
caturaśraṃ (")atrāgāmigranthe ca asraśabdo dantyasakārānto jñeyaḥ |(") vilikhya 
karṇikāyāṃ hsauḥ iti vilikhya prāgādikesareṣu a ā iti krameṇa 
svaradvayamekaikakesare svaramekaṃ vilikhya patrāntaḥ pūrvoktasthāne 
(")pūrvādidiksthapatramadhyavibhāgāśrayeṇeti jñeyam |(") kādyaṣṭavargān 
pratyekam(-)ekaikasyāntaḥ ekaikaṃ vargaṃ vilikhya tadbahiścaturaśre 
(")atrāgāmigranthe ca asraśabdo dantyasakārānto jñeyaḥ |(") prāgādidigaṣṭake 
vaṃ ṭhaṃ(-)iti likhediti samuditārthaḥ | taduktaṃ bhagavatpādaiḥ(-)

vyomendvaurasanārṇakarṇikamacāṃ dvandvaiḥ sphuratkesaraṃ 
patrāntargatapañcavargayaśalārṇāditrivargaṃ kramāt |
āśāsvaśriṣu (")atrāgāmigranthe ca asraśabdo dantyasakārānto jñeyaḥ |(") 
lāntalāṅgaliyujā kṣoṇīpureṇāvṛtaṃ 
varṇābjaṃ śirasi sthitaṃ viṣagadapradhvaṃsi mṛtyuñjayam || iti ||

vyoma hakāraḥ induḥ sakāraḥ au svarūpaṃ rasanārṇaṃ visargaḥ lānto 
vakāraḥ lāṅgaliḥ ṭhakāraḥ śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam ||

tisṛbhiḥ śrīśyāmāvārtālīvidyābhiḥ (")atra vārtālīśabdena(-)vārāhī(-)jñeyā(-) | 
vidyāśabdena ca(-)tāsāṃ tisṛṇāṃ mūlamantrā jñeyāḥ |(") snapayet sarvāṅge 
jalasaṃyogo yathā bhavati tathā kuryāt | tenetiviśeṣaṇāt udakāntaramaparyāptau 
na grāhyamiti sūcitam | ayameva pūrṇābhiṣeka ityucyate || 38||

māntrīṃ dīkṣāmupasaṃharati(-)

sadukūlaṃ sālepaṃ sābharaṇaṃ samālaṃ suprasannaṃ śiṣyaṃ pārśve 
niveśya mātṛkāṃ tadaṅge vinyasya vimuktamukhakarpaṭasya tasya haste trīn 
prathamasiktān candanokṣitān dvitīyakhaṇḍān puṣpakhaṇḍānnikṣipya 
tattvamantrairgrāsayitvā dakṣiṇakarṇe bālāmupadiśya paścādiṣṭamanuṃ vadet 
||39||

<p. 62>

sadukūlamityādi pārśve niveśyetyantaḥ spaṣṭārthaḥ | bahirmātṛkānyāsaḥ 
(")ayaṃ nyāso mahānirvāṇatantrādyanekatantragranthastha eva grāhyo 
nādhunikapustakāt |(") svāṅge tantrāntarokto yathā kriyate tadvacchiṣyāṅge 
vinyasya vimuktamukhakarpaṭasya pūrvaṃ mukhaṃ yena baddhaṃ vimuktaṃ 
mukhavastraṃ yasya tasya haste ||

idaṃ dīkṣātrayasya tantrapakṣe | kecinmatānusāreṇa kramikadīkṣāpakṣe 
tattaddīkṣā'nte visargaḥ ||

yadvā(-)sūtrakārasya tantradīkṣāyā eva abhimatatvāt tantrapakṣe eva 
mukhabandhanam ||

prathamasiktān atra prathamam(-)asaṃskṛtam(-) ājyena yūpamanakti itivat | evameva 
dvitīyaṃ jāghanyā patnīḥ saṃyājayanti itivat ||

vastutastu(-)kramasya pūrvaṃ vidhānāt taccheṣasya saṃskṛtasya vidyamānatvāt 
prāyaṇīyasya niṣkāse udayanīyamabhinirvapati itivat 
upayokṣyamāṇasaṃskārārthaṃ tāvatkālaṃ pātravisarjanamakṛtvā 
sthāpitatvāt saṃskṛtaprathamasiktadvitīyakhaṇḍānāmeva dānaṃ na 
tvasaṃskṛtasya ||

bahuvacanenaiva kapiñjalanyāyena tritvālābhe trīniti punarviśeṣaṇāt sakṛdeva 
trayāṇāṃ na nikṣepaḥ kintvekaikamiti dvau paridhī paridadhāti itivat ||

tattvamantraiḥ ātmatattvaṃ śodhayāmi namaḥ svāhā vidyātattvaṃ śodhayāmi 
namaḥ svāhā śivatattvaṃ śodhayāmi namaḥ svāhā iti tribhiḥ | grāsayitveti 
ṇijantaśravaṇāt ācāryānujñā'nantaraṃ bhakṣaṇam | bālāṃ tryakṣarīm | 
upadiśyetyantamaṅgam | iṣṭamanuṃ pañcadaśīṣoḍaśīrūpaṃ vadet 
upadiśedityarthaḥ (")ita etat 39 sūtraṭīkāntaṃ dīkṣāvidhau 
pañcadaśīṣoḍaśyubhayagrahaṇakaḥ śāstrārthaḥ |(") || 

nanu nāyaṃ ṣoḍaśyā upadeśavidhiḥ manum(-)ityekavacanena kevalapañcadaśyā 
eva vidhiḥ | na ca vaiparītye kiṃ vinigamakam(-)iti vācyam bālopadeśānantaraṃ 
pañcadaśyā eva prasaktatvena ekavacanena tasyaiva grahaṇāt (")na 
vinigamanāvirahaḥ ityadhikaḥ(-)ba 2(.") | kiṃ ca asmin tantre yadi 
ṣoḍaśyupadeśo'bhimataḥ syāt tarhi taduddhāraṃ kuryāt | 
yato'sminnanuddhāraḥ ata evānabhimata iti cet(-)na | na (")nahi ekavacanānusāreṇa 
tatsiddhiḥ ityadhikaḥ(-)ba 2(.") hi sarvatra vidheyaviśeṣaṇānāṃ 
saṃkhyāvācakānāṃ vivakṣāyāmapi prakṛtyartha evānvayaḥ iti niyamaḥ 
tadavacchedakenāpyanvayasya dṛṣṭatvāt | tathā ca 
jātyanvitamekavacanamupapannam | tathā sati kathaṃ tadanusāreṇa 
ṣoḍaśīnivṛttiḥ | anyathā brāhmaṇaṃ na hanyāt ityatra 
brāhmaṇadvayahanananiṣedhaḥ na syāt | astu vaikavacanavivakṣā | tathā'pi na 
ṣoḍaśīnivṛttiḥ vacanānusāreṇa variṣṭhāyāḥ 

<p. 63>

ekasyāḥ ṣoḍaśyā upadeśānantaraṃ paścāt 
śyāmāraśmimālā'dividyopadeśāvasare pañcadaśyupadeśe 
bādhakābhāvāt | anuddhārādagrahaṇamiti yat tadapi na | pañcadaśyā api 
anuddhāreṇa tasyāḥ apyupadeśo na syāt ||

na ca mūlādhāre vibhāvanīyaraśmipañcakamadhye mādanaśaktītyanena 
soddhṛteti vācyam sā pañcadaśī na sarvasādhāraṇyenoddhṛtā kiṃtu (")idaṃ 
raśmimālāpañcakaṃ-10-khaṇḍīya-9-sūtrataḥ 28 sūtrāntagranthesti ||(") 
raśmipañcakāvayavarūpā | ata eva tatra tasyāḥ mahāvidyetyuktam | anyathā 
tasyā ityasya sārthakyaṃ brahmaṇā'pi durupapādam | ataḥ 
pūrvapratipāditāṅgopāṅgapratyaṅgapādukāsahitavidyā ekā | 
tadavayavabhūtā vidyā kathaṃ pradhānabhūtā bhavet ||

kiṃ ca(-)svatantre anuddhṛtaṃ na grāhyam(-)iti kiṃ sūtrakārābhiprāyo niṣkāsyate 
athavā svatantre anuddhṛtaṃ na grāhyam(-)iti vacanāntareṇa niṣkāsyate (?)

nādyaḥ etādṛśābhiprāyaniṣkāsakaliṅgasya sūtre abhāvāt | kiṃca(-)
bālāmantrastryakṣaro na kutrāpyuddhṛtaḥ svayaṃ ca bālāmupadiśyeti vadati | 
etenānuddhṛto'pi grāhya iti sūtrakārābhiprāyaḥ suspaṣṭaḥ | na ca 
raśmimālāsu (")agre-10 khaṇḍīyasarvasādhāraṇakrame-29-sūtre(-)ityarthaḥ |(") 
śriyo'ṅgatvena navārṇabālāyā uddhṛtatvena bālāmupadiśyetyukte saiva 
grāhyā iti vācyam | yadi navākṣarīvidyā bālāpadena vivakṣitā tarhi agre 
pañcadaśanityāmantroddhāre (") || 4- || lalitā(-)|| 9-sūtre bālā eva(-)kulasundarī(-)vā(-)
kumārī(-)vā(-)uktā |(") kumārī kulasundarī iti kulasundarīmantre 
kumārīvarṇasādṛśyavidhānena tatrāpi navārṇatvaprasaṅgaḥ | iṣṭāpattau 
dūṣaṇaṃ kulasundarīmantroddhāre vakṣyāmaḥ | evaṃ 
śrīvidyānyāsaprakaraṇe bālādvirāvṛttyā kḷptaṣaḍaṅga ityatra 
navārṇādvirāvṛttyā ṣaḍaṅganyāsastu sarvasaṃpradāyaviruddhaḥ | tasmānna 
navārṇā'tra bālā kiṃ tu tryakṣaryeva | ata eva raśmimālāyāṃ 
navārṇāmantre śriyo'ṅgaṃ bāletyevoktaṃ na tu bāleti | 
ito'pyadhikayuktikalāpaṃ raśmimālāmantroddhāre vakṣyāmaḥ 
(")daśamakhaṇḍastha(0) 9 sūtrādārabhya pañcemā(-)ityādi-28-sūtrāntena athavā(-)
50-sūtrāntena granthena vakṣyāma iti sambandho jñeyaḥ |(") | ataḥ syāt tryakṣarī | 
bālā tu na kvacanoddhṛtā kiṃ tu tantrāntare kḷptaṃ gṛhītvaivopadiśyeti 
vyavahṛtam | api ca tattvamantraiḥ grāsayitveti sūtritam | mantrāśca noddhṛtāḥ | 
evaṃ vārāhīprakaraṇe trayoguṇamantrāḥ ityādayo noddhṛtāḥ | tena na 
sūtrakārasyāyamabhiprāya iti siddhāntaḥ ||

na dvitīyaḥ tādṛśaśāstrasya kutrāpyanupalabdheḥ ||

kiṃca(-)etaddīkṣā'vasāne śiṣyo'pi pūrṇatāṃ bhāvayitveti viditaveditavya iti 
aśeṣamantrādhikārīti śiṣyaviśeṣaṇatrayaṃ śrūyate | tatra pūrṇatvaṃ 
gurorgrāhyaśeṣarahitatvam | yadi 

<p. 64>

pañcadaśyaiva aśeṣadīkṣāripapūrtiḥ tarhi śeṣasya ṣoḍaśīgrahaṇasya sattvāt 
pūrṇatābhāvanāvidhānaṃ katham | evameva viditaveditavyatvamanupapannam ||

na ca pañcadaśyaiva sūtrakāramate kṛtārthatā pūrṇatā'stu tenaiva 
mokṣasiddhirastu iti na kā'pyanupapattiḥ iti vācyam 
evamapyaśeṣamantrādhikārītyatra kiṃ pañcadaśyupadeśena 
ṣoḍaśyāmapyadhikāraḥ svīkriyate athavā aśeṣapadasya ṣoḍaśībhinne 
saṅkocaḥ kriyate | nādyaḥ pañcadaśyapekṣayā ṣoḍaśyāḥ 
alpaphalajanakatvāpatteḥ | yo gurukārye adhikṛtaḥ saḥ laghukārye adhikṛto bhavati 
| yathā yo gaṅgātaraṇe adhikṛtaḥ sa kulyātaraṇe adhikṛtaḥ | natu viparītaṃ loke 
dṛṣṭam | na dvitīyaḥ saṅkoce mānābhāvāt ||

tasmāt evaṃ niṣpakṣapātena vicāryamāṇe iṣṭamantrapadena 
pañcadaśīṣoḍaśyoḥ grahaṇe na kimapi bādhakaṃ paśyāmaḥ || 

astu vā parasaṃtoṣāya pañcadaśīdīkṣāmātraṃ sūtrakārābhipretam | 
tathā'pi taddīkṣāvān alpadīkṣāvān tanmaṇḍale ṣoḍaśīdīkṣāvatā 
tantrāntarānuyāyinā na praveṣṭavyaṃ sevakagṛhe rājapraveśavat iti 
maheśvarānandanāthā āhuḥ | tanna | tathāhi(-)dīkṣāyāmalpatvam 
alpākṣaramantratvaṃ vā kimalpaphalasādhanamantratvam | ādye 
śrīvidyādīkṣāto vārāhyāḥ tato'pi śyāmādīkṣāyāḥ variṣṭhatvāpattiḥ | 
dvitīye tantrāntare ṣoḍaśīdīkṣāyāḥ yatphalaṃ tadeva asyāpi phalaṃ śrūyate 
kṛtakṛtyo viditanikhilaveditavyo jīvanmukto bhavatītyādipadaiḥ (")nāma 
tattatkhaṇḍasamāptisthasūtrasthapadairityarthaḥ |(") pratīyate | tathā ca tulyatvānna 
nyūnadīkṣāvattvam ||

nanu tarhi tantrāntare pañcadaśīdīkṣā nyūnadīkṣā bhavatīti śrūyate | tasya 
kā gatiḥ iti cet(-)na yasmin tantre ṣoḍaśīpañcadaśyoḥ samuccayaḥ tasmin tantre 
pañcadaśyāḥ aparipūrṇaphalatvāt ṣoḍaśīdīkṣāyāstathātvāt | 
tantrānusāriṇāvubhau tatraikaḥ pañcadaśyā dīkṣitaḥ ekaḥ ṣoḍaśyā dīkṣitaḥ 
tasyāgre kartavyaśeṣasattvādaparipūrṇa iti tasya maṇḍale gurudīkṣitena na 
gantavyamiti yuktam | iha tu tulyaphalaṃ pramāṇena siddhaṃ kathaṃ gurutvaṃ 
laghutvam | vicārayantvanāgraheṇa | 

na ca kāraṇalāghavagauraveṇa phalalāghavagauravamastyeva iti vācyam tathā sati 
kevalavahnyārthinau dvau | tatraikena lohapāṣāṇasambandhena vahnirnirmitaḥ | 
ekena araṇinirmathanena nirmitaḥ | tatra pūrvāpekṣayā parasya vahninirmāṇe 
kālādhikyaṃ puruṣādhikyaṃ śramādhikyamiti bahukāraṇagauravamiti 
tadīyavahneradhikadāhajanakatvaṃ syāt | evaṃ 
baudhāyanasūtrānusāridarśapūrṇamāsaprayogāpekṣayā 

<p. 65>

āpastambaprayogasya dviguṇatvena āpastambasūtrānuyāyināṃ 
dviguṇasvargotpattyāpattiḥ | āpastambasūtrānusāriṇo 
baudhāyanasūtrānuyāyito gurutaratvāpattiḥ | 
tasmādadhikaphalajanakatvātiriktaṃ gurutvaṃ dīkṣāyāṃ durvacam ||

prakṛte tadabhāvāt kathaṃ laghudīkṣāvattvaṃ sūtrānuyāyinaḥ gurusādhane 
tulyaphalatve'pi pravṛttiḥ | svapūrvaguruparamparā'gatasādhanamantarā 
tadadhikāriṇaḥ phalaṃ na bhavatīti śāstreṇaiva na phalādhikyecchayā | atirātre 
ṣoḍaśinaṃ gṛhṇāti nātirātre ṣoḍaśinaṃ gṛhṇāti ityādau 
phalatāratamyavyavasthāpanaṃ ca tādṛśaśāstrābhāvādadhikāribhedena 
vyavasthāsaṃbhavādyuktam | tasmādatra na nyūnādhikadīkṣābhāva iti | 
sudhībhiḥ śeṣamūhyam ||

ayaṃ pakṣaḥ paratuṣṭaye aṃgīkṛtya cālitaḥ | vastutastu iṣṭamantrapadena 
ṣoḍaśīgrahaṇe bādhakābhāva uktaḥ prāk ||

na ca uṣaḥkālakriyāyāṃ kādiṃ hādiṃ vā mūlavidyāṃ manasā 
daśavāramāvartyetyatra kādiṃ hādiṃ veti vidyāviśeṣaṇaṃ atra 
ṣoḍaśyabhāve liṅgam iti vācyam tābhyāṃ viśeṣaṇābhyāṃ 
uṣaḥkālakriyāsannidhau paṭhitābhyāṃ tadaṅgatvena ṣoḍaśī nivartatāṃ 
kāmaṃ tathā'pi sarvatra ṣoḍaśīṃ nivartayituṃ tayoḥ kā śaktiḥ | 
ārāmagamanakāle aśvamānaya iti rājño vākyena 
ārāmagamanasādhanaśibikā'diyānabādhe'pi aśvapadaghaṭitaṃ vākyaṃ 
sadā yānāntaraṃ na bādhituṃ samarthaṃ bhavati ||

tasmāt ṣoḍaśyupadeśaḥ āvaśyakaḥ sūtrānuyāyināmapi | ito'pyadhikaṃ 
sudhībhirāgrahaṃ parityajya vicāryam | dharmatattvavivecane svamatapakṣapāto 
narakāyaiva bhavet ityalaṃ bhūyasā || 39 ||

śiṣyanāmanirdeśaḥ 

gurukartṛkaṃ karmaśeṣaṃ vadati(-)

tatastasya śirasi svacaraṇaṃ nikṣipya sarvān mantrān sakṛdvā krameṇa vā 
yathā'dhikāramupadiśya svāṅgeṣu kimapyaṅgaṃ śiṣyaṃ sparśayitvā 
tadaṅgamātṛkāvarṇādi dvyakṣaraṃ tryakṣaraṃ caturakṣaraṃ vā 
ānandanāthaśabdāntaṃ tasya nāma diśet || 40 ||

tataḥ ityanena vakṣyamāṇānāṃ dharmāṇām uttarāṅgatvaṃ sūcitam | svasya 
guroḥ caraṇam anādeśe dakṣiṇaṃ pratīyāt iti paribhāṣayā dakṣiṇacaraṇameva 
nyaset | sarvān mantrān prakaraṇena sarvapadasaṅkoce sarve hāriyojanaṃ lipsanti 
itivat śrīvidyā'ṅgabhūtān gaṇapati(-)śyāmāvārtālī(-)

<p. 66>

parā(-)pañcadaśī(-)nityā(-)raśmimālā(-)mantrādīn (")ataḥ paraṃ 
vakṣyamāṇānityarthaḥ |(") sarvān | sakṛdvā ityatra vākāra evakārārthaḥ | 
tadānīmevetyarthaḥ | krameṇa vā tattadupāsanavelāyāṃ vā | yathā'dhikāram 
ityanena vyavasthitavikalpaḥ sūcitaḥ | bhaktiśraddhā'dhikyavataḥ tadānīmeva 
kiṃcinnyūnatadvataḥ krameṇeti | svāṅgeṣu ityatra aṅgapadaṃ 
śarīrāvayavaparam | sparśaṃ kurvityājñāṃ dadyāt | tataḥ śiṣyo 
yamavayavaṃ spṛśet tatra mātṛkānyāse yo varṇaḥ saḥ ādiḥ yasmin īdṛśam | 
idaṃ nāmaviśeṣaṇam | yathā śirassparśe tatra mātṛkāvarṇaḥ akāraḥ saḥ 
ādiryasya amṛtānandanātha iti | evameva sarvatra yojyam | dvyakṣaraṃ vetyādiḥ 
spaṣṭārthaḥ | ānandanāthaśabdāntaṃ spaṣṭam | tasya śiṣyasya nāma diśet 
sthāpayet || 40 ||

gurupādukāmantradānam 

vismṛtaṃ punarāha(-)

bālopadiṣṭeḥ pūrvamātmanaḥ pādukāṃ ṣaṭtārayuktāṃ dadyāt || 41 ||

dvitīyaśakalagrāsānantaraṃ bālopadiṣṭeḥ pūrvam ātmanaḥ pādukām 
ātmanaḥ guroḥ dīkṣākāle dattaṃ yannāma taddhaṭitapādukā'ntaṃ mantraṃ 
ṣaṭtārayuktaṃ tasmai upadiśet | ṣaṭ tārāśca kulārṇave(-)

vāgbhavaṃ ca parā śrīśca kālībījaṃ tataḥ priye |
bhuvaneśī manmathaṃ ca ṣaṭ tārāśca prakīrtitāḥ || iti ||

amukānandanāthaśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti ||

etena nibandhasthapādukāmantraḥ sūtrānavalokanakalpitaḥ parāstaḥ ||
 
yadyapyatra pāṭhakrameṇa atraivopadeśaḥ prāptaḥ tathā'pi āśvino daśamo 
gṛhyate itivat śrautakrameṇa tasya bādho yuktaḥ || 41 ||

ācārānuśāsanādi 

ācārānanuśiṣya hārdacaitanyamāmṛśya vidyātrayeṇa tadaṅgaṃ triḥ 
parimṛjya parirabhya mūrdhanyavaghrāya svātmarūpaṃ kuryāt || 42 ||

