ityucyate tadā dvārapūjā'vyavahitaprāgevopalepaḥ kāryaḥ | 

ubhayapārśvayorityatrānādeśāddakṣiṇaṃ prathamaṃ paścādvāmam | 
dakṣavāmau dvārādbahirnirgamanavelāyāṃ yau tau grāhyau tatraiva tathā 
vyavahārāt na tu praveśavelāyām | namaḥ ityuttaraṃ yajediti śeṣaḥ | 
mantraliṅgāvagatā devatā | antaḥ praviśyetyanenaiva dvārapūjā bahiḥ sthitvaiva 
kāryā iti siddham | āsanamantreṇetyanena (")ayamāsanamantro'gre(-)
śyāmākramīya-6-khaṇḍe-6 sūtre ādhāraśaktikamalāsanāya nama iti 
vakṣyamāṇo jñeyaḥ |(") śyāmāprakaraṇapaṭhito mantro jñeyaḥ sannikṛṣṭatvāt | 
ata eva na tantrāntarasthaṃ grāhyam || 

nibandhoktanirmūladharmapradarśanam 

yattu nibandhe dīpānabhitaḥ prajvālyeti tāmbūlabhakṣaṇaṃ 
bālātṛtīyabījenāsanaprokṣaṇaṃ (")bālātṛtīyaṃ(-)sauḥ(-)iti bījam ||(") likhitaṃ taṃ 
prati ayaṃ praśnaḥ(-)etatprāpakaṃ pramāṇaṃ tantrāntare kiṃ vā etattantre 
dīpaprajvalanādikamagre (")agre śrīkrame nāma-3-khaṇḍe-11-sūtre(-)dīpānamito 
datvā(-)iti sūtre ityarthaḥ |(") śrīkrame uktaṃ bālātṛtīyabījenāsanaprokṣaṇaṃ 
parāpaddhatāvuktaṃ (")agre(-)parākrame-8-khaṇḍe-6-sūtre(-)bhāṣye cedamasti |(") 
teṣāṃ sarveṣāṃ prāpakamatideśaśāstraṃ vā | nādyaḥ tasya pūrvameva 
nirastatvāt | dvitīye atideśastrividhaḥ(-)vacanātideśaḥ nāmātideśaḥ 
ākāṅkṣayā ānumānikātideśaḥ | tanmadhye kīdṛśo'tideśaḥ | na vacanaṃ(-)
samānamitaracchyenena itivat śeṣaṃ śrīkrameṇa samam iti vacanam asti | ato 
nādyaḥ | evaṃ māsamagnihotraṃ juhoti itivat śrīkramaṃ kuryāt iti tannāmnā 
vyavahāro na hyasti | ato na dvitīyaḥ | tṛtīyo'tideśo yathā(-)sauryaṃ caruṃ nirvapet 
brahmavarcasakāmaḥ ityukte kamiyogāt brahmavarcasaṃ kiṃ kuryāditi 
karmākāṅkṣāpūrakam | tataḥ kena kuryāt ityākāṅkṣāyāṃ dhātvarthaḥ 
karaṇatvena anveti | kathaṃ kuryāt ityākāṅkṣāparipūrakatayā aṅgakalāpo na 
paṭhitaḥ | tata ākāṅkṣāśāmakam oṣadhīdravyakatvena vyaktaliṅgakatvena 
sādṛśyāt darśapūrṇamāsavaditi padaṃ kalpyate(-)sauryaṃ caruṃ 
darśapūrṇamāsavat nirvapet iti vākyam | tataśca darśapūrṇamāsadharmāḥ 
prāpnuvanti | nahyatra tathā'kāṅkṣā'sti sāṅgapradhānasyātra pāṭhāt || 

kiṃ ca(-)yadyatideśenaiva dharmaprāptiḥ tarhi śrīkrame pīṭhamanunā āsane 
samupaviṣṭaḥ iti vacanena āsanamantrasya kḷptatvāt atideśenaiva prāptau 
punarvidhānaṃ vyarthaṃ sat gṛhamedhīyājyabhāganyāyena 

<p. 74>

yāvaduktaṃ kartavyaṃ nāto'dhikamiti spaṣṭīkaroti | itthaṃ ca 
kathametadatiriktānāṃ prāptirbhavet | kiṃ ca(-)śrīkramāddharmaprāptiratideśena 
bhavati tat kiṃ yāvadaṅgānāṃ bhavatītyucyate āhosvit yatkiṃciddharmāṇām | 
ādyaṃ caturnavatimantraiḥ abhimantraṇābhāvaḥ kena siddhaḥ | na hi nārṣevaṃ 
vṛṇīte na hotāram itivat sūtre caturnavatimantrairabhimantraṇaṃ na 
kartavyamityasti yena tannivāryate | yaśca (")manmate tu prakṛtivikṛtibhāvābhāvāt 
yāvaduktaṃ kartavyamiti atra taduktyabhāvāt caturnavatimantrairanabhimantraṇaṃ 
yuktam | tava mate saṃdarbhaviruddham ityadhikaḥ pāṭhaḥ(-)ba(.) 2(") 
yatkiṃciddharmātideśa iti pakṣaḥ sa ca devānāṃpriyāṇāmeva priyo 
bhavitumarhati na paṇḍitānām || 

tasmāt pūrvoktadharmaprāpakaṃ sarṣapamātramapi pramāṇaṃ na paśyāmaḥ | 
evamatratyāḥ kecana nirmūlaṃ śrīkrame likhitāḥ | evaṃ śyāmākramoktāḥ 
niṣpramāṇāḥ śrīkrame anyatra ca prakṣiptāḥ | na hi pramāṇarahito dharmo 
bhavitumarhati | ato mīmāṃsāgandhānabhijñena 
kevalasaṃskṛtabhāṣā'bhijñena svecchayā sāṅkaryaṃ prāpito yo nibandhaḥ 
tamāśritya sudhiyo'pyanutiṣṭhanti | atra ke'pi pariśodhanaṃ na kurvanti | atra 
kaliyugaśaktireva bījaṃ nānyaditi yuktamutpaśyāmaḥ | tasmāt tatratyāni 
nānuṣṭheyāni | yāvaduktaṃ kartavyam yatrānyato grāhyaṃ sūcitaṃ 
yathā'sanamantreṇeti tad grāhyaṃ na kenacidavicārya likhitaṃ pramāṇam | 
pramāṇābhāvāt tadanuṣṭhāne nāpūrvaṃ bhavet | yadi bhavet tarhi agnihotre 
darśapūrṇamāsadharmātideśaḥ darśapūrṇamāsayoḥ 
jyotiṣṭomadharmātideśo'pi bhavet | tasmādapramāṇaṃ svecchayā saṅkīrṇo 
nibandho'śraddheyaḥ ityalamativistareṇa ||

kiṃ ca(-)ekakriyāyāḥ prakṛtirekā śāstre dṛṣṭā na hi nānāprakṛtikā ekā 
vikṛtirdṛṣṭā śrutapūrvā vā āsīt | ayaṃ nibandhakāraḥ kāṃściddharmān 
parāprakaraṇasthān saurityanena āsanaprokṣaṇādirūpān 
tāmbūlabhakṣaṇādirūpān śrīvidyāprakaraṇasthāṃśca (")tantrāntare 
ityadhikaḥ(-)ba(.") ityevaṃ nānāprakaraṇasthān ekatra atidiśan kathaṃ 
dharmatattvajño bhavet ||

na ca yathā jyotiṣṭomasya ye dharmāḥ teṣāṃ dvādaśāhe atideśaḥ tataḥ 
atidiṣṭatatprakaraṇasthadharmayoḥ yathā dvirātrādāvatideśaḥ tadvat 
mūlaprakṛtiḥ śrīvidyā tato'tideśena prāptāḥ parāyāṃ tāmbūlādayaḥ 
tatsahitaḥ yo'sāvāsanaprokṣaṇarūpo viśeṣadharmaḥ sa sarvo'pi 
dvirātrādisthānāpanne gaṇapatāvatidiśyatām | tathā sati na nānāprakṛtikatvam 
iti vācyam | yadi śrīprakṛtikā parā tarhi bhūṣaṇadhāraṇasya atideśenaiva 
prāptau tatprakaraṇe bhūṣitavigraha iti vyartham | evaṃ 
vāmapārṣṇighātādikaṃ bahutaraṃ vyartham | ato na prakṛtivikṛtibhāvastayoḥ 
saṃbhavati | ato yeṣāṃ pratyakṣavacanamasti yathā'traiva sūryārghyāntavidhiḥ 
evaṃ parāprakaraṇe śyāmāvat sāmānyaviśeṣārghye 

