anye tu niruktadigvyavasthāyā vaidike karmaṇi sāvakāśatvāt 
pūjyapūjakayormadhye diśaṃ prācīṃ prakalpayet iti tantravacanānusāreṇa 
devyagrabhāgaḥ prācī devīpṛṣṭhabhāgaḥ pratīcī devyā dakṣabhāgo dakṣiṇā 
vāmabhāga udīcī diganusāreṇa vidiśāṃ kalpanam ityūcuḥ || 

