sarvasattvān 

<p. 147>

bhageśvari aiṃ blūṃ jeṃ blūṃ bheṃ blūṃ moṃ blūṃ heṃ blūṃ heṃ 
klinne sarvāṇi bhagāni me vaśamānaya strīṃ hara bleṃ hrīṃ bhagamālinī | 
tāro māyā nityaklinne madadrave svāhā iti nityaklinnā | praṇavaḥ kroṃ bhroṃ 
krauṃ jhrauṃ chrauṃ jrauṃ svāhā iti bheruṇḍā | praṇavo māyā vahnivāsinyai 
namaḥ iti vahnivāsinī | māyāklinne vāk kroṃ nityamadadrave hrīṃ iti 
mahāvajreśvarī | māyā śivadūtyai namaḥ iti śivadūtī | praṇavo māyā huṃ 
khe ca che kṣaḥ strīṃ huṃ kṣeṃ hrīṃ phaṭ iti tvaritā | kumārī kulasundarī | 
hasakalaraḍavāgbhavahasakalaraḍabindumālinī hasakalaraḍacaturdaśaṣoḍaśā iti 
nityā | māyā phreṃ srūṃ 
aṅkuśapāśasmaravāgbhavablūṃpadanityamadadrave varma phreṃ māyeti 
nīlapatākā | bhamaraya(-)ūmiti vijayā | svaumiti sarvamaṅgalā | tāro namo 
bhagavati jvālāmālini devadevi sarvabhūtasaṃhārakārike jātavedasi jvalanti 
jvala jvala prajvala prajvala trijātiyuktamāyārephasaptakajvālāmālini 
varmaphaḍagnijāyeti jvālāmālini | (aṃ) ckauṃ iti citreti pañcadaśa nityāḥ 
prathamatryasrarekhāsthitapañcadaśasvareṣu pūjyāḥ | visṛṣṭau ṣoḍaśīṃ 
mūlavidyayā cābhyarcya || 9 ||

vāk aiṃ | śeṣaṃ yathā paṭhitam | mantrānte sarvatra tattannityānāma taduttaraṃ 
aṣṭākṣarīyogaḥ | yathā ādau tritārī aiṃ sakalahrīṃ nityaklinne madadrave sauḥ 
kāmeśvarīnityāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ iti | evamagre'pi draṣṭavyam | 
yadyapi śrīpāduketyaṣṭākṣarīyogaḥ sāmānyavacanaprāptaḥ tathā'pi 
nityāpadaghaṭitatvenāprāptatvāt tadartha ārambhaḥ sarvatra 
nityāpūjanamantreṣu | dvitīyamāha vāgiti | tṛtīyamāha tāra iti | tāraḥ praṇavaḥ 
māyā hrīṃ śeṣaṃ yathāśrutaṃ paṭhanīyam | ādau praṇavaḥ tato māyā tataḥ 
svāhā'nto yathāśrutaḥ iti phalito'rthaḥ | caturthamāha praṇava iti svāhetyantena 
| pañcamīmāha praṇava iti namaḥ ityantena | ṣaṣṭhamāha māyeti hrīmityantena | 
saptamamāha māyeti namaḥ ityantena | aṣṭamamāha praṇava iti phaḍityantena | 
navamamāha kumārīti | kumārī bālā saiva kulasundarītyarthaḥ | dasamamāha 
haseti ṣoḍaśā ityantena | atra pūrvoktayuktyā hasaketyādau 
kevalavyañjanānāmeva grahaṇam | anyathā dvādaśārdhā ca nityā syāt iti 
anyatantravacanena dvādaśārdhā mantravarṇātideśe tribījasthā dvādaśārdhā 
iti mantre trivarṇatvasiddheḥ atrāpi tadatideśasiddhatrivarṇatvaṃ virudhyeta | 
hasakalaraḍottaraṃ vāgbhavaḥ aiṃ punaḥ taduttaraṃ binduyuktā mālinī īkāraḥ 

<p. 148>

govindaśca trimūrtiśo mālinīvāmalocanam iti kośāt | caturdaśaṣoḍaśau 
pūrvamuktau | itthaṃ ca hsklrḍaiṃ hsklrḍīḥ hsklrḍauḥ nityānityāśrī iti(-)
mantrasvarūpam ||

yacca nibandhe avarṇasahitahakārādi likhitaṃ tadajñānaprayuktameva | 
tantrāntarānusāreṇa yadi likhitaṃ tarhi vaśinyādinyāse kavargaṃ kalahrīṃ ca 
nigadya iti sūtre sati halmātragrahaṇe tantrāntaramṛte sādhanaṃ mṛgyam | tasmāt 
uktayuktyā tryakṣaryeva nityāvidyā ||

ekādaśamāha māyetyārabhya māyetyantena | ādyāni trīṇi bījāni spaṣṭāni 
aṅkuśaḥ kromiti pāśaḥ āmiti ādyantago mahāpāśa iti yoginītantrāt | 
ādirakāraḥ tasyāntaḥ agrimo deśaḥ tatra sthita ākāra iti tadarthaḥ | evaṃ 
kāmo'gnirvyāpako'ṅkuśaḥ iti tatraiva | kāmaḥ kakāraḥ agniḥ rephaḥ 
vyāpakaḥ praṇavaḥ militvā kromiti sampadyate | ayamaṅkuśa ityarthaḥ | smaraḥ 
klīṃ vāgbhavaḥ aiṃ varma huṃ | itthaṃ ca hrīṃ phreṃ srūṃ kroṃ āṃ klīṃ 
aiṃ blūṃ nityamadadrave huṃ phreṃ hrīṃ nīlapatākānityāśrī iti 
mantrasvarūpam | dvādaśamāha bhamaraya(-)ūṃ iti | atrapi pūrvayuktyā 
halmātragrahaṇam iyamekākṣarī vidyā vijayā samprakīrtitā iti 
tantrāntaravacanāt ||

tena nibandhe pañcākṣaroccāraṇaṃ aukāroccāraṇaṃ prāmādikam | 
rbhmyūmiti svarūpaṃ jñeyam | yadyapi tantrāntare 
aṅgadādibindusaṃyutabhityasti | aṅgada aukāraḥ | tena caramasvara aukāraḥ iti 
pratibhāti | tathā'pi sūtre ṣaṣṭhasvaroccāraṇāt sūtraviruddhaṃ 
tantrāntaroktaṃ sūtrānusāriṇāmanādartavyameva ||

trayodaśamāha svaumiti | caturdaśamāha tāra iti agnijāyetyantena | 
trijātiyuktamāyā hrāṃ hrīṃ hrūṃ | vahnijāyā svāhā | śeṣaṃ spaṣṭam | 
pañcadaśamāha aṃ ckraumiti | pañcadaśa nityāpūjane deśaniyamamāha 
prathametyādi | prathamatryasraṃ bindusamīpasthaṃ trikoṇaṃ tatratyāḥ 
yāstisrorekhāḥ tāsu vartamānā ye pañcadaśa svarāḥ 
ākārādyanusvārāntāḥ teṣu ekaikasvare ekaikanityā krameṇa pūjyetyarthaḥ | 
atra rekhāsthitapañcadaśasvareṣviti svarāṇāṃ tatra siddhavannirdeśāt 
ekaikarekhāyāṃ pañca pañca svarāḥ bhāvanīyāḥ iti vidhirunneyaḥ | 
kramasyānuktatvāt svāgrādiprādakṣiṇyena | paścimādārabhya 
īśānāntarekhāyāṃ a ā i ī u iti | aiśānādāgneyāntarekhāyām ū ṛ ṝ ḷ ḹ 
iti | āgneyādārābhya paścimāntam e ai o au am iti bhāvanāvivekaḥ | vigatā 
nirgatā sṛṣṭiḥ yasyāḥ sā visṛṣṭiḥ binducakram | tatsṛṣṭiprakāraḥ 
uttaracatuśśatīvyākhyāne setubandhe draṣṭavyaḥ | tasmin ṣoḍaśīṃ 
samaṣṭirūpāṃ mūlavidyayā pañcadaśyā abhyarcya | etāsāmadhiṣṭhānaṃ 
kḹptatrikoṇādanyadeva trikoṇamuktaṃ jñānārṇave(-)

