madhye prāktryasramadhyāntaḥ munivedanāgasaṅkhyān yathāsampradāyaṃ 
pādukān divyasiddhamānavaughasiddhāniṣṭvā paścāt svaśirasi nāthaṃ yajet | 
etallayāṅgapūjanam iti śivam (")eke yogasūtrasṛṣṭisthitisaṃhāratrike 
