|| [iti (...) kalpasūtre lalitākramo nāma caturthaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] || śrīḥ(-)

prāktryasraṃ prathamatryasram | yadvā prāktryastraṃ pūrvoktaṃ tryasraṃ tasya 
yo madhyaḥ ābhyantarapradeśaḥ tasya yaḥ antaḥ caramāvayavaḥ 
svābhimukhāgrasamīpavartī yaḥ ābhyantarapradeśaḥ tatreti phalito'rthaḥ | 
muniḥ sapta vedaḥ catvāraḥ nāgaḥ aṣṭau saṅkhyā yatreti vyutpattyā oghe 
viśeṣaṇam | yathāsaṃpradāyaṃ pādukāḥ kādihādividyābhedena 
pādukānāṃ gurumaṇḍalānāṃ bhinnatvāt yasya puruṣasya parigṛhītāḥ yā 
yāḥ pādukāḥ tattallābhāya yathāsampradāyaṃ pādukā iti | divyāśca 
siddhāśca mānavāvaśca te oghāśca tādṛśān siddhān | pūrvokte 
oghaviśeṣaṇe | ubhayatra vibhaktivyatyayaḥ ārṣaḥ | divyāḥ 7 siddhāḥ 4 
mānavāḥ 8 iti vivekaḥ | tān iṣṭvā pūjayitvā | ktvāpratyayena pāṭhena ca 
prāptakramaḥ paścādityanena anūdyate | etad(-)uktaṃ yadvā (")nāma(-)
pāścātyaitatkhaṇḍīya 9 sūtrādārabhyordhvatana 10 sūtrāntam |(") etaduttaraṃ 
vakṣyamāṇaṃ (")nāma(-)āgāmipañcamakhaṇḍasthaikasūtrādārabhya |(") 
navāvaraṇapūjanaṃ layāṅgaṃ layasvarūpaṃ caturasrādibindvantakramasya 
layasvarūpatvāt layāṅgapūjanaṃ bhavitumarhati | etena 
tantrāntaroktabindvādipūjāvyāvṛttiḥ (")idamatratātparyaṃ yat(-)sarvatra 
yantrapūjāyāṃ(-)sṛṣṭisthitisaṃhārakramāṇāmanyatama ekaḥ kramaḥ 
pratipadokto gṛhyate arthāt sṛṣṭikrameṇa bindumārabhyārcanamārabhyate(-)
tathātra krame na grāhyamapi tu(-)layāṅgaṃ nāma saṃhārakrameṇātra krame 
pūjārambhaḥ kāryaḥ | etaddevatābhinnadevatārcane tu bindumārabhyeti 
mārmikam |(") | śivamiti khaṇḍasamāptidyotakam || 10 ||

