śyāmācakralekhanaprakāraḥ

atha śyāmācakralekhanaprakāramāha(-)

suvarṇarajatatāmracandanamaṇḍaleṣu bindutrikoṇapañcakoṇāṣṭadalaṣoḍaśa(-)
dalāṣṭadalacaturdalacaturasrātmakaṃ cakrarājaṃ vilikhya || 17 ||

