cakradevīpūjā

itthaṃ pātrāsādanamuktvā śrīdevatāyāḥ mūrtikalpanāmantramāha(-)

cakramadhye śrīmātamuktvā gīśvarīmūrtaye namaḥ iti mūrtiṃ kalpayitvā 
bhūyaḥ śrīmātamuktvā gīśvaryamṛtacaitanyamāvāhayāmi ityāvāhya 
ṣoḍaśabhirupacarya āśuśukṣaṇitryakṣarakṣaḥprabhañjanadikṣu devyā maulau 
paritaśca pūjyā aṅgadevyaḥ | tanmantrāḥ sarvajanādayaḥ aṣṭau saptaikādaśa 
daśa punardaśāṣṭāviṃśatikhaṇḍāḥ tritārīkumārīvāgādayaḥ sajātayaḥ 
sāmānyamanuyuktāḥ || 2 ||

cakramadhye iti āvāhyetyanenānvitam | śrī(0) ityārabhya ityantaḥ uktvetyapahāya 
mūrtikalpanamantraḥ | dvitīyaśrī(0) ityārabhya āvāhayāmītyantaḥ uktvāvarjam 
āvāhanamantraḥ | ṣoḍaśopacārāḥ sapramāṇaṃ dvitīyakhaṇḍe 
(")dvitīyakhaṇḍe-9 sūtrabhāṣye-82-patre(-)darśitā iti jñeyam |(") darśitāḥ | 
āśuśukṣaṇiḥ agniḥ tryakṣaḥ īśānaḥ rakṣaḥ nir(-)ṛtiḥ prabhañjano vāyuḥ 
eṣāṃ dikṣu uktakrameṇa vidikṣviti bhāvaḥ | devyā maulau madhye ityarthaḥ | 
prāgādidikṣu aṅgadevyaḥ ṣaḍaṅgadevyaḥ pūjyāḥ | tāsāṃ mantrān vaktuṃ 
prakramate tanmantrā iti | mūlamantreṇa sarvajanetyārabhya ṣaṭ khaṇḍāni 
ṣaḍaṅgadevīnāṃ mantrā bodhyāḥ | tatraikaikaṃ kūṭaṃ kiyadvarṇakamiti 
jijñāsāyāmāha aṣṭāviti | sarvajanetyādiṣaṭkhaṇḍāni 
kramādaṣṭādisaṅkhyākānītyarthaḥ prathamakhaṇḍam aṣṭavarṇaṃ dvitīyaṃ 
saptavarṇaṃ tṛtīyam ekādaśavarṇaṃ caturthapañcamau daśavarṇau ṣaṣṭham 
aṣṭāviṃśativarṇakamiti phalitam | na kevalaṃ 
mūlamantraghaṭakoktasaṅkhyākavarṇāḥ eva mantrasvarūpam anye'pi varṇā 
yojyāḥ ityāha tritārīkumārīvācaḥ ādau eṣāṃ khaṇḍānāṃ jātiḥ hṛdayāya 
śirase(0) ityādiḥ taiḥ sahitāḥ sajātayaḥ sāmānyamanavo namaḥ svāhā 
vaṣaḍityādayaḥ taiḥ krameṇa yuktāḥ | itthaṃ ca mantrasvarūpam aiṃ hrīṃ 
śrīṃ aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ aiṃ sarvajanamanohāri hṛdayāya namaḥ | uktabījāni aiṃ(0) 
ityādīni sapta ādau sarvatra yojyāni | 7 sarvamukharañjini śirase svāhā | 7 klīṃ 
hrīṃ śrīṃ sarvarājavaśaṅkari śikhāyai vaṣaṭ | 7 sarvastrīpuruṣavaśaṅkari 
kavacāya huṃ | 7 sarvaduṣṭamṛgavaśaṅkari netratrayāya vauṣaṭ | 7 
sarvasattvavaśaṅkari sarvalokavaśaṅkari amukaṃ me vaśamānaya svāhā | sauḥ 
klīṃ aiṃ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ astrāya phaṭ iti mantrasvarūpam | yadyapi mantre 
trayastriṃśadvarṇāḥ dṛśyante sūtroktāṣṭāviṃśatisaṅkhyayā virudhyante 
tathā'pi svāhā'ntāḥ saptaviṃśativarṇāḥ agrimaṣaḍbījāni militvā 
śrīṣoḍaśākṣaryāṃ praviṣṭapañcadaśavarṇātmakakūṭatraye 
ekaikakūṭasyaikaikavarṇatvavat ṣaṇṇāṃ varṇānāmaikavarṇatvam | itthaṃ ca 
aṣṭāviṃśatisaṅkhyopapannā ||

<p. 201>

nibandhakāraḥ svāhā'ntaṃ khaṇḍaṃ cakāra tathā saptaviṃśativarṇātmake 
uktagaterapyabhāvaḥ || 20 ||

āvaraṇapūjā

paścādāvaraṇapūjāṃ kuryāt || 21 ||

paścāditīdaṃ sūtraṃ vyartham eva dṛśyate tathā'pi na tathā mantavyam | tathā 
hi idam āvaraṇapūjotpattivākyam agrimavākyāni 
taditikartavyatāprapañcarūpāṇi somena yajeta aindravāyavaṃ gṛhṇāti itivat | 
etena ekavidhivihitatvena ekapadārtharūpatvāt madhye 
āvaraṇāvayavaikadevatālope'pi punaḥ sarvānuṣṭhānaṃ siddham || 21 ||

atha sarvopayoginīṃ kāṃcit paribhāṣāmāha(-)

sarvacakradevatā'rcanāni vāmakarāṅguṣṭhānāmikāsandaṣṭadvitīyaśakala 
gṛhītaśrīpātraprathamabindusahapatitaiḥ dakṣakarākṣatapuṣpakṣepaiḥ kuryāt || 
22 ||

sarvacakradevatāḥ gaṇapatyādiparā'ntāḥ sāmānyapaddhatyā yakṣyamāṇā 
anyāśca | śrīpātraṃ viśeṣārghyapātram | sahapatitairityanena 
bindupuṣpākṣatayoḥ patanam ekakāle iti sūcitam || 22 ||

prathamāvaraṇadevatāḥ tatsthānaṃ cāha(-)

trikoṇe ratiprītimanobhavān || 23 ||

trikoṇe trikoṇakoṇeṣvityarthaḥ | atra kramasyānuktatvāt 
svāgrādiprādakṣiṇyakramaḥ | yadvā āgneyakoṇe tataḥ paścimakoṇe tata 
aiśāne tenodagapavargalābhaḥ | iti prathamāvaraṇam || 23 ||

dvitīyāvaraṇapūjāsthānādikaṃ darśayati(-)

pañcāramūle pura ādikrameṇa drāṃ drāvaṇabāṇāya drīṃ 
śoṣaṇabāṇāyaklīṃ bandhanabāṇāya blūṃ mohanabāṇāya saḥ 
unmādanabāṇāya namaḥ iti tadagre māyākāmavāgblūṃ strīmupajuṣṭāḥ 
kāmamanmathakandarpamakaraketanamanobhavāḥ || 24 ||

namaḥ iti sarvamantreṣvanuṣajyate | puraḥ prācī | mūle pañcārakoṇamūle | 
tadagre iti pañcārakoṇāgreṣvityarthaḥ | māyā'dipañcakaiḥ krameṇa yuktāḥ 
kāmādayaḥ pūjyā ityarthaḥ | mantrasvarūpaṃ tu hrīṃ kāmaśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi | evamagre'pi | pūrvavat caturthyantanamo'ntarahitaṃ jñeyam | iti 
dvitīyāvaraṇam || 24 || 

<p. 202>

tṛtīyāvaraṇapūjādeśādīnāha(-)

aṣṭadalamūle brāhmī māheśvarī kaumārī vaiṣṇavī vārāhī māhendrī 
cāmuṇḍā caṇḍikāḥ sendusvarayugmāntyādayaḥ pūjyāḥ | tadagre 
lakṣmīsarasvatī rati prīti kīrti śānti puṣṭi tuṣṭayaḥ || 26 ||

indunā anusvāreṇa sahitāḥ ye svarayugmeṣu aṃ āṃ iṃ īṃ uṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ṝṃ 
ḷṃ ḹṃ eṃ aiṃ oṃ auṃ aṃ aḥ ityaṣṭasu antyāḥ āṃ īṃ ūṃ ṛṃ ḹṃ aiṃ 
auṃ aḥ ityaṣṭau varṇāḥ ādau ebhiḥ krameṇa yuktā brāhmyādayaḥ pūjyāḥ | 
mantrasvarūpam āṃ brāhmīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti | evamagre'pi | tadagre 
aṣṭadalāgre ityarthaḥ | jātāvekavacanam | pūjyā ityasyānuṣaṅgaḥ | iti 
tṛtīyāvaraṇam || 25 ||

caturthāvaraṇapūjāsthānānyāha(-)

ṣoḍaśadale vāmā jyeṣṭhā raudrī śānti śraddhā sarasvatī kriyāśaktilakṣmī(-)
sṛṣṭi mohinī pramathinī āśvāsinī vīcī vidyunmālinī surānandā 
nāgabuddhikāḥ || 25 ||

atra kriyāśaktiḥ vidyunmālinī surānandā ityekaikā devatā | śeṣā devatāḥ 
spaṣṭāḥ | kramasyānuktatvāt devyagradalamārabhya prādakṣiṇyena | iti 
caturthāvaraṇam || 26 ||

pañcamāvaraṇadeśādīnāha(-)

aṣṭadale asitāṅga ruru caṇḍa krodhana unmatta kapāla bhīṣaṇa saṃhārāḥ 
sadaṇḍisvarayugmādisaṃyuktā bhairavāntāśca bhāvanīyāḥ || 27 ||

sadaṇḍītyatra daṇḍī anusvāraḥ daṇḍī pañcadaśaḥ śūnyaḥ iti medinīkośāt | 
anusvāreṇa sahitāḥ ye pūrvoktasvarayugmādayaḥ aṃ iṃ uṃ(0) ityādayaḥ ādau 
taiḥ yuktāḥ bhairavāntāśca ye mantrāḥ taiḥ pūjyāḥ ityarthaḥ | yathā aṃ 
asitāṅgabhairavaśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi | evamevāgrimasaptamantrāḥ ūhyāḥ 
| iti pañcamāvaraṇam || 27 ||

ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇadevatāmantrādīnāha(-)

caturdalaṃ māyuktataṅgī siddhalakṣmīśca mahāmāyuktataṅgī 
mahāsiddhalakṣmīśca || 28 ||

ubhayatra yukteti jñeyam | tathā ca mātaṅgī mahāmātaṅgīti siddham | śeṣaṃ 
spaṣṭam | mātaṅgī siddhalakṣmī mahāmātaṅgī mahāsiddhalakṣmyaḥ catasraḥ 
pūjyāḥ iti vivekaḥ | iti ṣaṣṭhāvaraṇam || 28 ||

<p. 203>

saptamāvaraṇapūjāmāha(-)

gaṃ gaṇapati duṃ durgā baṃ baṭuka kṣaṃ kṣetrapālāḥ caturasre sampūjyāḥ || 
29 ||

kramastu āgneyakoṇamārabhyaiśānāntakoṇeṣu | iti saptamāvaraṇam || 29 ||

āvaraṇabahirbhūtadevatāyajanam

śrīkrame tantrāntare āmnāyādidevatāvat 
āvaraṇabahirbhūtadevatāyajanamāha(-)

sāṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ iti prabhṛti vāstupataye brahmaṇe namaḥ iti paryantaṃ 
punastatraivābhyarcya || 30 ||

tatraiveti pūrvaṃ (")pūrvaṃ nāma 196-patre(-)anugana-14-sūtre yathoktaṃ tadvat |(") 
yatra nyāsottaraṃ pūjitāḥ tatra taireva mantraiḥ śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti 
sahitaiḥ | yathā sāṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ sarasvatīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti | 
evamagre'pi namaḥpadānte śrīpādukāmiti yogastu sūtre namo'ntānukaraṇena 
sūcitaḥ ||

nibandhe caturasre amīṣāṃ pūjanamuktaṃ tanmandam pūrvaṃ yatraikavāraṃ 
pūjitāḥ tatraiva punaḥ pūjyā iti svarasato lābhāt | loke'pi caitraṃ gṛhāt bahiḥ 
sthāpaya maitraṃ gṛhe bhojaya caitraṃ tatraiva bhojaya ityuktau kathamanubhavaḥ 
śrutuḥ iti sūkṣmabuddhyā vicārayantvāryāḥ || 30 ||

śyāmāvidyā'cāryapūjā

śrīśyāmāvidyāpravartakācāryapūjāṃ (")pravartakapūjā'cārya iti kośeṣu(.") 
teṣāṃ sthānaṃ cāha(-)

haṃsamūrtiparaprakāśapūrṇanityakaraṇasampradāyagurūṃścaturasrapūrva(-)
rekhāyāmabhyarcya || 31 ||

haṃsamūrtiśca paraprakāśaśca pūrṇaśca nityaśca karuṇaśca ye te 
sampradāyaguravaḥ tān caturasrapūrvarekhāyām udagapavargaṃ pūjayet iti 
tadarthaḥ | mantrasvarūpaṃ ca haṃsamūrtisampradāyaguruśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi | evamagrimamantreṣvapi sampradāyagurviti yojyam dvandvānte 
śrūyamāṇaṃ pratyekaṃ sarvatra sambadhyate iti nyāyāt || 31 ||

gurupādukāpūjā

evaṃ cakrapūjāṃ samāpya gurupādukāpūjāmāha(-)

svaśirasi sāmānyaviśeṣapāduke abhyarcayet || 32 ||

<p. 204>

sāmānyagurupādukāmantraḥ dīkṣākhaṇḍe (")dīkṣākhaṇḍe 66-patre sūtre 
tadbhāṣye ca |(") pratipāditaḥ | viśeṣagurupādukāmantraḥ caramakhaṇḍe 
śyāmāgurupāduketyuddhṛtaḥ | tābhyāṃ mantrābhyāṃ svaśirasi 
pādukādvayaṃ sampūjayet || 32 ||

devyāḥ punaḥpūjā

evaṃ gurupādukā'rcanāntam āvaraṇapūjāmuktvā 
pradhānadevatāpūjāpurarasaraṃ balipradānaṃ vivṛṇoti(-)

punardevīmabhyarcya bālayā ṣoḍaśopacārān vidhāya || 33 ||

mūleneti śeṣaḥ | punarityanena ṣaḍaṅgadevatābhyaḥ prāk 
pradhānadevyarcanaṃ jñāpitam | bālayeti spaṣṭam || 33 ||

balidānam 

balidānaprakāraṃ darśayati(-)

śuddhajalena trikoṇavṛttacaturasraṃ vidhāyārdhānnapūrṇasalilaṃ (")ya tasmin 
puṣpāṇi vikīryārdhā(-)śrī(.") sādimopādimamadhyamaṃ su(")sa(")gandhapuṣpaṃ 
sādhāraṃ pātraṃ nidhāya || 34 ||

śuddhajalena kalaśasthena | ardhānnapūrṇaṃ salilaṃ yasmiṃstat | ādimaṃ 
prathamam upādimaṃ dvitīyaṃ madhyamaṃ tṛtīyam ebhiḥ sahitaṃ 
sugandhapuṣpaṃ yatra īdṛśam ādhārasahitaṃ balipātraṃ nidhāya sthāpayitvā 
|| 34 ||

balidānamantrān taditikartavyatāṃ ca darśayati(-)

śrīmātamuktvā gīśvarīmaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa huṃ phaṭ svāhā 
śrīmātamuktvā gīśvari śaraṇāgataṃ māṃ trāhi trāhi huṃ phaṭ svāhā 
kṣetrapālanāthemaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa phaṭ svāhā iti mantratrayeṇa 
vāmapārṣṇighātakarāsphoṭasamudañcitavaktranārā ca mudrābhiḥ baliṃ 
pradāya || 35 ||

śrīmātamiti huṃphaṭ svāhetyantaṃ mantratrayam | nārācamudrā 
paramānandatantre(-)

vimuṣṭyaṅguṣṭhatarjanyāvūrdhvāṅguṣṭhāgratarjanī |
hastadvayagatā caivaṃ mudrā nārāca saṃjñitā || iti ||

ayamarthaḥ prathamaṃ hastadvaye muṣṭibhāvaṃ sampādya tasyā nirgate vimuṣṭī 
ye aṅguṣṭhatarjanyau tayormadhye ūrdhvāgramaṅguṣṭhaṃ prāgagrām 
ṛjurūpāṃ tarjanīṃ kuryāt | iyaṃ nārācamudretyarthaḥ || 35 ||

<p. 205>

suvāsinīpūjādi

evaṃ balipradānakramamuktvā suvāsinīpūjā'dikamupadiśati(-)

śyāmalāṃ śaktimāhūya bālayā tāmabhyarcya tasyā hasta ādimopādimau 
dattvā tattvaṃ śodhayitvā taccheṣamurarīkṛtya yogyaiḥ saha haviśśeṣaṃ 
svīkuryāt || 36 ||

abhyarcyeti viśeṣānukteḥ yathāvibhavam | tattvaṃ śodhayitvā ityanena 
tattvaśodhanamantrāḥ api prāptāḥ te ca mantrāścatvāraḥ prasiddhāḥ (")ime 
tattvamantrāḥ trayaḥ dīkṣāprakaraṇe-62-patre 39 sūtrabhāṣye santi caturthaśca 
mantra sarvatattvāyasvāheti jñeyaḥ || iti tattvamantracatuṣṭayaṃ jñeyam ||(") | taiḥ 
pātracatuṣṭayaṃ grāhayitvā caturthapātraṃ saśeṣaṃ grāhayitvā taccheṣaṃ 
svayam urarīkuryāt | haviśśeṣapratipattimāha yogyairiti | yogyapadārthaḥ 
śrīkramoktaśiṣṭapadena vyākhyātaḥ (")176-patre(-)pāścātyapañcamakhaṇḍīya 
22 sūtre tadbhāṣye ca(-)śiṣṭapadārthaḥ sphoṭitaḥ |(") | itthaṃ ca tasya prayojanaṃ 
taditikartavyatā tat sarvamapi śrīkramoktaprakāreṇāvagantavyaṃ bhavati || 36 ||

śyāmāpūjā'vadhiḥ

evaṃ saṅgītamātṛkāpūjā kiyatkālaṃ kartavyā ityavadhyākāṅkṣāyāṃ 
tadavadhimāha(-)

evaṃ nityasaparyāṃ kurvan lakṣajapaṃ japtvā taddaśāṃśakrameṇa ca 
homatarpaṇabrāhmaṇabhojanāni vidadhyāt || 37 ||

evam uktaprakāreṇa nityasaparyāṃ nityapūjām | atra kurvannityanena pūjanasya 
japāṅgatvaṃ gamayati | tathā hi yadi pūjā pradhānaṃ japaścāṅgaṃ syāt tarhi 
yāvatparyantaṃ lakṣajapaḥ tāvat pūjeti kathanaṃ virudhyeta | na hi 
aṅgānusāriṇī pradhānāvṛttiḥ loke vede ca dṛṣṭā | yāvat bhaṭo dhāvati tāvat 
rājā dhāvati iti na hi brūte | yāvat rājā dhāvati tāvat bhaṭo dhāvati iti 
vyavahāro'sti | ato japaḥ pradhānaṃ tadavadhitvasya pūjāyāṃ kathanāt | ata eva 
japasamāptau pūjānivṛttiḥ | lakṣajapaṃ japtveti lakṣasaṅkhyāviśiṣṭajapo'nena 
vidhīyate | taddaśāṃśakrameṇa homo japadaśāṃśaṃ taddaṃśāṃśaṃ 
tarpaṇaṃ taddaśāṃśaṃ brāhmaṇabhojanamityarthaḥ || 37 ||

śyāmāmanujāpidharmāḥ

athaitanmanujāpidharmānāha(-)

etanmanujāpī na kadambaṃ chindyāt girā kālīti na vadet 
vīṇāveṇunartanagāyanagāthāgoṣṭhīṣu na parāṅmukho gacchet gāyakaṃ na 
nindyāt || 38 ||

<p. 206>

etanmanujāpī śyāmāmanujāpītyarthaḥ | ete dharmāḥ na japasamakālikāḥ kiṃ 
tu japamārabhya yāvajjīvaṃ tasmādagnicid varṣati na dhāvet itivat || 38 ||

lalitopāsakadharmāḥ

evaṃ śyāmopāsakānāṃ dharmānuktvā prasaṅgāt prādhānyācca 
lalitopāsakadharmānapyāha(-)

lalitopāsako nekṣukhaṇḍaṃ bhakṣayet na divā smared vārtālīṃ na jugupseta 
siddhadravyāṇi na kuryāt strīṣu niṣṭhuratāṃ vīrastriyaṃ na gacchet na taṃ 
hanyāt na taddravyamapaharet nātmecchayā 
mapañcakamurarīkuryātkulabhraṣṭaiḥ saha nāsīta na bahu pralapet yoṣitaṃ 
sambhāṣamāṇāmapratisambhāṣamāṇo na gacchet kulapustakāni gopāyet iti 
śivam || 39 ||

[iti(...)kalpasūtre śyāmākramo nāma ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||

ikṣukhaṇḍamityanena tadvikārāṇāṃ guḍaśarkarādīnām adoṣaḥ sūcitaḥ | 
vārtālīṃ vārāhīm | siddhadravyāṇi mapañcakarūpāṇi na 
jugupsetasvamanasā'pi na nindyāt | niṣṭhuratāṃ nāsikācchedanādi | 
vīrastriyamiti ṣaṣṭhītatpuruṣaḥ na karmadhārayaḥ | tathā sati agre na taṃ hanyāt 
ityatra puṃstvasyānanvayāpatteḥ | ato bādhakasattvāt laghorapi karmadhārayasya 
tyāgaḥ | vīrastriyam ityatra vīrapadārthaśca nirmūlaparāhatadvaitabhāvaḥ | 
taduktaṃ tantre(-)

ahami pralayaṃ kurvan idamaḥ pratiyoginaḥ |
saḥ vīra iti vijñeyaḥ svātmānandanimagnadhīḥ ||

taṃ vīram | taddravyaṃ vīradravyam | ātmecchayā svendriyatṛptaye urarīkuryāt 
svīkuryāt | kulabhraṣṭaiḥ prathamaṃ kulamārgamaṅgīkṛtya janmāntarāṃhasā 
tatrotpannāviśvāsāḥ santoye svīkṛtaṃ mārgaṃ parityajanti te kulabhraṣṭāḥ | 
taduktaṃ devībhāgavate(-)

kulamārgaṃ samāśritya janmāntarakṛtāṃhasā |
tanmārgaṃ tyajatā sākaṃ na tiṣṭhenna ca saṃvadet |
tato varaḥ paśurjñeyaḥ taṃ dṛṣṭvā'paḥ (")apsu saṃviśet śrī(.)

sūtrasyapunarāvṛttau śodhyaṃ sūcayitavyakam |
pariśiṣṭasthalaṃ caiva pūrṇamādyāprasādataḥ || [iti ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] || śrīḥ(-)
(") susaṃspṛśet || iti ||

na bahuvacanaṃ pralapet iti taiḥ sākameva | bahupadena svamārgaguptaye 
tajjanitānarthaparihārārthaṃ yāvadarthasambhāṣī bhavet iti jñāpitam | 
apratisambhāṣamāṇaḥ pratyuttaramadattvā | kulapustakāni kulaśāstrapustakāni | 
śivamityasya vyākhyānaṃ pūrvavat ||

[iti(...)kalpasūtravṛttau śyāmākramo nāmaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ khaṇḍaḥ] ||

<p. 497>

(1) oṃ aiṃ prāṇāya svāhā (2) oṃ klīṃ apānāya svāhā (3) oṃ sauḥvyānāya svāhā 
(4) oṃ ai klīṃ udānāya svāhā (5) oṃ aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ samānāya svāhā
atra kecit prāṇāhutiviṣaye pratyekāhutau mudrāṃ pradarśayanti | sā yathā (-)

(1) oṃ prāṇāya svāhā (-) ityaṅguṣṭhatarjanīmadhyamābhiḥ
(2) oṃ apānāya svāhā (-) ityaṅguṣṭhamadhyamānāmikābhiḥ
(3) oṃ vyānāya svāhā(-) ityaṅguṣṭhānāmikākaniṣṭhikābhiḥ
