1 kulārṇavatantre 7 ullāse 61 patrato yathā(-)
 
baṭukamantrān vakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣva kulanāyike (!) |
yaiḥ samarcitamātreṇa sarve naśyantyupadravāḥ ||

tāratrayaṃ tato devī putreti baṭuketi ca |
nāthaśca kapilajaṭābhārabhāsurapiṅgala ||

trinetreti padaṃ paścāt jvālāmukhapadaṃ tataḥ |
imāṃ pūjāṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa dvayaṃ pāvakavallabhā ||

ukto baṭukamantro'yaṃ catvāriṃśadbhirakṣaraiḥ |
balinānena santuṣṭo baṭukaḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ || 

<p. 527>

śāntiṃ karotu me nityaṃ bhūtavetālasevitaḥ |
tāratrayaṃ tataḥ sarvayoginībhyaḥ padaṃ vadet ||

tatpaścāt sarvabhūtebhyaḥ sarvabhūtādhipāya ca |
padaṃ tato ḍākinībhyaḥ śākinībhyaḥ padaṃ vadet ||

trailokyanipadaṃ caiva vāsinībhya imāṃ vadet | 
pūjāṃ baliṃ guhṇa yugmaṃ svāhānto yoginīmanuḥ ||

kathito'yaṃ maheśāni (!) mantraḥ pañcadaśākṣaraḥ |
yā kācid yoginī raudrā saumyā saumyatarā yadi ||

khecarī bhūcarī vyomacarī prītāstu me sadā | 
tāratrayaṃ vadet sarvabhūtebhyaḥ sarva eva hi || 

paścād bhūpatibhyo huṁ phaṭ saptadaśākṣaraḥ |
bhūtā ye vividhākārā dikṣu bhaumāntarikṣagāḥ ||

pātālasaṃsthā ye kecicchive ye ca na bhāvitāḥ |
brahmādyāḥ satyasandhāśca bhṛtyāḥ śaktyupabṛṃhitāḥ ||

tṛpyantu prītamanasaḥ pratigṛhṇantvimaṃ baliṃ |
tāratrayaṃ tato devi (!) yagmaṃ devīpadaṃ vadet |
sarvavighnān padaṃ paścānnāśaya dvitīyaṃ tathā ||

sarvopacārasahitāmimāṃ pūjāṃ baliṃ vadet |
gṛhṇa gṛhṇa dviṭhānto'yaṃ bhairavādhiṣṭhitāya ca ||

akṣobhyavanditaḥ paścād hṛdayādhiṣṭhitaṃ param |
siddhārthaṃ padamābhāṣya paścādavataradvayam || 

kṣetrapāladvayaṃ paścānmahākṣetrapadaṃ tataḥ |
asmin grāmādhipataye'smin deśādhipataye tataḥ ||

vadedbaṭukanātheti devīputrapadaṃ tataḥ |
meghanādapadaṃ paścāt pracaṇḍograpadaṃ vadet ||

kapālīti padaṃ paścādbhīṣaṇeti padaṃ vadet |
syāt sarvavighnādhipataye imāṃ pūjāṃ baliṃ vadet ||

gṛhṇa gṛhṇa kurudvandvaṃ mama duraya yugmakam |
jvalayugmaṃ prajvalayugmaṃ sarvavighnānitīrayet ||

<p. 528>

nāśayadvitayaṃ kṣāṃ kṣīṃ kṣūṃ kṣaiṃ kṣauṃ kṣaṃ(-) tataḥ paraṃ |
mātṛputrapadaṃ paścāt kulaputrapadaṃ tataḥ ||

kṣetrapālāya vauṣaṭ huṁ ṣaḍuttaraśatākṣaraḥ |
tāratrayaṃ vadet paścādamukakṣetrapāla ca (!) ||

rājarājeśvara (!) imāṃ pūjāṃ balimataḥ param |
gṛhṇayugmaṃ dviṭhānto'yamaṣṭāviṃśākṣaro manuḥ ||

anena balidānena baṭuvṛndasamanvitaḥ |
rajarājeśvaro devo me prasīdatu sarvadā || iti || 

