khasyānto gakārastadrūpaṃ bījaṃ samuddhṛtya tato ṅe'ntaṃ gaṇapatiṃ (-)
ñcoktvā tato vahnijāyāṃ svāheti vadet yojanayā
gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ gaiṃ gauṃ gaḥ gaṇapataye svāheti mantro jātaḥ
eṣaḥ sudhāmiṣānvitānnabalirityādyenānenaiva mantreṇa
uttarasyāṃ maṇḍalasyottare bhāge gaṇeśāya baliṃ kalpayeddadyāt || iti ||

