kṣaṃ kṣetrapālāya namaḥ ityuktvā taṃ dhyātvā candanākṣatapuṣpāṇi 
ākāśe tasmai samarpya namaskṛtya |

oṃ śrīkṣetrapālabalidravyāya namaḥ ityuccārya baliṃ candanādinā sampūjya | 
balipātrāttadabhāve sāmānyārghapātrājjalamādāya oṃ kṣāṃ kṣīṃ kṣūṃ 
kṣaiṃ kṣauṃ kṣaḥ ehyehi devīputra ucchiṣṭahārin muhurmuhūrakṣa rakṣa 
