gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā ityuktvā vāmāṅguṣṭhaṃ tarjanīṃ ca miśrīkṛtya tajjalaṃ 
tatra pātayedyathā balau patet | tatastaṃ prārthayedyathā puṣpāñjalimādāya

oṃ yaṃ yaṃ yaṃ yakṣarūpaṃ daśadiśivadanaṃ bhumikampāyamānam | 
saṃ saṃ saṃhāramūrti śirasi dhṛtajaṭāśekharaṃ candrabimbam ||

