mantrāṇāṃ devatā proktā devatā gururūpiṇī |
abhedena yajed yastu tasya siddhiranuttamā || 167 ||

guruṃ śirasi sañcintya devatāṃ hṛdayāmbuje |
rasanāyāṃ mūlavidyāṃ tejorupāṃ vicintya ca ||
trayāṇāṃ tejasātmānamekībhūtaṃ vicintayet || 168 ||

tāreṇa sampuṭīkṛtya mūlayantrañca saptadhā |
japtvā tu sādhakaḥ paścānmātṛkāpuṭitaṃ smaret || 169 ||

māyābījaṃ svaśirasi daśadhā prajapet sudhīḥ |
vadane praṇavaṃ tadvat punarmāyāṃ hṛdambuje ||
prajapya saptadhā mantrī prāṇāyāmaṃ samācaret || 170 ||

tato mālāṃ samādāya pravālādisamudbhavām |
māle (!) māle (!) mahābhāge (!) sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi (!) || 171 ||

caturvargastvayi nyastastasmānme siddhidā bhava ||
iti sampūjya mālāṃ tāṃ śrīpātrasthāmṛtena ca || 172 ||

tridhā mūlena santarpya sthiracitto japaṃ caret |
aṣṭottarasahasraṃ vāpyathavāṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 173 ||

prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā śrīpātrajalapuṣpakaiḥ |
guhyātiguhyagoptrī tvaṃ gṛhāṇāsmatkṛtaṃ japam || 174 ||

siddhirbhavatu me devi (!) tvatprasādānmaheśvari (!) |
iti mantreṇa matimān devyā vāmakarāmbuje || 175 ||

tejorūpaṃ japaphalaṃ samarpya praṇamedbhuvi 
tataḥ kṛtāñjalirbhūtvā stotrañca kavacaṃ paṭhet || 176 || iti ||

<p. 544>

35-3 | 2 || śrīguruguruśrīśaṅkaroktaṃ japakartṛkartavyam ||
japakaraṇasthalaṃ (-) kulārṇavatantre 15 ullāse 136 patre yathā(-)

puṇyakṣetraṃ nadītīraṃ guhāparvatamastakam |
tīrthapradeśāḥ sindhūnāṃ saṅgamaḥ pāvanaṃ vanam ||

udyānāni viviktāni bilvamūlaṃ taṭaṃ gireḥ |
devatāyatanaṃ kūlaṃ samudrasya nijaṃ gṛham ||

sādhaneṣu praśastāni sthānānyetāni mantriṇām | 
athavā nivasettatra yatra cittaṃ prasīdati ||

sūryyasyāgnergurerindordīpasya syandanasya ca |
gorakṣakulavṛkṣāṇāṃ sannidhau śasyate japaḥ ||

gṛhe śataguṇaṃ vindyādgoṣṭhe lakṣaguṇaṃ bhavet ||
koṭirdevālaye puṇyamanantaṃ śivasannidhau ||

mlecchaduṣṭamṛgavyālaśaṅkātaṅkavivarjitaḥ |
ekāntapāvane nindārahite bhaktisaṃyute ||

svadeśe dhārmike deśe subhikṣe nirupadrave |
ramye bhaktajanasthāne nivasettāpasāśraye ||

rājānaḥ sacivā rājñaḥ prabhavāḥ puruṣā janāḥ |
caranti yena mārgeṇa nivasettatra mantravit || 

jīrṇadevālayodyāne gṛhe vṛkṣataleṣu ca |
nadītaḍāgakūpeṣu bhūcchidrādiṣu no viśet ||

dīpanāthamavijñāya yo japādikamācaret |
vaṃśāśmadharaṇīdārutṛṇavannavanirmitam ||

varjayedāsanaṃ dhīmān dāridryavyādhiduḥkhadam |
tūlakambalavastrāṇāṃ siṃhavyāghramṛgājinam ||

kalpayedāsanaṃ dhīmān saubhāgyajñānavṛddhidam |
padmasvastikavīrādiṣvāsaneṣupaviśya ca ||

japārcanādikaṃ kuryyādanyathā niṣphalaṃ bhavet |
dvādaśāvarttayedbuddhyā praṇavantu trimātṛkam ||

muñcet piṅgalayā vāyuṃ antasthaṃ recako bhavet |
ṣoḍaśāvarttakaṃ tāraṃ pūrayedbāhyamārutam ||

<p. 545>

śanakairiḍayā badvā pūrakaṃ parikīrttitam |
dvādaśāvartakaṃ tāraṃ vāyumadhye tu kumbhayet ||

śoṣayedvāyubījena dehaśoṣaṇamīritaṃ |
punaśca pūrayedvāyuṃ viracyāpūryya kumbhayet ||

dehaṃ dahanabījena dehadāhanamīritam |
punaśca pūrvavadvāyuṃ virecyāpūryya kumbhayet ||

śivakuṇḍalinīyogaspandanāmṛtadhārayā |
āpādamastakaṃ devi (!) prāpayet plāvanaṃ bhavet ||

japo dhyānaṃ vinā garbhaḥ sagarbhastadviparyyayaḥ |
agarbhagarbhasaṃyuktaḥ prāṇāyāmaḥ śatādhikaḥ ||

tapāṃsi tīrthayātrādyamatha dānavratādayaḥ |
prāṇāyāmasya tasyaite kalāṃ nārhanti ṣoḍaśīm ||

mānasaṃ vācikaṃ pāpaṃ kāyikaṃ vāpi yat kṛtam |
tat sarvaṃ nirdahecchīghraṃ prāṇāyāmatrayeṇa vai ||

dahmate dhmāyamānānāṃ dhātūnāñca yathā malam |
tathendriyāṇāṃ dahyante doṣāḥ prāṇasya saṃyamāt ||

prāṇāyāmairviśuddhātmā yad yat karma karoti hi |
tattat phalatyasandehādaprayatnena vā kṛtam |
āgamoktena mārgeṇa nyāsaṃ nityaṃ karoti yaḥ |
devatābhāvamāpnoti mantrasiddhiḥ prajāyate ||

yo nyāsakavacacchando mantraṃ japati ca priye (!) |
vighnā dṛṣṭvā palāyante siṃhaṃ dṛṣṭvā yathā gajāḥ ||

akṛtvā nyasajālaṃ yo mūḍhatvāt prajapenmanum ||
bādhyate sarvavighnaiśca siṃhairmṛgapaśuryathā ||

akṣamālā dvidhā proktā kalpitākalpiteti ca |
kalpitā mālābhiḥ kḷptā mātṛkā syādakalpitā ||

ādikṣāntākṣarāntatvādakṣamāleti kīrtitā |
anulomavilomābhyāṃ gaṇayenmantravittamaḥ ||

<p. 546>

ekaikamaṅgulibhiḥ syādrekhābhirdaśadhā phalam | 
mālābhiḥ śatasāhasraṃ mālinyānantamucyate ||

triṃśadbhiḥ syāddhanaṃ puṣṭiḥ saptaviṃśatibhirbhavet ||
pañcaviṃśatibhirmokṣaṃ pañcadaśyābhicārake ||

pañcāśadbhiḥ kuleśāni (!) sarvasiddhiritīritā |
aṅguṣṭhena ca mokṣaḥ syāttarjanī śatrunāśinī ||

madhyamā dhanadāṃ vidyāt śāntikarmaṇyanāmikā |
kaniṣṭhā stambhanākarṣi cāṅguliṣu prakīrtitā ||

etāvacca japiṣyāmītyādau saṅkalpya mantravit |
sthirāsano japitvā ca devyai sodakamarpayet ||

uccairjapo'dhamaḥ prokta upāṃśurmadhyamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
uttamo mānaso devi (!) trividhaḥ kathito japaḥ ||

atihrasvo vyādhiheturatidīrghe tapakṣayaḥ |
akṣarākṣarasaṃyuktyā japenmauktikapaṅktivat || 

manasā yaḥ smaret stotraṃ vacasā vā manuṃ japet |
ubhayaṃ niṣphalaṃ devi bhinnabhāṇḍodakaṃ yathā ||

jātasūtakamādau syāttadante mṛtasūtakam |
sūtakadvayasaṃyukto yo mantraḥ sa na sidhyati ||

atastadrahitaṃ kṛtvā mantramāvartayet sadā ||

sūtakadvayāsaṃyukto yo mantraḥ sa hi sidhyati |
mantrārthaṃ mantracaitanyaṃ yonimudrāṃ na vetti yaḥ ||

śatakoṭijapenāpi tasya siddhirna jāyate |
guptavīryyāśca ye mantrā na dāsyanti phalam priye (!) ||

mantrāścaitanyasahitāḥ sarvasiddhikarāḥ smṛtāḥ |
caitanyarahitā mantrāḥ proktā varṇāstu kevalam || 

phalaṃ naiva prayacchanti lakṣakoṭijapādapi |
mantroccāre kṛte yādṛka svarūpaṃ prathamaṃ bhavet ||

śataiḥ sahasrairlakṣairvā koṭijāpena tat phalam |
hṛdaye granthibhedaśca sarvāvayavavarddhanam ||

<p. 547>

ānandāśru ca pulako dehāveśaḥ kuleśvari |
gadgadoktiśca sahasā jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 

sakṛduccarite'pyevaṃ mantre caitanyasampuṭe |
dṛśyante pratyayā yatra pāramparyaṃ taducyate ||

bahukūṭākṣaro mugdho baddhaḥ kruddhaśca bheditaḥ |
bālaḥ kumāro yuvako vṛddhaḥ prauḍhaśca garvitaḥ ||

stambhito mūrcchitaḥ kaṣṭaḥ saṃvītaḥ khaṇḍitaḥ priye (!) |
mantraḥ parāṅmukhaśchinno badhiro'ndhastvacetanaḥ ||

kekaraḥ kṣudhitaḥ kḷptaḥ sthānaduṣṭaśca pīḍitaḥ |
nisneho vikalaḥ stabdho nirjīvaḥ khaṇḍitārikaḥ ||

suptastiraskṛto līḍho malinaśca durāsadaḥ |
niḥsatvo nirdayo dagdhaścapalaśca bhayaṅkaraḥ ||

nistriṃso vikṛtācāraḥ phalahīno nikṛntanaḥ |
nirbījo bhūmitaḥ śapto rūkṣaḥ kṛṣṭo'ṅgahīnataḥ ||

jaḍo ripurudāsīno lajjito mohitaḥ priye (!) |
santyetān mantradoṣāṃśca jñātvā paścājjapenmanum ||

siddhirna jāyate tasya lakṣakoṭijapādapi |
kathyante daśasaṃskārā mantradoṣaharāḥ priye (!) ||

jananaṃ jīvanaṃ paścāttāḍanaṃ bodhanaṃ tataḥ |
abhiṣeko'tha vimalīkaraṇāpyāyane tathā ||

tarpaṇaṃ dīpanaṃ guptiḥ saṃskārāḥ kulanāyike (!) |
śāṇollīḍhāni śastrāṇi yathāsyurniśitāni vai ||

mantrāśca sphūrtimāyānti saṃskārairdaśabhistathā |
bhakṣyaṃ haviṣyaṃ śākādivihitāni phalānyapi ||

mūlaṃ sakturyavānāñca śastānyetāni mantriṇām ||
yasyānnapānamaśnāti kurute dharmasañcayam ||
annadātuḥ phalaṃ cārddhaṃ karttuścārddhaṃ na saṃśayaḥ ||
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena parānnaṃ varjayet sudhīḥ ||
puraścaraṇakāle ca kāmyakarmasvapīśvari (!) ||

<p. 548>

jihvā dagdhā parānnena karau dagdhau pratigrahāt |
mano dagdhaṃ parastrībhiḥ kāryyasiddhiḥ kathaṃ bhavet ||

indvagnirudragrahayugvedārkadikṣaḍaṣṭasu ||
ṣoḍaśamanubāṇābdhitithitrayodaśasvapi |
likhet ṣoḍaśakoṣṭheṣu mātṛkārṇān vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

svanāmādyakṣarād yāvanmantrādyakṣaradarśanam |
siddhādīn kalpayenmantrī kuryāt siddhādibhiḥ punaḥ ||

siddhasiddho japāt siddho dviguṇāt siddhasādhyakaḥ |
siddhasusiddho'rddhajapāt siddhārirhanti bāndhavān || 

sādhyasiddho'tisaṅkleśāt sādhyasādhyo nirarthakaḥ |
sādhyasusiddho bhajanāt sādhyārirhanti gotrajān ||

susiddhasiddho'rddhajapāt tatsādhyastu yathoktataḥ |
tat susiddho grahādeva susiddhāriḥ sagotrahā ||

arisiddhaḥ sutaṃ hanyādarisādhyastu yoṣitam | 
tat susiddhaḥ kulaṃ hanti svātmānaṃ hanti tadripuḥ ||

siddhārṇā bāndhavāḥ proktāḥ sādhyāste sevakāḥ smṛtāḥ ||
susiddhāḥ poṣakā jñeyāḥ śatravo ghātakāḥ smṛtāḥ ||

bāndhavā navabāṇaikāḥ syurdviṣaḍdaśasevakāḥ |
prāpalepapaṭuprāpa (")atrāśuddhaṃ śodhyaṃ(-)(")rudraścātivakaṃ naraḥ || 
lokālokapaṭuprāpaghanaghāteṣu bheditaḥ ||
varṇāḥ kramāt yuvāntyau tu revatyaṃśagatau tayoḥ ||

janmasampadvipatkṣemapratyariḥ sādhako vadhaḥ |
mitraṃ paramamitraśca janmādīni punaḥ punaḥ ||

bāṇaṃ gauraṃ khuraṃ śoṇaṃ samīno bheti rāśiṣu |
krameṇa bheditā varṇāḥ kanyāyāṃ śādayaḥ smṛtāḥ ||

lagno dhanaṃ bhrātṛbandhuputraśatrukalatrakāḥ |
maraṇaṃ dharmakarmāyavyayā dvādaśa rāśayaḥ ||

nāmādyakṣaramārabhya yāvanmantrādimākṣaram | 
tridhā kṛtvā svarairbhindyāt tadanyadviparītakam || 

<p. 549>

kṛtvādhikamṛṇaṃ jñeyamṛṇī cenmantravittamaḥ |
svayamṛṇī cettanmantraṃ japet pūrvamṛṇī yataḥ ||

vāyvagnibhūjalākāśāḥ pañcāśallipayaḥ sthitāḥ |
mahīsalilayormitramanilānalayorapi ||

śātravaṃ vaiparītyena maitraṃ sarvatra cāparam |
parasparaviruddhānāṃ varṇānāṃ yatra saṅgatiḥ ||

varjayettādṛśaṃ mantraṃ nāsakṛt tat kuleśvari (!) |
ekākṣare tathā kūṭe traipure mantranāyake ||

strīdatte svapnalabdhe ca siddhādīnnaiva śodhayet |
mantrasiddhopadiṣṭeṣu caturāmnāyajeṣu ca ||

mālāmantreṣu deveśi (!) siddhādīnnaiva śodhayet |
nṛsiṃhārkavarāhāṇāṃ prāsādapraṇavasya ca ||

sapiṇḍākṣaramantrāṇāṃ siddhādīnnaiva śodhayet |
mano'nyatra śivo'nyatra śaktiranyatra mārutaḥ ||

na sidhyati varārohe (!) lakṣakoṭijapādapi |
vādārthaṃ paṭhyate vidyā parārthaṃ kriyate japaḥ ||

khyātyarthaṃ dīyate dānaṃ kathaṃ siddhirvarānane (!) |
dhanārthaṃ gamyate tīrthaṃ dambhārthaṃ kriyate tapaḥ ||

amedhyena tu dehena nyāsaṃ devārcanaṃ japam |
homaṃ kurvanti ye mūḍhāstat sarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet ||

viṇmūtratyāgaśeṣādiyuktaḥ karma karoti yaḥ |
japārcanādikaṃ sarvamapavitraṃ bhavet priye (!) ||

malināmbarakeśādimukhadaurgandhyasaṃyutaḥ |
yo japettaṃ dahatyāśu devatā sujugupsitam ||

ālasyaṃ jṛmbhaṇaṃ nidrāṃ kṣutaṃ niṣṭhīvanaṃ bhayam |
nīcāṅgasparśanaṃ kopaṃ japakāle vivarjayet ||

atyāhāraḥ pralāpaśca prajalpo niyamāgrahaḥ |
anyāsaṅgañca laulyañca ṣaḍbhirmantro na sidhyati ||

uṣṇiṣī kañcukī nagno muktakeśo gaṇīvṛtaḥ |
apavitrottarīyastu nirgacchanna japet priye (!) ||

<p. 550>

