pradakṣiṇālokanamekavāraṃ kṛtvāpavargaṃ labhate manuṣyaḥ || iti || 
pradakṣiṇāyāṃ namaskārakaraṇe vidhijñānaṃ (-) yoginītantre 9 paṭale 231 
patre'pi yathā(-)

pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kuryāt padmākāraṃ namettataḥ |
dakṣiṇāduttaraṃ gatvā devasya ca maheśvari (!) |
kṛtvāñjalistato bhaktyā bhramayitvā namettataḥ (")namaskaraṇaṃ 
maṇḍalādbahiriti na vismaraṇīyam(-)(") ||
pratyekaṃ praṇameddevi (!) daṇḍavat praṇipātayet || 
yo no named bhramitvā ca aparādho bhavettadā || iti || (37 | 3 vi0 sarvaḥ saṃ0)

<p. 574> 

38 | 4 || pradakṣiṇākaraṇe phalam ||

1 śrī(0) bā(0) mā(0) pūjāyāṃ gaditameva 
śrīmajjagadguruśrīśaṅkarācāryapādairyathā(-)

pade pade yā paripūjakebhyaḥ sadyo'śvamedhādiphalaṃ dadāti |
tāṃ sarvapāpakṣayahetubhūtāṃ pradakṣiṇāṃ te paritaḥ karomi || 61 || iti ||

2 anyacca śrīśrīvidyā(-)śrī(0) mā(0) pūjāyāṃ śrīmacchaṅkarācāryapādāḥ (-) 
yathā(-)
 
2 || ekaṃ trayaṃ vā nava pañca sapta pradakṣiṇāṃ yaḥ paradevatāyāḥ |
ekādhikaṃ viṃśatikaṃ tu kṛtvā pramāṇamasyā vibudho bhavet saḥ || 52 ||

3 || aṣṭottaraṃ yacchatamuttamaṃ tat pradakṣiṇaṃ caiva tathā praṇāmān |
bhaktyā punarlakṣamitaṃ ca kṛtvā kailāsavāsaṃ labhate manuṣyaḥ || 53 || iti ||

4 || śrīcakrarājasya saparyayāsya śrīsundarīśaṅkaramandirasya |
