purāṇe karmagrantheṣu ca yathā(-)

5 || yāni kāni ca pāpāni janmāntarakṛtāni vai |
tāni sarvāṇi naśyanti pradakṣiṇapade pade || iti || (38 | 4 tahtā ca 13 | 38 vi0 sarvaḥ 
saṃ0)

vi(0) 13 | 39 (-) 1 stutiviṣaye ||

atha śrīmajjagadguruśrīśaṅkarācāryaviracitaṃ 
śrībālātripurasundarīmānasapūjāstotraṃ ||

1 oṃ (-) uṣasi māgadhamaṅgalagāyanai (-)
rjhaṭiti jāgṛhi jāgṛhi jāgṛhi ||
atikṛpārdrakaṭākṣanirīkṣaṇai(-)
rjagadidaṃ jagadamba (!) sukhīkuru || 1 ||

kanakamayavitardiśobhamānaṃ diśi diśi pūrṇasuvarṇakumbhayuktam ||
maṇimayamaṇḍapamadhyame hi mātarmayo kṛpayā hi samarcanaṃ grahītum || 2 ||

kanakakalaśaśobhamānaśīrṣaṃ jaladharacumbisamullasatpatākam ||
bhagavati (!) tava saṃnivāsahetormaṇimayamandirametadarpayāmi || 3 ||

tapanīyamayī satūlikā kamanīyā mudulottāracchadā ||
navaratnavibhūṣitā mayā śibikeyaṃ jagadamba (!) terpitā || 4 ||

kanakamayavitardisthāpite tūlikāḍhye vividhakusumakīrṇe koṭibālārkavarṇe ||
bhagavati (!) ramaṇīye ratnasiṃhāsane'sminnupaviśa padayugmaṃ hemapīṭhe 
nidhehi || 5 || 

<p. 575>

maṇimayamauktikanirmitaṃ mahāntaṃ kanakastambhacatuṣṭayena yuktam ||
kamanīyatamaṃ bhavāni (!) tubhyaṃ navamullocamahaṃ samarpayāmi || 6 ||

dūrvayā sarasijānvitaviṣṇukrāntayā ca sahitaṃ kusumāḍhayam ||
padmayugmasadṛśe padmayugme pādyametadurarīkuru mātaḥ (!) || 7 ||

gandhapuṣpayavasarṣapadurvāsaṃmitaṃ tilakuśākṣatamiśram ||
hemapātranihitaṃ saharatnairarghyametadudarīkuru mātaḥ (!) || 8 ||

jalajadyutinā kareṇa jātīphalakaṅkolalavaṅgagandhayuktaiḥ ||
amṛtairamṛtairivāhṛtairbhagavatyācamanaṃ vidhīyatām || 9 || 

nihitaḥ kanakasya sampuṭe pihito ratnapidhānakena saḥ ||
tadayaṃ bhavatīkare'rpito madhuparko bhavati (!) pragṛhyatām || 10 ||

etaccampakatailameva vividhaiḥ puṣpairmuhurvāsitaṃ
nyastaṃ ratnamaye suvarṇacaṣake bhṛṅgairbhramadbhirvṛtam |
sānandaṃ surasundarībhirabhito hastairdhṛtaṃ yanmayā
keśeṣu bhramaraprabheṣu sakaleṣvaṅgeṣu cālipyatām || 11||

mātaḥ (!) kuṅkumapaṅkanirmitamidaṃ dehe tavodvartanam
bhaktyāhaṃ kalayāmi hemarajasā saṃmiśritaṃ kesaram |
keśānāmalakairviśodhya viśadān kastūrikādyanvitam 
snānaṃ te navaratnakumbhasahitaiḥ saṃvāsitoṣṇodakaiḥ || 12 ||

dadhidugdhaghṛtai sapākṣikaiḥ sitayā śarkarayā samanvitaiḥ |
snapayāmi tavāhamādṛto janani (!) tvāṃ punaruṣṇavāribhiḥ || 13 || 

elośīrasuvāsitaiḥ sukusumairgaṅgāditīrthodakai(-)
rmāṇikyāmalamauktikāmṛtayutaiḥ svacchaiḥ suvarṇodakaiḥ |
mantrān vaidikatāntrikān paripaṭhan sānandamatyādarāt
snānaṃ te parikalpayāmi janani (!) snehāttvamaṅgīkuru || 14 ||

bālārkadyutidāḍimīyakusumapraspardhi sarvottamam
mātastvaṃ paridhehi divyavasanaṃ bhaktyā mayā kalpitam |
muktābhirgrathitaṃ sakañcukamidaṃ svīkṛtya pītaprabhaṃ 
taptasvarṇasamānavarṇabahulaṃ prāvarṇamaṅgīkuru || 15 ||

navaratnayute mayārpite kamanīye tapanīyapāduke ||
savilāsamidaṃ padadvayaṃ kṛpayā devi (!) tayornidhīyatāṃ || 16 || 

<p. 576>

bahubhiragarudhūpaiḥ sādaraṃ dhūpayitvā
bhagavati (!) tava keśān kaṅkatairmārjayitvā |
surabhibhiraravindaiścampakaiścārcayitvā
jhaṭiti kanakasūtrairjūṭamāveṣṭayāmi || 17 ||

sauvīrāñjanamidamamba (!) cakṣuṣoste
vinyastaṃ kanakaśalākayā mayā yat |
tannūnaṃ malinamapi tvadakṣisaṅgād
brahmendrādyabhilaśaṇīyatāmiyāya || 18 ||

mañjīre padayornidhāya rucire vinyasya kāñcīṃ kaṭau
muktāhāramurojayoranupamāṃ nakṣatramālāṃ gale |
keyūrāṇi bhujeṣu ratnavalayaśreṇīḥ kareṣu kramāt
tāṭaṅke tava karṇayorvinidadhe śīrṣe ca cūḍāmaṇim || 19 ||

dhaṃmille tava devi (!) hemakusumānyādhāya bhālasthle
muktārājivirājihematilakaṃ nāsāpuṭe mauktikam |
mātarmauktikajālikāṃ ca kucayoḥ sarvāṅgulīṣūrmikāḥ
kaṭyāṃ kāñcanakiṅkiṇīrvinidadhe ratnāvataṃsaṃ śrutau || 20 ||

mātarbhālatale tavātivimale kāśmīrakastūrikā
karpūrāgurubhiḥ karomi tilakaṃ dehe'ṅgarāgaṃ tataḥ ||
vakṣojādiṣu yakṣakardamarasaiḥ sitkāñcapuṣpadravaiḥ
pādau kuṅkumalepanādibhirahaṃ sampūjayāmi kramāt || 21||

ratnākṣataistvāṃ paripūjayāmi muktāphalaiścārurucairvicitraiḥ |
akhaṇḍitairdevi (!) yavādibhirvā kāśmīrapaṅkāṅkitataṇḍulairvā || 22 ||

janani (!) campakatailamidaṃ puro
mṛgamado'yamayaṃ paṭavāsakaḥ |
surabhigandhamidaṃ ca catuḥsamaṃ
sapadi sarvamidaṃ pratigṛhyatām || 23 ||

sīmante te bhagavati (!) yayā sādaraṃ nyastametat
sindūraṃ me hṛdayakamale devi (!) harṣaṃ tanotu |
bālādityadyutiriva sadā lohitā yasya kānti(-)
rantardhvāntaṃ haratu sakalaṃ cetasā cintayāmi || 24 ||

<p. 577>

mandārakundakaravīralavaṅgapuṣpai(-)
stvāṃ devi (!) saṃtatamahaṃ paripūjayāmi |
jātījapābakulacampakaketakādi(-)
nānāvidhāni kusumāni ca te'rpayāmi || 25 ||

mālatībakulahemapuṣpikā(-)
kāñcanārakaravīracampakaiḥ |
karṇikāragirikarṇikādibhiḥ |
pūjayāmi jagadamba (!) te vapuḥ || 26 ||

pārijātaśatapatrapāṭalai (-)
rmallikābakulacampakādibhiḥ |
ambujaiśca kusumaiśca sādaraṃ pūja(0) || 27 ||

lākṣāsammilitaiḥ śilārasayutaiḥ śrīvāsasammiśritaiḥ
karpūrākalitaiḥ sitāmadhuyutairgosarpiṣā'loḍitaiḥ |
śrīkhaṇḍāguruguggalaprabhṛtibhirnānāvidhairvastubhi(-)
rdhūpaṃ te parikalpayāmi janani (!) tvaṃ dhūpamaṅgīkuru || 28 ||

ratnālaṅkṛtahemapātranihitairgosarpiṣoddīpitai(-)
rdīpairdīrghatarāndhakārabhidurairbālārkakoṭiprabhaiḥ |
ātāmrajvaladujjvalajvalanavadratnapradīpaiḥ sadā
mātastvāmahamādarādanudinaṃ nīrājayāmyuccakaiḥ || 29 ||

mahati kanakapātre sthāpayitvā viśālān
ḍamarusadṛśarūpān pakvagodhūmadīpān |
bahughṛtamatha teṣu nyasya dīpairakampai(-)
rbhuvanajanani (!) kurve nityamārātrikaṃ te || 30 ||

savinayamatha datvā jānuyugmaṃ dharāyāṃ
sapadi śirasi dhṛtvā pātramārātrikasya |
mukhakamalasamīpe te'mba (!) sārdhatrivāraṃ
bhramayati mayi bhūyāt te kṛpārdraḥ kaṭākṣaḥ || 31|| 

mātastvāṃ dadhidugdhapāyasamahāśālyanyasantānakān
sūpāpūpasitāghṛtaiḥ savaṭakaiḥ sakṣaudrarambhāphalaiḥ ||

<p. 578>

elājīrakahiṅgunāgaraniśākaustumbarīsaṃyutaiḥ
śākaiḥ sākamahaṃ sudhādhikarasaiḥ saṃtarpayāmyarpayan || 32 ||

sāpūpasūpadadhidugdhasitāghṛtāni
susvādubhakṣyaparamānnapuraḥsarāṇi ||
śākollasanmaricajīrakavallikāni
bhakṣyāṇi bhuṅkṣva jagadamba (!) mayārpitāni || 33 ||

kṣīrametadidamuttamottamam 
prājyamājyamidamujjvalaṃ madhu |
mātaretadamṛtopamaṃ tvayā
sambhrameṇa paripīyatāṃ muhuḥ  || 34 ||

uṣṇodakaiḥ pāṇiyugaṃ mukhaṃ ca
prakṣālya mātaḥ kaladhautapātre |
karpūramiśreṇa sakuṅkumena
hastau samudvartaya candanena || 35 ||

atiśītamuśīravāsitaṃ
tava pāṇau ca mayā niveditam |
paṭapūtamidaṃ jitāmṛtam
śuci gaṅgāmṛtamamba (!) pīyatām || 36 ||

ātāmrarambhāphalasaṃyutāni
drākṣāphalākṣoṭasamanvitāni ||
sanārikelāni sadāḍimāni
phalāni te devi (!) samarpayāmi || 37 ||

kaliṅgakośātakasaṃyutāni
jambīranāriṅgasamanvitāni |
sabījapūrāṇi sadāḍimāni
phalāni te devi (!) samarpayāmi || 38 ||

karpūreṇa yutairlavaṅgasahitaiḥ kaṅkolacūrṇānvitaiḥ
susvādukramukaiḥ sagaurakhadiraiḥ susnigdhajātīphalaiḥ |
mātaḥ ketakipatrapāṇḍuruciraistāmbūlavallīdalaiḥ 
sānandaṃ mukhamaṇḍanārthamatulaṃ tāmbūlamaṅgīkuru || 39 ||

<p. 579>

elālavaṅgādisamanvitāni
kaṅkolakarpūravimiśritāni |
tāmbūlavallīdalasaṃyutāni
phalāni te devi (!) samarpayāmi || 40 ||

tāmbūlavallīdalanirjitahemavarṇaṃ
svarṇāktapūgaphalamauktikacūrṇayuktam |
ratnasthalīsthitamidaṃ khadireṇa sārdham
tāmbūlamamba (!) vadanāmburuhe gṛhāṇa || 41|| 

atha bahumaṇimiśrairmauktikaistvāṃ vikīrya
tribhuvanakamanīyaiḥ pūjayitvā ca vastraiḥ |
militavividhamuktāṃ divyamāṇikyayuktām
janani (!) kanakavṛṣṭiṃ dakṣiṇāṃ te'rpayāmi || 42 ||

mātaḥ kāñcanadaṇḍamaṇḍitamidaṃ pūrṇendubimbaprabham 
nānāratnaviśobhi hemakalaśaṃ lokatrayālhādakam |
bhāsvanmauktikajālikāparivṛtaṃ prītyātmahaste dhṛtam
chatraṃ te parikalpayāmi śirasi tvaṣṭrā svayaṃ nirmitam || 43 ||

śaradindumarīcigauravarṇai(-)
rmaṇiyuktairvilasatsuvarṇadaṇḍaiḥ |
jagadamba (!) vicitracāmarai (-) 
stvāmahamānandabhareṇa vījayāmi || 44 ||

mārtaṇḍamaṇḍalanibho jagadamba (!) yo'yam 
bhaktyā mayā maṇimayo mukuṭo'rpitaste |
pūrṇendubimbaruciraṃ vadanaṃ svakīya(-)
masmin vilokaya vilolavilocane (!) tvam || 45 ||

indrādayo natinatairmukuṭapradīpai(-)
rnīrājayanti satataṃ tava pādapīṭham |
tasmādahaṃ tava śarīramaśeṣametan(-)
nīrājayāmi jagadamba (!) sahastradīpaiḥ || 46 ||

priyagatiratituṅgo ratnapallāṇayuktaḥ
kanakamayavibhūṣaḥ snigdhagambhīraghoṣaḥ ||

<p. 580>

bhagavati (!) kalito'yaṃ vāhanārthaṃ mayā te
turagaśatasameto vāyuvegasturaṅgaḥ || 47 ||

madhukaravṛtakumbho nyastasindūrareṇuḥ
kanakakalitaghaṇṭaḥ kiṅkiṇīśobhikaṇṭhaḥ |
śravaṇayugalacañcaccāmaro meghatulyo
janani (!) tava mude syānmattamātaṅga eṣaḥ || 48 ||

drutataraturagairvirājamānaṃ maṇimayacakracatuṣṭayena yuktam |
kanakamayamahaṃ vitānavantaṃ bhagavati (!) hi rathaṃ samarpayāmi || 49 ||

hayagajarathapattiśobhamānam 
diśi diśi dudumbhimeghanādayuktam |
abhinavacaturaṅgasainyametad
bhagavati (!) bhaktibhareṇa ta'rpayāmi || 50 ||

paridhīkṛtasaptasāgaram
bahusampatsahitaṃ mayā'mba te ||
vipulaṃ dharaṇītalābhidham
prabalaṃ durgamidaṃ samarpitam || 51 ||

śatapatrayutaiḥ svabhāvaśītai (-)
ratisaurabhyayutaiḥ parāgapītaiḥ |
bhramarīmukharīkṛtairanekai(-)
rvyajanaistvāṃ jagadamba (!) vījayāmi || 52 ||

bhramavilulitalolakuntalāli(-)
rvigalitamālyavikirṇaraṅgabhūmiḥ |
iyamaticaturā naṭī naṭantī
tava hṛdaye mudamātanotu mātaḥ (!) || 53 ||

mukhacalanavilāsalolaveṇī
vilasitanirṇitalolabhṛṅgamālā |
yuvajanasukhakāricārulīlā
bhagavati (!) te purato naṭanti bālāḥ (")atra naṭanti bālā ityatra ārṣaṃ mantavyaṃ | (") 
|| 54 || 

rucirakucataṭīnāṃ nāṭyakāle naṭīnām 
pratigṛhamatha tatra pratyahaṃ prādurāsīt |

<p. 581>

dhimiki dhimiki dhiddhi dhiddhi dhiddheti dhiddhi
dhikiti dhikiti tatthai tthai tyathe ttheti śabdaḥ || 55 || 

bhramadalikulatulyā loladhammilabhārā
smitamukhakamalodyaddivyalāvaṇyapūrā ||
abhinavanavaveṣā vārayoṣā naṭantī
paramṛtakalakaṇṭhi devi (!) modaṃ tanotu || 56 ||

ḍamaruḍiṇḍimajharjharajhallarī(-)
mṛduravārdraghaṭārdraghaṭādayaḥ |
jhaṭiti jhāṅkṛtibhirjagadambike (!)
bahudayaṃ hṛdayaṃ sukhayantu te || 57 ||

vipañcīṣu saptasvarān vādayantya(-)
stava dvāri gāyanti gandharvakanyāḥ ||
kṣaṇaṃ sāvadhānena cittena mātaḥ
samākarṇaya tvaṃ mayā prārthitāsi || 58 ||

atiśayakamanīyairnartanairnartakīnām
jhaṭiti ca ramayitvā ceta evaṃ tvadīyam ||
svayamahamapi citrairnṛtyavāditragītai (-)
rbhagavati (!) bhavadīyaṃ mānasaṃ rañjayāmi || 59 ||

tava devi (!) guṇānuvarṇane
caturā no caturānanādayaḥ |
tadihaikamukheṣu jantuṣu
stavanaṃ kastava kartumīśvaraḥ || 60 ||

pade pade yā paripūjakebhyaḥ
sadyo'śvamedhādiphalaṃ dadāti ||
tāṃ sarvapāpakṣayahetubhūtām
pradakṣiṇāṃ te paritaḥ karomi || 61||

raktotpalāraktatalaprabhābhyāṃ
dhvajordhvarekhākuliśāṅkitābhyām ||
aśeṣavṛndārakavanditābhyāṃ
namo bhavānīpadapaṅkajābhyām || 62 ||

<p. 582>

caraṇanalinayugmaṃ paṅkajaiḥ pūjayitvā
kanakakamalamālāṃ kaṇṭhadeśe'rpayitvā |
śirasi vinihito'yaṃ ratnapuṣpāñjaliste
hṛdayakamalamadhye devi (!) harṣaṃ tanotu || 63 ||

atha maṇimayamañcakābhirāme
dyutimati puṣpavitānarājamāne | 
prasaradagarudhūpairdhūpite'smin
bhagavati (!) vāsagṛhestu te nivāsaḥ || 64 ||

etasmin maṇikhacite suvarṇapīṭhe
trailokyābhayavaradau nidhāya pādau | 
vistīrṇe mṛdulataracchade'smin
paryaṅke kanakamaye niṣīda mātaḥ (!) || 65 ||

tava devi sarojacihnayoḥ
padayornijitapadmarāgayoḥ |
atiraktatarairalaktakaiḥ
punaruktāṃ racayāmi raktatām || 66 ||

atha mātaruśīravāsitam
nijatāmbūlarasena rājitam |
tapanīyamaye hi pātrake
mukhagaṇḍūṣajalaṃ vidhīyatām || 67 ||

kṣaṇamatha jagadamba mañcake'smin
mṛdutaratūlikayā virājamāne |
atimahati mudā nijecchayā tvaṃ
sukhaśayanaṃ kuru māṃ hṛdi smarantī || 68 ||

muktākundendugaurāṃ maṇimayamukuṭāṃ ratnatāṭaṅkayuktā(-)
makṣasrakpuṣpahastāmabhayavarakarāṃ candracūḍāṃ trinetrām |
nānālaṅkārayuktāṃ suramukuṭalasaddyotitasvarṇapīṭhām
sānandāṃ suprasannāṃ tribhuvanajananīṃ cetasām cintayāmi || 69 ||

eṣā bhaktyā tava viracitā yā mayā devi (!) pūjā
svīkṛtyaināṃ sapadi sakalān me'parādhān kṣamasva |

<p. 583>

nyūnaṃ yattat tava karuṇayā pūrṇatāmetu sadyaḥ
sānandaṃ me hṛdayakamale te'stu nityaṃ nivāsaḥ || 70 ||

pūjāmimāṃ paṭhet prājñaḥ pūjāṃ kartumanīśvaraḥ |
pūjāphalamavāpnoti vāñchitārthāṃśca vindati || 71 ||

pratyahaṃ bhaktiyukto yo devīpūjāmimāṃ paṭhet |
vāgvādinyāḥ prasādena vatsarāt sa kavirbhavet || 72 ||

|| iti śrīmatparamahaṃsaparivrājakācāryaviracitaṃ devīmānasapūjanastotraṃ 
sampūrṇaṃ ||

śubhamastu
 
(anena stotrapāṭhakarmaṇā śrīkālikā bālāmbā prīyatām ||)

