kāruṇyāṃ tanubuddhikarmaviratāṃ sindhupriyāṃ śālinīm |
pañcabrahmasanātanāntaragatāṃ jñeyāṅgayogānvitāṃ
śrī(-------------------------------------) || 8 || 

haste kumbhanibhāṃ payoktabharitāṃ pīnonnatāṃ naumi tāṃ
hīrāḍhyābharaṇāṃ surendravanitāṃ śṛṅgārapīṭhālayām |
yogyākāriṇī (")atra yonyākāriṇī ityatra chandobhaṅgaḥ soḍhavya ārṣatvāt 
|(")yonimudritakarāṃ nityāmavarṇātmikāṃ 
śrī(-------------------------------------) || 9 || 

