māṅgalyāyatapaṅkajābhanayanāṃ māṅgalyasiddhipradām |
tāruṇyāntapasārcitāntaruṇikāṃ tantryarcitāṃ nartinīṃ
śrī (-------------------------------------) || 11 ||

sarveśāṅgavihāriṇīṃ sakaruṇāṃ sarveśvarīṃ sarvagāṃ
satyāṃ sarvamayīṃ sahasradalanāṃ saptārṇavopasthitām |
saṃsargādivivarjinīṃ śubhakarīṃ bālārkakoṭiprabhāṃ
śrī (-------------------------------------) || 12 || 

kādikṣāntasuvarṇabindusutanuṃ svarṇādisiṃhāsinīṃ
nānāvarṇavicitracitracaritāṃ cāturyacintāmaṇim |
cittānandavidhāyinīṃ suvipulāṃ ruḍhatrayāṃ śeṣikāṃ
śrī (----------------------------------) ||13||

lakṣmīśādividhīndracandramukuṭāṃ ṣaṣṭhāṅgapīṭhārcitāṃ
sūryendrāgnimayaikapīṭhanilayāṃ tristhāṃ trikoṇeśvarīm |

