oṃ śrībhagavānuvāca (-)

namo devyai prakṛtyai ca vidhātryai satataṃ namaḥ |
kalyāṇyai kāmadāyai ca vṛddhyai siddhyai namo namaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 589>

saccidānandarūpiṇyai saṃsārāraṇaye namaḥ |
pañcakṛtyavidhātryai te bhuvaneśyai namo namaḥ || 2 ||

sarvādhiṣṭhānarūpāyai kūṭasthāyai namo namaḥ  |
ardhamātrārthabhūtāyai hṛllekhāyai namo namaḥ || 3 ||

jñātaṃ mayākhilamidaṃ tvayi sanniviṣṭaṃ tvatto'sya sambhavalayāvapi 
mātaradya | 
śaktiśca te'sya karaṇe vitataprabhāvā jñātā'dhunā sakalalokamayīti nūnam || 
4 ||
vistārya sarvamakhilaṃ sadasadvikāraṃ saṃdarśayasyavikalaṃ puruṣāya kāle |
tattvaiśca ṣoḍaśabhireva ca saptabhiśca bhāsīndrajālamiva naḥ kila rañjanāya || 
5 ||

na tvāmṛte kimapi vastugataṃ vibhāti vyāpyaiva sarvamakhilaṃ tvamavasthitā'si |
śaktiṃ vinā vyavahṛtau puruṣo'pyaśakto bambhaṇyate janani (!) buddhimatā janena 
|| 6 || 

prīṇāsi viśvamakhilaṃ satataṃ prabhāvaiḥ svaistejasā ca sakalaṃ prakaṭīkaroṣi 
|
atsyeva devi (!) tarasā kila kalpakāle ko veda devi (!) caritaṃ tava vaibhavasya || 7 ||

trātā vayaṃ janani (!) te madhukaiṭabhābhyāṃ lokāśca te suvitatāḥ khalu 
darśitā vai |
nītāḥ sukhsya bhavane paramāṃ ca koṭiṃ yaddarśanaṃ tava bhavāni (!) 
mahāprabhāvam || 8 ||

nāhaṃ bhavo na ca viriñci (")atrāpadamārṣatvāt soḍhvyaṃ |(") viveda mātaḥ (!) 
ko'nyo hi vetti caritaṃ tava durvibhāvyam |
kānīha santi bhuvanāni mahāprabhāve hyasmin bhavāni (!) carite racanākalāpe || 9 
|| 

asmābhiratra bhuvane hariranya eva dṛṣṭaḥ śivaḥ kamalajaḥ prathitaprabhāvaḥ |
anyeṣu devi (!) bhuvaneṣu na santi kiṃ te kiṃ vidma devi (!) vitataṃ tava suprabhāvam 
|| 10 || 

yāce'mba te'ṅghrikamalaṃ praṇipatya kāmaṃ citte sadā vasatu rūpamidaṃ 
tavaitat |
nāmāpi vaktrakuhare satataṃ tavaiva saṃdarśanaṃ tava padāmbujayoḥ sadaiva || 
11 || 

bhṛtyo'yamasti satataṃ mayi bhāvanīyaṃ tvāṃ svāminīti manasā nanu 
cintayāmi |
eṣāvayoraviratā kila devi (!) bhūyād vyāptiḥ sadaiva jananīsutayorivārye (!)  || 12 ||

tvaṃ vetsi sarvamakhilaṃ bhuvanaprapañcaṃ 
sarvajñatāparisamāptinitāntabhūmiḥ |
kiṃ pāmareṇa jagadamba (!) nivedanīyaṃ
yadyuktamācara bhavāni (!) taveṅgitaṃ syāt || 13 || 

brahmā sṛjatyavati viṣṇurumāpatiśca saṃhārakāraka iyaṃ tu jane prasiddhiḥ |
kiṃ satyametadapi devi (!) tavecchayā vai kartuṃ kṣamā vayamaje (!) tava 
śaktiyuktāḥ || 14 ||

dhātrī dharādharasute (!) na jagad bibharti ādhāraśaktirakhilaṃ tava vai bibharti |
sūryo vibhāti varade (!) prabhayā yutaste tvaṃ sarvametadakhilaṃ virajā vibhāsi || 
15 || 

<p. 590>

brahmāhamīśvaravaraḥ kila te prabhāvāt sarve vayaṃ janiyutā na yadā tu 
nityāḥ |
ke'nye surāḥ śatamakhapramukhāśca nityānitye (!) tvameva janani prakṛtiḥ 
purāṇā || 16 ||

tvaṃ cedbhavāni (!) dayase puruṣaṃ purāṇaṃ jāne'hamadya tava sannidhigaḥ 
sadaiva |
no cedahaṃ vibhuranādiranīha īśo viśvātmadhīriti tamaḥprakṛtiḥ sadaiva || 17 ||

vidyā tvameva nanu buddhimatāṃ narāṇāṃ śaktistvameva kila śaktimatāṃ 
sadaiva |
tvaṃ kīrtikāntikamalāmalatuṣṭirūpā muktipradā viratireva manuṣyaloke || 18 ||

gāyatryasi prathamavedakalā tvameva svāhā svadhā bhagavatī 
suguṇārdhamātrā |
āmnāya eva vihito nigamo bhavatyā sañjīvanāya satataṃ surapūrvajānām || 19 
|| 

mokṣārthameva racayasyakhilaṃ prapañcaṃ teṣāṃ gatāḥ khalu yato nanu 
jīvabhāvam |
aṃśā anādinidhanasya kilānaghasya pūrṇārṇavasya vitatā hi yathā taraṅgāḥ 
|| 20 || 

jīvo yadā tu parivetti tavaiva kṛtyaṃ tvaṃ saṃharasyakhilametaditi prasiddham |
nāṭyaṃ naṭena racitaṃ vitathe'ntaraṅge kārye kṛte viramasi prathitaprabhāvā || 
21 || 

trātā tvameva mama mohamayādbhavābdhestvāmambike (!) satatamemi mahārtide 
ca |
rāgādibhirviracite vitathe kilānte māmeva pāhi bahuduḥkhakare ca kāle || 22 ||

namo devi (!) mahāvidye (!) namāmi caraṇau tava |
sadā jñānaprakāśaṃ me dehi sarvārthade (!) śive (!) || 23 || iti || saṃ(0) || 

6 || śrīśivena bhagavatoktā śrījagadambāstutiḥ | śrīdevībhāgavate 3 skaṃ (-) 5 
