oṃ śrīśiva uvāca ||

yadi haristava devi bibhāvajastadanu padmaja eva tavodbhavaḥ |
kimahamatra tavāpi na sadguṇaḥ sakalalokavidhau caturā śive (!) || 1 ||

tvamasi bhūḥ salilaṃ pavanastathā khamapi vahniguṇaśca tathā punaḥ |
janani (!) tāni punaḥ karaṇāni ca tvamasi buddhimano'pyatha haṅkṛtiḥ || 2 ||

na ca vidanti vadanti ca ye'nyathā hariharājakṛtaṃ nikhilaṃ jagat |
tava kṛtāśraya eva sadaiva te viracayanti jagat sacarācaram || 3 ||

avanivāyukhavahnijalādibhiḥ saviṣayaiḥ saguṇaiśca jagadbhavet |
yadi tadā kathamadya ca tat sphuṭaṃ prabhavatīti tavāmba (!) kalāmṛte || 4 ||

bhavasi sarvamidaṃ sacarācaraṃ tvamajaviṣṇuśivākṛtikalpitam |
vividhaveṣavilāsakutūhalairviramase (")ārṣo'yamavibhaktikaḥ prayogaḥ 
ātmanepadaprayogaśca |(") ramase'mba yathāruci || 5 ||

<p. 591>

sakalalokasisṛkṣurahaṃ hariḥ kamalabhūśca bhavābhayade'mbike (!) |
tava padāmbujapāṃsuparigrahaṃ samadhigamya tadā na ca cakrima || 6 ||

yadi dayārdramanā na sadāmbike (!) kathamahaṃ vihitaśca tamoguṇaḥ |
kamalajaśca rajoguṇasambhavaḥ suvihitaḥ kimu sattvaguṇo hariḥ || 7 ||

yadi na te viṣamā matirambike (!) kathamidaṃ bahudhā vihitaṃ jagat |
sacivabhūpatibhṛtyajanāvṛtaṃ bahudhanairadhanaiśca samākulam || 8 || 

tava guṇāstraya eva sadā kṣamāḥ prakaṭanāvanasaṃharaṇeṣu vai |
hariharadruhiṇāśca kramāt tvayā viracitā jagatāṃ kila kāraṇam || 9 ||

paricitāni mayā hariṇā tathā kamalajena vimānagatena vai ||
pathigatairbhuvanāni kṛtāni vā kathaya kena bhavāni (!) navāni ca || 10 ||

sṛjasi pāsi jagajjagadambike (!) svakalayā kiyadicchasi nāśitum |
ramayase svapatiṃ puruṣaṃ sadā tava gatiṃ na hi vidma (")ārṣo'yaṃ prayogaḥ |(") 
vayaṃ śive (!) || 11 ||

(|| śrīmaṇidvīpe yavatibhāvamāpananaḥ śrībrahmaviṣṇurudrāḥ ||)

janani (!) devi (!) padāmbujasevanaṃ yuvatibhāvagatānapi naḥ sadā |
puruṣatāmadhigamya padāmbujād virahitāḥ kva labhema sukhaṃ sphuṭam || 12 ||

na rucirasti mamāmba (!) padāmbuje tava vihāya śive (!) bhuvaneṣvalam |
nivasituṃ naradehamavāpya ca tribhuvanasya patitvamavāpya vai || 13 ||

sudati (!) nāsti manāgapi me ratiryuvatibhāvamavāpya tavāntike |
puruṣatā kva sukhāya bhavatyalaṃ tava padaṃ na yadīkṣaṇagocaram || 14 || 

tribhuvaneṣu bhavatviyamambike (!) mama sadaiva hi kīrtiranāvilā |
yuvatibhāvamavāpya padāmbujaṃ paricitaṃ tava saṃsṛtināśanam || 15 ||

bhuvi vihāya tavāntikasevanaṃ ka iva vāñchati rājyamakaṇṭakam |
truṭirasau kila yāti yugātmatāṃ na nikaṭaṃ yadi te'ṅghrisaroruham || 16 ||

tapasi ye niratā munayo'malāstava vihāya padāmbujapūjanam |
janani (!) te vidhinā kila vañcitāḥ paribhavo vibhave parikalpitaḥ || 17 || 

na tapasā na damena samādhinā na ca tathā vihitaiḥ kratubhiryathā |
tava padābjaparāganiṣevaṇād bhavati muktiraje bhavasāgarāt || 18 ||

kuru dayāṃ dayase yadi devi (!) māṃ kathaya mantramanāvilamadbhutam ||
samabhavaṃ prajapan sukhito hyahaṃ suviśadaṃ ca navārṇavamuttamam || 19 ||

<p. 592>

prathamajanmani cādhigato mayā tadadhunā na vibhāti navākṣaraḥ |
kathaya māṃ manumadya bhavārṇavājjanani (!) tāraya tārake (!) || 20 ||

brahmovāca (-)

ityuktā sā tadā devi śivenādbhutatejasā |
uccacārāmbikā mantraṃ prasphuṭaṃ ca navākṣaram || 21 ||

taṃ gṛhītvā mahādevaḥ parāṃ mudamavāpa ha |
praṇamya caraṇau devyāstatraivāvasthitaḥ śivaḥ || 22 ||

japannavākṣaraṃ mantraṃ kāmadaṃ mokṣadaṃ tathā ||
bījayuktaṃ śubhoccāraṃ śaṅkarastasthivāstadā || 23 || iti saṃ(0) ||

7- || atha madhukaiṭabhadaityārditena brahmaṇā kṛtā śrīdevīstutiḥ ||
(śrī0 de0 bhā0 3 skaṃ0 5. a0 yathā-)

oṃ śrībrahmovāca (-)

na vedāstvāmevaṃ kalayitumihāsannapaṭavo yatastenocustvāṃ 
sakalajanadhātrīmavikalām |
svāhābhūtādevī (")ārṣotra chandobhaṅgaḥ |(") sakalamakhahome suvihitā tadā 
tvaṃ sarvajñā janani (!) khalu jātā tribhuvane || 1 ||

kartāhaṃ prakaromi sarvamakhilaṃ brahmāṇḍamatyadbhutaṃ ko'nyo'stīha 
carācare tribhuvane mattaḥ samarthaḥ pumān |
dhanyosmyatra na saṃśayaḥ kila yadā brahmāsmi lokātigo magnohaṃ 
bhavasāgare pravitate garvābhiveśāditi || 2 ||

adyāhaṃ tava pādapaṅkajaparāgādānagarveṇa vai dhanyo'smīti 
yathārthavādanipuṇo jātaḥ prasādācca te |
yāce tvāṃ bhavabhītināśacaturāṃ muktipradāṃ ceśvarīṃ hitvā mohakṛtaṃ 
mahārtinigaḍaṃ tvadbhaktiyuktaṃ kuru  || 3 ||

ato'haṃ ca jāto vimuktaḥ kathaṃ syāṃ sarojādameyāttvadāviṣkṛtādvai |
tavājñākaraḥ kiṅkaro'smīti nūnaṃ śive (!) pāhi māṃ mohamagnaṃ 
bhavābdhau || 4 ||

na jānanti ye mānavāste vadanti prabhuṃ māṃ tavādyaṃ caritraṃ pavitram |
yajantīha ye yājakāḥ svargakāmā na te te prabhāvaṃ vidantyeva kāmam || 5 ||

tvayā nirmito'haṃ vidhitve vihāraṃ vikartuṃ caturdhā vidhāyādisargam |
ahaṃ vedmi ko'nyo vivedādimāye (!) kṣamasvāparādhaṃ tvahaṅkārajaṃ me || 6 
|| 

<p. 593>

śramaṃ ye'ṣṭadhā yogamārge pravṛttāḥ prakurvanti mūḍhāḥ samādhau 
sthitā vai |
na jānanti te nāma mokṣapradaṃ vā samuccāritaṃ jātu mātarmiṣeṇa || 7 ||

vicāre pare tattvasaṅkhyāvidhāne pade mohitā nāma te saṃvihāya |
na kiṃ te vimuḍhā bhavābdhau bhavāni (!) tvamevāsi saṃsāramuktipradā vai || 8 ||

paraṃ tattvavijñānamādyairjanairyairaje cānubhūtaṃ tyajantyeva te kim ||
nimeṣārdhamātraṃ pavitraṃ caritraṃ śivā cāmbikā śaktirīśeti nāma || 9 ||

(|| śrīmadādyāprakṛtibhavānī brahmāṇamapi janayatīti brahmaivāṅgīkurute ||)

na kiṃ tvaṃ samarthāsi viśvaṃ vidhātuṃ dṛśevāśu sarvaṃ caturdhā 
vibhaktam |
vinodārthamevaṃ vidhiṃ māṃ vidhāyādisarge kiledaṃ karoṣīti kāmam || 10 ||

hariḥ pālakaḥ kiṃ tvayā'sau madhorvā tathā kaiṭabhādrakṣitaḥ sindumadhye |
haraḥ saṃhṛtaḥ kiṃ tvayāsau na kāle kathaṃ me bhruvormadhyadeśāt sa jātaḥ || 
11 || 

na te janma kutrāpi dṛṣṭaṃ śrutaṃ vā kutaḥ sambhavaste na ko'pīha veda |
kolādyāsi śaktistvamekā bhavāni (!) svatantraiḥ samastairato bodhitā'si || 12 ||

tvayā saṃyuto'haṃ vikartuṃ samartho haristrātumamba tvayā saṃyutaśca |
haraḥ samprahartuṃ tvayaiveha yuktaḥ kṣamā nādya sarve tvayā viprayuktāḥ || 13 
||

yathā'haṃ hariḥ śaṅkaraḥ kiṃ tathā'nye na jātā na santīha no vā'bhaviṣyan 
|| 
na muhyanti ke'smiṃstavātyantacitre vinode vivādāspade'lpāśayānām || 14 ||

akartā guṇaspaṣṭa evādyadevo nirīho'nupādhiḥ sadaivākalaśca |
tathāpīśvaraste vitīrṇaṃ vinodaṃ susaṃpaśyatītyāhurevaṃ vidhijñāḥ || 15 ||

(|| dvaitādvaitaviṣayamugdho brahmā śrībhagavatīṃ prārthayate ||)

dṛṣṭādṛṣṭavibhedesmin prāk tvatto vai pumān paraḥ |
nānyaḥ ko'pi tṛtiyo'sti prameye suvicārite || 16 ||

na mithyā vedavākyaṃ vai kalpanīyaṃ kadācana |
virodho'yaṃ mayātyantaṃ hṛdaye tu viśaṅkitaḥ || 17 ||

ekamevādvitīyaṃ yad brahma vedā vadanti vai |
sā kiṃ tvaṃ vāpyasau vā kiṃ saṃdehaṃ vinivartaya || 18 ||

niḥsaṃśayaṃ na me cetaḥ prabhavatyaviśaṅkitam |
dvitvaikatvavicāre'smin nimagnaṃ kṣullakaṃ manaḥ || 19 ||

<p. 594>

svamukhenāpi saṃdehaṃ chettumarhasi māmakam |
puṇyayogācca me prāptā saṅgatistava pādayoḥ || 20 ||

pumānasi tvaṃ strī vā'si vada vistarato mama |
jñātvā'haṃ paramāṃ śaktiṃ muktaḥ syāṃ bhavasāgarāt || 21 || iti ||
 
(ita ūrdhvatano'tra sambandhotraiva de0 bhā0 sthale draṣṭavyaḥ || iti-saṃ0 ||)

