8 || asya śrīlalitātriśatīstotramantrasya || bhagavān hayagrīva(-)ṛṣiḥ || 
anuṣṭupchandaḥ || śrīlalitāmahābhaṭṭārikā devatā || vāgbhavakūṭaṃ bījaṃ || 
śaktikūṭaṃ śaktiṃ || kāmarājakūṭaṃ kīlakaṃ || 
śrīlalitāprasādasiddhyarthaṃ pāṭhe viniyogaḥ || atha ṛṣyādīn vidhāya || 
kūṭatrayeṇa dvirāvṛtya karahṛdayādiṣaḍaṅgadvayaṃ vidhāya dhyāyedyathā(-)

atimadhuracāpahastāmaparājitā(ta) modabāṇasaubhāgyām |
aruṇāmatiśayakaruṇāmabhinavakulasundarīṃ vande |

iti dhyātvā mānasopacāraiḥ sampūjya paṭhet ||

