samaṣṭiya jurjuhoti iti dhruvāyā api homaśeṣatvāt juhūdhruvāsruvān gṛhītvā 
bahuvacanopapattiḥ suvacetyalaṃ aprakṛtavicāreṇa ||

juhvādyanyatamatvena indriyāṇi daśa bhāvayet | indriyāṇāṃ 
pūrvoktahavirādhāratvena yuktaṃ tadbhāvanam | śaktayaḥ svaniṣṭhāḥ 
saṃkucitāḥ yāḥ icchājñānakriyāḥ śaktayaḥ tā eva jvālāḥ | agnau 
homakartuḥ jvālā hastādidāhakatvena duḥkhadā iti loke spaṣṭam | tadvat hotuḥ 
saṃkucitaparamaśivasyemāḥ śaktayo duḥkhadā iti jvālātvena bhāvanaṃ 
yuktam |  evaṃ svasaṃkucitacaitanyarūpo jīvaḥ tadabhinno yaḥ śivaḥ 
śuddhacaitanyaṃ taṃ homādhāra bhūtāgnitvena bhāvayet | svābhinneti 
viśeṣaṇāt svaśivayorapyabhedaṃ bhāvayediti bhāvanāntaraṃ jñāpitam | 
yadyapi iyaṃ bhāvanā satataṃ śivatāsamāveśaḥ ityanenaiva prāptā tathā'pi 
sā śivo'hamiti bhāvanā atra pāvako'hamiti śivasya pāvakatvena bhāvanamiti 
vailakṣyaṇam | pāvake prakāśatvaṃ śive'pi prakāśatvamiti yuktaṃ tathā 
bhāvanam | svayaṃ paricchinnacidrūpo hotā homakartṛtvena bhāvayet | 
ayamarthaḥ tantrāntare mantraviśeṣe sphuṭaḥ (-)

antarnirantaramanindhanamedhamāne
mohāndhakāraparipanthini saṃvidagnau |
kasmiṃścidadbhutamarīcivikāsabhūmni
viśvaṃ juhomi vasudhā'diśivāvasānam || iti ||

